?","content.76.813":"I'm here to take the baker test.","content.76.814":"Oh, nothing really. Just passing through.","content.76.815":"Thanks, I'll make sure I learn it all!","content.76.820":"Trapper.","content.76.821":"Miner.","content.76.822":"Miller.","content.76.823":"Farmer.","content.76.824":"They're crusty.","content.76.825":"They are the only things to give you back HP.","content.76.826":"You can use them to teleport.","content.76.827":"They make you look younger.","content.76.828":"Any time.","content.76.829":"Only during battles.","content.76.830":"Only when not in battle.","content.76.831":"Public holidays.","content.76.832":"An oven.","content.76.833":"A sloven.","content.76.834":"An anvil.","content.76.835":"A pastrier.","content.76.836":"Thanks!","content.76.837":"This place is packed and it smells like freshly baked bread.","content.76.840":"On the market?!","content.76.841":"I want to hit something! Where are the weapons?","content.76.842":"Thanks. Bye!","content.76.847":"You're not recruiting, by any chance, are you?","content.76.848":"No, thanks. I'll have a think about it, okay? Bye.","content.76.849":"Put me out of my misery, how much?","content.76.850":"Well, if I'm guaranteed to become a bandit, here they are!","content.76.851":"No, I'm here to make money, not lose it!","content.76.852":"That's more like it, let's call it 150 kamas!","content.76.853":"That's enough, bye!","content.76.854":"No, I don't have enough money. Bye.","content.76.855":"Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.856":"Could you teach me a profession?","content.76.857":"I want to take a profession test.","content.76.858":"It smells of good taste and kamas, how luxurious!","content.76.859":"I'll leave you to your work. Bye!","content.76.860":"I like shiny things. Can you teach me the jeweler profession?","content.76.861":"I would like to learn how to make clothes.","content.76.862":"I'd really get a kick out of leather dealing.","content.76.863":"Life is hard. That's why I'd like to learn to make armor.","content.76.864":"Jeweler.","content.76.865":"Tailor.","content.76.866":"Leather dealer.","content.76.867":"Armorer.","content.76.868":"Actually, I'd like to learn a profession.","content.76.870":"It smells like sweat and hot metal here!","content.76.871":"I'm just passing through. Bye...","content.76.872":"Scrapping is all I care about. I want to become a close-combat weapons master.","content.76.873":"I like doing damage without putting myself at risk. I want to become a long-distance weapons master.","content.76.874":"I love huge assaults. Teach me to be an area-of-effect weapons master.","content.76.878":"Wow, it rocks here! Is this your doing?","content.76.879":"Environmental quests? What do you mean?","content.76.880":"Well, keep it up, I adore your work. See you soon.","content.76.881":"And does the Governor know this sort of thing goes on?","content.76.882":"That's interesting. Goodbye.","content.76.883":"Thanks for the info. Bye.","content.76.884":"On the market?!","content.76.885":"I'd like to be able to protect my frail body. Where can I get some armor?","content.76.886":"Thanks. Bye!","content.76.890":"Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.892":"Xav, your bread is famous all over Amakna. What's your secret?","content.76.893":"That's very interesting. Thank you. See you soon.","content.76.894":"Golden Wheat, you say?","content.76.895":"Thanks a lot, Xav. See you soon.","content.76.896":"On the market?!","content.76.897":"I'm hungry. Isn't there anything to eat around here?","content.76.898":"Thank you, dahling.","content.76.902":"Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.904":"There are some dodgy people in the forest, aren't there?","content.76.905":"Their hideout? Where's that?","content.76.906":"Thank you for the advice. See you soon.","content.76.908":"That's good to know. Thank you. See you soon.","content.76.909":"Here goes...","content.76.911":"What is the Ingalsse family secret to getting such prosperous harvests?","cont