ed?","content.76.949":"Thank you for the advice. See you soon.","content.76.950":"Why are you waiting here instead of going home?","content.76.951":"If I find the key, I'll teach that Gobball War Chief a lesson he won't forget. See you soon.","content.76.953":"Well, actually... Here's my passport.","content.76.954":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.955":"Can I stand for election too?","content.76.956":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.957":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.958":"Can I stand for election too?","content.76.959":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.960":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.961":"Okay, I'll be careful. Bye!","content.76.962":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.963":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.964":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.967":"What's that castle?","content.76.969":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.970":"Can I stand for election too?","content.76.971":"Oh, so there are laws?","content.76.972":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.973":"And what happens if you get arrested?","content.76.974":"Ok, I'll be careful. See you soon.","content.76.976":"Here goes...","content.76.977":"I give up, it's the smart choice.","content.76.978":"You won't be seeing me behind bars anytime soon. Goodbye!","content.76.979":"Okay.","content.76.980":"Another thing...","content.76.981":"See you soon.","content.76.982":"That sounds tempting.","content.76.984":"What are you telling me?","content.76.985":"Another thing...","content.76.986":"See you soon.","content.76.987":"Thanks. See you later!","content.76.990":"I'm feeling a bit lost...","content.76.995":"No thanks, I like the color they are just now.","content.76.998":"Thanks. I hope I'll find what I'm looking for.","content.76.999":"Yep, that's right. I was locked in and the Misses went off pony riding.","content.76.1000":"I drank s