"content.76.1223":"I want to take a profession test.","content.76.1224":"It smells of good taste and kamas, how luxurious!","content.76.1225":"I'll leave you to your work. Bye!","content.76.1226":"I like shiny things. Can you teach me the jeweler profession?","content.76.1227":"I would like to learn how to make clothes.","content.76.1228":"I'd really get a kick out of leather dealing.","content.76.1229":"Life is hard. That's why I'd like to learn to make armor.","content.76.1230":"Actually, I'm not interested in any of those. See you soon.","content.76.1231":"Jeweler.","content.76.1232":"Tailor.","content.76.1233":"Leather dealer.","content.76.1234":"Armorer.","content.76.1235":"I'll read it and get back to you.","content.76.1236":"Metals.","content.76.1237":"Gemstones.","content.76.1238":"Stems and leaves.","content.76.1239":"Kamas.","content.76.1240":"A blacksmith.","content.76.1241":"A miner.","content.76.1242":"A jeweler.","content.76.1243":"A convict.","content.76.1244":"Breastplates, epaulettes, and boots.","content.76.1245":"Breastplates, epaulettes, shields, and hats.","content.76.1246":"Breastplates, epaulettes, and hats.","content.76.1247":"Breastplates, epaulettes, and shields.","content.76.1248":"A forge.","content.76.1249":"An armory.","content.76.1250":"A DIY workshop.","content.76.1251":"A textile workshop.","content.76.1252":"Thanks!","content.76.1253":"Thanks, I'll come back as soon as I'm done.","content.76.1254":"Gemstones.","content.76.1255":"Leather.","content.76.1256":"Kamas.","content.76.1257":"Flowers.","content.76.1258":"A miner.","content.76.1259":"A convict.","content.76.1260":"A collector.","content.76.1261":"An antique dealer.","content.76.1262":"Rings and bracelets.","content.76.1263":"Amulets, rings, and earrings.","content.76.1264":"Amulets and talismans.","content.76.1265":"Amulets and rings.","content.76.1266":"A forge.","content.76.1267":"A DIY workshop.","content.76.1268":"A setter.","content.76.1269":"A prison.","content.76.1270":"Thanks!","content.76.1271":"Ok, I'll get studying and come back.","content.76.1272":"Skins, fur, stems, or leaves.","content.76.1273":"Skins, fur, or leather.","content.76.1274":"Leather, stems, or leaves.","content.76.1275":"Leather and good music.","content.76.1276":"Trappers and tailors.","content.76.1277":"Trappers and herbalists.","content.76.1278":"Trappers and lumberjacks.","content.76.1279":"Trappers and hunters.","content.76.1280":"He can plait the stems into rope.","content.76.1281":"He can weave the fur into material.","content.76.1282":"He can refine the animal skins into leather.","content.76.1283":"He can fold the leaves to make a little pot.","content.76.1284":"Boots, cloaks, and pouches.","content.76.1285":"Boots, belts, and gloves.","content.76.1286":"Boots, bags, and gloves.","content.76.1287":"Boots, belts, and bags.","content.76.1288":"Thanks!","content.76.1289":"Ok, hon. I'll have a look at that and then come back.","content.76.1290":"Skins, fur, stems, or leaves.","content.76.1291":"Skins, fur, or leather.","content.76.1292":"Leather, stems, or leaves.","content.76.1293":"Material and thread.","content.76.1294":"Trappers and fishermen.","content.76.1295":"Trappers.","content.76.1296":"Trappers and herbalists.","content.76.1297":"Trappers and lumberjacks.","content.76.1298":"Refining certain stems and leaves into dyes.","content.76.1299":"Refining certain stems and leaves into fabrics.","content.76.1300":"Weaving certain stems and leaves into necklaces.","content.76.1301":"Refining certain stems and leaves into oils.","content.76.1302":"Cloaks, gloves, and boots.","content.76.1303":"Cloaks and gloves.","content.76.1304":"Hats, cloaks, and boots.","content.76.1305":"Hats and cloaks.","content.76.1306":"Thanks!","content.76.1307":"Thanks, I'll go and learn the basics. See you later.","content.76.1309":"Ores.","content.76.1310":"Ores and precious stones.","content.76.1311":"Mines.","content.76.1312":"Dust.","content.76.1313":"...","content.76.1319":"Salt.","content.76.1320":"Iron tablets.","content.76.1321":"Gold-fish.","content.76.1322":"None.","content.76.1323":"...","content.76.1324":"Blacksmith.","content.76.1325":"Weapons master and kama minter.","content.76.1326":"Handyman.","content.76.1327":"Jeweler.","content.76.1328":"...","content.76.1329":"I'll remember that! The mines are all mine!","content.76.1330":"She must really be something. See you later!","content.76.1331":"That sounds like very useful advice. See you soon.","content.76.1332":"And if I respect them, will I get a reward?","content.76.1333":"I'll be careful. Bye!","content.76.1334":"Gemi? Why did she leave?","content.76.1335":"Oh! Hey! Really? Great. Bye.","content.76.1336":"Sooo... you and the trees seem very... close.","content.76.1337":"Thanks, I love your work.","content.76.1338":"Of course, even in water.","content.76.1339":"In any type of grass.","content.76.1340":"In a good quality pan.","content.76.1341":"No, only in certain special soils.","content.76.1342":"Handymen.","content.76.1343":"Jewelers.","content.76.1344":"Boarders.","content.76.1345":"No one.","content.76.1346":"A sawmill.","content.76.1347":"A planker.","content.76.1348":"An anvil.","content.76.1349":"A refiner.","content.76.1350":"Prune the cuttings.","content.76.1351":"Pick the fruit.","content.76.1352":"Pick the berries.","content.76.1353":"Drop a log.","content.76.1354":"Cuttings.","content.76.1355":"Wood.","content.76.1356":"Planks.","content.76.1357":"Nothing, the trees grow back by themselves.","content.76.1363":"Revise I'm going to. Bye!","content.76.1365":"That sounds like very useful advice. See you soon.","content.76.1366":"And if I respect them, will I get a reward?","content.76.1367":"I'll be careful. Bye!","content.76.1375":"I was just taking a walk. Bye.","content.76.1376":"Could you teach me a profession?","content.76.1377":"I want a profession. Test me!","content.76.1378":"This place is packed and it smells like freshly baked bread.","content.76.1379":"I'll leave you to your work. Bye!","content.76.1380":"Your talents know no limits! I'd really like to become a baker, like you.","content.76.1381":"I'd like to be able to cook some nice dishes.","content.76.1382":"I've always wanted to be able to make my own furniture.","content.76.1383":"I've read your manual and now I'm ready to take the baker test.","content.76.1384":"I know the basics of the chef profession pretty well. I think I'm ready to take the test.","content.76.1385":"I think I'm ready to become a <b>handyman</b>.","content.76.1386":"On the market?!","content.76.1387":"I want to hit something! Where are the weapons?","content.76.1388":"Thanks. Bye!","content.76.1392":"Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.1394":"Thanks. See you later.","content.76.1395":"Trapper.","content.76.1396":"Miner.","content.76.1397":"Miller.","content.76.1398":"Farmer.","content.76.1399":"They're crusty.","content.76.1400":"They are the only things to give you back HP.","content.76.1401":"You can use them to teleport.","content.76.1402":"They make you look younger.","content.76.1403":"Any time.","content.76.1404":"Only during battles.","content.76.1405":"Only when not in battle.","content.76.1406":"Public holidays.","content.76.1407":"An oven.","content.76.1408":"A sloven.","content.76.1409":"An anvil.","content.76.1410":"A pastrier.","content.76.1411":"Thanks!","content.76.1412":"Thanks. See you later.","content.76.1413":"Miner, fisherman, and herbalist.","content.76.1414":"Trapper, fisherman, and farmer.","content.76.1415":"Trapper, fisherman, and herbalist.","content.76.1416":"Fisherman and trapper.","content.76.1417":"They're crusty.","content.76.1418":"They can give you a temporary bonus.","content.76.1419":"They can give you a permanent bonus.","content.76.1420":"They make you look younger.","content.76.1421":"Any time.","content.76.1422":"Only during battles.","content.76.1423":"Only when not in battle.","content.76.1424":"Once in the morning, once at noon, and once in the evening.","content.76.1425":"A saucepan.","content.76.1426":"A stove.","content.76.1427":"A heater.","content.76.1428":"A leek pie.","content.76.1429":"Thanks!","content.76.1430":"Thanks. See you later.","content.76.1431":"Wood and planks.","content.76.1432":"Planks and nails.","content.76.1433":"Wood and glue.","content.76.1434":"Gingerbread.","content.76.1435":"Herbalist.","content.76.1436":"Boarder.","content.76.1437":"Miner.","content.76.1438":"Lumberjack.","content.76.1439":"Crafting machines for the Governor.","content.76.1440":"Furniture for houses.","content.76.1441":"Display windows, furniture, and crafting machines for Haven Bags.","content.76.1442":"Pants.","content.76.1443":"A molder.","content.76.1444":"A demolder.","content.76.1445":"A wood lathe.","content.76.1446":"An Ikeamakna kit.","content.76.1447":"Thanks!","content.76.1448":"A little green friend who talks like you I know.","content.76.1449":"Erm... Yes, um... I'm... Sorry. Goodbye.","content.76.1454":"Nothing right now. Sorry to have disturbed you. Goodbye.","content.76.1456":"Thanks for the information. See you soon!","content.76.1460":"Thanks. Goodbye.","content.76.1464":"On the market?!","content.76.1465":"I have sensitive skin. Where can I find some armor?","content.76.1469":"Actually, I'd like to learn a profession.","content.76.1471":"The sound of the anvils around here is deafening.","content.76.1472":"I'm just passing through. Bye.","content.76.1515":"On the market?!","content.76.1516":"I'm hungry. Isn't there anything to eat around here?","content.76.1517":"Thank you, dahling.","content.76.1521":"Thanks for the information. See you soon!","content.76.1523":"A Xelor? I don't need a timer, I want to be a miner. I want to MINE!","content.76.1524":"I've had a great idea for an environmental quest!","content.76.1525":"The aim is to find Ogrest and stuff the Dofus up his nose and...","content.76.1526":"We put crates all around the territory, and inside one of them there'll be a disgusting Trool and...","content.76.1527":"You have to find a ring, then go to Brakmar and throw it into a volcano... ","content.76.1528":"Uh... Yeah, okay, why not?","content.76.1529":"Oh yeah!!! I'll tell the boss about it if I see him. Goodbye!","content.76.1530":"You sure you're ok, Grandpa? You seem a little... Out of sorts.","content.76.1531":"No no, I meant you looked worried.","content.76.1532":"Forget it. Bye!","content.76.1533":"But... That's not what I meant...","content.76.1534":"Forget it. Bye!","content.76.1535":"That's a shame. Bye.","content.76.1536":"Pff... Ignoramus. Goodbye...","content.76.1541":"Your environmental quests really got me thinking. I reckon I have an idea.","content.76.1542":"Urgh, living here all the time can't be easy.","content.76.1543":"Wow! You've lived a really full life for a salamander.","content.76.1549":"Awesome! Do you want to be my friend?","content.76.1550":"Crocobur... The sword. Does that sound familiar?","content.76.1551":"I'll let you take your bath in peace. Bye!","content.76.1552":"I think I'd better leave you in peace. Bye.","content.76.1553":"Ok, I'll have to get some more information. See you soon.","content.76.1554":"You have to release the Outlaws, and then carry out justice by putting as many of them as possible back in prison...","content.76.1555":"We could get all the weapons masters together and see who can make a sword the fastest...","content.76.1556":"You have to find a ring, then go to Brakmar and throw it into a volcano...","content.76.1557":"But... I thought justice... I mean...","content.76.1560":"I'm glad you like it. I'll pass that on to the Governor.","content.76.1561":"I... Sorry... Bye!","content.76.1562":"What are you talking about?!","content.76.1563":"Forget it. Bye!","content.76.1564":"You must have hit your head a bit too often down in the mines...","content.76.1565":"Forget it. Bye!","content.76.1566":"I can't hear anything... It must be in your head, Grandpa.","content.76.1567":"Forget it. Bye!","content.76.1568":"That's great.  Thanks for the advice. See you soon.","content.76.1569":"Is he really that bad?","content.76.1570":"You don't say... I'll be careful, in that case. See you soon.","content.76.1572":"Thanks. Have a nice day.","content.76.1573":"I made some very interesting discoveries in the swamp. Do you know Crocoburio?","content.76.1574":"I need to know. I'll take it!","content.76.1575":"Thanks. I'll be back soon. Bye!","content.76.1580":"I'm sure I've heard your name before...","content.76.1581":"No, that's not why. Are you related to a Gobbowl player, by any chance?","content.76.1582":"That must be it. Thank you. See you soon.","content.76.1583":"He used to be a great player, though! Did he train around here?","content.76.1584":"I guess you know best. Thanks for the advice. Bye for now.","content.76.1586":"I bet! I'm going to check out the area. See you later!","content.76.1591":"I've heard a lot about you. People say your father was a drago...","content.76.1592":"White? But... I... Okay, see you.","content.76.1593":"I believe I heard you had a sword called Crocobur. May I take a look at it?","content.76.1594":"And you're not Crocoburio, those texts can prove it! The gods wouldn't have made the one who destroyed Bonta a protector!","content.76.1595":"You dirty usurper, where is the Crocobur?","content.76.1596":"Thanks, I'll keep your secret. See you.","content.76.1598":"I must have misread the stone hidden in the swamp! Goodbye.","content.76.1599":"Powerful? Tell me where it is!","content.76.1600":"I give up, you're too creepy. Goodbye.","content.76.1603":"I want to become a citizen of Amakna.","content.76.1608":"Hoo-hooray! My good deed for the day! I'll go and see him now.","content.76.1619":"Hoo-hooray! My good deed for the day! I'll go and see him now.","content.76.1632":"Hmm... like a feedback system! I hadn't thought of that. I'll give it a shot.","content.76.1633":"Speak for yourself, you badly groomed pencil-pusher! Til never!","content.76.1634":"Uhh... Thanks. Goodbye.","content.76.1635":"Yes, Amakna can't wait any longer!","content.76.1636":"Errr... Thank you. I'll go and see him.","content.76.1637":"I've still got a few things to sort out. See you soon.","content.76.1638":"Yes, Bonta can't wait any longer!","content.76.1639":"I've still got a few things to sort out. See you soon.","content.76.1640":"I found something strange in the woods. Do you know what it is?","content.76.1641":"Calm down, dear... I'm going...","content.76.1642":"Uhh... Thanks. Goodbye.","content.76.1645":"You're my hero, Master Yew-Teeny!","content.76.1646":"I'll do my best, Master Yew-Teeny.","content.76.1647":"May the force be with you!","content.76.1648":"Thanks. Goodbye.","content.76.1658":"Speak for yourself, you badly groomed pencil-pusher! Til never!","content.76.1665":"Hmm... like a feedback system! I hadn't thought of that. I'll give it a shot.","content.76.1666":"Thanks. Goodbye.","content.76.1670":"Sokay, I'm ready to leave Incarnam.","content.76.1671":"Amakna, of course! Silly question!","content.76.1672":"I'll go straight to Bonta!","content.76.1673":"Ready...","content.76.1674":"Great, I'm ready to go!","content.76.1675":"Great, I'm ready to go!","content.76.1676":"Thanks, I'll head straight there.","content.76.1677":"Could you teach me the chef profession?","content.76.1678":"I want a profession. Test me!","content.76.1679":"This place is packed and it smells like freshly baked bread.","content.76.1680":"I'll leave you to your work. Bye!","content.76.1681":"Thanks!","content.76.1682":"A saucepan.","content.76.1683":"A stove.","content.76.1684":"A heater.","content.76.1685":"A leek pie.","content.76.1686":"Any time.","content.76.1687":"Only during battles.","content.76.1688":"Only when not in battle.","content.76.1689":"Once in the morning, once at noon, and once in the evening.","content.76.1690":"They're crusty.","content.76.1691":"They can give you a temporary bonus.","content.76.1692":"They can give you a