 do respect them?","content.76.2262":"I have magic fingers, just wait and see.","content.76.2267":"Thanks for the info. Bye.","content.76.2268":"That's a shame. Bye.","content.76.2269":"Great! I'll mention it to him if I see him. Bye!","content.76.2270":"If that's the way it is, then I bid you farewell.","content.76.2271":"And does the Governor know this sort of thing goes on?","content.76.2272":"That's interesting. Goodbye.","content.76.2273":"The aim is to find Ogrest, take a good yank at his nose hairs and...","content.76.2274":"During the Striches' love parades, we'd accost them and pluck out all their feathers and...","content.76.2275":"You need to find a little fellow with a ring, beat him up a bit and...","content.76.2276":"Environmental quests? What do you mean?","content.76.2277":"Ahh, so that's what it was... Thank you.","content.76.2281":"There are loads of people here, is something special going on?","content.76.2282":"Now my meditation has cleared my mind, I have a great idea for an environmental quest!","content.76.2283":"Sorry about the noise; I'm just passing through.","content.76.2284":"Thanks.","content.76.2285":"Of course, even in water.","content.76.2286":"In any type of grass.","content.76.2287":"In a good quality pan.","content.76.2288":"No, only in certain special soils.","content.76.2289":"Handymen.","content.76.2290":"Jewelers.","content.76.2291":"Boarders.","content.76.2292":"No one.","content.76.2293":"A sawmill.","content.76.2294":"A planker.","content.76.2295":"An anvil.","content.76.2296":"A refiner.","content.76.2297":"Prune the cuttings.","content.76.2298":"Pick the fruit.","content.76.2299":"Pick the berries.","content.76.2300":"Drop a log.","content.76.2301":"Cuttings.","content.76.2302":"Wood.","content.76.2303":"Planks.","content.76.2304":"Nothing, the trees grow back by themselves.","content.76.2310":"Thanks. See you later!","content.76.2311":"Hi, who are you?","content.76.2312":"Leave? What's keeping you here?","content.76.2313":"Yes, do enlighten me - what are you doing here?","content.76.2315":"And when are you going to leave this hole?","content.76.2316":"Hey, you've got my attention there... How much is it?","content.76.2318":"Here's the light!","content.76.2319":"I have nothing to give you, Woolly...","content.76.2320":"I don't have my kamas on me right now, I'll come back later.","content.76.2321":"Very well, I'll let you meditate on sewing. See you!","content.76.2322":"Thanks, I'll make sure I use it well.","content.76.2323":"You're right, there's nothing more for me to do here.","content.76.2325":"Thanks!","content.76.2326":"An oven.","content.76.2327":"A sloven.","content.76.2328":"An anvil.","content.76.2329":"A pastrier.","content.76.2330":"Any time.","content.76.2331":"Only during battles.","content.76.2332":"Only when not in battle.","content.76.2333":"Public holidays.","content.76.2334":"They're crusty.","content.76.2335":"They are the only things to give you back HP.","content.76.2336":"You can use them to teleport.","content.76.2337":"They make you look younger.","content.76.2338":"Trapper.","content.76.2339":"Miner.","content.76.2340":"Miller.","content.76.2341":"Farmer.","content.76.2342":"Thanks. See you later.","content.76.2343":"Thanks!","content.76.2344":"A saucepan.","content.76.2345":"A stove.","content.76.2346":"A heater.","content.76.2347":"A leek pie.","content.76.2348":"Any time.","content.76.2349":"Only during battles.","content.76.2350":"Only when not in battle.","content.76.2351":"Once in the morning, once at noon, and once in the evening.","content.76.2352":"They're crusty.","content.76.2353":"They can give you a temporary bonus.","content.76.2354":"They can give you a permanent bonus.","content.76.2355":"They make you look younger.","content.76.2356":"Miner, fisherman, and herbalist.","content.76.2357":"Trapper, fisherman, and farmer.","content.76.2358":"Trapper, fisherman, and herbalist.","content.76.2359":"Fisherman and trapper.","content.76.2360":"Thanks. See you later.","content.76.2361":"Thanks!","content.76.2362":"A molder.","content.76.2363":"A demolder.","content.76.2364":"A wood lathe.","content.76.2365":"An Ikeamakna kit.","content.76.2366":"Crafting machines for the Governor.","content.76.2367":"Furniture for houses.","content.76.2368":"Display windows, furniture, and crafting machines for Haven Bags.","content.76.2369":"Pants.","content.76.2370":"Herbalist.","content.76.2371":"Boarder.","content.76.2372":"Miner.","content.76.2373":"Lumberjack.","content.76.2374":"Wood and planks.","content.76.2375":"Planks and nails.","content.76.2376":"Wood and glue.","content.76.2377":"Gingerbread.","content.76.2378":"Thanks. See you later.","content.76.2380":"Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.2384":"Thanks. Bye!","content.76.2385":"I've read your manual and now I'm ready to take the baker test.","content.76.2386":"I know the basics of the chef profession pretty well. I think I'm ready to take the test.","content.76.2387":"I think I'm ready to become a <b>handyman</b>.","content.76.2388":"On the market?!","content.76.2389":"I want to hit something! Where are the weapons?","content.76.2390":"I'd like to make me some dough by baking bread.","content.76.2391":"I'd like to be able to cook some nice dishes.","content.76.2392":"I've always wanted to be able to make my own furniture.","content.76.2393":"Could you teach me a profession?","content.76.2394":"I want a profession. Test me!","content.76.2395":"This place is packed and it smells like fine wood.","content.76.2396":"I'll leave you to your work, goodbye.","content.76.2397":"Thanks!","content.76.2398":"A forge.","content.76.2399":"An armory.","content.76.2400":"A DIY workshop.","content.76.2401":"A textile workshop.","content.76.2402":"Breastplates, epaulettes, and boots.","content.76.2403":"Breastplates, epaulettes, shields, and hats.","content.76.2404":"Breastplates, epaulettes, and hats.","content.76.2405":"Breastplates, epaulettes, and shields.","content.76.2406":"A blacksmith.","content.76.2407":"A miner.","content.76.2408":"A jeweler.","content.76.2409":"A convict.","content.76.2410":"Metals.","content.76.2411":"Gemstones.","content.76.2412":"Stems and leaves.","content.76.2413":"Kamas.","content.76.2414":"I'll read it and get back to you.","content.76.2415":"Thanks!","content.76.2416":"A forge.","content.76.2417":"A DIY workshop.","content.76.2418":"A setter.","content.76.2419":"A prison.","content.76.2420":"Rings and bracelets.","content.76.2421":"Amulets, rings, and earrings.","content.76.2422":"Amulets and talismans.","content.76.2423":"Amulets and rings.","content.76.2424":"A miner.","content.76.2425":"A convict.","content.76.2426":"A collector.","content.76.2427":"An antique dealer.","content.76.2428":"Gemstones.","content.76.2429":"Leather.","content.76.2430":"Kamas.","content.76.2431":"Flowers.","content.76.2432":"Thanks, I'll be back when I've done that.","content.76.2433":"Thanks!","content.76.2434":"Boots, cloaks, and pouches.","content.76.2435":"Boots, belts, and gloves.","content.76.2436":"Boots, bags, and gloves.","content.76.2437":"Boots, belts, and bags.","content.76.2438":"He can plait the stems into rope.","content.76.2439":"He can weave the fur into material.","content.76.2440":"He can refine the animal skins into leather.","content.76.2441":"He can fold the leaves to make a little pot.","content.76.2442":"Trappers and tailors.","content.76.2443":"Trappers and herbalists.","content.76.2444":"Trappers and lumberjacks.","content.76.2445":"Trappers and hunters.","content.76.2446":"Skins, fur, stems, or leaves.","content.76.2447":"Skins, fur, or leather.","content.76.2448":"Leather, stems, or leaves.","content.76.2449":"Leather and good music.","content.76.2450":"Ok, I'll get studying and come back.","content.76.2451":"Thanks!","content.76.2452":"Cloaks, gloves, and boots.","content.76.2453":"Cloaks and gloves.","content.76.2454":"Hats, cloaks, and boots.","content.76.2455":"Hats and cloaks.","content.76.2456":"Refining certain stems and leaves into dyes.","content.76.2457":"Refining certain stems and leaves into fabrics.","content.76.2458":"Weaving certain stems and leaves into necklaces.","content.76.2459":"Refining certain stems and leaves into oils.","content.76.2460":"Trappers and fishermen.","content.76.2461":"Trappers.","content.76.2462":"Trappers and herbalists.","content.76.2463":"Trappers and lumberjacks.","content.76.2464":"Skins, fur, stems, or leaves.","content.76.2465":"Skins, fur, or leather.","content.76.2466":"Leather, stems, or leaves.","content.76.2467":"Material and thread.","content.76.2468":"I'll get studying and then come back.","content.76.2470":"Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.2474":"Thanks a lot.","content.76.2475":"Jeweler.","content.76.2476":"Tailor.","content.76.2477":"Leather dealer.","content.76.2478":"Armorer.","content.76.2479":"On the market?!","content.76.2480":"Unfortunately, luxurious wares like those won't fill my belly. Is there somewhere to eat?","content.76.2481":"I like shiny things. Can you teach me the jeweler profession?","content.76.2482":"I would like to learn how to make clothes.","content.76.2483":"I'd really get a kick out of leather dealing.","content.76.2484":"Life is hard. That's why I'd like to learn to make armor.","content.76.2485":"Actually, I'm not interested in any of those. See you soon.","content.76.2486":"Could you teach me a profession?","content.76.2487":"I want to take a profession test.","content.76.2488":"Everything here is elegant and tasteful, from the clothes to the bridge itself.","content.76.2489":"I'll leave you to your work, goodbye.","content.76.2490":"Broo?","content.76.2491":"Bra braf...","content.76.2492":"Gnarf gnarf!","content.76.2493":"???","content.76.2494":"...","content.76.2495":"Huh?","content.76.2496":"...","content.76.2497":"I made some very interesting discoveries in the Cania Swamps. Do you know Crocoburio?","content.76.2498":"I made some very interesting discoveries in the Cania Swamps. Do you know Crocoburio?","content.76.2499":"I need to know. I'll take it!","content.76.2500":"Thanks, I'll come back later. Goodbye.","content.76.2501":"I need to know. I'll take it!","content.76.2502":"Thanks, I'll come back later. Goodbye.","content.76.2503":"Me? Of course not, I'm just about to show him what I'm made of!","content.76.2504":"It doesn't matter anyway, I'm going to take care of myself now.","content.76.2505":"I understand. I'm going to fly with my own wings now.","content.76.2506":"Let's go! I'll attack the Gobbly!","content.76.2507":"Sounds fair, but where can I find these quills?","content.76.2508":"So, I need to choose a Nation, right?","content.76.2509":"Okay, go ahead and tell me. That stuff's boring, but I kind of like it.","content.76.2510":"No, I'm going to make my own way forward now!","content.76.2511":"Yeah, a bit... What's going on?","content.76.2512":"Stop treating me like a noo-hoob, Screech, are you going to teach me to play or what?","content.76.2513":"Great, I'm ready to go!","content.76.2514":"On this trapdoor?","content.76.2515":"Hoo-hooray! My good deed for the day! I'll go and see him now.","content.76.2516":"Thanks. Goodbye.","content.76.2533":"Hmm... like a feedback system! I hadn't thought of that. I'll give it a shot.","content.76.2534":"Speak for yourself, you badly groomed pencil-pusher! Til never!","content.76.2535":"Uhh... Thanks. Bye!","content.76.2536":"Uhh... Thanks. Bye!","content.76.2537":"Yes, Sufokia can't wait any longer!","content.76.2538":"I've still got a few things to sort out. See you soon.","content.76.2539":"Thanks. Keep fishin'!","content.76.2540":"Oh right... Well, bye then.","content.76.2541":"I have all that in my pouch! Here!","content.76.2542":"I'm sorry, I have nothing to give you.","content.76.2543":"I don't have anything to eat on me, I'll come back later.","content.76.2545":"They seem really practical, though! If you like, I can take one off your hands...","content.76.2546":"Believe me, the air is better outside. But what I really want to know is what those things are, piled up next to you?","content.76.2547":"Uh... What spaces do you mean?","content.76.2549":"Looks like there aren't even enough for one, just sayin'. Seeya.","content.76.2550":"Well, okay, since I'm already here...","content.76.2551":"\"The Sisters of Dathura\"","content.76.2552":"\"The Last Sentry\"","content.76.2553":"\"Ogrest's Cult\"","content.76.2554":"\"Otamai's Disciples\"","content.76.2555":"\"The Aprophetics\"","content.76.2556":"That'll be all, thanks.","content.76.2557":"Show me the books, you dirty fowl!","content.76.2558":"Ogrest's Chaos, I've changed my mind. Bye.","content.76.2559":"I don't have enough money. Goodbye.","content.76.2561":"Ok, I'll be careful. See you soon.","content.76.2562":"And what happens if you get arrested?","content.76.2563":"Ok, I'll be careful. See you soon.","content.76.2564":"Can I stand for election too?","content.76.2565":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.2566":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.2567":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.2568":"Can I stand for election too?","content.76.2569":"Oh, so there are laws?","content.76.2570":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.2571":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.2572":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.2573":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.2574":"Thanks for the info, I'll find out about that. Bye!","content.76.2575":"I will. Thanks!","content.76.2576":"I need to know. I'll take it!","content.76.2577":"Thanks, I'll come back later. Goodbye.","content.76.2578":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.2579":"Can I stand for election too?","content.76.2580":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.2581":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.2582":"Thanks a lot.","content.76.2583":"A cloak? It's time I got rid of this box!","content.76.2584":"French text only.","content.76.2587":"What's that castle?","content.76.2588":"Do you have any more information on Ogrest?","content.76.2589":"I'd like to really devote myself to serving Sufokia. But how?","content.76.2590":"I'd like to really devote myself to serving Sufokia. But how?","content.76.2591":"Did you know that I've beaten at least 10 Outlaws?","content.76.2592":"Did you know that I've been in a fight with a Clan Member?","content.76.2593":"I'm ready to sign up to be a <b>guard</b>!","content.76.2594":"I'm ready to enlist as a <b>soldier</b>!","content.76.2595":"I'd like to resign from my role as a guard.","content.76.2596":"I'd like to resign from my role as a soldier.","content.76.2597":"I'd like to pick up a Guard Insignia, please.","content.76.2598":"I'd like to pick up a Soldier Insignia, please.","content.76.2600":"See you soon.","content.76.2601":"I will. Thanks!","content.76.2602":"By being elected by the people.","content.76.2603":"By finishing a dungeon.","content.76.2604":"By bribing a Clan Member.","content.76.2605":"By being appointed by the Governor.","content.76.2606":"An insignia.","content.76.2607":"A coat of arms.","content.76.2608":"A cloak.","content.76.2609":"A shield.","content.76.2610":"They herd Gobballs.","content.76.2611":"They have to conquer territories.","content.76.2612":"They catch Outlaws.","content.76.2613":"They protect the Governor.","content.76.2614":"I'll go and revise...","content.76.2615":"Patriot.","content.76.2616":"Citizen","content.76.2617":"Just anybody.","content.76.2618":"There is no minimum rank for being a guard.","content.76.2619":"Thanks, that's taken a load off my mind.","content.76.2620":"Coo-hool!","content.76.2621":"I'll be careful. Thanks!","content.76.2622":"I've thought about it long and hard. I'm sure.","content.76.2623":"On second thoughts, I'm going to think about it a little more.","content.76.2624":"I will. Thanks!","content.76.2625":"By being appointed by the governor.","content.76.2626":"By bribing a Clan Member.","content.76.2627":"By being elected by the people.","content.76.2628":"By finishing a dungeon.","content.76.2629":"A shield.","content.76.2630":"A coat of arms.","content.76.2631":"An insignia.","content.76.2632":"A cloak.","content.76.2633":"They catch Outlaws.","content.76.2634":"They protect the Governor.","content.76.2635":"They herd Gobballs.","content.76.2636":"They have to conquer and protect territories.","content.76.2637":"I'll go and revise...","content.76.2638":"Patriot.","content.76.2639":"Citizen","content.76.2640":"Just anybody.","content.76.2641":"There is no minimum rank for being a soldier.","content.76.2642":"Thanks, that's taken a load off my mind.","content.76.2643":"Coo-hool!","content.76.2644":"I'll be careful. Thanks!","content.76.2645":"I've thought about it long and hard. I'm sure.","content.76.2646":"On second thoughts, I'm going to think about it a little more.","content.76.2649":"I'm feeling a bit lost...","content.76.2654":"Totally! Uh... I think I'm gonna go take a walk.","content.76.2655":"Another thing...","content.76.2656":"See you soon.","content.76.2657":"That sounds tempting.","content.76.2658":"Another thing...","content.76.2659":"See you soon.","content.76.2660":"You're a Clan Member, aren't you? I'd like to know more about your territory.","content.76.2661":"Apart from your territory, what else is worth seeing in the region?","content.76.2662":"What else do I need to know about Sufokia?","content.76.2667":"Thanks, I hope I'll find what I'm looking for.","content.76.2668":"Thanks. See you later!","content.76.2669":"What are you telling me?","content.76.2670":"Thank you, O Clan Member! Goodbye!","content.76.2671":"Why not just tell me now?","content.76.2672":"Huh?","content.76.2673":"Yep, that's right. I went to do a surprise spot of fishing.","content.76.2674":"I drank some awful drink, and I ended up like this.","content.76.2677":"Thanks!","content.76.2678":"...","content.76.2679":"One of those hooks that lets you fish for another fish.","content.76.2680":"A bit of meat attached to the end of the line to attract rare fish.","content.76.2681":"A harpoon.","content.76.2682":"One of his fingers.","content.76.2683":"...","content.76.2684":"Handymen.","content.76.2685":"Chefs.","content.76.2686":"Boarders.","content.76.2687":"Fishmongers.","content.76.2688":"...","content.76.2689":"Yes.","content.76.2690":"Yes, but he has to confront the fish.","content.76.2691":"No, he might get a fish, an item, or nothing at all.","content.76.2692":"Yes, but he has to pay part of his catches to the territory's Clan Member.","content.76.2693":"...","content.76.2694":"On shoals of fish, in freshwater only.","content.76.2695":"On shoals of fish, in freshwater or seawater.","content.76.2696":"On shields belonging to adventurers only.","content.76.2697":"On shawls belonging to old women only.","content.76.2704":"I'll read it and come back. Thanks!","content.76.2708":"If I find the key, I'll teach that Gobball War Chief a lesson he won't forget. See you soon.","content.76.2713":"What are you doing hanging around here?","content.76.2714":"Nothing right now. Bye.","content.76.2731":"That sounds like very useful advice. See you soon.","content.76.2732":"And if I respect them, will I get a reward?","content.76.2733":"I'll be careful. Bye!","content.76.2737":"You seem to be very attached to your crops.","content.76.2739":"Nothing, thanks.","content.76.2740":"Here we go! Erm... I mean, thank you, sir!","content.76.2741":"...","content.76.2742":"Turn them into various types of flour.","content.76.2743":"Turn them into Bowmeow-pops.","content.76.2744":"Turn them into juice.","content.76.2745":"What is this? I don't even-","content.76.2746":"No, the fields are much more fertile.","content.76.2747":"Of course, the earth is welcoming.","content.76.2748":"Yes, but rocky land is best of all.","content.76.2749":"I don't even... What is this?","content.76.2750":"Pick the flowers.","content.76.2751":"Harvest the fruit.","content.76.2752":"Harvest the seeds.","content.76.2753":"What is this? I don't even-","content.76.2759":"Thanks, I'll make sure I learn it all!","content.76.2760":"Thanks, I'll bear it in mind. Bye!","content.76.2761":"Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.2762":"Haven Bags, eh? ","content.76.2764":"That really is very interesting. See you soon.","content.76.2765":"Thanks. Bye!","content.76.2766":"I've read your manual and now I'm ready to take the baker test.","content.76.2767":"I know the basics of the chef profession pretty well. I think I'm ready to take the test.","content.76.2768":"I think I'm ready to become a <b>handyman</b>.","content.76.2769":"On the market?!","content.76.2770":"I want to hit something! Where are the weapons?","content.76.2771":"I really like your buns. Could you teach me how to make mine just like that?","content.76.2772":"I'd like to be able to cook some nice dishes.","content.76.2773":"I've always wanted to be able to make my own furniture.","content.76.2774":"Could you teach me a profession?","content.76.2775":"I want a profession. Test me!","content.76.2776":"This place is packed and it smells like freshly baked bread.","content.76.2777":"I'll leave you to your work, goodbye.","content.76.2778":"Thanks!","content.76.2779":"An oven.","content.76.2780":"A sloven.","content.76.2781":"An anvil.","content.76.2782":"A pastrier.","content.76.2783":"Any time.","content.76.2784":"Only during battles.","content.76.2785":"Only when not in battle.","content.76.2786":"Public holidays.","content.76.2787":"They're crusty.","content.76.2788":"They are the only things to give you back HP.","content.76.2789":"You can use them to teleport.","content.76.2790":"They make you look younger.","content.76.2791":"Trapper.","content.76.2792":"Miner.","content.76.2793":"Miller.","content.76.2794":"Farmer.","content.76.2795":"Thanks. See you later.","content.76.2796":"Thanks!","content.76.2797":"A saucepan.","content.76.2798":"A stove.","content