? Huh?! What?","content.76.3593":"Yeah, I couldn't agree more, I do deserve a little miracle!","content.76.3594":"Urgh! Let me past, you... you... dead thing.","content.76.3595":"Silence, Wispy, I've found your royal water.","content.76.3596":"Honestly... I get the water, now I have to pour it over you... Can you not do anything yourself...?!","content.76.3597":"What is this place?","content.76.3598":"OK. Thanks.","content.76.3600":"Thanks for the advice.","content.76.3602":"I'm ready, I want to become a citizen of Amakna.","content.76.3603":"No, no. I'm sure.","content.76.3604":"You're right, I need to have a think.","content.76.3605":"No, no. I'm sure.","content.76.3606":"You're right, I need to have a think.","content.76.3607":"OK. Thanks.","content.76.3608":"Thanks for the advice.","content.76.3609":"I want to become a citizen of Bonta.","content.76.3610":"I'm ready, I want to become a citizen of Bonta.","content.76.3611":"What is this place?","content.76.3613":"I want to become a citizen of Brakmar.","content.76.3614":"I'm ready; I want to become a citizen of Brakmar.","content.76.3615":"What is this place?","content.76.3617":"Thanks for the advice.","content.76.3618":"OK. Thanks.","content.76.3619":"No, no. I'm sure.","content.76.3620":"You're right, I need to have a think.","content.76.3621":"I want to become a citizen of Sufokia.","content.76.3622":"I'm ready, I want to become a citizen of Sufokia.","content.76.3623":"What is this place?","content.76.3625":"Thanks for the advice.","content.76.3626":"OK. Thanks.","content.76.3627":"No, no. I'm sure.","content.76.3628":"You're right, I need to have a think.","content.76.3629":"I would like to learn a profession first.","content.76.3630":"I'm here to test my knowledge.","content.76.3634":"Um... I thought you were someone else. Bye.","content.76.3645":"I would like to learn the <b>farmer</b> profession.","content.76.3648":"I want to become a <b>lumberjack</b>.","content.76.3651":"I would like to learn the <b>miner</b> profession.","content.76.3654":"I would like to learn the <b>fisherman</b> profession.","content.76.3657":"None, thanks.","content.76.3659":"The farmer profession.","content.76.3662":"The lumberjack profession.","content.76.3665":"The miner profession.","content.76.3668":"The fisherman profession.","content.76.3670":"Actually, I've just changed my mind. Forget I said anything!","content.76.3696":"I need some more time...","content.76.3697":"Someone mentioned a Nation book, and...","content.76.3698":"It's like a dream! I choose Bonta without a doubt...","content.76.3699":"I need some more time...","content.76.3700":"Someone mentioned a Nation book, and...","content.76.3701":"Great! I choose Amakna...","content.76.3702":"That's just it, I want to belong to a Nation.","content.76.3703":"Battles? I love battles!","content.76.3704":"Hmm... I'm going to need to make some friends if I want to form an army...","content.76.3705":"Me, me! Choose me! Where is this baron?","content.76.3706":"Your Hero{[1*]?ïne:} is standing right in front of you! I'll bring you back this guy's scalp.","content.76.3714":"Cool, I'll go and have a goosey gander.","content.76.3715":"Thanks, I'll go and find out more right away.","content.76.3716":"I've made my choice, but I don't know where to go now...","content.76.3719":"What? Is that it? You're darned useless...","content.76.3723":"That sucks, but okay. See you soon.","content.76.3724":"What? Is that it? You're darned useless...","content.76.3725":"What? Is that it? You're darned useless...","content.76.3726":"What? Is that it? You're darned useless...","content.76.3727":"I'm with you for Ogrest, is there anything in it for me?","content.76.3728":"Urm... Or we could just leave that big wussy up there on his rock...?","content.76.3729":"You may have fooled me once, but you will not fool me twice... You're just a box... Boxes don't talk... They can't talk! You... are just... a... figment... of my... imagination!","content.76.3730":"But what about me? What's in it for me?","content.76.3733":"Right, okay, first step then: find a boat and sail to Zinit!","content.76.3734":"Yeah, alright, alright, I get the picture.","content.76.3736":"Flee? Me? Never!","content.76.3738":"I guess I'll have to cut your water off, then!","content.76.3739":"Yeah, well, I wasn't planning on sticking around here, to be honest.","content.76.3740":"I left my caution back in Astrub. Let's get going!","content.76.3741":"You might as well tell the gods about my success so far, no?","content.76.3742":"I'll get to it, thanks.","content.76.3743":"I'm dying to go back to Zinit Beach (Chapter 1).","content.76.3744":"No, thanks. I've had enough of that place for the moment.","content.76.3745":"All ready. Let's go back to Amakna!","content.76.3746":"All ready. Let's go back to Bonta!","content.76.3747":"All ready. Let's go back to Brakmar!","content.76.3748":"All ready. Let's go back to Sufokia!","content.76.3749":"All ready. Let's go back to Astrub!","content.76.3750":"Can you take me home?","content.76.3751":"Can you take me home?","content.76.3752":"Can you take me home?","content.76.3753":"Yeah, I know... I just came by to say goodbye.","content.76.3755":"It's as good as done!","content.76.3757":"Thank you, Master.","content.76.3760":"I can get you the 100 Wheat Grains if you like.","content.76.3761":"I can get you the 100 Gobball Slobbers if you like.","content.76.3762":"I actually have... uh... a cookery class to get to.","content.76.3763":"A-OK! Adventure, here I come!","content.76.3766":"Top notch! I'll get to it!","content.76.3767":"Gah! I think I'm gonna go now. Bye.","content.76.3768":"All that work for... Gah! I think I'm gonna go now. Bye.","content.76.3774":"All that work for... Gah! I think I'm gonna go now. Bye.","content.76.3775":"All that work for... Gah! I think I'm gonna go now. Bye.","content.76.3776":"Top notch! I'll get to it!","content.76.3777":"A-OK! Adventure, here I come!","content.76.3778":"I can get you the 100 Gobball Slobbers if you like.","content.76.3779":"I can get you the 100 Gobball Slobbers if you like.","content.76.3780":"I actually have... uh... a horse-riding class to get to.","content.76.3784":"All that work for... Gah! I think I'm gonna go now. Bye.","content.76.3785":"All that work for... Gah! I think I'm gonna go now. Bye.","content.76.3786":"Top notch! I'll get to it!","content.76.3787":"A-OK! Adventure, here I come!","content.76.3788":"I can get you the 25 Iron Ore if you like.","content.76.3789":"I can get you the 100 Gobball Slobbers if you like.","content.76.3790":"I actually have... uh... a class to get to. Sports class. Yeah.","content.76.3794":"Gah! I should go now... Goodbye.","content.76.3795":"Gah! I should go now... Goodbye.","content.76.3796":"Top notch! I'll get to it!","content.76.3797":"A-OK! Adventure, here I come!","content.76.3798":"I can get you the 100 Sturgeon if you like.","content.76.3799":"I can get you the 100 Gobball Slobbers if you like.","content.76.3800":"I actually have... uh... a class to get to. Sports class. Yeah.","content.76.3801":"I'm going to go look for serenity elsewhere. See ya.","content.76.3802":"Bandits, you say?","content.76.3803":"I'll show them whose path it's dangerous to cross! Pow!","content.76.3805":"Ok, if you say so...","content.76.3813":"Perhaps you have an idea on how to use this darned Box of Plasmogrine?","content.76.3814":"Perhaps you have an idea on how to use this darned Box of Plasmogrine?","content.76.3815":"Perhaps you have an idea on how to use this darned Box of Plasmogrine?","content.76.3816":"Perhaps you have an idea on how to use this darned Box of Plasmogrine?","content.76.3817":"I can't smell anything, my most odiferous King. Goodbye.","content.76.3819":"With all due respect... Laters, loser.","content.76.3820":"OK... Tell me this, will the Nun let me into the Undieworld if I light up all the candles?","content.76.3822":"Are you sure? Cos, see, there are medium-sized ones, big ones, and small ones, so if we try them all, and then try without the little ones, then the medium ones...","content.76.3824":"I'd like to go back to Truce Cavern (Chapter 2).","content.76.3825":"My group is ready. We're good to go.","content.76.3828":"Let's head down to Melancholy Falls (checkpoint 1).","content.76.3837":"Gotcha.","content.76.3839":"I'm afraid you're mistaken, Mister Mayor...!","content.76.3840":"What makes you think I'm crazy? Bye.","content.76.3841":"Vampyro? But... Who's that?","content.76.3843":"Hmmm, I'll go and pay a little visit to this local celebrity.","content.76.3844":"The villagers? Why?","content.76.3845":"But what...? And why...? How...? Meh, bye.","content.76.3846":"Hmmm, I'll go and pay a little visit to this local celebrity.","content.76.3847":"You what? You told me this place was safe!","content.76.3848":"I ain't afraid of no arena battles. Bring it on!","content.76.3849":"Do you know what? You're right! Take me home.","content.76.3851":"I think I'll just head on home and relax for now.","content.76.3857":"I need some help with the Undieworld riddle.","content.76.3858":"Or, hey, do the candles have an influence on the Nun's spectral color during the night? Or...","content.76.3859":"Here's another idea...","content.76.3860":"Simple - I'll poison myself using a secret recipe... Then I'll die near the six Bow Meow tombs, and then I can be used as fertilizer for the Schneks.","content.76.3861":"Well, I heard this thing about human sacrifices on the island....","content.76.3862":"Ah! Of cooouuurse! I'll cover myself with Rat Clette and set my eyes on fire using those little candles!","content.76.3863":"That clearus mea nuces problemae, salve.","content.76.3864":"Here's another idea...","content.76.3865":"Well, this one Feca once told me about Malus' Law and the quantity of light transmitted by a perfect polarizer.","content.76.3866":"And when a wave is polarized rectilinearly, the projection is proportional to the cosine of angle O defined above. So, if we take A to mean the exit amplitude, we find the following...","content.76.3867":"Here's another idea...","content.76.3868":"I'm going to go and see if the polarization of the incidental wave is orthogonal to the polarizer's axis. Science will save the day! Good morrow.","content.76.3869":"I give up. Curse the old Nun! Bye.","content.76.3870":"I give up. Curse the old Nun! Bye.","content.76.3872":"Can you take me home?","content.76.3874":"Thanks for the advice. Bye.","content.76.3875":"My group is ready. We're good to go.","content.76.3876":"Oh re-heally? Be right back...","content.76.3877":"Let's trot on over to Stalagmote Territory (checkpoint 2).","content.76.3878":"Take me to Shrapnel Cavern (checkpoint 3).","content.76.3879":"I want to go back to the Schlammer (checkpoint 4).","content.76.3881":"I need to think a little longer about this.","content.76.3882":"I ain't afraid of no arena battles. Bring it on!","content.76.3883":"Ah, well that won't take me long. Back in a jiffy.","content.76.3884":"To Truce Dungeons (checkpoint 5), fine sir!","content.76.3886":"OK, but don't expect me to clean up after myself.","content.76.3888":"I'll be cheering you on from the sidelines.","content.76.3889":"I'll be cheering you on from the sidelines.","content.76.3890":"I made some very interesting discoveries in the Cania Swamps. Do you know Crocoburio?","content.76.3892":"I looooooooove fairs, let's go!","content.76.3893":"I'm not here to have fun. Goodbye.","content.76.3894":"I looooooooove the fair, but no. Let's get outta here.","content.76.3895":"Okay, okay, I'll stay!","content.76.3896":"I looooooooove the fair, but no. Let's get outta here.","content.76.3897":"I looooooooove the fair, but no. Let's get outta here.","content.76.3898":"I looooooooove the fair, but no. Let's get outta here.","content.76.3899":"I looooooooove fairs, let's go!","content.76.3902":"Gotcha. Bye, then!","content.76.3904":"Sooo... I hear you've fought a certain Excarnus?","content.76.3906":"Yes, and I've faced all your pupils.","content.76.3907":"Yes, and I've faced all your pupils.","content.76.3908":"Yes, and I've faced all your pupils.","content.76.3909":"An Excarnate? What's that?","content.76.3910":"Why didn't the gods send them back to the Kingdom of the Dead?","content.76.3911":"Lemme at him! That way, I'll learn more about him and help you!","content.76.3912":"No problemo! This test'll be like falling off a Bambooto!","content.76.3918":"Uh... Yeah... That's sad. Anyway, I don't suppose you have any idea how I could get into the castle's archive room, do you?","content.76.3919":"Leave that to me. Thanks for your help! See you soon.","content.76.3927":"Isn't there anything we can do?!","content.76.3928":"Time for me to get Lunar, then!","content.76.3929":"Thanks a lot, Master!","content.76.3930":"Ready as I'll ever be! Let's get started!","content.76.3931":"I have the scroll! But it's blank! You hoodwinked me, old panda!","content.76.3932":"If I have to sit on a waterfall or walk on hot coals or something, I'm outta here.","content.76.3933":"What happened here?!","content.76.3934":"The Queen is beside herself! Do you have everything you need?","content.76.3936":"Okay, but how are you planning on getting in? The entrance is blocked.","content.76.3937":"Yeah, so...?","content.76.3938":"I may be small, but I can pack a punch!","content.76.3939":"Why don't you come down here and see for yourself, Crow?","content.76.3940":"What am I, your assistant now?!","content.76.3941":"Okay, I'll do it. But I'll be back to get you!","content.76.3942":"What now? Are you going to stop looking down on me or what? ","content.76.3943":"If I have anything to say about it, Boris Eca won't be the only one falling from grace.","content.76.3945":"Hey, I found this Schnek Egg. Can you eat these things?","content.76.3946":"Take me, oh please, take me now!!!","content.76.3947":"Not right now, thanks.","content.76.3948":"Thank you, Master, I'll go and find out what they've brewed up right away!","content.76.3949":"Oh. Uh... that's reassuring. Here you go.","content.76.3950":"Amakna tastes like home to me.","content.76.3951":"Bonta seems to be the only fair choice for me!","content.76.3952":"Brakmar - I think I'll have a fighting chance there!","content.76.3953":"Sufokia; after all, it seems like a nice plaice...","content.76.3955":"I've been ready all my life! Bring it on!","content.76.3956":"Check out the pretty bell I found.","content.76.3957":"That's a long story, but I need to fix it up!","content.76.3958":"Here are the ingredients you asked for.","content.76.3960":"Thanks! Duty calls.","content.76.3961":"Got it. I'll be back soon!","content.76.3962":"I have the scroll! But it's blank! You hoodwinked me, old panda!","content.76.3964":"Thank you, Master.","content.76.3969":"Tokens? Where do I get these tokens?","content.76.3970":"Thank you very much for this information.","content.76.3971":"Tokens? Where do I get these tokens?","content.76.3972":"Tokens? Where do I get these tokens?","content.76.3973":"Tokens? Where do I get these tokens?","content.76.3974":"Thank you very much for this information.","content.76.3975":"Thank you very much for this information.","content.76.3976":"Thank you very much for this information.","content.76.3977":"Ooh okay, I getcha. Bye!","content.76.3980":"The Moowolf is dead too.","content.76.3981":"The specialist was the Moowolf! He led us into his lair. It was a trap from the beginning!","content.76.3982":"Oh, a million kamas should do the trick.","content.76.3983":"You'll be laughing on the other side of your beak when I'm more experienced!","content.76.3991":"Can you tell me anything about the reserve?","content.76.3993":"Thank you, Master.","content.76.3994":"Can you tell me anything about the reserve?","content.76.3995":"Can you tell me anything about the reserve?","content.76.3996":"Okay, if you say so.","content.76.3998":"I'm on my way!","content.76.4010":"Open sesame!","content.76.4011":"Hmm? Oh, nothing. Sorry.","content.76.4023":"Bossowl told me that you had something for me?","content.76.4024":"...Thanks for the info... Vile!","content.76.4025":"Larsenus wants back what belongs to him.","content.76.4026":"Urgh, this paper is absolutely repulsive! I don't want it; keep it! ","content.76.4028":"Now you come to mention it, it does feel like I'm in Gobballand! What's Gobballing on?","content.76.4029":"Schweet! We're going to have loads of wool to keep us warm this winter then!","content.76.4030":"Okaaaay...","content.76.4033":"Hmmm... That sounds tempting... Okay, I'll do it!","content.76.4034":"I'm just having a stroll actually. Laters.","content.76.4035":"Pardon? Could you speak a bit louder?","content.76.4037":"Do you need my help?","content.76.4039":"Off I trot then!","content.76.4041":"Sssssh... You're going to attract attention. The boss has sent me. I need the password for the betting room. Tell me what it is and I'll free you.","content.76.4042":"Do you really think that I would get a kick out of something like that?","content.76.4043":"I see you really had to strain to curl that one out!","content.76.4061":"Thanks!","content.76.4068":"J'ai suivi le plan gravé sur une dent... Je ne pensais pas trouver quelqu'un.","content.76.4069":"Grampar ? Tu parles du gros Craqueleur sur lequel j'ai trouvé cette dent ?","content.76.4070":"Tu divagues, excuse-moi de t'avoir dérangé mais je repars.","content.76.4071":"Grampar ? Tu parles du gros Craqueleur sur lequel j'ai trouvé cette dent ?","content.76.4072":"Tu divagues, excuse-moi de t'avoir dérangé mais je repars.","content.76.4123":"To the Whisper Crisper!","content.76.4124":"Very well. Where do I start?","content.76.4125":"That sounds dangerous. No, thanks!","content.76.4126":"Ah right. No thanks then.","content.76.4127":"It just so happens I have the 3 pieces of uniform.","content.76.4142":"I want to do the tutorial.","content.76.4143":"I don't need no tutorial, fool.","content.76.4145":"Allow me to offer you these beautiful slippers.","content.76.4146":"Thanks!","content.76.4147":"Right. And where am I supposed to find these Pumpkwins? They seem to be surrounded by those cursed Gobballs!","content.76.4148":"This is gonna be delicious! Thanks!","content.76.4149":"Oh, I'm not much of a chef myself...","content.76.4151":"Uh... hi. Do you have a roast Dragoturkey that I could have?","content.76.4152":"Uh... hi. Do you have a roast Dragoturkey that I could have?","content.76.4153":"Uh... hi. Do you have a roast Dragoturkey that I could have?","content.76.4154":"Uh... hi. Do you have a roast Dragoturkey that I could have?","content.76.4155":"What's going on?","content.76.4156":"His plan? What plan?","content.76.4158":"Woah, woah, woah. Wait a second. You mean to say that little maggots like you can capture Cracklers? Are you kidding me?!","content.76.4159":"Steady on, I get it! No need for a demonstration! To the Whisper Crisper!","content.76.4167":"So, you've probably heard this tons of times, but...","content.76.4168":"Your buns are to die for...","content.76.4174":"Your skin is as soft and smooth as a fresh croissant.","content.76.4175":"Your eyes are like pools of melted chocolate.","content.76.4176":"When I look at you, my oven hits maximum heat!","content.76.4177":"Beautiful Shosanne, would you care to butter my muffin?  ","content.76.4178":"Ergh... Sorry...","content.76.4179":"Ergh... Sorry...","content.76.4180":"Great! So, see you this evening at 8? Don't be late!","content.76.4181":"Ergh... Sorry...","content.76.4182":"Ergh... Sorry...","content.76.4184":"That's a lovely dress you're wearing! Is it cashmere or cotton?  ","content.76.4185":"Oh right... I was just thinking that it really brought out the color of your eyes.  ","content.76.4186":"It's tight in all the right places...  ","content.76.4188":"Okay, okay, cool it...!","content.76.4189":"I've always thought that yellow eyes are a sign of treachery and depravity.","content.76.4191":"Did you know that brown eyes are a sign of being dependable and down-to-earth?","content.76.4193":"Uhh... Okay then.","content.76.4194":"Not to mention her hairstyle! She looks like a beehive gone wild!","content.76.4195":"Yeah, and what about her dress sense?! I mean she is SO last year!  ","content.76.4196":"Thanks!","content.76.4198":"Haha. Well, I guess it's just the luck of the straw... I mean, draw!","content.76.4199":"Do you have something to ask me...?","content.76.4207":"Here's your Clay!","content.76.4208":"No problem. I'll go and tear apart some harmless Piwis to get you that.","content.76.4209":"Here's the other Clay you asked for. Here's hoping it's enough this time!  ","content.76.4210":"Couldn't you have told me that before to save me some time?  ","content.76.4211":"Fine, but next time you can get it yourself!","content.76.4212":"Hey, what about if I bring you 100 and you craft a helmet to suffocate yourself in?!","content.76.4220":"This is gonna be delicious! Thanks!","content.76.4250":"I would like to learn the <b>trapper</b> profession.","content.76.4252":"The trapper profession.","content.76.4253":"Show your passport.","content.76.4254":"Show your passport.","content.76.4255":"Show your passport.","content.76.4256":"Show your passport.","content.76.4257":"I've come for my Armorer's Seal.","content.76.4258":"Thanks, see ya later.","content.76.4262":"Thanks, see ya later.","content.76.4263":"Thanks, see ya later.","content.76.4264":"Thanks, see ya later.","content.76.4265":"I've come for my Armorer's Seal.","content.76.4266":"I've come for my Armorer's Seal.","content.76.4267":"I've come for my Armorer's Seal.","content.76.4280":"I've come for my Jeweler's Seal.","content.76.4281":"I've come for my Tailor's Seal.","content.76.4282":"I've come for my Leather Dealer's Seal.","content.76.4283":"I've come for my Jeweler's Seal.","content.76.4284":"I've come for my Tailor's Seal.","content.76.4285":"I've come for my Leather Dealer's Seal.","content.76.4286":"I've come for my Jeweler's Seal.","content.76.4287":"I've come for my Tailor's Seal.","content.76.4288":"I've come for my Leather Dealer's Seal.","content.76.4289":"I've come for my Jeweler's Seal.","content.76.4290":"I've come for my Tailor's Seal.","content.76.4291":"I've come for my Leather Dealer's Seal.","content.76.4293":"I looooove treasure hunts. Tell me more!","content.76.4294":"So I need a shovel, right?","content.76.4295":"I couldn't give two squits! Laters.","content.76.4296":"Dig, okay... But what with?","content.76.4299":"Do you think I'm some kind of Drheller or something? Laters.","content.76.4300":"Thanks, Captain! Treasure, shovel, South Beach, got it.","content.76.4303":"Fandabadooza. Cheers!","content.76.4307":"Top notch! A shovel, eh? Where might I get one?","content.76.4308":"Where can I get a shovel?","content.76.4310":"I found your treasure. Behold!","content.76.4311":"Aww... Really, it was nothing.","content.76.4315":"Sounds interesting. What do I have to do?","content.76.4316":"Are you kidding me? Do I look like an elf to you?!","content.76.4317":"Ha! Is that all?! I'll be back in two shakes of a Gobball's tail!","content.76.4318":"Urm... On second thoughts. I think I'll give it a miss. It's too cold around here!","content.76.4320":"Diddly squat.","content.76.4326":"It won't be long...","content.76.4331":"What now? Did I forget your Kwismas thong?","content.76.4332":"Yes way! I've always wanted to go to Father Kwismas's workshop!","content.76.4334":"The coat!","content.76.4336":"The boots!","content.76.4338":"The cloak!","content.76.4342":"The hat!","content.76.4343":"That should be everything!","content.76.4392":"Oh, just a nasty Reindeer... but he's a doner now.","content.76.4393":"I found this key. Do you know anything about it?","content.76.4394":"I'll think about it!","content.76.4395":"I looooooooove the fair, but no. Let's get outta here.","content.76.4396":"Thanks for the info. I'll get back to you.","content.76.4397":"Okay.","content.76.4398":"I'd like to reset my spells and specialities.","content.76.4400":"Err... Now I think about it... No!","content.76.4401":"I think I'm going to stay here for the moment.","content.76.4402":"I know, I know. I've made up my mind! ","content.76.4404":"Let's go, Kano! ","content.76.4554":"Great! Well, I'm going to go and freeze my bits off on the Ice Floe.","content.76.4555":"Hmmm... I think I'm gonna go make some snow angels. Bye!","content.76.4556":"Erm, I didn't really understand a word of that. I'm going to go and look at the bricks over there. Bye, live long and prosper!","content.76.4560":"Hey! What is there to do on your island, Chillberg?","content.76.4562":"Who are you again?","content.76.4563":"Great! Well, I'm going to go and freeze my bits off on the Ice Floe.","content.76.4564":"Great! Well, I'm going to go and freeze my bits off on the Ice Floe.","content.76.4566":"Where are we? What is this icy island?","content.76.4567":"What mineral is that?","content.76.4568":"Oh really? What uses does it have?","content.76.4570":"Grrr... It is pretty cold, I must admit.","content.76.4571":"Got it! I'm gonna turn Hagen Daz into slush!","content.76.4589":"Excuse me... Um... Father...?! But I... You're...?!","content.76.4590":"You've got 200 years to catch up on, Father. You must need a rest.","content.76.4592":"Frigost? God-like power? Give me the key, I'd like to pay this little nobleman a visit!","content.76.4593":"Awesome! I'm off to the workshop!","content.76.4594":"I have your Stolen Cargo. Do you have my Climbing Gear?","content.76.4595":"I'm bored. Isn't there anything I can do around here?","content.76.4596":"Yeah, that doesn't really sound that epic. But hey, if I can line my pockets that way... I'll be right on it.","content.76.4597":"I have 10 Taroudium Shards!","content.76.4598":"Here we go! ","content.76.4600":"You're as white as a ghost, if you want my honest opinion.","content.76.4601":"Do you want to tell me about the life you had before you died?","content.76.4603":"I can't leave you like this!","content.76.4605":"I found a death certificate in your name, you should read it.","content.76.4606":"You need to face the facts, you're a ghost!","content.76.4608":"I can't believe it! Forget it, Father... I'll see you later.","content.76.4613":"I can't leave you like this!","content.76.4614":"I can't leave you like this!","content.76.4641":"Here are the 10 Freezepops. So, about the ke... Hey! Watch my fingers!","content.76.4644":"Thanks, ancestor-man! Destination, the Manor basement... and the Ice Dofus!","content.76.4649":"Uh... Hello...? Me adventurer, you machine. Me want go top of tower...","content.76.4650":"It that your church? Looks kinda drafty...","content.76.4651":"Here are your ice kamas.","content.76.4652":"No problem. I'll go and remind them of their religious duties all right!","content.76.4658":"I found this icy lollipop, do you happen to know where it came from?","content.76.4661":"Recently... Like, for the past few days? Or more like the past few months?","content.76.4663":"That's a bummer. Although... You're only a machine, so it's not like you have feelings. Why did he abandon you?","content.76.4664":"Your mechanism has gone, it must be the cold. I'll let you jabber in peace. Bye!","content.76.4665":"Hmm... I'm not much of a metalhead... I'm going to go look at those bricks over there. Bye!","content.76.4666":"Who... or what... are you?","content.76.4667":"Where are we?","content.76.4668":"Who are... were you?","content.76.4669":"But how come the village is doubly snowbound?","content.76.4670":"Really?! You don't look that young... Are you sure you don't have anything else to tell me?","content.76.4671":"Children, yes, I see...","content.76.4672":"Okay, I get the first part... What happened the second time, then?","content.76.4673":"Well, that's just plain bad luck. Thank you for clarifying that.","content.76.4675":"Who is Sylargh again?","content.76.4676":"Errr... I've heard enough. I'm off. Bye!","content.76.4678":"Ogrest?! Dofus... Incomparable power... Of course! But Father Deepboar, it's been a long time since...","content.76.4679":"Ok, je vais en faire de la glace pilée de tes Craqueleurs !","content.76.4680":"Super... Je retourne me les geler sur la banquise, à pluch !","content.76.4684":"Basically I should have thought better of it. Although...","content.76.4685":"Hey! I thought there were treasures in the gorge, not monsters!","content.76.4686":"Hmm. Anyway, let me try my equipment.","content.76.4687":"Variés ? Genre, très variés ?","content.76.4688":"No way! Well, I gotta go. Bye!","content.76.4689":"About that climbing gear...","content.76.4690":"Great! Well, I'm going to go and freeze my bits off on the Ice Floe.","content.76.4691":"Oh... too bad. It's useless then?","content.76.4692":"And what's that got to do with the Ice Dofus?","content.76.4693":"You've lost me now. What's the Water Clock?","content.76.4694":"He erased an entire day?","content.76.4695":"And... and the Ice Dofus is inside?","content.76.4696":"You'd be better off coming with me, I think the cold has affected your brain...","content.76.4697":"Okay. Let me guess, I'm supposed to help you, am I right?","content.76.4699":"Wait, did you say Dofus? Tell me more, tell me more!","content.76.4700":"Uh... But what do you want exactly?","content.76.4701":"Okay. I'll help you get your memory back, Father! ","content.76.4702":"Okay, okay... I've heard enough.","content.76.4703":"Oh... That bit about the children was sad, but where do you come into it?","content.76.4704":"And what do you do now?","content.76.4705":"Centuries... You are pretty creepy, you know.","content.76.4706":"Yeah, it does seem like time has stopped, and permanently for you, too. Brrr, I feel really cold all of a sudden. I need a walk.","content.76.4707":"That sounds complicated.","content.76.4708":"Yeah, whatever.","content.76.4709":"What exactly is this Water Clock thing?","content.76.4710":"Ah... Okay.","content.76.4711":"That's interesting. Anyway, I'm freezing, so we'll leave it there if you don't mind.","content.76.4712":"Did you just say Missiz Freezz?","content.76.4713":"Not far from the Manor, you say? Okay, I'll go take a look!","content.76.4735":"I will bring you some Pure Taroudium!","content.76.4736":"Give me the map already, I'll go and get your cargo.","content.76.4738":"Styffen Chillberg sent me. Have you got anything warm for me to wear?","content.76.4739":"Butchering Brrrblis is my hobby!","content.76.4740":"Here are your 10 Untreated Furs from Brrrblis with the Lurgi.","content.76.4742":"We're quits now. I'm off.","content.76.4754":"I'm going to freeze somewhere else. Bye bye!","content.76.4761":"That'll be a breeze! I'll be right back.","content.76.4762":"I still need to find a few more Krak-Ertz.","content.76.4763":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.4764":"I'll go and get you some more Krak-Ertz.","content.76.4765":"I'll go and get you some more seeds.","content.76.4766":"Hagen Daz? I'll be the end of that doofus!","content.76.4768":"And what's so interesting about the tower?","content.76.4770":"Time for an adventure! Let's go!","content.76.4772":"Your business? Who are you, really?","content.76.4773":"I am ready to fight, Father! I won't let that Icy Maiden chill our bones! ","content.76.4774":"I'm not afraid of anything, Father! ","content.76.4777":"I'll wait a few more minutes.","content.76.4779":"Where is the key to Harebourg Castle? ","content.76.4780":"Oh, okay! ","content.76.4781":"That'll be a breeze! I'll be right back.","content.76.4782":"I still need to find a few more Hair-Feathers.","content.76.4783":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.4784":"I'll go and get you some more Hair-Feathers.","content.76.4785":"I'll go and get you some more seeds.","content.76.4786":"The YeCh'Ti'Wawa? I'll stuff him up nice for your sitting room!","content.76.4787":"I can help you with the Boohemoths if you want...","content.76.4788":"I can help you with the Boohemoths if you want...","content.76.4789":"I can help you with the Boohemoths if you want...","content.76.4790":"I've got the Snow Hair-Feathers for you.","content.76.4791":"I've got the Snowy Seeds for you.","content.76.4793":"I can help you with the Northern Chafers if you want...","content.76.4794":"I can help you with the Northern Chafers if you want...","content.76.4795":"I can help you with the Northern Chafers if you want...","content.76.4796":"That'll be a breeze! I'll be right back.","content.76.4797":"I still need to find a few more Frozen Bones.","content.76.4798":"Essence? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as much as you need.","content.76.4799":"I'll go and get you some more Frozen Bones.","content.76.4800":"I'll go and get you some Essence of Northern Chafer.","content.76.4801":"Kill Missiz Freezz? I'll melt that witch down!","content.76.4802":"I've got the Frozen Bones for you.","content.76.4803":"I got the 10 Chafer Seeds for you.","content.76.4805":"I'm going to freeze somewhere else. Bye bye!","content.76.4806":"I've treated them all.","content.76.4807":"Where is the key to Harebourg Castle? ","content.76.4808":"No problem!","content.76.4810":"To the library, then! Let's go!","content.76.4814":"Go on, tell me, but afterwards I'm going to find a way into that tower to enjoy its spoils.","content.76.4816":"D is for...","content.76.4820":"Oh really? Well I won't keep you any longer then. Bye!","content.76.4890":"I'm gonna go do a little dance now. Seeya!","content.76.4891":"Blibloo?","content.76.4892":"Blibloo!","content.76.4894":"I turned the Riff Raft upside down! Now can I come to the Jellix Show?!","content.76.4895":"Check it out - I've found my color! Is it almost Show-time?","content.76.4898":"Bilby King asked me to find my color... Can you help me?","content.76.4899":"I've found my color! I think I've earned my ticket to the Jellix Show, don't you?","content.76.4900":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Bilbibeach monsters.","content.76.4901":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Bilbibeach monsters.","content.76.4902":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Bilbibeach monsters.","content.76.4903":"Here are your Gritty Skins!","content.76.4904":"Here are your Beach Seeds!","content.76.4906":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.4907":"I should be able to find a few more Gritty Skins for you. ","content.76.4908":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.4909":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Gritty Skins for you.","content.76.4910":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Bilbibeach Monster Seeds for you.","content.76.4911":"The Pearly Bilbimussel? I'll show no mercy!","content.76.4912":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.4913":"I should be able to find a bit more Outlandish Slobber for you.","content.76.4914":"Jelly Extract? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as much as you need.","content.76.4915":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Outlandish Slobber for you.","content.76.4916":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Jelly Extract for you.","content.76.4917":"Emperor Jellix? I hope he's trembling in his boots, cos I'm coming for him!","content.76.4925":"Sugary Remains!","content.76.4926":"Nothing.","content.76.4927":"Bits of Carb!","content.76.4928":"Nothing.","content.76.4930":"A donation of kamas...? Well, if you insist! ","content.76.4939":"Bye!","content.76.4941":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Field Plants, do you?","content.76.4942":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Field Plants, do you?","content.76.4943":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Field Plants, do you?","content.76.4945":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.4946":"I have your Country Scalps!","content.76.4947":"I have your Field Plant Seeds!","content.76.4949":"I should be able to find a few more Country Scalps for you.","content.76.4950":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Country Scalps for you.","content.76.4952":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.4953":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Field Plant Seeds for you.","content.76.4954":"The Carnivorous Plant? I'll cut it down to size in no time!","content.76.4976":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Moogrrs, do you?","content.76.4977":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Moogrrs, do you?","content.76.4978":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Moogrrs, do you?","content.76.4979":"I have your Bells!","content.76.4980":"I have your Mooggr Seeds!","content.76.4982":"Bye!","content.76.4983":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Bells for you.","content.76.4984":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Mooggr Seeds for you.","content.76.4985":"The Royal Moogrr? I'll bring you its head on a platter!","content.76.4986":"I should be able to find a few more Bells for you.","content.76.4987":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.4988":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.4989":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Scaras, do you?","content.76.4990":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Scaras, do you?","content.76.4991":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Scaras, do you?","content.76.4992":"I have your Scara Horns!","content.76.4993":"I have your Scara Seeds!","content.76.4995":"Bye!","content.76.4996":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Scara Horns for you.","content.76.4997":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Scara Seeds for you.","content.76.4998":"Kill the Scarador? Five minutes' work!","content.76.4999":"I should be able to find a few more Scara Horns for you.","content.76.5000":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.5001":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.5002":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.5003":"I should be able to find a few more Fins for you.","content.76.5004":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.5005":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Fins for you.","content.76.5006":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Snapper Seeds for you.","content.76.5007":"The Black Zordfish? He'd better look sharp when I'm about!","content.76.5008":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Snappers, do you?","content.76.5009":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Snappers, do you?","content.76.5010":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Snappers, do you?","content.76.5011":"I have your Fins!","content.76.5012":"I have your Snapper Seeds!","content.76.5014":"Bye!","content.76.5036":"J'étais... mort ?","content.76.5037":"Je vais encore masser votre disciple.","content.76.5038":"Je me sens prêt{[1*]?e:} pour la suite, c'est parti !","content.76.5039":"Je me suis réincarné{[1*]?e:} du bon pied, c'est parti !","content.76.5040":"C'est parti !","content.76.5042":"Bye.","content.76.5043":"So is this where I sign up for the Jellix Show?","content.76.5044":"Are you kidding me? I set the Full Jellix Party on fire!","content.76.5045":"I'll give it my all!","content.76.5047":"That's right! Is there anything I ought to know?","content.76.5049":"Actually, I didn't want anything...","content.76.5052":"Sokay, I'm ready to leave Incarnam.","content.76.5060":"Ready...","content.76.5061":"Let's go!","content.76.5064":"Why not? What are the rules?","content.76.5065":"Yeah, yeah... Haven't you heard? Disco's dead!","content.76.5066":"Too easy! I hope the turns are only 15 seconds long!","content.76.5067":"Actually, that doesn't sound like my kind of thing at all.","content.76.5069":"I'd like to explore the Mint and Lemon Dimensions again.","content.76.5075":"Chuck over the Lemon Multijely!","content.76.5079":"Chuck over the Mint Multijely!","content.76.5081":"Actually, right now I think I should be dancing... Yeah!","content.76.5083":"I have nothing to give you.","content.76.5084":"What if I gave you some Sweet Mint Jelys? ","content.76.5085":"What if I gave you some Sweet Blue Raspberry Jelys? ","content.76.5086":"What if I gave you some Sweet Strawberry Jelys?","content.76.5087":"What if I gave you some Sweet Lemon Jelys? ","content.76.5088":"What if I gave you some Sweet Jelys... of all four flavors? ","content.76.5096":"Show me your worst, sweet cheeks! ","content.76.5097":"Urm.. No... Wait!","content.76.5098":"Okay, here are your Sweet Mint Jelys! ","content.76.5099":"Interesting...","content.76.5101":"Just gimme two seconds...","content.76.5102":"Okay, here are your Sweet Strawberry Jelys! ","content.76.5103":"Interesting...","content.76.5104":"Okay, here are your Sweet Lemon Jelys! ","content.76.5105":"Interesting...","content.76.5106":"Okay, here are your Sweet Raspberry Jelys! ","content.76.5107":"Interesting...","content.76.5108":"Okay, here are your Sweet Jelys! ","content.76.5109":"Interesting...","content.76.5139":"I'll leave you in peace!","content.76.5143":"Donalangelo asked me to show you this.","content.76.5144":"You're just a box... Boxes don't talk... They can't talk! You... are just... a... figment... of my... imagination!","content.76.5145":"I just remembered I had a thing to do.","content.76.5146":"I found your royal water or whatever it is.","content.76.5148":"Ogrest's Chaos?","content.76.5149":"Great! Where can I find him?","content.76.5150":"I will go immediately.","content.76.5153":"I'll do it! Keep my kamas warm for me!","content.76.5155":"So where are these vermin hiding?","content.76.5156":"Fallen from the skies to land in the sewers... I sure hope this is worth my while.","content.76.5157":"He believes in me... I beat the Chaos plants!","content.76.5160":"Nothing comes for free, right? I'll be back soon!","content.76.5161":"Let's go and see this Ullu guy.","content.76.5164":"That was, uh... kind of them.","content.76.5166":"Yes, as soon as I'm ready to go!","content.76.5169":"I'm ready to head back to Zinit!","content.76.5170":"I'm looking for Ogrest, he's owed a butt-kicking. Move!","content.76.5175":"Hey, look what the \"half-wit\" found. Whaddya say to that, huh? Huh?! What?","content.76.5176":"I'm going to go look for serenity elsewhere. See ya.","content.76.5177":"Simpleton? You little... I oughta... Grrr... *sigh* Okay, I'll get it for you. Go jump in a... Er... I mean, OK, I'll go get it for you.","content.76.5178":"Hopefully he'll have more to say for himself than you do...","content.76.5180":"Urgh! Let me past, you... you... dead thing.","content.76.5182":"Yeah, alright, alright, I get the picture.","content.76.5183":"Don't sweat it; I'm ready.","content.76.5184":"Uh... Thanks for the information. Bye!","content.76.5187":"I've still got a few things to sort out. See you soon.","content.76.5188":"Errr... Thanks for the information. Bye!","content.76.5189":"I've still got a few things to sort out. See you soon.","content.76.5190":"Errr... Thanks for the information. Bye!","content.76.5191":"I've still got a few things to sort out. See you soon.","content.76.5192":"Errr... Thanks for the information. Bye!","content.76.5193":"I've still got a few things to sort out. See you soon.","content.76.5195":"What?! But I proved I was a party animal... A party BEAST!","content.76.5196":"A spangled jumpsuit? ","content.76.5197":"My color... If you say so, chief! I think I'll go pay a visit to the hunters you mentioned.","content.76.5205":"I'm off!","content.76.5214":"Gimme the Lemon Multijely!","content.76.5215":"Gimme the Mint Multijely!","content.76.5216":"Uhhh... That doesn't sound like my kind of thing. I'll sit this one out.","content.76.5217":"This is the best day of my life! I'm going to put on a great show for you!","content.76.5218":"Me? A Wabbit spy? I've just gotten to the island! But anyway... Where did the Wabbits go?","content.76.5219":"Of course not! I'm just an adventurer, passing through. Goodbye!","content.76.5220":"Find your equipment? That doesn't sound too hard. I'll help you.","content.76.5221":"That's not my problem. Do it yourself!","content.76.5222":"Tada! It wasn't that far all things considered.","content.76.5225":"Let's go!","content.76.5230":"Let's go!","content.76.5231":"Let's go!","content.76.5232":"Let's go!","content.76.5233":"No pwoblem!","content.76.5248":"What is your relationship with the Lenalds like now?","content.76.5249":"You doing okay? Not too many troubles?","content.76.5250":"Is your army well trained?","content.76.5251":"Yes, understood. What's the coded message that I have to give to the Loyal Lenald?","content.76.5252":"No, sorry, other things to do. I'm not a messenger pigeon!","content.76.5253":"Uh... Hey, that's true! Yeah, I should go say that! Yeah!","content.76.5254":"I'm going to put an end to this revolt! You can count on me.","content.76.5255":"Just send the guards out to hack them to pieces. It's not my problem.","content.76.5256":"Go find that chicken Siw Bows and give him a good shake? Bring it on!","content.76.5257":"Not my fault if your knights are wusses. Deal with it yourself.","content.76.5258":"Everyone's got problems of their own bub!","content.76.5259":"No, nothing...","content.76.5264":"The message is: \"It's time to lepail some boutineels!\"","content.76.5265":"I have a coded message for the Wa! Uh no... for the Loyal Lenald!!","content.76.5266":"The message is: \"It's time to lecluit some melcenalies!\"","content.76.5267":"The message is: \"It's time to hile some musketeels!\"","content.76.5268":"Who are you? I really wanna know... What are you doing shut in here?","content.76.5269":"You and your brothers are being manipulated by the Loyal Lenald.","content.76.5270":"You're the violent type, aren't you? Can't you just live together with them?","content.76.5271":"No, I'm just saying you could stand to be a bit more tolerant...","content.76.5272":"Guald? What's a guald?","content.76.5274":"What do you mean?","content.76.5275":"That's tewwib... uh, terrible... But what can we do about it?","content.76.5276":"Okay! Let me in and I'll deal with the guards! I'll see Mawvin very soon.","content.76.5279":"I prefer flies to Callots! I'm going to go see if I can find some! Bye!","content.76.5281":"I defeated the Lenalds and went into the dojo. What did I win?","content.76.5283":"Oh, right... So I didn't win anything in the end...","content.76.5284":"Oh! Just tell me what to do, and I'll show you my worth!","content.76.5285":"That's crazy. What does that have to do with my valor?","content.76.5286":"Maybe, but he's just using you to terrorize the Wabbits without putting any Lenalds at risk.","content.76.5287":"Ok, we'll try that...","content.76.5288":"Oh, I love fries! I'm going to go see if I can find some! Bye!","content.76.5289":"Hey dude! I proved my power! That means you're gonna teach me your clan techniques, right?","content.76.5290":"Stop the attacks on the Wabbits; that will oblige the Loyal Lenald to get his paws dirty.","content.76.5291":"I'm hurrying!","content.76.5292":"Hey dude! I proved my power! That means you're gonna teach me your clan techniques, right?","content.76.5293":"Oh, I love fries! I'm going to go see if I can find some! Bye!","content.76.5294":"What? Only three? I'm gonna go knock him around a bit right now.","content.76.5295":"What? Only three? I'm gonna go knock him around a bit right now.","content.76.5296":"Tada! Three hits and I'm back. Is that all you know how to do?!","content.76.5297":"Oh yeah! I like that idea! I'm gonna go ice this newb, and I'll be back!","content.76.5298":"Oh really? Those things sound awesome! I'm gonna go light this newb up, and I'll be back!","content.76.5299":"Would you happen to have seen a huge zeppelin flying over your island?","content.76.5300":"That's them! I must thwart their plot as soon as possible!","content.76.5303":"Thank you little King, I'll go shed some light on this mystery immediately.","content.76.5304":"Um... I must have got lost. Seeya!","content.76.5305":"Oh yeah! I like that idea! I'm gonna go ice this apprentice, and I'll be back!","content.76.5306":"Oh yeah! I like that idea! I'm gonna go light this apprentice up, and I'll be back!","content.76.5307":"Oh yeah! I'm cold as ice! I'm gonna go ice this disciple, and I'll be back!","content.76.5308":"Oh yeah! I'm too hot to handle! I'm gonna go light this disciple up, and I'll be back!","content.76.5309":"The ball of ice was a nice touch. You tapped out? Or do you want to crank it up to 11?","content.76.5310":"Blam! I gave that Callot such a beating his own mother wouldn't recognize him! Training's cool and all, but can't we do something more serious?","content.76.5311":"Tada! Three hits and I'm back. Is that all you know how to do?!","content.76.5312":"I thought \"GET OVER HERE!\" was a nice touch. You tapped out? Or do you want to crank it up to 11?","content.76.5313":"Blam!!! I gave that Callot such a beating his own mother wouldn't recognise him! Training's cool and all, but can't we do something more serious?","content.76.5314":"Did you see that?! It'll take him a while to recover!","content.76.5315":"Did you see that?! It'll take him a while to recover!","content.76.5316":"I'll think about it! Ok, gotta run, see ya!","content.76.5317":"I'll think about it! Ok, gotta run, see ya!","content.76.5318":"I know all the techniques of both clans. What now?","content.76.5319":"I'm gonna go think for a second, and I'll get back to you, Papy Lenald.","content.76.5320":"I've made my choice. The Shilay Lyu, masters of fire, are the best, and I'll prove it!","content.76.5321":"I've made my choice. The Lin Kawaii, masters of water, are the best, and I'll prove it!","content.76.5322":"I've changed my mind. The Shilay Lyu, masters of fire, are the best, and I'll prove it!","content.76.5323":"I've changed my mind. The Lin Kawaii, masters of water, are the best, and I'll prove it!","content.76.5324":"Clearly! There's nothing better than fire!","content.76.5325":"I'm gonna go think for a second, and I'll get back to you, Papy Lenald.","content.76.5326":"Clearly! There's nothing better than water!","content.76.5327":"I'm gonna go think for a second, and I'll get back to you, Papy Lenald.","content.76.5328":"I beat Scolpion! I won a... Wait, what did I win?","content.76.5329":"Sweet! I love yellow pajamas! That's the color of bananas! And I love bananas! Thanks and see ya!","content.76.5330":"Sweet! I love blue pajamas! That's the color of the sky! And I love the sky! Thanks and see ya!","content.76.5331":"I beat Sub-Zelo! I won a... Wait, what did I win?","content.76.5335":"I've successfully learned all you taught me!","content.76.5336":"Let's go!","content.76.5338":"I've come to save you! You're sitting on a pile of Twapped Cawwots!","content.76.5339":"Oops... No, not more gualds!","content.76.5340":"Oops... I must have made a mistake in the code... *The last sound you hear is that of a sword being unsheathed*","content.76.5341":"Hop hop hop!","content.76.5342":"Hop hop hop!","content.76.5343":"Do you need a hand?","content.76.5344":"You need to lay off the juice! I'm leaving.","content.76.5345":"I'll go find it for you... ","content.76.5349":"Yeah, I'd better leave.","content.76.5350":"Me? A Wabbit spy? I've just gotten to the island! But anyway... Where did the Wabbits go?","content.76.5351":"See ya!","content.76.5355":"Sule thing, boss! ","content.76.5356":"Times are hard?","content.76.5357":"And can we do anything about it?","content.76.5358":"Hmmm... It all seems a bit complicated. If I find a solution, I'll come tell you about it. See ya!","content.76.5359":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Black Wabbits.","content.76.5360":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Black Wabbits.","content.76.5361":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Black Wabbits.","content.76.5362":"Here are your Black Wabbit Fuws!","content.76.5363":"Here are your Black Wabbit Seeds!","content.76.5365":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.5366":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.5367":"I should be able to find a few more Black Wabbit Fuws for you. ","content.76.5368":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.5369":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Black Wabbit Fuws for you.","content.76.5370":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Black Wabbit Seeds for you.","content.76.5371":"Don't worry, I'll get him!","content.76.5372":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.5373":"I should be able to find a few more Lenald Fuls for you.","content.76.5374":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.5375":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Lenald Fuls for you.","content.76.5376":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Lenald Seeds for you.","content.76.5377":"Kill the Lenald Empelol? With pleasure. I'll take control of his Empile!","content.76.5378":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Lenalds.","content.76.5379":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Lenalds.","content.76.5380":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Lenalds.","content.76.5381":"Here are your Lenald Fuls!","content.76.5382":"Here are your Lenald Seeds!","content.76.5384":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Wabbits.","content.76.5385":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Wabbits.","content.76.5386":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Wabbits.","content.76.5387":"Here are your Wabbit Fuws!","content.76.5388":"Here are your Wabbit Seeds!","content.76.5390":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.5391":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Zwombbits.","content.76.5392":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Zwombbits.","content.76.5393":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Zwombbits.","content.76.5394":"Here are your Infected Fuws!","content.76.5395":"Here are your Infected Seeds!","content.76.5397":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.5398":"I should be able to find a few more Wabbit Fuws for you. ","content.76.5399":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.5400":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Wabbit Fuws for you.","content.76.5401":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Wabbit Seeds for you.","content.76.5402":"The Gwand Viziew Wabbit? Consider that bunny boiled!","content.76.5403":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.5404":"I should be able to find a few more Infected Fuws for you.","content.76.5405":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.5406":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Infected Fuws for you.","content.76.5407":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Infected Seeds for you.","content.76.5408":"I'm going to kick that Gweat GM Wabbit off the face of the earth!","content.76.5409":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Owange Fabwics for you.","content.76.5410":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Well-Guawded Seeds for you.","content.76.5411":"The Wa Wabbit? I'll end his reign... and then his life! ","content.76.5412":"I should be able to find a few more Owange Fabwics for you.","content.76.5413":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.5414":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.5415":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Wabbit Guawds.","content.76.5416":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Wabbit Guawds.","content.76.5417":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Wabbit Guawds.","content.76.5418":"Here are your Owange Fabwics!","content.76.5419":"Here are your Well-Guawded Seeds!","content.76.5421":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.5423":"My apologies for the delay. How may I assist you?","content.76.5426":"You must have mistaken me for someone else, geezer. See ya!","content.76.5427":"Ha! That's why!","content.76.5428":"But there are plenty of Cawwots here, aren't there? ","content.76.5430":"Nah, I'm gonna go now... but it was rice to see you!","content.76.5431":"I'll get to work right away!","content.76.5432":"The experiment was an unqualified success!","content.76.5433":"I haven't had time to take care of it. I'll get on it now.","content.76.5434":"No problem! I feel inspired!","content.76.5435":"I told you already, I'm done, y'old coot!","content.76.5436":"Would you like to taste my freshly pressed Black Cawwot Juice?","content.76.5437":"The experiment was a success!","content.76.5438":"You'le vely welcome! Have a wondelful day!","content.76.5439":"How rude...","content.76.5446":"Whatever. I'll see you again, and next time... BAM! There'll be no messin' around. Farewell.","content.76.5448":"I got my hands on the Bow, so I'm good to go. So now that you have your castle back, what's next?","content.76.5451":"Oh yeah... The Cawwot Dofus... Ahem. Yes. Good luck with that. I'm off, farewell.","content.76.5453":"Pfff... You Was are each more arrogant than the last. I'll be back when there's a real dungeon here. Then I'll teach you a thing or two about de-Cawwotation.","content.76.5454":"That really sucks... Welp, my job here is done. I'll leave you to it.","content.76.5455":"Yeah, and I suppose I had nothing to do with it...? Whatever, I won't spoil your illusions. Seeya.","content.76.5456":"I always feel a bit tired after fighting at the dojo. Is there a way to get a little energy back?","content.76.5457":"Hey! Thanks! What?! 100 kamas!! This water had better be better than Bamboo Milk!","content.76.5458":"I always feel a bit tired after fighting at the dojo. Is there a way to get a little energy back?","content.76.5459":"Hey! Thanks! What?! 100 kamas!! This water had better be better than Bamboo Milk!","content.76.5461":"But... Why exactly are you doing this?","content.76.5462":"Sure doesn't seem too glorious to me... Are you sure there's nothing else?","content.76.5464":"Yeah, not very convincing. I'll get you to spill your guts one of these days.","content.76.5465":"Ok, ok. So some Googoos in bonnets tell you things like that and you really believe them?","content.76.5466":"Yeah, not very convincing. I'm sure there's something else...","content.76.5467":"The huge degenerate Wabbit has been put down. Permanently. So, what's the end of the story?","content.76.5468":"Uh... Uber-Wabbits... The most horrible of all Zwombbits... Whoa, that's heavy. I'll do what I can, but I'm not making any promises.","content.76.5469":"You talk too much, old man. I'm gonna go give my ears a rest. Bye!","content.76.5472":"That's crazy. Still, I wonder who these hoods could be... Maybe I'll come across them someday... See ya!","content.76.5473":"What's that huge crater on the north end of the main island?","content.76.5474":"That's crazy. Bye!","content.76.5478":"Much to learn, I still have.","content.76.5486":"I'd like to help you complete your collection of semi-rare skulls...","content.76.5487":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Al Howin Gobballs!","content.76.5488":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Al Howin Ghouls!","content.76.5489":"Here's something for your questionable collection!","content.76.5490":"Here are your Pumpkwinny Wools.","content.76.5491":"Here are your Al Howin Emulsions.","content.76.5497":"I think you'll like these Gobball Skulls!","content.76.5498":"... (You quietly slip out the back...)","content.76.5499":"If it'll make you happy, there's nothing... I'd rather... do.","content.76.5500":"You know that Gobballs are actually... *killer look*... Uh... No, never mind! I'm on it!","content.76.5501":"I don't mean to upset you, but... *terrifying look* ...b-but... You have really nice skin! I'll go find you some!","content.76.5502":"... How kind of you!","content.76.5503":"I'd like to help you find Al Howin Emulsion and Pumpkwinny Wool!","content.76.5504":"HOW MANY? *She glares at you*... No, no, I didn't say anything. I'll go get those for you!","content.76.5505":"Here are your 10 Al Howin Emulsions and your 10 Pumpkwinny Wools.","content.76.5509":"Ok, forget I said anything.","content.76.5511":"Ok, forget I said anything.","content.76.5513":"Ok, forget I said anything.","content.76.5515":"Ok, forget I said anything.","content.76.5516":"Can you take me home?","content.76.5517":"I've changed my mind, I've still got some things to do actually.","content.76.5522":"All ready. Let's go back to Astrub!","content.76.5532":"Well, okay, since I'm already here...","content.76.5534":"All the ruins were infested with Chaos plants.","content.76.5536":"I'll go straight away!","content.76.5537":"Could you teach me a profession?","content.76.5542":"Bon appétit!","content.76.5543":"I would like to become a baker.","content.76.5544":"I would like to become a chef.","content.76.5546":"Yes, I would like to learn one of your professions!","content.76.5547":"No, that's fine. Goodbye.","content.76.5548":"I would like to become a Weapons Master.","content.76.5549":"I would like to become an armorer.","content.76.5552":"Could you teach me a profession?","content.76.5553":"I'll leave you to your work, goodbye.","content.76.5554":"I would like to become a tailor.","content.76.5555":"I would like to become a jeweler.","content.76.5556":"I would like to become a leather dealer.","content.76.5559":"Nothing. In the end, I'd rather watch you do it.","content.76.5560":"I've changed my mind - bye.","content.76.5561":"I've changed my mind - bye.","content.76.5562":"My Baby Schnek hid somewhere and I can't find it.","content.76.5563":"Thank you... I'll take good care of it!","content.76.5565":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Wild Gobballs!","content.76.5566":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Wild Gobballs!","content.76.5567":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Wild Gobballs!","content.76.5568":"Here's your Wild Wool!","content.76.5569":"Here are your Wild Gobball Seeds!","content.76.5570":"Here's your Wild Gobball Talisman!","content.76.5571":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Bworks!","content.76.5572":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Bworks!","content.76.5573":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Bworks!","content.76.5574":"Here are your Bwork Fabrics!","content.76.5575":"Here are your Bwork Seeds!","content.76.5576":"Here's your Thork's Gobball Horn!","content.76.5577":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.5578":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.5579":"I should be able to find a few more Wild Wools for you.","content.76.5580":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.5581":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Wild Wool for you.","content.76.5582":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Wild Gobball Seeds for you.","content.76.5583":"A Wild Gobball Talisman? I'll get right on it.","content.76.5584":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.5585":"I should be able to find a few more Bwork Fabrics for you.","content.76.5586":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.5587":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Bwork Fabrics for you.","content.76.5588":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Bwork Seeds for you.","content.76.5589":"Thork's Gobball Horn? I'll get right on it.","content.76.5609":"Nothing, I'm leaving!","content.76.5610":"Let's go!","content.76.5613":"Let's go!","content.76.5615":"Let's go!","content.76.5616":"Hey there big chief! I'm looking for the archaosologists. Do you know where they are?","content.76.5617":"Say hello to the new Bworkball champion! Woot!","content.76.5618":"Yep, he said you might have some work for me.","content.76.5619":"Here are the pieces you asked me for.","content.76.5621":"Uh... Aaand is there any way I can help you deal with the Bwork Foos?","content.76.5622":"Okay... Ok... I'll do it! Seeya!","content.76.5624":"Actually, that's a fine question. I think I'm gonna go.","content.76.5625":"Got it! Thanks for your help!","content.76.5626":"So, actually, this is embarrassing but I left my jockstrap at the barber's. See ya!","content.76.5628":"No problemo. I'll be right back.","content.76.5629":"Uh... I have to say I'm doubtful about your concoction, but if you say it works, let's give it a shot!","content.76.5630":"Your Bwork Burger didn't do much...","content.76.5631":"Okay, let's try it out.","content.76.5632":"That's not gonna be a problem. Pass me a bit of your beer and I'll force him to drink it!","content.76.5634":"This is the stinkiest stuff I could find. What now?","content.76.5637":"All right... I have to go now. Don't forget to take your pills before bed...","content.76.5639":"Uh, sorry buddy, but there's nobody around except us.","content.76.5640":"*You take the Frightened Bwork by the arm* There there... Everything will be fine. Come with me... You need some fresh air... (Start a fight)","content.76.5641":"All right... I have to go now. Don't forget to take your pills before bed...","content.76.5642":"Alright. I'll follow my nose and find the stinkiest stuff around.","content.76.5645":"There. You're in the clear. Now, tell me where all the archaosologists are...","content.76.5646":"I've got your Logs of Wood, Pappy!","content.76.5647":"Consider it done.","content.76.5648":"I'm still ready for anything! Bring it on!","content.76.5656":"Melmac says he'll keep a closer eye on the Bow Meows.","content.76.5662":"I'll go straight away!","content.76.5665":"Jenry says there's no doubt about it: the monster comes from Mount Zinit and somebody led it here!","content.76.5672":"Slather myself in... I... F-for justice!","content.76.5687":"Bossowl thinks I can serve the city in some way.","content.76.5688":"I had to fight off an enooormous plant in the Ingalsses' cellar!","content.76.5689":"Oh, whilst I'm here, your mercenary isn't feeling too great... Well, I'm gonna get going!","content.76.5691":"They have a hideout down here?","content.76.5692":"Let's go together! We've got to stop them!","content.76.5693":"Uh, thanks... You'll be waiting right here for me, yeah...?","content.76.5698":"No rest for the wicked, eh? Here goes nothin'...","content.76.5699":"Thanks for the advice. Bye!","content.76.5701":"I've searched high and low for you all over the Wild Estate! Well, I can now declare you well and truly saved. What now?","content.76.5702":"I've searched high and low for you all over the Wild Estate! Well, I can now declare you well and truly saved. What now?","content.76.5703":"I've searched high and low for you all over the Wild Estate! Well, I can now declare you well and truly saved. What now?","content.76.5704":"I've searched high and low for you all over the Wild Estate! Well, I can now declare you well and truly saved. What now?","content.76.5706":"Seeya later, water skater!","content.76.5708":"Why are you digging in the Wild Estate?","content.76.5709":"There are other gems?","content.76.5712":"Alright. I'll go see how they're getting on!","content.76.5713":"What does that have to do with the Wild Estate?","content.76.5714":"So?","content.76.5715":"Alright. I'll go see how they're getting on!","content.76.5716":"There are other gems?","content.76.5718":"Why are you digging in the Wild Estate?","content.76.5719":"Seeya later, cheese grater...","content.76.5720":"What happened at the Bontarian archaosology camp?","content.76.5721":"What happened at the Amaknian archaosology camp?","content.76.5722":"Okay, that really sucks...","content.76.5723":"Okay, that really sucks...","content.76.5724":"No way! I must have this relic!","content.76.5725":"Yeah, yeah, I read your journal.","content.76.5726":"No way! I must have that relic!","content.76.5727":"Alright. I'll go see how they're getting on!","content.76.5728":"There are other gems?","content.76.5730":"Seeya later, water skater...","content.76.5731":"Why are you digging in the Wild Estate?","content.76.5732":"What happened at the Brakmarian archaosology camp?","content.76.5733":"So?","content.76.5734":"That is one crazy story! See you around...","content.76.5735":"No way! I must have that relic!","content.76.5737":"I'll go straight there! Finally I'll be able to enter the Temple...","content.76.5739":"Awesome! The Bwork Beer cured Bwork Foo Zero!","content.76.5740":"Uh... Thanks, I guess. I'll just go scale that tiny little mountain up north. Great. Good luck!","content.76.5743":"Mission accepted!","content.76.5745":"So you're the chief of all the Bworks?","content.76.5746":"Of course, exploring and killing... Alrighty then. Anything else I should know?","content.76.5747":"Isn't that, like, treason or something? Did you kill them?","content.76.5748":"No way! Well, good look with the strike... I mean the stripe, and Kiki and all...","content.76.5749":"How about you tell me the recipe for Bwork Beer, hmmm?","content.76.5750":"I want to know the traditional recipe. I'll add my own secret ingredient afterwards.","content.76.5751":"Whatever... If *you* can do it, it can't be that dif... I mean... If you can do it, I can too.","content.76.5752":"I'm sure I can figure it out!","content.76.5758":"Okay, I get it. I'll give up now.","content.76.5759":"Trool Hairs?","content.76.5760":"A disembodied Bwork nail (ewww)...","content.76.5762":"A Iop brain?","content.76.5764":"Gobball Slobber!","content.76.5765":"Okay, I get it. I'll give up now.","content.76.5766":"An Ogrine?","content.76.5767":"Hazy Lead?","content.76.5768":"A little piece of Stasili...","content.76.5769":"One of Bossowl's feathers?","content.76.5770":"A drop of blood from a Sacrier!","content.76.5772":"Okay, I get it. I'll give up now.","content.76.5773":"I know! Bwork urine!","content.76.5774":"A dried Mushd crust?","content.76.5775":"A Dragon Pig Tail!","content.76.5776":"A spine from a Prespic...","content.76.5777":"An Ecaflip's tuft?","content.76.5778":"An Albino Schnek Egg!","content.76.5779":"Okay, I get it. I'll give up now.","content.76.5780":"One of Shosanne's buns!","content.76.5781":"One of Pappy Pal's kamas?","content.76.5782":"One of Marily... I mean Mmmmmmmmmporg's hairs?","content.76.5783":"An Eniripsa wing?","content.76.5784":"A slippery Bworkball!","content.76.5785":"Okay, I get it. I'll give up now.","content.76.5787":"Why are you digging in the Wild Estate?","content.76.5788":"What happened at the Sufokian archaosology camp?","content.76.5789":"Seeya later, water skater!","content.76.5790":"There are other gems?","content.76.5791":"Alright. I'll go see how they're getting on!","content.76.5792":"Okay, and what about the Frightened Bwork?","content.76.5793":"No way! I must have that relic!","content.76.5794":"What does that have to do with the Wild Estate?","content.76.5795":"Okay, that really sucks...","content.76.5796":"Do I have to do everything myself around here?","content.76.5798":"What an ungodly site! Why aren't you digging?","content.76.5799":"Huh? Oh yeah. Sure thing...","content.76.5801":"Shut up and dig!","content.76.5802":"I hate Skeletal Gobballs...","content.76.5804":"Hey grand-père ! Pourquoi tu fixes l'horizon alors que t'as un bandeau sur les yeux ?","content.76.5805":"Ha... \"Vu\" comme ça...","content.76.5806":"Hey dis grand-père ! Toi qui vois tout, t'aurais pas vu un gros ballon volant atterrir sur ton île ?","content.76.5807":"*En suivant du regard la direction montrée par le vieux Lenald, vous constatez que la crique est strictement vide de tout dirigeable* Là ? Où là ? Il n'y a rien que de l'eau ! Et je croyais que tu ne voyais rien car tu es aveugle...","content.76.5808":"*Vous vous frottez les yeux mais décidément, vous ne voyez rien* Heu... J'entends rien non plus, non... *Vous vous demandez si le vieux n'est pas fou en plus d'être aveugle* Mais bon, si tu insistes, je vais tenter de trouver ce que tu dis voir et entendre...","content.76.5809":"T'avais raison ! Il y a bien le dirigeable que je cherche amarré dans la crique ! Merci pour ton aide grand-père !","content.76.5810":"Bien dit ! J'en ferai une leçon de vie maintenant.","content.76.5812":"Yes, I'm ready to explore the whole wide world!","content.76.5813":"What exactly do I need to do to fill out the forms?","content.76.5814":"Say what? I might do for what exactly? ","content.76.5815":"Stop staring at me like that! I'm not a piece of meat!","content.76.5816":"Actually... that's exactly how I see myself, yes!","content.76.5817":"Hmm, not at all... My dream is to have my own cottage in the countryside, with a roaring fire and enough cookies to choke a pony.","content.76.5819":"And you want me to go find these oh-so-important resources for you, am I right?","content.76.5820":"I see where you're going with this, but I don't have time right now. Seeya! Goodbye!","content.76.5821":"I'm fine with that... But what's in it for me?","content.76.5822":"Dangerous monsters? Suicide mission?! I don't like the sound of that! I think I'll stay here...","content.76.5823":"Yes, I'm ready to explore the whole wide world!","content.76.5824":"What exactly do I need to do to fill out the forms?","content.76.5826":"Okay, okay, I'm in. What exactly do I have to do?","content.76.5827":"What exactly do I need to do to fill out the forms?","content.76.5830":"Don't you worry about me! Get the second list ready, 'cause I'll be back before you know it!","content.76.5831":"What exactly do I need to do to fill out the forms?","content.76.5832":"Y'know, I don't actually think I'm interested after all. Good luck with your weird harvesting, though.","content.76.5833":"Yes, I'm ready to explore the whole wide world!","content.76.5834":"Yes, I'm ready to explore the whole wide world!","content.76.5835":"Nothing right now.","content.76.5838":"Sure do - I have the Shin Larva Leg.","content.76.5840":"Great! I'll get started immediately!","content.76.5841":"Not yet... I'll get on with it!","content.76.5842":"Sure do - I have the Treechnell Leg.","content.76.5846":"Yes, I'm ready to explore the whole wide world! Although right now, I'd better head back to my Nation.","content.76.5847":"I'm here to sort out the paperwork for my file!","content.76.5852":"Next stop, the Garrison!","content.76.5857":"All done! I don't think I missed anything...","content.76.5858":"Alright, Mr Sergeant!","content.76.5859":"I'm here to sort out the paperwork for my file!","content.76.5860":"I'm here to sort out the paperwork for my file!","content.76.5861":"I'm here to sort out the paperwork for my file!","content.76.5862":"Am I ever!","content.76.5863":"Nothing for the moment, but it's on the way, promise!","content.76.5868":"There's nothing I love more than monster hunting!","content.76.5869":"Not for the moment. I'll get back to it soon, don't worry!","content.76.5874":"I'm on it!","content.76.5875":"It's not!","content.76.5881":"More than ever!","content.76.5882":"Rest? I laugh in the face of fatigue!","content.76.5883":"I'm not ready to give up yet!","content.76.5884":"Not really... It's not really the time of year for it...","content.76.5885":"Sure is... Here are the 8 Royal Jellies.","content.76.5886":"Sure is... Here are the 8 Eternal Ices.","content.76.5887":"Sure is... Here are the 8 Ice Sticks.","content.76.5888":"Sure is... Here are the 8 Ponk-tiuses.","content.76.5889":"I have sooo much to do right now, but I'll be back soon with the things you asked me for!","content.76.5890":"Just dandy! Here, I've brought you the 10 Pompom Tails.","content.76.5891":"Certainly. Here's the 10 Zomkin Juice for you.","content.76.5892":"Just dandy! Here, I've brought you the 10 Luxulious Fuls.","content.76.5893":"Just dandy! Here, I've brought you the 10 Royal Myceliums.","content.76.5894":"They're empty! Nothing in 'em!","content.76.5895":"They're doing just fine, and here's the proof: 14 Cawwot Tufts.","content.76.5896":"They're doing just fine, and here's the proof: 14 Osgasmiks.","content.76.5897":"They're doing just fine, and here's the proof: 14 Gaping Locks.","content.76.5898":"They're doing just fine, and here's the proof: 14 Age-Old Fragments.","content.76.5899":"I know, I know - I just haven't got them yet, okay?!","content.76.5900":"And here are the 20 Koko Nutt Essences!","content.76.5901":"And here are the 20 Black Monkey Hairs!","content.76.5902":"And here are the 20 Pirate Flags!","content.76.5903":"And here are the 20 Cataplasms!","content.76.5904":"At last! I've worked so hard for this, and finally it's mine!","content.76.5905":"Hmmm, no, not yet. I think I'm going to rest first.","content.76.5907":"Finish the ritual? Over my dead body! (Start a fight)","content.76.5908":"Sorry, I didn't mean to disturb you!","content.76.5909":"A little bit, yeah! What's Astrub?","content.76.5911":"I thought you were someone else. Bye.","content.76.5912":"Could you help me out with something I've been wondering about?","content.76.5913":"Nothing right now.","content.76.5914":"What's an archivist?","content.76.5915":"Can you tell me more about Astrub?","content.76.5918":"Can you tell me about the Nations?","content.76.5922":"Ah, I get it, you're writers!","content.76.5923":"I think I must have seen him already.","content.76.5930":"Thanks, I'll give it a read.","content.76.5931":"Thanks for the advice!","content.76.5934":"That sounds incredible...!","content.76.5935":"Is there anything I can help you with?","content.76.5936":"Actually, I don't have any questions right now.","content.76.5937":"Right!","content.76.5940":"I need some information.","content.76.5948":"Uh... I'm the one who did all the work...!","content.76.5949":"And... What's going on?","content.76.5950":"Isn't there anyone who can help us?","content.76.5952":"Mount Zinit?","content.76.5953":"Nothing right now.","content.76.5956":"Do you know Ogrest's Cult?","content.76.5959":"What does being an Archaosologist involve?","content.76.5967":"Alright, thanks.","content.76.5968":"I wonder what those reasons are...","content.76.5969":"Thanks for the info.","content.76.5970":"Totally...","content.76.5973":"I need some information.","content.76.5974":"I must find all the artefacts to go there!","content.76.5975":"I understand.","content.76.5976":"Hmmm...","content.76.5981":"Goodness me...","content.76.5982":"I have some questions for you.","content.76.5983":"Artefacts?...","content.76.5984":"My memory is failing me.","content.76.5985":"Where do you come from?","content.76.5986":"Can you tell me more about the members of Ogrest's Cult?","content.76.5989":"He should have left the mission to me, instead of giving me the rat one!","content.76.5990":"Have you met a mercenary calling himself the Astrub Knight?","content.76.5992":"Thank you.","content.76.5993":"Thank you.","content.76.5994":"When you put it that way...","content.76.5997":"Okay, I'm ready to go to Zinit!","content.76.5998":"Let me think about it a while, okay?","content.76.6002":"Thanks!","content.76.6003":"Oh, nothing.","content.76.6004":"Zinit?","content.76.6005":"Thanks!","content.76.6006":"Thanks!","content.76.6007":"Thank you.","content.76.6008":"Ambassador to the gods?","content.76.6009":"You know Ogrest?","content.76.6010":"Nations?","content.76.6011":"I need your help! A terrible being is being reincarnated as we speak, in the Ogrest's Cult camp!","content.76.6013":"I have the ingredients you asked for!","content.76.6014":"Here, ta... ahh! (Start a fight)","content.76.6015":"Yes, to register with Amakna!","content.76.6016":"Nothing, I'm just passing by.","content.76.6017":"I'm ready! En garde!","content.76.6018":"I feel too weak...","content.76.6019":"It was the least I could do, seriously. I mean, I wasn't going to leave you all alone!","content.76.6020":"Me?!","content.76.6021":"I'd love to! I mean, it's not as though I haven't done anything to help in Astrub.","content.76.6022":"Alright Sergeant. I'll jump in the Canoon of the Guard and fire myself over to the Prison on the double!","content.76.6023":"I'm checking out the different sections of the Prison!","content.76.6025":"I need to get to the Prison!","content.76.6027":"There's a tunnel under the prison showers, and someone's been giving them passes and guard clothes so they can get out incognito!","content.76.6029":"Have you noticed anything strange going on in the Prison?","content.76.6030":"And you haven't noticed anything unusual recently?","content.76.6031":"Thanks for your help.","content.76.6032":"Have you noticed anything strange going on in the Prison?","content.76.6033":"Have you noticed anything strange going on in the Prison?","content.76.6034":"I can do it, if you like?","content.76.6035":"Sergeant, yes Sergeant!","content.76.6036":"Not yet - I still have things to investigate!","content.76.6037":"I think I've found your culprit!","content.76.6038":"All the clues point to Officer Krupt, Sergeant!","content.76.6039":"Understood, Sergeant! I'll go and see if my theory holds!","content.76.6040":"Yes Sergeant!","content.76.6041":"Yes Sergeant, I can confirm that it's definitely him!","content.76.6042":"You're welcome, Sergeant!","content.76.6046":"Thanks for the info!","content.76.6047":"Yes, I'd like to become a Guard!","content.76.6048":"Yes, I'd like to become a Guard!","content.76.6049":"Tell me about Citizenship Points again!","content.76.6050":"No, thank you.","content.76.6051":"Citizenship Points?","content.76.6052":"Got it!","content.76.6053":"Here's my passport!","content.76.6054":"I've been ready all my life!","content.76.6055":"As you wish, my lo... my Sergeant!","content.76.6056":"Here's my passport!","content.76.6057":"Here's my passport!","content.76.6058":"Here's my passport!","content.76.6060":"Errr... I'll need to think about it a little longer.","content.76.6061":"As you wish, my lo... my Sergeant!","content.76.6064":"Thanks, Sergeant!","content.76.6065":"Yes Sergeant!","content.76.6069":"If you say so...","content.76.6070":"If you say so...","content.76.6071":"If you say so...","content.76.6072":"Wanna bet? I'll beat it out of you if I have to! \\n[Starts a fight.]","content.76.6073":"(You tell him everything, right from the beginning)","content.76.6074":"True... but I'm exhausted now!","content.76.6075":"Thanks! A drink would be great!","content.76.6076":"Thanks for your help!","content.76.6077":"... Ah... Errr... Alright...","content.76.6078":"Oh, nothing. Just checking that everything's shipshape for the Sergeant!","content.76.6080":"Are you often in charge of transferring prisoners?","content.76.6082":"Gee! No need to be THAT unpleasant!","content.76.6084":"Alright! Be back in five!","content.76.6085":"Thanks Donalangelo! I'm off to save the world thanks to this...this... What is this again? Anyway, I'm off!","content.76.6086":"I'll go and see him right away!","content.76.6088":"Yes, to register with Bonta!","content.76.6089":"Yes, to register with Brakmar!","content.76.6090":"Yes, to register with Sufokia!","content.76.6091":"I've been ready all my life!","content.76.6092":"Errr... I'll need to think about it a little longer.","content.76.6093":"I've been ready all my life!","content.76.6094":"Errr... I'll need to think about it a little longer.","content.76.6095":"I've been ready all my life!","content.76.6096":"Errr... I'll need to think about it a little longer.","content.76.6098":"I don't feel ready yet. (downloading hasn't finished)","content.76.6099":"Uh... I must have left it somewhere. I'll be right back!","content.76.6100":"But I already have enough Citizen Points!","content.76.6101":"It's as good as done, Sergeant!","content.76.6107":"I heard there were some holes to repair.","content.76.6110":"Shustuft Crust? What is that? Can you eat it?","content.76.6111":"Nothing special, I just saw the light.","content.76.6112":"You don't say... Well, go ahead and explain it to me.","content.76.6113":"I fear nothing and noone, let's go!","content.76.6115":"I'm starting to understand. You need me, don't you?","content.76.6116":"Uh, yeah... Demons and all that... no thank you.","content.76.6118":"I hope the compensation is worth it! Let's go!","content.76.6119":"What is this place?","content.76.6121":"What's going on?","content.76.6122":"I'm just admiring the countryside...","content.76.6123":"What's going on?","content.76.6124":"What is this place?","content.76.6125":"Sounds pretty serious.","content.76.6126":"Oh, that sounds lovely!","content.76.6129":"Pray to the Meridia of the day","content.76.6131":"I'm going to go see where they are and tell them to come look for you.","content.76.6133":"I met Little-Feet; he told me that I could find you in the area.","content.76.6134":"Nothing, I'm just passing by. Bye!","content.76.6137":"Uh.... Poink?","content.76.6140":"Ponk pooonk! Nothing sir!","content.76.6141":"Poink as well. The expedition would like to settle down here. Do you think you can share the area and the fountain? ","content.76.6143":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Castucs, do you?","content.76.6144":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Castucs, do you?","content.76.6146":"I have your 10 Castuc Spines.","content.76.6147":"I have your 10 Castuc Seeds.","content.76.6150":"Nothing at all. I'm leaving!","content.76.6154":"I'll be back soon with your Castuc Spines.","content.76.6155":"I'll get searching for those Castuc Seeds right away.","content.76.6156":"Obviously, I'm game!","content.76.6161":"Okay, I'll bring you some Blackspore Strips.","content.76.6162":"I'll get searching for those Blackspore Seeds right away.","content.76.6163":"Uh... Ok, I'll bring them to you!","content.76.6164":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Blackspores, do you?","content.76.6165":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Blackspores, do you?","content.76.6166":"I have your 10 Blackspore Strips.","content.76.6167":"I have your 10 Blackspore Strips.","content.76.6171":"What happened to me?","content.76.6177":"Next stop, Castuc Grove. Be back soon!","content.76.6178":"You're probably right. \\nSo what can I do to help you settle in?","content.76.6179":"Won't notice a thing, eh? This better work!","content.76.6180":"Really? There's not a SINGLE drop of water anywhere else?","content.76.6181":"I guess I'll head out that way and take a look, then! I'm not giving you a hug.","content.76.6182":"Okay, I'll get going. A hearty poinkpoink to you as well, good sir.","content.76.6183":"Oh, nothing.","content.76.6184":"I was just wondering why you stayed here all alone. Did they abandon you?","content.76.6185":"What's your role in the expedition?","content.76.6186":"How did it happen? I mean... your legs?","content.76.6187":"Woah... That's not what I was expecting at all...\\nWell, seeya!","content.76.6188":"Oh right. Well... awesome! Bye!","content.76.6189":"Woah! That's not a funny story at all!","content.76.6190":"Juicy Sap?","content.76.6191":"South, southwest! I'm gonna find that source!","content.76.6193":"I have all the Juicy Sap you asked me for.","content.76.6194":"Nothing, I'm just passing by. Bye!","content.76.6196":"What's your role in the expedition?","content.76.6197":"That's crazy! What else?","content.76.6198":"Wowee! What a story!","content.76.6199":"A fresh start, with all your basic needs catered for. Good luck!","content.76.6200":"And where might this spring be?","content.76.6201":"What a sad tale! And what a guy this Ahabar is!","content.76.6202":"I've found a spring, but it's well-guarded. The spine I got from the sentinel gave me an idea...","content.76.6203":"This is too good to be true! Maybe I can help you get back there! Tell me, where is this passage?","content.76.6206":"I've found an entrance which should lead to the land of your ancestors, but it's sealed shut. Can you give me a hand? ","content.76.6207":"This isn't going to hurt, is it...?","content.76.6208":"Thanks, I guess...","content.76.6209":"The Blackspores? You bet I'll help you!","content.76.6210":"Huh?! What?! Deep within the...?!","content.76.6212":"It was nothing! Is there anything else I can do?","content.76.6214":"Alright, I'll go straight away!","content.76.6216":"Can you tell me more about the Blackspores?","content.76.6218":"Why don't you leave this place and go up to the surface?","content.76.6220":"Nothing right now.","content.76.6221":"Where are the Contaminated Springs?","content.76.6222":"I get the impression I can hear the Blackspores' thoughts...","content.76.6223":"Oh, thanks! I'll have a look at my map.","content.76.6224":"Turns out the spores aren't all bad... which gives me an advantage over them!","content.76.6225":"For all the tears of Ogrest in the sea... What happened to the other Fungi?","content.76.6226":"Now that's a long story that I really don't have the time to tell right now.","content.76.6227":"I wouldn't like to be in your place.","content.76.6228":"Yessir, right away sir!","content.76.6229":"Uh... okay.","content.76.6230":"I guess I'd better go take a look, then! Thanks!","content.76.6231":"Poink and ponk. So? Have you managed to speak with your ancestors? ","content.76.6233":"It's looking very likely that you'll be able to occupy the Castuc Village soon!","content.76.6234":"It's looking very likely that you'll be able to occupy the Castuc Village soon!","content.76.6235":"I hope things turn out alright for you!","content.76.6236":"*You describe your trip to the Fungopole*","content.76.6237":"Yeah, the water should become pure again!","content.76.6238":"I hope you find peace in the Fungopole.","content.76.6239":"What are you going to do now?","content.76.6240":"I hope things turn out alright for you!","content.76.6241":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Castucs, do you?","content.76.6242":"I'll be back soon with your Castuc Spines.","content.76.6243":"I'll get searching for those Castuc Seeds right away.","content.76.6244":"I'm gonna burst that Ponktius's bubble!","content.76.6245":"Okay, I'll bring you some Blackspore Strips.","content.76.6246":"I'll get searching for those Blackspore Seeds right away.","content.76.6247":"The terrible Sugnuf... I'm on my way!","content.76.6248":"Don't suppose you need a hand dealing with the Blackspores, do you?","content.76.6250":"Very well. I'll come back some other time.","content.76.6251":"No offense, but creating the Teleport of Scriptures? Portals? The Ancients? Other dimensions? It's kind of far-fetched...","content.76.6252":"Ummm... Hello! Are you the person who needs help getting out to Chillberg Island?","content.76.6253":"I'll do it!","content.76.6254":"Um... See you around!","content.76.6255":"To infinity, and... uh... Chillberg Island!","content.76.6260":"I don't really feel like attacking monsters right now. I'll come back in a bit, okay?","content.76.6261":"I'll leave right away!","content.76.6263":"What kind of machine?","content.76.6264":"And what does all this have to do with me?","content.76.6265":"Nous téléporter ?","content.76.6266":"Impossible, le Biblio-téléport est un artefact de l'ancienne civilisation, tout comme les Zaaps !","content.76.6271":"Well met, Master. I need some information. I was told you could help me... for a price.","content.76.6272":"Ah, it seems I was mistaken. See you later.","content.76.6273":"Greetings, Master. I need information. I've heard that you're the type to know things... As long as we have something you need in return.","content.76.6274":"Hmm... Nothing special, see ya!","content.76.6275":"Here are your Skramas. Now I'd like some information on the Dimensional Voyagers...","content.76.6276":"Here is your loot. Now I'd like some information on the Dimensional Voyagers...","content.76.6280":"More work? I hope this Guild Master will be able to give my some information about... my friends. Bye.","content.76.6281":"I hear you have work for me? You'd better have the information I need...","content.76.6282":"That's that taken care of! I don't know what that guy had done to you, but he won't be bothering you any longer.","content.76.6283":"Hmm... Nothing special, see ya!","content.76.6290":"Yes, take me back to Astrub please.","content.76.6291":"No, let's go and find that energy in the tower!","content.76.6295":"The portal still doesn't seem very stable. What can we do? (Daily Quest)","content.76.6296":"Here, I've filled the Wakfu Harvester so we can use it to fuel the machine.","content.76.6297":"So, have you found a way to stabilize the portal for good?","content.76.6302":"Here's the Wakfu Harvester, filled by yours truly.","content.76.6303":"The portal doesn't seem very stable. What can we do? (Daily Quest)","content.76.6304":"Here, I've filled the Wakfu harvester so we can use it to fuel the machine. (Daily Quest)","content.76.6307":"That's great, but I have things to do!","content.76.6309":"I'll see if I'm feeling motivated tomorrow. Seeya!","content.76.6310":"Let's activate the machine!","content.76.6312":"Super, so what's the plan?","content.76.6313":"And if it doesn't work?","content.76.6314":"Ok, let's go break into the bank!","content.76.6315":"Let's go for the \"heist\" of the century!","content.76.6316":"Pff... I don't feel so well, I'm off.","content.76.6317":"Can you explain Plan B to me again?","content.76.6318":"Uh... okay, that's not really a plan.","content.76.6320":"Erm.....\\nHello!","content.76.6321":"We're not moving!","content.76.6322":"Thank you!","content.76.6323":"Enurado!\\nChuck over the Lemon Multijely!","content.76.6324":"Nothing, thanks!","content.76.6325":"The Great Explorancient? Who is she? \\nThat's the second time we've heard about it.","content.76.6326":"There is one! We can gather the energy required with Pandora's Wakfu gatherer.","content.76.6327":"Uh... Remind me again how to recharge the I.D.S., please?","content.76.6328":"Ah yes, that's right! Thanks!","content.76.6329":"Yes, let's try with this Wakfu!","content.76.6330":"Fingers crossed!","content.76.6331":"I would just like to power the Syncroportal","content.76.6332":"Go on, I'm ready to try my luck with your riddles!","content.76.6333":"A current.","content.76.6334":"No, not yet. I'll get on it now!","content.76.6335":"I've got the energy required to power the I.D.S.","content.76.6336":"Thank you!","content.76.6337":"Are you sure? You're the leader of the Dimensional Voyagers? Your friend in Ingloriom sent me here, but I still don't know why...","content.76.6338":"I see. And so why did the \"old guy\" as you call him send me to you...?","content.76.6339":"Yep, I'm going to gather Skramas. (Daily Quest)","content.76.6340":"No, not today, it's my rest day!","content.76.6341":"I prefer to act in the shadows! I choose the burglary.","content.76.6342":"I'd like to try my luck at pickpocketing again!","content.76.6343":"No, none.","content.76.6344":"I've completed the pickpocketing contract. Here are the 2,000 skramas.","content.76.6345":"I've completed the burglary contract. Here is the loot of 10,000 skramas.","content.76.6346":"Thank you. See you.","content.76.6347":"Thank you. See you.","content.76.6348":"I've completed the burglary. Here is the loot of 10,000 skramas.","content.76.6349":"I've completed the pickpocketing. Here are the 2,000 skramas.","content.76.6350":"I've completed the burglary. Here is the loot of 10,000 skramas.","content.76.6351":"I've completed the pickpocketing. Here are the 2,000 skramas.","content.76.6352":"I prefer collecting Skramas. \\n(Daily Quest)","content.76.6353":"I've completed the burglary. Here is the loot of 10,000 skramas.","content.76.6354":"I've completed the pickpocketing. Here are the 2,000 skramas.","content.76.6355":"I prefer collecting Skramas. (Daily Quest)","content.76.6356":"I've completed the burglary. Here is the loot of 10,000 skramas.","content.76.6357":"I've completed the pickpocketing. Here are the 2,000 skramas.","content.76.6358":"I want to complete the contract and finance the Srambad Dimensional Voyagers. (Daily Quest)","content.76.6359":"I'm going to take a break first!","content.76.6360":"What happened?","content.76.6361":"What do you mean, \"not safe\"? And anyway, where is \"here\"?","content.76.6362":"Do you know Pandora? Are you also a travel... Huh?! (Start a fight)","content.76.6363":"Oh, I didn't want to disturb you. See ya!","content.76.6365":"Why are you helping us?","content.76.6366":"Wait! Tell me your name. (Start a fight)","content.76.6367":"Oh, I didn't want to disturb you. See ya!","content.76.6368":"Nice fight. But isn't it dangerous for you to oppose the Militia?","content.76.6369":"True! Tell me, do you think you can help us a little longer?","content.76.6371":"Indeed, we're looking for very specific people who prefer to remain anonymous...","content.76.6372":"Guild masters, in a city of thiefs and assassins... So much potential for trouble...","content.76.6373":"Uhhh... And the non-egghead translation?","content.76.6374":"Okay, I understand now! I just need to go monster hunting!","content.76.6375":"A Wakfu Harvester?","content.76.6376":"Could you tell me about the Wakfu Harvester again?","content.76.6378":"Why don't you use the Wakfu crystals on the roof of the Temple of Scriptures?","content.76.6379":"Totally! At least that way they'd be of some use. Bye!","content.76.6381":"The portal in the Temple of Scriptures still doesn't seem stable. (Daily Quest)","content.76.6382":"Here, I've filled the Wakfu Harvester so we can use it to fuel the machine in the Temple.","content.76.6383":"Could you tell me about the Wakfu Harvester again?","content.76.6384":"I'm going to the Temple of Scriptures!","content.76.6386":"But you've changed your mind...?","content.76.6387":"So where do you think you're from, then?","content.76.6388":"An Eliatrope?!  \\nIf that's true, the archaosologists would love to meet you!","content.76.6389":"Aren't you worried about what Sylargh said?","content.76.6390":"After that episode with Sylargh and meeting the old guy in Ingloriom, I guess you've reconsidered, huh?","content.76.6391":"True...","content.76.6394":"Well, good luck!","content.76.6395":"No way! I hope that, some day, you find out who you really are.","content.76.6396":"Chad, eh? So you don't pay attention to what your enemies think of you?","content.76.6397":"A real adventurer. I like you, kid.","content.76.6398":"Wow... You're not afraid of anyone, are you?","content.76.6399":"But... who are you exactly?","content.76.6400":"Tell me about where you come from.","content.76.6401":"Aren't you worried about what Sylargh said?","content.76.6402":"But you've changed your mind...?","content.76.6403":"So where do you think you're from, then?","content.76.6404":"Aren't you worried about what Sylargh said?","content.76.6405":"Tell me about where you come from.","content.76.6406":"So, have you found a way to stabilize the portal?","content.76.6407":"Whoa, so we can finally use the portal now? New world, here we come! ","content.76.6408":"Other dimensions? But... But... Who are you?!","content.76.6410":"What do the gods have to do with this? We risked our lives for these contracts, and that wasn't enough?","content.76.6411":"The other Guild Masters have told me that the Voyagers probably all died in Srambad. I'm go...","content.76.6413":"I've already done a lot for the guilds. Isn't there a way to skip straight to the information?","content.76.6414":"That's all?? And why not Ogrest roasted on a platter, with fried Dofus and a selection of crunchy Celestial Tofus on the side?","content.76.6415":"Very well, I'll take care of it. But for now, know that you've raised more questions than you've given answers. You'll have to spill the beans when I return.","content.76.6416":"I love Crozolilies... Can I have some seeds?","content.76.6417":"Yes grandpa, I run, I steal, I vanish! Bye.","content.76.6418":"The god of thieves was rbobbed? Great, that's not really useful to me... See ya, and cheers.","content.76.6419":"I'll see what I can do, it doesn't look that hard.","content.76.6421":"I don't really know. See you later, maybe.","content.76.6422":"I'll see what I can do, it doesn't look that hard.","content.76.6423":"I don't really know. See you later, maybe.","content.76.6424":"I'm doing that... You're not exactly the best of friends then... That's not my problem. Do it yourself!","content.76.6425":"I can't believe it! I'm going to see what the other one can tell me. See you later, and cheers.","content.76.6426":"The god of thieves was robbed? I'm going to see what the other guy can tell me... See ya, and cheers.","content.76.6427":"Not heard anything more about the Dimensional Voyagers? I'm off...","content.76.6428":"Not heard anything more about the Dimensional Voyagers? I'm off...","content.76.6429":"What was I doing for you? I've forgotten.","content.76.6430":"What was I doing for you? I've forgotten.","content.76.6431":"Let's go! Open sesame!","content.76.6432":"Seems like the portal is still unstable...","content.76.6433":"Don't worry! I'm sure you'll figure it out. Keep your chin up!","content.76.6434":"I'd like to know more, because I hope I didn't take on all these contracts for nothing...","content.76.6435":"THE GODS' POWER!?","content.76.6436":"But!! How?! Where is it? Can we use it?","content.76.6440":"That's a lot of information at once... I need to mull it all over. I'll be back.","content.76.6441":"Right, I'm ready, we can talk about your plan for the bank.","content.76.6442":"Erm... I'm not sure I follow...","content.76.6443":"Ok. I trust you. I imagine you've had time to think about it anyway.","content.76.6447":"Ok, I'll be back as soon as I can.","content.76.6448":"Forget about it; I'm going for a walk instead. Bye.","content.76.6449":"Erm... Forget about it.","content.76.6450":"Do you know more about the gods' power? Where could we find it?","content.76.6451":"Did you create the security system?!","content.76.6452":"You... You've impressed me!!!\\nAnd what do we have to do to get our hands on this power?","content.76.6453":"That's an impressive invention! \\nAre you talking about this? (show the I.D.S.)","content.76.6454":"Super! We'll be able to go to the next Dimension!","content.76.6455":"Very well! Let's go fight some monsters!","content.76.6458":"No, I won't stay any longer.","content.76.6459":"I'll get you! One of these days, I'll get you!","content.76.6460":"Woohoo! I won!","content.76.6461":"Thirty-eight.","content.76.6462":"Twenty-six.","content.76.6463":"A torrent.","content.76.6464":"Oh no, I'm going to rest first... I'll see you later!","content.76.6466":"A breath.","content.76.6467":"\"Individual-Dimensional-Syncroportal\".","content.76.6468":"\"Inter-Dimensional-Syncroportal\".","content.76.6469":"\"Inter-Dimensional Sausage\".","content.76.6470":"Krosmoglob","content.76.6471":"Krosmogolem","content.76.6472":"Krosmosphere","content.76.6473":"Kamas.","content.76.6474":"Skramas","content.76.6475":"Money","content.76.6482":"Forty-two.","content.76.6483":"Hi, I've been sent here by Goultard. Do you know anything about \"dragoturkeys\"?\\n\\n(Show the permit)","content.76.6484":"Me!","content.76.6485":"What?","content.76.6487":"Fantastic! I've heard that dragoturkeys make great mounts, do you think I could have one if you have too many? ","content.76.6489":"No problem, I'm a{[1*]?:} pro!","content.76.6492":"Very well, we'll proceed as such. So, what are the books and where can I find them?","content.76.6493":"Makoffee","content.76.6494":"A Meteorite Eel.","content.76.6495":"\"Iop Devilish Sauce\".","content.76.6496":"Two trouts.","content.76.6497":"You who knows so much, could you recommend me a book on dragoturkeys?","content.76.6498":"Woah? Woah what? Problem?","content.76.6499":"Hey, what do you think of dragoturkeys?","content.76.6500":"okay. I'll go and take care of it now.","content.76.6502":"Melmac sent me to you because you know all about dragoturkey trappings. Could you teach me a few things about it?","content.76.6503":"Some items to craft? Understood. I'll be back as soon as I'm finished.","content.76.6504":"Here are the items you asked of me!","content.76.6507":"There, I collected three books and read them all! I know the anatomy and biology of dragoturkeys, and how to train and equip them.","content.76.6508":"Missy Amulet? I understand, I'm going right away.","content.76.6509":"Hello! I was sent by Melmac. I need your help to craft a Dragoturkey saddle and reins.","content.76.6510":"Perfect: I'll take care of it straight away. Thanks!","content.76.6514":"Here are the canoon powders.","content.76.6516":"So, the saddle and reins are ready?","content.76.6517":"My thanks!","content.76.6518":"All right, I crafted my own saddle and reins. Am I a real dragoboy now?","content.76.6519":"Awesome!","content.76.6520":"What?! Why are you dressed up as... Sram?","content.76.6521":"Ok, it's serious now. See you.","content.76.6522":"I'd like to try your riddles again, just for fun!","content.76.6523":"I'll remember that!","content.76.6524":"I'm going back on the hunt, see ya!","content.76.6525":"I would like to take care of the Shushus","content.76.6526":"I would like to take care of the Tormented Shushus","content.76.6527":"I would like to take care of the Fanatical Shushus","content.76.6528":"Here are the 50 Shushu essences","content.76.6529":"Here are the 10 Tormented Shushu seeds","content.76.6530":"Here are the 10 Fanatical Shushu seeds","content.76.6531":"No question, I am good and ready!","content.76.6532":"Aww, that's annoying... I can go and get them for you if you want. ","content.76.6533":"The Bonta Outpost on Astrub? Very well, I'll go look for your bag right away.","content.76.6534":"(Show the bag in your possession)","content.76.6537":"I've heard about a Petsmount Permit, what does that entail?","content.76.6539":"3,000 kamas? That's kind of expensive... I'll come back when I have them.","content.76.6540":"I've got the kamas to buy the Permit!","content.76.6541":"There, I got rid of the rats in your stock room!","content.76.6543":"Remind me what I have to do again.","content.76.6544":"What is Endurance?","content.76.6545":"What is Panic?","content.76.6546":"What is Exhaustion?","content.76.6547":"Do you have any advice to give me?","content.76.6548":"What is Endurance?","content.76.6549":"What is Panic?","content.76.6550":"What is Exhaustion?","content.76.6551":"Do you have any advice to give me?","content.76.6552":"Alright, thanks. I have no more questions.","content.76.6553":"Remind me what I have to do again.","content.76.6554":"What is Panic?","content.76.6555":"What is Exhaustion?","content.76.6556":"Do you have any advice to give me?","content.76.6557":"Alright, thanks. I have no more questions.","content.76.6558":"Remind me what I have to do again.","content.76.6559":"What is Endurance?","content.76.6560":"What is Exhaustion?","content.76.6561":"Do you have any advice to give me?","content.76.6562":"Alright, thanks. I have no more questions.","content.76.6563":"Remind me what I have to do again.","content.76.6564":"What is Endurance?","content.76.6565":"What is Panic?","content.76.6566":"Do you have any advice to give me?","content.76.6567":"Alright, thanks. I have no more questions.","content.76.6568":"Remind me what I have to do again.","content.76.6569":"What is Endurance?","content.76.6570":"What is Panic?","content.76.6571":"What is Exhaustion?","content.76.6572":"Alright, thanks. I have no more questions.","content.76.6573":"What's that castle?","content.76.6574":"Do you have any more information on Ogrest?","content.76.6575":"I would like to procure an Amaknian harness for my Petsmounts please.","content.76.6576":"See you soon.","content.76.6577":"I am an involved citizen and I'm willing to pay the 2,000 kamas!","content.76.6578":"2,000 kamas! That's too much...","content.76.6579":"A good, dedicated citizen? Well, I think I still have some work to do...","content.76.6580":"I'm not a good citizen and I don't even have the kamas... I'm nowhere close to having it!","content.76.6581":"Actually, I've changed my mind.","content.76.6582":"What's that castle?","content.76.6583":"Do you have any more information on Ogrest?","content.76.6584":"I would like to procure a Bontarian harness for my Petsmounts please.","content.76.6585":"See you soon.","content.76.6586":"I am an involved citizen and I'm willing to pay the 2,000 kamas!","content.76.6587":"2,000 kamas! That's too much...","content.76.6588":"A good, dedicated citizen? Well, I think I still have some work to do...","content.76.6589":"I'm not a good citizen and I don't even have the kamas... I'm nowhere close to having it!","content.76.6590":"Actually, I've changed my mind.","content.76.6591":"What's that castle?","content.76.6592":"Do you have any more information on Ogrest?","content.76.6593":"I would like to procure a Brakmarian harness for my Petsmounts please.","content.76.6594":"See you soon.","content.76.6595":"I am an involved citizen and I'm willing to pay the 2,000 kamas!","content.76.6596":"2,000 kamas! That's too much...","content.76.6597":"A good, dedicated citizen? Well, I think I still have some work to do...","content.76.6598":"I'm not a good citizen and I don't even have the kamas... I'm nowhere close to having it!","content.76.6599":"Actually, I've changed my mind.","content.76.6600":"What's that castle?","content.76.6601":"Do you have any more information on Ogrest?","content.76.6602":"I would like to procure a Sufokian harness for my Petsmounts please.","content.76.6603":"See you soon.","content.76.6604":"I am an involved citizen and I'm willing to pay the 2,000 kamas!","content.76.6605":"2,000 kamas! That's too much...","content.76.6606":"A good, dedicated citizen? Well, I think I still have some work to do...","content.76.6607":"I'm not a good citizen and I don't even have the kamas... I'm nowhere close to having it!","content.76.6608":"Actually, I've changed my mind.","content.76.6617":"Ok... See you soon!","content.76.6635":"Okay, I'll get all that for you.","content.76.6636":"Give me an epic item!","content.76.6637":"Give me an epic item!","content.76.6638":"Give me an epic item!","content.76.6640":"Ok... See you soon!","content.76.6641":"Here are the resources for the epic item","content.76.6642":"I'm on it!","content.76.6643":"I'll come and visit you sometimes!","content.76.6644":"Oh, thanks Granny! I'll take good care of it.\\nCome on Dot!","content.76.6645":"Dot and I will come visit you from time to time!","content.76.6646":"Mammy Pal asked me to bring you your haven bag.","content.76.6647":"Yes, I just crashed through your house's ceiling and onto your bed.","content.76.6648":"What's in it for me?","content.76.6649":"It's agreed then, let's head to the Mercenaries' training room!","content.76.6650":"I was attacked by Chaos Plants in the stock room!","content.76.6651":"Who is \"they\"?","content.76.6652":"So what's their plan? Make the world even worse than it already is?","content.76.6653":"Why don't you go yourself, or send one of your mercenaries?","content.76.6654":"All right. It seems like an important mission. I'll see what I can do.\\n\\n(Agree, together with your Gemlin)","content.76.6655":"Sewers to set the mood... Lovely.","content.76.6656":"It's agreed then, let's head to the Mercenaries' Reserve!","content.76.6657":"A graveyard to set the mood... How quaint.","content.76.6658":"I'm going to see Donalangelo again!","content.76.6659":"I was trained by Donalangelo in the sewers and I'm now ready to fight the Cult, but the entrance to their temple is blocked. I was thinking you might be able to help me...","content.76.6660":"Thanks Pappy, I'll go see Mammy right now!","content.76.6661":"Thanks Pappy, I'll go see Mammy right now!","content.76.6662":"I'll show them what I can do!","content.76.6663":"Oh yes! They won't be causing trouble on Astrub for some time!","content.76.6664":"In fact, I met someone named Ullu who kept saying I was some sort of prophecy hero?!","content.76.6665":"He asked me to gather the 12 remaining Artefacts in the universe, in order to go to Mount Zinit.","content.76.6666":"I'll go look for him, maybe he can tell me where to look. \\nThanks, Pappy!","content.76.6667":"Thanks, Pappy! See you soon!","content.76.6674":"I have some questions for you.","content.76.6675":"I'll let your work, Pappy!","content.76.6678":"I'm going to take this old wooden box.","content.76.6679":"Here are your weapons. Still not sure whether I'm good enough?","content.76.6680":"Pappy Pal told me you might know where the members of Ogrest's Cult are hiding.","content.76.6681":"I destroyed the eggs, but I'm pretty sure I saw things moving inside the nests.","content.76.6682":"I defeated the Nanny Larva. That should calm things down a bit. Now will you help me?","content.76.6683":"I have the ingredients you asked for!","content.76.6684":"I need your help! A terrible being is being reincarnated as we speak, in the Temple of Ogrest's Cult!","content.76.6685":"I've lost the key to Ogrest's Cult's hideout!","content.76.6686":"I need some information.","content.76.6687":"I was only passing through - bye!","content.76.6688":"I have to go to the Nanny Larva's Nest.","content.76.6690":"The Nanny Larva won't be a problem any longer!","content.76.6691":"Let's go teach this Larvae a lesson!","content.76.6693":"Sweet! \\nWhich way is it?","content.76.6694":"Thanks Donalangelo! \\nI'll equip it right now and head into their camp.","content.76.6695":"Thanks for the info!","content.76.6730":"So, I fought this plant, and apparently it's not from around here, and Pappy Pal doesn't know where it's from... \\n*You tell the whole story, at length*","content.76.6731":"Do you have a little errand for me to run?","content.76.6732":"Do you have a little errand for me to run?","content.76.6733":"Do you have a little errand for me to run?","content.76.6734":"Here are all the different samples.","content.76.6735":"I got the 15 Archaeological Fragments for you.","content.76.6736":"I got the 3 Astrubian Artifacts for you.","content.76.6737":"You who know so much; could you recommend a book on Dragoturkeys for me?","content.76.6738":"I need some information.","content.76.6739":"Hey, my bag of books! You found it, thanks! As promised, here is the book your were searching for. I owe this much for finding the others.","content.76.6740":"Oh, nothing. I need to go and see Pappy Pal right away!","content.76.6741":"I'm off!","content.76.6743":"Do you know where I can find an artifact like my compass, but which will allow me to travel beyond the cliffs of Mount Zinit?!","content.76.6744":"I found it in the temple hidden in the sewers, the one that's guarded by members of Ogrest's Cult!","content.76.6749":"And where can I find what I need to get past the cliffs?","content.76.6750":"Only?","content.76.6751":"Those blasted Ogrest's Cult members...","content.76.6752":"... ?","content.76.6753":"Take a look at this old parchment!","content.76.6754":"Mammy?","content.76.6755":"Where does the Gemlin's name come from?","content.76.6756":"Uh... But no, nothing...","content.76.6757":"What a funny wedding present!","content.76.6758":"Mammy?","content.76.6759":"Mammy?","content.76.6760":"I would have rather had the Astrub Knight' mission!","content.76.6761":"I'm off right away!","content.76.6762":"As long as I don't have to fight any more rats!","content.76.6763":"Rats... ...Really...","content.76.6764":"Look carefully!","content.76.6765":"How are your ankles holding up? \\nDon't worry, I'll soon be better than you!","content.76.6766":"I hope so!","content.76.6767":"Yes, I'm interested!","content.76.6768":"What... Rats?","content.76.6769":"I'm off!","content.76.6770":"Yes, but still, rats...","content.76.6771":"Uh... I don't have a license for Astrub. Can I get one, please?","content.76.6772":"I don't see any available contracts at the Mercenary Post.","content.76.6773":"Could you explain to me how the Mercenary Post works?","content.76.6774":"No thank you, I have better things to do.","content.76.6775":"Very well! Here are the 10 Kamas.","content.76.6776":"Shoot! I don't have 10 Kamas...","content.76.6777":"Pff, don't feel like it right now.","content.76.6779":"Okay. Anyway, there is something else I want to ask you.","content.76.6780":"Ok, I'll come back later. Bye!","content.76.6781":"Very well, I have other questions...","content.76.6782":"Ok, I'll come back later. Bye!","content.76.6797":"Young'un?! Pappy Pal?! Son?!","content.76.6798":"That's interesting, but it doesn't really explain...","content.76.6799":"Woah! And?","content.76.6800":"That's crazy! \\nI have a better understanding now. I'm sorry I doubted you.","content.76.6802":"Erm... Kid, aren't you a little young to be watching over all these books all by yourself?","content.76.6807":"The display case still looks in a good state. I'll take it.","content.76.6812":"Yes, I'd like to become a Handyman.","content.76.6813":"Erm... No Thanks!","content.76.6814":"Just learning a profession will be enough!","content.76.6818":"... No, thanks!","content.76.6819":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6820":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6821":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6822":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6823":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6824":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6825":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6826":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6827":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6828":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6829":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6830":"I hear you have a little present for me.","content.76.6833":"Hello. I'm here to collect your contribution to Astrub's reconstruction.","content.76.6834":"Hello. I'm here to collect your contribution to Astrub's reconstruction.","content.76.6835":"Hello. I'm here to collect your contribution to Astru