I've come for my Leather Dealer's Seal.","content.76.7564":"I've come for my Jeweler's Seal.","content.76.7565":"I've come for my Tailor's Seal.","content.76.7566":"I've come for my Leather Dealer's Seal.","content.76.7581":"I'm going back to the Bermuda Triangle. See ya!","content.76.7584":"Oh, nothing.","content.76.7585":"I don't understand... Who are you? And where are we?","content.76.7587":"I'm going to have a lie down.","content.76.7588":"Very well, I'm ready!","content.76.7591":"The I.D.S. must have sufficient charge now, right?","content.76.7592":"Thanks, I'll set off right away!","content.76.7593":"I was just looking for you! The situation has changed... Pandora has disappeared. The Srambadians have got their hands on her.","content.76.7599":"I'll come back later.","content.76.7604":"Very well. I look forward to hearing your news. I can't wait to deal with Ogrest once my power has regenerated. Goodbye!","content.76.7605":"Wha... I opened the Box and... What happened...? You saw Xelor too? Where is the Box?","content.76.7607":"I don't see any available contracts at the Mercenary Post.","content.76.7608":"Could you explain to me how the Mercenary Post works?","content.76.7609":"No thank you, I have better things to do.","content.76.7610":"Very good! Here are the 310,000 Kamas.","content.76.7611":"Oh poo... I don't have 310,000 Kamas...","content.76.7612":"Pff, don't feel like it right now.","content.76.7613":"Okay. Anyway, there is something else I want to ask you.","content.76.7614":"Ok, I'll come back later. Bye!","content.76.7615":"Very well, I have some other questions...","content.76.7616":"Ok, I'll come back later. Bye!","content.76.7617":"Uh... I don't have a license for the Present Xelorium. Can I get one, please?","content.76.7618":"I don't see any available contracts at the Mercenary Post.","content.76.7619":"Could you explain to me how the Mercenary Post works?","content.76.7620":"No thank you, I have better things to do.","content.76.7621":"Very good! Here are the 320,000 Kamas.","content.76.7622":"Oh poo... I don't have 320,000 Kamas...","content.76.7623":"Pff, don't feel like it right now.","content.76.7624":"Okay. Anyway, there is something else I want to ask you.","content.76.7625":"Ok, I'll come back later. Bye!","content.76.7626":"Very well, I have some other questions...","content.76.7627":"Ok, I'll come back later. Bye!","content.76.7628":"What do you mean when? But... Anyway, Pandora is already here with us, so you can't be her!","content.76.7629":"Hang on, where are we? And when?","content.76.7630":"I'm lost...","content.76.7633":"I have a few questions to ask you.","content.76.7634":"What's your role in this story? What were you doing there?","content.76.7635":"Why are you the only ones?","content.76.7636":"You're not a bit mad, by any chance, are you? Ok, I have some other questions.","content.76.7638":"Oh, nothing.","content.76.7639":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Xelots.","content.76.7640":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Xelots.","content.76.7641":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Xelots.","content.76.7642":"Here are your Antique Fragments!","content.76.7643":"Here are your Regulated Seeds!","content.76.7644":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.7645":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.7646":"I should be able to find a few more Antique Fragments for you","content.76.7647":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.7648":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Antique Fragments for you!","content.76.7649":"For now, I'm going to go find you some Regulated Seeds!","content.76.7650":"Take care of Vertox the Timeless? It's as good as done!","content.76.7651":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Antique Fragments for you!","content.76.7652":"For now, I'm going to go find you some Unregulated Seeds!","content.76.7653":"Take care of Robowl the Outcast? It's as good as done!","content.76.7654":"I should be able to find a few more Meshed Feathers for you","content.76.7655":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.7656":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.7657":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Hulors","content.76.7658":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Hulors","content.76.7659":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Hulors","content.76.7660":"Here are your Meshed Feathers!","content.76.7661":"Here are your Unregulated Seeds!","content.76.7662":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.7663":"But what?","content.76.7664":"Let's go!","content.76.7666":"Erhhh... I need to recount my kamas. See ya!","content.76.7667":"I don't need anything at the moment. See you later!","content.76.7669":"We know each other now; you can skip the formalities.","content.76.7670":"Why is it called \"Kabrok's Shop\" and not \"Miranda's Shop\"?","content.76.7671":"Hello! I'm looking for a Shushu map called Grav'Mar'Av'.","content.76.7672":"Hi! What are you selling here?","content.76.7673":"Why is it called \"Kabrok's Shop\" and not \"Miranda's Shop\"?","content.76.7674":"I have some other things to ask you...","content.76.7675":"Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.7676":"I have some other things to ask you...","content.76.7677":"Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.7678":"You speak like an old Enutrof. Strange for an Ecaflip...","content.76.7679":"I have some other things to ask you...","content.76.7680":"Uh... Okay then. Bye!","content.76.7681":"Kelba port?! But it's not that far...","content.76.7682":"And what's my part in all this?","content.76.7683":"Ok, what's the plan?","content.76.7684":"Hadibal, the port! Delivery! Ok, that works, a mere stroll in the park! Let's go!","content.76.7685":"What's in this package anyway?","content.76.7686":"Woah! Calm down, little lady. No need to get your back up.","content.76.7687":"Hello, I'm looking for a specific map and I'm told you're the man to ask.","content.76.7688":"Ok, fine. I'll take care of things myself.","content.76.7690":"South, then west as soon as possible. Thanks a lot!","content.76.7692":"Hey! What are you selling here?","content.76.7694":"Forget it; perhaps I'll come back later.","content.76.7696":"Yeah, maybe later. See you soon.","content.76.7697":"I'd like to ask you something else.","content.76.7698":"Hello, Miranda sent me. It's about the \"package\".","content.76.7699":"I'm all ears.","content.76.7700":"Ok, the convoy with the package at the port, and...","content.76.7701":"At the port, at sunrise. See you later.","content.76.7702":"What's with the Riktus bandits?!","content.76.7703":"Forget it; perhaps I'll come back later.","content.76.7704":"Bandits. For the good of the market?! You thought I was a Iop?","content.76.7706":"Bandits. For the good of the market?! Ok, I'm a Iop, but that's pushing it!","content.76.7707":"So, you're the one who organized the attack?","content.76.7709":"And what's the Black Crow got to do with all this?","content.76.7711":"What? \"Unless...\" what?!","content.76.7713":"Along the cliffs to the west? I've got you, Black Crow!","content.76.7715":"Mr. Toot, we need to talk about the convoy... And the Riktus.","content.76.7716":"As it happens... We have proof and...","content.76.7717":"Forget it, perhaps I'll come back later.","content.76.7718":"As it happens... actually no, I don't have anything to implicate you at the moment. Sorry for the hassle.","content.76.7719":"Forget it; perhaps I'll come back later. Sorry again.","content.76.7720":"What's going on? Worried about your precious reputation?","content.76.7721":"Ok, I will give you a chance. But you would do well to get there swiftly. Otherwise, I will find you and it won't be pretty.","content.76.7722":"Pis... ass... Dis... ast... Disaster! Is Miranda here?","content.76.7725":"I don't need anything at the moment. See you later!","content.76.7726":"The convoy...  The Riktus...  BIF!  And then, these things...  BAM! And then...  POW!  The Black Crow...  merchandise, all gone!","content.76.7728":"We still haven't found any clues...","content.76.7729":"But... What about my reward and my reputation? I MUST find the merchandise and the Black Crow.","content.76.7731":"NEVER! I will find the package, with or without your help.","content.76.7733":"Hadibal? Hmmm... That would be strange, but certainly possible... I will search the area where the attack took place, maybe I'll find something that would incriminate him.","content.76.7734":"I'm on my way. I'll update you later.","content.76.7735":"Ok... I'll be back.","content.76.7736":"I found a clue where the first attack took place and it incriminates Hadibal!","content.76.7737":"Ok... I'll be back.","content.76.7738":"I spoke to Hadibal, but he claims to be innocent. I need to grill him again, in private.","content.76.7739":"I'm always ready, seriously! ","content.76.7743":"So, you're the Black Crow!","content.76.7744":"The Black Crow... Really... I need to think about this. I'll be back.","content.76.7745":"Ok, remind me where we're supposed to be meeting?","content.76.7747":"What does Miranda want with the contents of this package?","content.76.7748":"Tell me, why did you steal Miranda's package?","content.76.7749":"Have you always been the Black Crow?","content.76.7750":"So Miranda is your sidekick? Like... you're Kabman and she's Crobin? And you have a secret Kabcave, is that it?","content.76.7751":"Hmm... Not too sure what to make of this. See you later.","content.76.7752":"Sounds tough. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.7753":"And... if I were to tell her...?","content.76.7754":"Ok. I'll be back.","content.76.7755":"A reward for not fighting? Not really worthy of an adventurer, but I won't turn my nose up at a little bonus.","content.76.7756":"Ok. I'll be back.","content.76.7757":"Ok. I have some other things to ask you.","content.76.7758":"Ok. I'll be back.","content.76.7759":"Wha... What?! The Black Crow was robbed? In HIS lair?","content.76.7760":"Hmm... Not too sure what to make of this. See you later.","content.76.7761":"What do you mean? You think it was...","content.76.7762":"Hmm... Not too sure what to make of this. See you later.","content.76.7763":"Indeed, what were you thinking of?","content.76.7764":"... Arachnee-men?","content.76.7765":"... acrobatic monkeys?","content.76.7766":"... Rogues with suckers?","content.76.7767":"... extra-Twelvian creatures from another planet?","content.76.7769":"... flying Srams?","content.76.7770":"... Ghostof Riktus?","content.76.7771":"I... It's crazy, but actually I don't feel very different... *You describe your vision with Xelor after opening the box*","content.76.7772":"Not necessarily lost, just not absorbed. But at least I'm not dead. That's a good thing, right?","content.76.7773":"What? What? What's going on?","content.76.7774":"That's great! So we'll be able to retrieve them! Where are they?","content.76.7775":"Nest? Stop it with the suspense. I want to know!","content.76.7776":"Nest? Stop it with the suspense. I want to know!","content.76.7777":"Pfft! How is it you know them and I don't?","content.76.7778":"Smart scavengers? Like intelligent Albatrocious?","content.76.7779":"Whatever. It's great, all this socio-psycho-theological talk, but it won't help me track down the shipment...","content.76.7780":"Woah! Wait... While I was escorting the convoy... The second attack... Bird-men!","content.76.7781":"Alright, come on, eh... Let's skip the details. Get right to the point, please.","content.76.7782":"What now? I have to wear red socks with yellow polka dots and bring a offering of pure ogrines on a crefish beard-hair mat?","content.76.7783":"Oh... How will I manage then?","content.76.7784":"Perfect! I'm off then! Thanks a lot.","content.76.7785":"Look, let me go to Amakna.","content.76.7786":"Look, let me go to Kelba","content.76.7787":"No thank you!","content.76.7788":"Uh... I don't have a license for Kelba. Can I get one, please?","content.76.7790":"I don't see any available contracts at the Mercenary Post.","content.76.7791":"Could you explain to me how the Mercenary Post works?","content.76.7792":"No thank you, I have better things to do.","content.76.7793":"Very good! Here are the 1000 Kamas.","content.76.7794":"Oh poo... I don't have 1000 kamas...","content.76.7795":"Pff, don't feel like it right now.","content.76.7796":"Very good! Here are the 1000 Kamas.","content.76.7797":"Oh poo... I don't have 1000 kamas...","content.76.7798":"Pff, don't feel like it right now.","content.76.7799":"Okay. Anyway, there is something else I want to ask you.","content.76.7800":"Ok, I'll come back later. Bye!","content.76.7801":"Very well, I have some other questions...","content.76.7802":"Ok, I'll come back later. Bye!","content.76.7804":"Where can I find the feathery one? I mean... the other one, the Raskaw.","content.76.7805":"Hello. Me friend. Me want information. Where are thieving Raskaws stole from Black Crow?","content.76.7806":"Kawwww koaw to you too, old man. I've completed my end of the deal. Now give me the information I need.","content.76.7807":"The wind is picking up. Bye!","content.76.7808":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Raskaws.","content.76.7809":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Raskaws.","content.76.7810":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Raskaws.","content.76.7811":"Here are your Raskaw Talons!","content.76.7812":"Here are your Raskaw Seeds!","content.76.7813":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.7814":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it.","content.76.7815":"I should be able to find a few more Talons for you.","content.76.7816":"Seeds? Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.7817":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Talons for you.","content.76.7818":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Raskaw Seeds for you.","content.76.7819":"Deal with the Grand Orrok? Consider it done.","content.76.7821":"Uh... Forget it. Bye!","content.76.7822":"The Guild of Mercenaries sent me to give you this.","content.76.7823":"The Guild of Mercenaries sent me to give you this","content.76.7827":"The Mercenaries' Guild finds your prices a bit too high. I'm here to help you lower them! (Start a fight)","content.76.7828":"Ok, I'll see what I can do.","content.76.7833":"Who or what are these Raskaws?","content.76.7834":"Have you known these bird-men for a long time?","content.76.7835":"Nothing actually. Bye!","content.76.7836":"We're not going to play at Bow Meow and mouse for a couple of hours. When I've finished with you, you'll look like something the Bow Meow dragged in, Ecaflip. En garde! (Start a fight)","content.76.7837":"I have other Bow Meow Fish to fry. See you later!","content.76.7838":"Hello, I'm looking for \"Kabrok's Shop\"; I have...","content.76.7839":"I'm looking for a Shushu map that can show me the way to anywhere in the World of Twelve...","content.76.7840":"I'm looking for a specific map and I'm told you're the man to ask.","content.76.7841":"It's that special? Where are you going to send me?","content.76.7842":"Oh poo... I don't have 30 kamas...","content.76.7843":"Very well, I'll bring you your package and you'll give me the map.","content.76.7844":"Uh... What's a \"Shushu\"?","content.76.7845":"Well, sounds like it's a really cool object. Bye!","content.76.7846":"Cool! I have some other things to ask you...","content.76.7847":"I have some other things to ask you...","content.76.7848":"Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.7854":"(Leave)","content.76.7857":"Ok. I have some other things to ask you.","content.76.7858":"And if I were to tell her...?","content.76.7859":"I have some other things to ask you...","content.76.7860":"Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.7861":"That remains to be seen. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.7862":"Whatever. I'll be back.","content.76.7863":"That remains to be seen. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.7864":"Whatever. I'll be back.","content.76.7865":"I see. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.7866":"Okay. See you later.","content.76.7867":"I've come to help. What do you need?","content.76.7868":"Alright, I'll go right away!","content.76.7870":"I would like to procure a Riktus Clan harness for my Petsmounts.","content.76.7871":"I agree to pay 2,000 kamas!","content.76.7872":"2,000 kamas! That's too much...","content.76.7873":"Actually, I've changed my mind.","content.76.7875":"How?","content.76.7876":"Smart scavengers? Like intelligent Albatrocious?","content.76.7878":"I think so, but maybe not... There's something else I want to ask you.","content.76.7879":"Uhhh... Bye!","content.76.7882":"What's the problem between you and the Black Crow?","content.76.7883":"You don't look too good. Have you been ripped off?","content.76.7885":"Erm... Yes, of course, I understand. My sincere apologies. How can I be of service to y... Pfffft! That's heavy. What do you want, old man?","content.76.7886":"And I suppose you want me to get these items back for you, am I right?","content.76.7887":"Three crates for our unfeathered friend, let's go!","content.76.7888":"Uh... Yeah, hello. What do I have to do again?","content.76.7889":"Three crates for our unfeathered friend, let's go!","content.76.7890":"But, who are you?","content.76.7891":"A warehouse, in a village full of Raskaws? Seems risky to me...","content.76.7892":"Wha... What?! The Black Crow was robbed? In HIS lair?","content.76.7893":"Hmm... Not too sure what to make of this. See you later.","content.76.7894":"A hidden door round the side of the warehouse. Thanks my friend! Seeya!","content.76.7895":"Whoa, sorry to rub salt into that old festering wound. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.7896":"Whoa, sorry to rub salt into that old festering wound. Bye.","content.76.7897":"Oh really? Is there no way you can tell me more? I'm really interested...","content.76.7898":"I see, tribal law and all that. Bye!","content.76.7899":"Hit the big bad, that works... Grand Orrok, I'm coming for you!","content.76.7900":"I see, tribal law and all that. Bye!","content.76.7901":"All done! But you never told me that the Grand Orrok was a woman...","content.76.7902":"Ok, go ahead, tell me everything!","content.76.7903":"Maybe later. I want to ask you something else.","content.76.7904":"I'm done for now. Bye!","content.76.7905":"Maybe later. I want to ask you something else.","content.76.7906":"Well, I have to say you speak Twelvian really well. Where did you learn it?","content.76.7907":"Really? But not you?","content.76.7910":"Ok, so you have your own language. Then what?","content.76.7912":"That story was beautiful and sad at the same time. I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.7913":"Hmmm. Bye.","content.76.7915":"The Guild of Mercenaries sent me to give you this.","content.76.7916":"No, thank you.","content.76.7918":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Zoogeymen.","content.76.7919":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Zoogeymen.","content.76.7920":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Zoogeymen.","content.76.7921":"Here are your Putribits!","content.76.7922":"Here are your Mortified Essences!","content.76.7923":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Putribits for you!","content.76.7924":"For now, I'm going to go and find some more Mortified Essences for you!","content.76.7925":"It will not be spared!","content.76.7926":"I should be able to find a few more Putribits for you. ","content.76.7927":"Mortified Essences! Piece of cake. I'll be right back with as many as you need.","content.76.7928":"Piece of cake! I'll get right on it!","content.76.7929":"Uh... I don't have a license for Forfut. Can I get one, please?","content.76.7931":"I don't see any available contracts at the Mercenary Post.","content.76.7932":"Could you explain to me how the Mercenary Post works?","content.76.7933":"No thank you, I have better things to do.","content.76.7934":"Very well, I have some other questions...","content.76.7935":"Ok, I'll come back later. Bye!","content.76.7936":"Very good! Here are the 1000 Kamas.","content.76.7937":"Oh poo... I don't have 1000 kamas...","content.76.7938":"Pff, don't feel like it right now.","content.76.7939":"Very good! Here are the 1000 Kamas.","content.76.7940":"Oh poo... I don't have 1000 kamas...","content.76.7941":"Pff, don't feel like it right now.","content.76.7942":"Okay. Anyway, there is something else I want to ask you.","content.76.7943":"Ok, I understand better!","content.76.7944":"Oh yes! They won't soon come back wreaking havoc in Astrub!","content.76.7945":"It seems you have a gift for me.","content.76.7946":"By the way, I met a certain Ullu, who told me I was{[1*]?:} the hero{[1*]?:} of a prophecy?!","content.76.7947":"He asked me to join him immediately on Mount Zinit?!","content.76.7948":"I'm going to find Master Bossowl. Thanks, Pappy!","content.76.7949":"Thanks, Pappy! Quickly!","content.76.7954":"I'm ready! Let's go to Mount Zinit!","content.76.7955":"I'll be back as soon as I'm ready!","content.76.7956":"Yes, let's go to Mount Zinit!","content.76.7957":"No, not today. Next time!","content.76.7973":"I'm too scared to go further. Take me to Astrub please!","content.76.7974":"No problem. I'm on it!","content.76.7990":"I like what I hear - you're one hull of a guy!","content.76.7991":"I like what I hear - you're one hull of a guy!","content.76.7992":"Goodbye!","content.76.7993":"Pappy, do you know where I can find information about the Artifacts?","content.76.7994":"There's nothing left but to go to the Temple of Scriptures. Thank you Pappy!","content.76.8002":"No, no! Don't worry about me! Bye!","content.76.8003":"It's nothing. I'm leaving!","content.76.8007":"Let's go do some archaosology!","content.76.8008":"Laura Craft sent me to see you! You would be in possession of a spherical antique...","content.76.8009":"Oh! Well, since you mention it! \\nBut I don't want to take advantage. Good day!","content.76.8010":"I'm looking for an artifact; I got this from Jenry Hones Sr.","content.76.8011":"And the artifact is there?","content.76.8012":"I'll get back to work immediately!","content.76.8013":"I've finished what you asked me to do at the archaosological site, without too much damage!","content.76.8014":"And what are they?","content.76.8015":"So the artifact must be linked to the temple! I must go and get a closer look at this temple!","content.76.8016":"How am I going to do it?","content.76.8017":"What are we waiting for?!","content.76.8018":"I'm looking for an artifact; I got this from Jenry Hones Sr.","content.76.8019":"I'll get back to work immediately!","content.76.8020":"I've finished what you asked me to do at the archaeologic site, without too much damage!","content.76.8021":"And the artifact is there?","content.76.8022":"So the artifact must be linked to the temple! I must go and get a closer look at this temple!","content.76.8023":"How am I going to do it?","content.76.8024":"What are we waiting for?!","content.76.8025":"I'm looking for an artifact; I got this from Jenry Hones Sr.","content.76.8026":"I'll get back to work immediately!","content.76.8027":"I've finished what you asked me to do at the archaeologic site, without too much damage!","content.76.8028":"It's nothing. I'm leaving!","content.76.8029":"And the artifact is there?","content.76.8030":"So the artifact must be linked to the temple! I must go and get a closer look at this temple!","content.76.8031":"How am I going to do it?","content.76.8032":"What are we waiting for?!","content.76.8033":"I'm looking for an artifact; I got this from Jenry Hones Sr.","content.76.8034":"I'll get back to work immediately!","content.76.8035":"I've finished what you asked me to do at the archaeologic site, without too much damage!","content.76.8036":"It's nothing. I'm leaving!","content.76.8037":"And the artifact is there?","content.76.8038":"So the artifact must be linked to the temple! I must go and get a closer look at this temple!","content.76.8039":"How am I going to do it?","content.76.8040":"What are we waiting for?!","content.76.8041":"I'm looking for an artifact; I got this from Jenry Hones Sr.","content.76.8042":"I'll get back to work immediately!","content.76.8043":"I've finished what you asked me to do at the archaeologic site, without too much damage!","content.76.8044":"It's nothing. I'm leaving!","content.76.8045":"And the artifact is there?","content.76.8046":"So the artifact must be linked to the temple! I must go and get a closer look at this temple!","content.76.8047":"How am I going to do it?","content.76.8048":"What are we waiting for?!","content.76.8049":"I won't bother you much longer!","content.76.8050":"Anyway, I don't like repressed people!","content.76.8051":"So, can I claim the title of Honorary Archaosologist of Amakna?","content.76.8052":"Now let's go! No time to lose!","content.76.8053":"Thanks a lot! I won't hesitate!","content.76.8054":"Oh ok, I won't bother you much longer!","content.76.8055":"And I don't want to have to deal with a third zone of your kind!","content.76.8056":"... Ah Bontarians, I swear!","content.76.8057":"... Ah these Brakmarians, no idea how to live!","content.76.8058":"As heartless as ever, I can assure you!","content.76.8059":"... Grrrr! ","content.76.8060":"I'll be as invisible as I can be!","content.76.8061":"I'm completely petrified with fear!","content.76.8062":"I better get out of here quick!","content.76.8063":"Don't you have some flowers to go with your message?!","content.76.8064":"Ok, later.","content.76.8065":"I'll have to get my swimming certification then.","content.76.8066":"You seem to have hesitated when Mademoiselle Craft mentioned the Orichalcums...","content.76.8067":"Alright! See you later, maybe.","content.76.8068":"What?! But! Where is it? Show it!","content.76.8069":"... ... ...","content.76.8070":"I'm having a bit of difficulty projecting myself into the past there...","content.76.8071":"Where can I find this Magnum Bairefute?","content.76.8072":"Let's go find Magnum Bairefute in the Amakna Capital!","content.76.8073":"That works perfectly! Good luck and see you soon!","content.76.8074":"Yes. It resembles the description they gave me of the Orichalcums that will let me open the door in Sufokia.","content.76.8075":"Surely... What do I have to do?","content.76.8077":"No, autographs don't interest me! Bye!","content.76.8078":"I'll be back in two shakes!","content.76.8079":"I have missions to accomplish! Seeya!","content.76.8080":"I've finished all the missions you've given me! There were larvae possessed by...","content.76.8081":"It's as good as done! Off for the old sheep pen!","content.76.8082":"Let's go find these wool-eaters in the old sheep pen! I'll be back.","content.76.8083":"I've eradicated the Mad Larvae, but they were commanded by a Weakened Spectral Arachnee, and...","content.76.8084":"What is this important mission?","content.76.8085":"Uh... OK, I'll go get you that rockwool!","content.76.8086":"It wasn't easy, but here's the Rockwool, freshly shorn from Bovis!","content.76.8087":"I'll take great care of your good luck charm!","content.76.8088":"I think I found an Orichalcum, but I'm not sure{[1*]?:}!","content.76.8089":"A little visit to Jenry Hones Sr. at the Temple of Scriptures in Astrub would seem to be in order.\\nSeeya!","content.76.8090":"I think I found an Orichalcum, but I'm not sure!","content.76.8091":"I think I found an Orichalcum, but I'm not sure!","content.76.8092":"I think I found an Orichalcum, but I'm not sure!","content.76.8093":"I think I found an Orichalcum, but I'm not sure!","content.76.8094":"I think I've gotten my hand on one of the Orichalcums we're looking for with the national archaosologists, but only you can verify its authenticity.","content.76.8098":"... So?","content.76.8102":"Hmmm?! What \"Hmmm...\" ?","content.76.8103":"Fantastic! Only two more to find! Thanks and see you!","content.76.8104":"Yeah! (Start the fight)","content.76.8105":"No thanks. I'm not ready.","content.76.8106":"I'd like to go to the archaosological site of Oktapodas's Sunken Temple in Sufokia...","content.76.8107":"Let's go!","content.76.8109":"Uh... Hang on, I have something to show you first. Bye!","content.76.8110":"I'd like to go to the archaeological site of Oktapodas's Sunken Temple in Sufokia...","content.76.8111":"I'd like to go to the archaeological site of Oktapodas's Sunken Temple in Sufokia...","content.76.8112":"I'd like to go to the archaeological site of Oktapodas's Sunken Temple in Sufokia...","content.76.8113":"I'd like to go to the archaeological site of Oktapodas's Sunken Temple in Sufokia...","content.76.8114":"So can I claim the title of Honorary Archaeologist of Bonta?","content.76.8116":"So can I claim the title of Honorary Archaeologist of Brakmar?","content.76.8117":"So can I claim the title of Honorary Archaeologist of the Riktus Clan?","content.76.8118":"So can I claim the title of Honorary Archaeologist of Sufokia?","content.76.8119":"Blasted crook. Hurry and find your \"client\". I'll speak to Laura Craft while waiting.","content.76.8120":"It seems you have a gift for me.","content.76.8121":"I was just looking to see if your purse had grown as much as your beard had. Bye!","content.76.8122":"Very good!","content.76.8123":"Me pay? Are you crazy?","content.76.8125":"I prefer watching others break their heads. Haha.","content.76.8129":"I'd like to take care of the Tropikoko Seeds.","content.76.8130":"I'd like to take care of the Kanniball Seeds.","content.76.8131":"I'd like to take care of the Kanniball Staffs.","content.76.8134":"Here are your 10 Tropikoko Seeds.","content.76.8135":"Here are your 10 Tropikoko Barks.","content.76.8136":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.8137":"I'd like to take care of the Tropikoko Barks.","content.76.8138":"Here are your 10 Kanniball Seeds.","content.76.8139":"Here are your 10 Kanniball Staffs.","content.76.8140":"I'd like to take care of the Tropickle Dungeon.","content.76.8141":"I'd like to take care of the Kanniball Dungeon.","content.76.8142":"Ouk?","content.76.8143":"???","content.76.8144":"Oh, the cute little monkey!","content.76.8145":"All right... But, who are you?","content.76.8146":"I would just like to know more about the village!","content.76.8147":"Danger, that's what I am! So, what's this island hiding?","content.76.8148":"Thanks for the advice! See you soon!","content.76.8149":"I still have questions.","content.76.8150":"Thanks for the info. See you soon!","content.76.8151":"I still have questions.","content.76.8152":"Thanks for the info. See you soon!","content.76.8153":"Let's talk about something else...","content.76.8154":"Thanks for the info. See you soon!","content.76.8155":"What? There's hidden treasure, that it?","content.76.8156":"That Koko the Nutt, I made him spit up all of his milk! So where are these treasures?","content.76.8157":"Who is this Moon? A god? I'd like to see how long he can hold out against a great [#breedName] like me!","content.76.8158":"I swallowed Darkli Moon whole. So, where's the \"big\" Moon hiding?","content.76.8159":"I still have questions.","content.76.8160":"I'm a bit disappointed, but I'll be back. See you soon!","content.76.8161":"I still have questions.","content.76.8162":"Thanks for the info. See you soon!","content.76.8163":"I still have questions.","content.76.8164":"Nothing easier. See you soon!","content.76.8165":"I still have questions.","content.76.8166":"Thanks for the info. See you soon!","content.76.8169":"I've put away all the crates. Now tell me more!","content.76.8170":"I'm in second year now; teach me magic!","content.76.8171":"Really? What's going on? Tell me everything!","content.76.8172":"It's as good as done!","content.76.8175":"I'll pass!","content.76.8177":"Hello, I'd like to enroll in the school.","content.76.8179":"Oh, nothing.","content.76.8180":"Nothing could be easier! Consider it done.","content.76.8181":"Actually, I'm not that bothered...","content.76.8182":"I've brought everything you asked me for.","content.76.8184":"Hello! How can I help you?","content.76.8186":"I passed the test! I have breathtaking stamina. What's next?","content.76.8187":"I overcame the Carnivorous Plant without losing so much as a limb!","content.76.8189":"Nothing right now.{[1*]?: (You wink)*}","content.76.8197":"Why do the plants react like that?","content.76.8198":"I'm up for it!{[1*]?:} (Start a fight)","content.76.8200":"Hmm... Seems risky to me... I'm going to wait a while.","content.76.8201":"That's heavy! Thanks for the info.","content.76.8202":"Off I go!","content.76.8203":"Errr ok... Thanks?","content.76.8207":"While I was sleeping peacefully, I was attacked by masked men! Are they crazy around here or what?","content.76.8208":"I beat them, of course.","content.76.8209":"I got a spanking, but I'll get them another night.","content.76.8210":"Oh, okay. I won't bother you any longer.","content.76.8211":"Thanks, I won't bother you any longer.","content.76.8212":"It's as good as done!","content.76.8213":"I got attacked by intruders last night. For the love of Tofus, is it even possible to have a quiet night in this school?!","content.76.8214":"Would you believe it... I've brought back all the flax flowers!","content.76.8215":"Thanks for your concern!","content.76.8216":"I'm here to pick up my 1st Year Certificate!","content.76.8217":"Thanks a lot!","content.76.8218":"I'm not afraid. I'll make it my business; tell me everything!","content.76.8220":"I'll follow your advice. But may I help you in any way?","content.76.8221":"Let's go! I'll be as stealthy as a shadow...","content.76.8222":"I'd like to try the Fiftinepuzle again. (Start a fight)","content.76.8226":"I'm just taking a stroll, it's lovely around here!","content.76.8228":"Hu-Sed-Tusei-Bald said I should come and see you. He said you're the master of equipment, and I want to get equipped to defend myself.","content.76.8229":"I've brought all the resources required!","content.76.8231":"What's the symbol on the floor in the middle of the room?","content.76.8233":"I recreated the diagram of my sword! What now?","content.76.8237":"Resources? Which ones?","content.76.8238":"I'm going to wait a while, I'm not ready yet.","content.76.8239":"I'll fetch it all!","content.76.8240":"Ok, let's go! (Start a fight)","content.76.8241":"I don't feel ready yet. I'll come back later.","content.76.8243":"Oooh... What a beautiful sword! Thank you.","content.76.8244":"So that's the symbol on the floor in the middle of the room?","content.76.8245":"It seems you've tracked down a second Orichalcum?","content.76.8246":"I'd like to go to the Immaterial University of Bonta, please.","content.76.8248":"Uh... Oh, nothing. I must have turned left as opposed to right, at some point. \\nBye!","content.76.8253":"Err... where is your university? I hope it's not that little shack!","content.76.8254":"Perry Mage? Well, you had me there! I'll talk to you again as soon as I'm ready.","content.76.8255":"Alrighty! Let's go!","content.76.8256":"Hmmm... I'm sure I've forgotten something. Bye!","content.76.8257":"So, how are we going to find the second Orichalcum in this University?","content.76.8258":"There's the Spherolithic Encyclopedia! Okay, can we go now?","content.76.8259":"There's the Abacus Compendium! What now?","content.76.8260":"You told me about Perry Mage earlier. Who is he?","content.76.8261":"Jenry! It's awful! Members of Ogrest's Cult attacked the University and stole the Gobbowlium Codex!","content.76.8262":"Uh... yeah yeah. It's break time, so I'm outta here! Bye!","content.76.8263":"What do I have to do again? I'm having a memory lapse.","content.76.8264":"Uh... Could you refresh my memory and tell me what the next step is?","content.76.8265":"But how did he accomplish this feat?!","content.76.8267":"{[1*]?:You're very charming today! }I'm short of ideas. You wouldn't happen to know of a way to breathe underwater, by any chance?","content.76.8268":"... Errr... I just wanted to know how to get the Branchy-Flower, actually.","content.76.8269":"Okay, I've got it! I'll fetch them right away!","content.76.8270":"I've brought you the resources to make the Branchy-Flower!","content.76.8271":"Exploring the depths, we're on!","content.76.8273":"No! But I did go to the Flooded Room.","content.76.8274":"The chest was empty, Hu-Sed-Tusei-Bald...","content.76.8275":"I'll get to it!","content.76.8277":"I won't bother you any longer.","content.76.8278":"Ah, well... In that case, I won't bother you.","content.76.8279":"Oh? What is it? A giant drill? An old and rare metal detector? A ball of Stasili?","content.76.8280":"In the Library? What, you mean by reading books?","content.76.8281":"A Spherolithic Enclyclopedia, just one! Let's go!","content.76.8282":"What is it? So, do we know where the Orichalcum is?","content.76.8283":"I see... I'm going to have to go back to the library, aren't I?","content.76.8284":"What are you implying? We're going to steal the book in the middle of a lesson?","content.76.8285":"I get the idea. But if it's one of the professors who offers me the book... Let's go!","content.76.8286":"Well, I'm having trouble putting the pieces together. Where are we again?","content.76.8287":"So? Well? And the Orichalcum?","content.76.8288":"Really? Am I going to have to win the Gobbowl Championship to get the cup? A bit of action, at last!","content.76.8289":"Don't tell me... Another book?","content.76.8290":"All of them? That must be one hell of a Gobbowlium Codex! Next stop, the library!","content.76.8291":"Sorry, it burned down. How are we going to find the Orichalcum without the book?","content.76.8292":"Why copies? And how does that help us?","content.76.8293":"What? Some action, at last! Where are we going?","content.76.8294":"Second on the right, aquatic portal, got it! See you in a moment!","content.76.8295":"I'm not interested.","content.76.8296":"Tell me more!","content.76.8297":"I'm ready, let's go!","content.76.8298":"Thanks for the info!","content.76.8300":"What's that got to do with the University?","content.76.8301":"Okay, so Huppermage is the right word. Thank you.","content.76.8302":"If there's a way of beating books rather than reading them, I'm game. So what should we do now?","content.76.8303":"We've got to track down a Gobbowl Cup. But where could it be?","content.76.8305":"Don't go anywhere, I've got something I need to do. I'll be back shortly. See ya!","content.76.8306":"Okay! Direction: The Library in the underground ruins of Old Bonta!","content.76.8309":"I'm ready, take me back to Astrub!","content.76.8310":"Not now, thanks.","content.76.8311":"How can that help us find the cup?","content.76.8312":"No worries, let's go and raid a tomb!","content.76.8313":"Why have these ruins never been brought to the surface?","content.76.8314":"Has no one ever explored these ruins?","content.76.8315":"Is there still any treasure around here?","content.76.8316":"Wind Room (1)","content.76.8317":"Water Room (2)","content.76.8318":"Rock Room (3)","content.76.8319":"Hell Room (4)","content.76.8320":"I found the Zeppelantern, but I didn't find out anything about their plans. I think Hoodfella was only one of our enemies' many henchmen long ago. Now they work separately.","content.76.8321":"What's your theory?","content.76.8322":"I'm listening!","content.76.8323":"But who could it be?","content.76.8324":"Very well. I'll try and find out what's going on.","content.76.8325":"Thanks a lot!","content.76.8326":"Thank you, miss! I can already feel maturity taking shape within me. While I wait for your invite, please take my warm regards.","content.76.8327":"I'm here to pick up my 2nd Year Certificate!","content.76.8328":"I'm here to pick up my 3rd Year Certificate!","content.76.8329":"I got attacked in the Store Room! It's becoming commonplace around here...","content.76.8330":"But... I was very careful, there was nobody there. They can't humanly have gotten there that fast.","content.76.8331":"No actually, I was very careful: there was no one anywhere to be seen.","content.76.8332":"They were wearing long tunics which covered their clothes and hid their faces... What's more, they called themselves Hoodlums when they were talking about themselves and their leader... Which fits well with what I saw.","content.76.8333":"That's child's play for an apprentice like me!","content.76.8334":"okay. I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8335":"Very well. Thank you. Bye!","content.76.8336":"Okay. I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8337":"Okay, thanks. Bye!","content.76.8338":"Okay. I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8339":"Okay, thanks. Bye!","content.76.8341":"I'd like to ask you a few questions about your status as a \"Goddess\"...","content.76.8342":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8345":"I'd like to know more about the Huppermagic School.","content.76.8346":"Thanks! I won't bother you any longer.","content.76.8347":"Thanks! I won't bother you any longer.","content.76.8348":"Thanks! I won't bother you any longer.","content.76.8349":"The downfall? So it's true that the island used to fly?","content.76.8350":"But... It fell all the same...","content.76.8351":"Thanks! I won't bother you any longer.","content.76.8352":"How did the island fly?","content.76.8353":"How did the island fly?","content.76.8354":"Really?","content.76.8355":"I'll get to it!","content.76.8356":"I'd like to know more about the Huppermagic School.","content.76.8357":"Oh, nothing.","content.76.8358":"But... Rok Island ended up falling...","content.76.8359":"Hello, I'd like to try catching a seed again.","content.76.8360":"It's me again! Let's talk about what happened last night.","content.76.8361":"{[1*]?:Radiant, as always! }I've come to talk to you about the aquatic diving.","content.76.8365":"What do we do now?","content.76.8367":"I've got little personal questions regarding you, Mimi...","content.76.8368":"I'm ready; take me back to the entrance of the Immaterial University of Bonta!","content.76.8369":"I'd like to go to the Immaterial University of Bonta, please.","content.76.8370":"Too bad. Well next time, I'll take the walkway from Astrub to get to the IUB or the Huppermage School.","content.76.8371":"I'll improve.","content.76.8372":"The equi-what?","content.76.8373":"I think I'm in perfect equilibrium!","content.76.8374":"All right...","content.76.8375":"Okaaay...","content.76.8376":"If I told you that I'm not balanced when I am, I wouldn't be balanced. If I told you that I'm balanced when I am not, I wouldn't be balanced either. If I told you that I'm not balanced when I am not, I still wouldn't be balanced. On the other hand, if I tell you that I'm perfectly balanced and that I am, it means I am balanced and that you must believe me.","content.76.8377":"Let's try anyway.","content.76.8378":"At least I'll have tried!","content.76.8379":"...","content.76.8380":"All of that's too philosophical for me.","content.76.8381":"Everything's relative. Perfect balance doesn't exist, I can't maintain that it does. Well, I'm as balanced as possible.","content.76.8382":"Indeed, I am not perfectly balanced. And neither are you. There's a good reason for that. We strive for balance, but a perfect balance does not exist: it's an ideal beyond our reach.","content.76.8383":"Imperfection is the beauty of the soul. My madness is my genius.","content.76.8384":"That seems a bit of an easy answer to me...","content.76.8385":"Okay, I'll get to it!","content.76.8386":"Okay, I'll get to it!","content.76.8388":"What's your full name, anyway?","content.76.8389":"I see you've learnt some new tricks since Bovis's Lair...","content.76.8393":"What's this new outfit? Jemmy and Janes looked like they knew it...","content.76.8394":"But... Where's Bovis?","content.76.8395":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8399":"Why are the members of Ogrest's Cult hunting you down?","content.76.8400":"You say you're a goddess, the god Osamodas's avatar?","content.76.8401":"I've rarely seen Osamodas with such a little Gobgob, much less fighting with a tool!","content.76.8404":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8405":"Yes I do! I'm just going to take this book and go...","content.76.8407":"Sorry! I'll go to the back of the class, don't let me bother you.","content.76.8408":"I won't take long. Tell me, who are you?","content.76.8409":"If you think I'll fail, gramps, you're off to a bad start... Fire away!","content.76.8411":"Woah! What is it? General knowledge? That's not my forté... Bye!","content.76.8412":"Of course I do, I'm just taking this book...","content.76.8413":"Shoot! I'll have to go to spend some time in the Library...","content.76.8414":"Great! Jenry Hones, Jr. will be pleased!","content.76.8415":"Radius, circumference and sinusoidality","content.76.8416":"Radius, cubitus, and sinus.","content.76.8417":"Radishes, cucurbits, and superabundance.","content.76.8418":"Radiance, confidence and self-importance","content.76.8419":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8420":"Round, convoluted and seeded","content.76.8421":"Rating, consensus, and semi-neutrality.","content.76.8422":"You want more definitions, there you go","content.76.8423":"You want more definitions, you'll get them","content.76.8424":"More definitions, and more and more","content.76.8425":"You want definitions, there you go","content.76.8426":"A nation defined, and there's some more","content.76.8427":"Didi defines scions. What a bore. Maybe more.","content.76.8428":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8429":"Taxonomy of Wabbits","content.76.8430":"Tax on me Wabbits","content.76.8431":"Attack-so-no-me of the Wabbits","content.76.8432":"Taxes on my Wodent bones.","content.76.8433":"Tacks on \"O' my Wabbits\"!","content.76.8434":"Tax on me, tax me ooooon...","content.76.8435":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8436":"Yippee! Here we go!","content.76.8437":"I give up. Oh well, I'll start over again later...","content.76.8438":"Amakna","content.76.8439":"Astrub","content.76.8440":"Bonta","content.76.8441":"Brakmar","content.76.8442":"Sufokia","content.76.8443":"Ankama","content.76.8444":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8445":"The whole of Gobbowl since its creation","content.76.8446":"What lies beneath Gobbowl","content.76.8447":"Gobbowl Stripped: Nothing Censored","content.76.8448":"Gobbowl from A to Z, and then some","content.76.8449":"Gobbowl, Gobballs, or Gobbowl balls?","content.76.8450":"Gobbowl: A Ioppish Sport?","content.76.8451":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8452":"Go on, I'm up for it!","content.76.8453":"I give up. Oh well; I'll start over again later...","content.76.8454":"Bonta Archaosology Vol. V","content.76.8455":"Bonta - Justice and Light vol. X","content.76.8456":"Protectors of Bonta vol. I","content.76.8457":"The Bontarian Empire vol. XII","content.76.8458":"Bonta vs. Brakmar vol. XXI","content.76.8459":"The Great Bonta vol. IV","content.76.8460":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8461":"History of Brakmar vol. IV","content.76.8462":"Brakmar Archaosology Vol. V","content.76.8463":"Low Blow to Brakmar vol. I","content.76.8464":"Brakmar the Red vol. XV","content.76.8465":"Brakmarian in the Soul vol. XXXIV","content.76.8466":"Brakmar vs. Bonta vol. VII","content.76.8467":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8468":"Sufokia Emerged","content.76.8469":"The Foggernaut Empire","content.76.8470":"Sufokia Archaosology","content.76.8471":"Sufokia: Stories and Myths","content.76.8472":"Sufokia: From Region to Nation","content.76.8473":"The Foggernauts of Sufokia.","content.76.8474":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8475":"Mimic Encyclopedia volume III","content.76.8476":"Mimic Taxonomy vol. II","content.76.8477":"Mimiclopedia volume XII","content.76.8478":"Mimicus Compendium","content.76.8479":"Mimic Zoomonology","content.76.8480":"Mimics and other metamorphs","content.76.8481":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8482":"Cult Compendium vol. XI","content.76.8483":"Ogrest's Cult and the Occult Cult","content.76.8484":"All about Cults vol. XVI","content.76.8485":"Ogrest's Cult - Unabridged","content.76.8486":"Cults and Legends vol. III","content.76.8487":"History of Cults and Beliefs volume XXV","content.76.8488":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8489":"The news was written at the start of Ogrest's Chaos, a long time ago, and it was carried by the current of Ogrest's tears.","content.76.8490":"The stories it brings together stink of feet and sting my eyes.","content.76.8491":"The news tells a story about an Enutrof who sticks a toe in his eye.","content.76.8492":"It's just a reprint of an old storybook for emotional Eniripsas.","content.76.8493":"Well, it tells the story of a one-legged, one-armed orphan, who is mute and allergic to citrananas, and dreams of become the greatest warrior Bonta has ever seen, and...","content.76.8494":"I think it talks about the bad news from before, actually.","content.76.8495":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8496":"The author tries to make us think about the possible existence of an underwater present-day Sufokian Empire.","content.76.8497":"The author thinks that Sufokia doesn't even deserve to be called a nation and should become a province of Amakna.","content.76.8498":"The author thinks that Sufokia is nothing more than a gigantic fish farm, and wonders if they shouldn't open a chain of fish and chip shops.","content.76.8499":"The author is a fervent supporter of Sufokia, and wishes to unify the nations under Oktapodas's banner.","content.76.8500":"The author's actually a half-man, half-Kralove creature, who wants to convert us all to worship him as an avatar of Oktapodas.","content.76.8501":"The author had had enough of finding his clothes full of holes every morning and asks himself if there are spectral mites who come around at night to nibble on his laundry.","content.76.8502":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8503":"Vissemeryd is cursed by the Emperor of the Gray Moon, and is forced to eat nothing put fresh Troutuna, otherwise he'll get horrific stomach cramps.","content.76.8504":"A vicious Meridia wishes to see all Troutuna disappear, and crosses all of the oceans eliminating them.","content.76.8505":"The Gray Moon is entering its third cycle, and its eclipse will cause great tides that will decimate the Troutuna in the oceans.","content.76.8506":"Meredith has done enough work today, so decides to go and make herself a little tuna sandwich.","content.76.8507":"It's a story about a Troutuna who goes into a bar... No, wait... That's the punchline...","content.76.8508":"The deputy mayor of the city of Yd resists its vices, and sets off to hunt Troutuna to take his mind off things. He comes across a Bellaphone, which subjugates him.","content.76.8509":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8510":"It talks about the sometimes romantic journey of an ordinary Twelvian: his everyday life, his death, his trek through the Krosmoz, and his reincarnation.","content.76.8511":"It's the story of a little hairy Feca who is taken away by Enutrofs who say they want to reclaim their family's heritage, under the amused watch of a hedonic Huppermage.","content.76.8512":"It's the story of Martin McFall, who tampered with a Zaap and travels between dimensions, ending up in Incarnam. There, he meets some creatures and becomes their new chief following a revolt.","content.76.8513":"It's a rubbish story about a guy who works, eats, and sleeps. That's all.","content.76.8514":"It's the book that was in my parents' bathroom. I always used to tear pages out of it to make paper airplanes.","content.76.8515":"It's the story of twelve very loutish guys who are going to save the world by eliminating a really wicked king of Brakmar.","content.76.8516":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8517":"Many enlightened people's Aperirel fish pushed them to rip out an eye, to see if the socket held the secret of the universe.","content.76.8518":"Many scientomages tried in vain to build flying ships to go off and find the secret of the universe in orbit of the World of Twelve.","content.76.8519":"Some Enutrofs who were a bit Ioppish around the edges thought that orbit was a new ore derived from gold, and they squandered their fortune trying to find it, without success.","content.76.8520":"Some slightly Ioppic scientomages tried to find an IT orb, knowing full well that orb classification only goes up to HL.","content.76.8521":"Many members of Ogrest's Cult invaded the Gobbowl Stadiums, shouting \"Smash the orbit!\".","content.76.8522":"Errr, there was no scandal.","content.76.8523":"It's too difficult! I give up...","content.76.8531":"Uh... Are you Khan Karkass?","content.76.8532":"Uhhh... Not right now. Goodbye.","content.76.8533":"I don't want to interrupt you, but that cup isn't real, is it?","content.76.8535":"Oh! The Gobbowl Stadium... So let's go!","content.76.8537":"Uh... Okay. Well, see you there.","content.76.8539":"Aren't you a bit old to be playing Gobbowl?","content.76.8541":"What's that bird on your shoulder?","content.76.8542":"Ok ok ok... Let's keep our ghoul, and breathe. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.8544":"Alright! It's not as if I was going to call you an wrinkly old... Well, in fact, I was. See ya!","content.76.8545":"Oh! So you're one of Joris's pals? Impressive!\\nI have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.8546":"Joris? As in Master Joris, the great Bontarian messenger that nobody ever sees, except in hard times? Well, that gives me something to think about. See ya!","content.76.8547":"Let's breathe deeply and keep our ghoul. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.8548":"I think your son and I have found a second Orichalcum, but you're the only one who can verify its authenticity.","content.76.8549":"... And?","content.76.8550":"Hmmm?! What \"Hmmm...\" ?","content.76.8551":"Fantastic! Just one more, and Oktapodas's Temple in Sufokia will be ours! Thanks and see you!","content.76.8552":"Really? Well, me and Jenry are going to get a rusty old cup from the stadium and...","content.76.8553":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8554":"Yeah right... But? By the way, how did you get to these ruins? You didn't come via the Immaterial University of Bonta, I imagine...","content.76.8555":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8556":"A few kamas? Dang... I had to read books, and more books... books... so many books... Anyway, let's continue! Direction: the Gobbowl Stadium!","content.76.8557":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8558":"Whatever... Right, we'll talk about it later. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.8559":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8560":"Okay, that gives me something to think about. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.8561":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8562":"That's an opinion like any other. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.8563":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8564":"Michelene you say... I'll note that down. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.8565":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8566":"Uh... And what's that got to do with your clothes?","content.76.8568":"No, but seriously... Your clothes. What's that got to do with them?","content.76.8569":"Oh! At last, some useful information. But anyway, your rags...","content.76.8570":"Oh! Actually, that's Twisty's outfit, the worst Gobé'Mob master he has ever known! Hahaha! Now I understand Team Missile's reaction! Hahahaha!","content.76.8571":"Sorry, but I think you should stop asking yourself questions sometimes... Incidentally, I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8572":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8573":"Ah yes, that's true. Team Missile talked about that earlier. So... I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8574":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8575":"Really? So he didn't escape on his own? I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8576":"See you later, blue lady!","content.76.8577":"Okay! I'll note that down. Bye!","content.76.8578":"I made some very interesting discoveries in the Cania Swamps. Do you know Crocoburio?","content.76.8579":"Very well, I have some other questions...","content.76.8580":"Ok, I'll come back later. Bye!","content.76.8581":"Okay. Anyway, there is something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8582":"Ok, I'll come back later. Bye!","content.76.8583":"Very good! Here are the 550,000 Kamas.","content.76.8584":"Oh poo... I don't have 550,000 Kamas...","content.76.8585":"Pff, don't feel like it right now.","content.76.8586":"Uh... I don't have a license for Moon Island. Can I get one, please?","content.76.8587":"I don't see any available contracts at the Mercenary Post.","content.76.8588":"Could you explain to me how the Mercenary Post works?","content.76.8589":"No thank you, I have better things to do.","content.76.8590":"I'd like to take care of the Crocodyl Seeds.","content.76.8591":"I'd like to take care of the Crocodyl Leather.","content.76.8592":"I'd like to take care of the Nyl Crocodyl Dungeon.","content.76.8593":"Here are your 10 Crocodyl Seeds.","content.76.8594":"Here are your 10 Crocodyl Leathers.","content.76.8595":"I'd like to take care of the Kannivore Seeds.","content.76.8596":"I'd like to take care of the Kannivore Root.","content.76.8597":"I'd like to take care of the Kannivore Dungeon.","content.76.8598":"Here are your 10 Kannivore Seeds.","content.76.8599":"Here are your 10 Kannivore Roots.","content.76.8600":"I'd like to take care of a Boss.","content.76.8601":"I'd like to take care of the Bosses.","content.76.8605":"And here are the 6 Brrrbley Spears Leathers!","content.76.8606":"And here are the 6 Dark Purples!","content.76.8607":"And here are the 6 Chomped Jellies!","content.76.8608":"You betcha! I have 4 Ginger Goatees for you!","content.76.8609":"Here are the 4 Royal Moogrr mimilks.","content.76.8610":"Sure is... Here are the 4 Thork's Gobball Horns.","content.76.8611":"Sure is... Here are the 4 Royal Pincers.","content.76.8612":"Just dandy! Here, I've brought you the 4 Lunar Tears.","content.76.8613":"Just dandy! Here, I've brought you the 4 Ectoplasm Prisms.","content.76.8614":"Of course. Here, 4 Orrok's Ossicles.","content.76.8615":"Obviously. Here, the 4 Kiki Furs.","content.76.8616":"Here are the 6 YeCh'Ti'Wawa Fangs!","content.76.8617":"Yes, I'm finally ready! What's next on the program?","content.76.8618":"Phew... It was totally exhausting! But it was worth it. I'll come back when you need me.","content.76.8619":"I'll come back when you need me.","content.76.8620":"What do we do now?","content.76.8621":"Great, let's go!","content.76.8624":"Exactly! A vacation is what I need! ","content.76.8626":"Uh... Hello. Are you Jacky uh... Lilye Tstrong?","content.76.8627":"What do I have to do?","content.76.8628":"I was able to reassemble 3 big pieces of the logbook! Does that work for you?","content.76.8629":"Uh... I found this strange page in the stomach of a Crocodyl. Do you recognize it?","content.76.8630":"Remind me... Speaking of the logbook page: Where is Jacky Lilye Tstrong?","content.76.8631":"Perfect! I wrote down everything! The old one, in the Kannivore dungeon, in Marathiop mode. Thank you.","content.76.8633":"A hermit among the Kannivores? Where's he hiding?","content.76.8634":"Woah! I'm not sure I need quite so much information just now. Could you sum it up for me please?","content.76.8635":"Strange story. I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.8636":"Ok. Funny little man. Bye!","content.76.8637":"I have a bit of time. Tell me more about Jacky Lilye Tstrong...","content.76.8638":"I'm the person you need!","content.76.8639":"Here's the Fine Sänd you asked me for!","content.76.8640":"Sand?! If that'll make you happy!","content.76.8642":"I heard talk of Bläck Sänd?","content.76.8643":"I have news about the binding...","content.76.8644":"Here, Jacky! I was able to reassemble the logbook according to your instructions.","content.76.8645":"I'd like to know more about you...","content.76.8646":"Bye.","content.76.8647":"Uh... Who are you? I really wanna know...","content.76.8649":"Oh, heavens! Sorry old guy. See you later.","content.76.8651":"Uh... Are you talking to the Gobbowl Ball or me?","content.76.8652":"Uh... Okay. I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8653":"Uh... Okay. I'll see what I can do! Bye!","content.76.8654":"Ok... I suppose it's my job to do it.","content.76.8655":"Uh... ...yes, I mean... ...no. I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8656":"Ok... I'm going back. Bye.","content.76.8657":"I've got your 5 Robowl Feathers!","content.76.8658":"I've got your 2 Koko Nutt Essences!","content.76.8659":"Super! I have other news about the binding kit and the components.","content.76.8660":"Super! I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8661":"Super! I'll get on it now. Bye!","content.76.8662":"The Bläck Skäte, a terrible monster! I have a feeling this is going to be good.\\nI'll bring you ten Bläck Sänds!","content.76.8663":"I have 2 Cataplasms!","content.76.8664":"I've got your 2 Black Monkey Hairs!","content.76.8665":"I've got your 2 Pirate Flags!","content.76.8666":"Here's the Bläck Sänd you asked me for!","content.76.8667":"Great, but that doesn't tell me what I can do for you.","content.76.8668":"And that's all? Are you sure? Right... ...I'm leaving...","content.76.8669":"Alrighty then. Actually, I found this old page, and Botan Ficus told me you could...","content.76.8670":"In fact, I came from...","content.76.8671":"So you and Boufson just need to kill a few Crocodyls and it's over, right?","content.76.8672":"I get the idea. Are you just a bit agoraphobic, Jacky? Got a Mastostroke that gets all frizzy on the surface?","content.76.8673":"Sorry; it's true you're not exactly young. And you're certainly not going to beat the scaly thing with your wooden leg and your crutch. But how will I find enough pages?","content.76.8674":"Ok. Gutting a maximum number of Crocodyls in all the possible locations... Surely that wouldn't take more than... oh, a week, or maybe a year. I'll get on it. Bye!","content.76.8675":"Well... Actually, I think I lost your... Boufson's binding kit...","content.76.8676":"It's a bit expensive, but I haven't much of a choice. Here, your 100,000 kamas!","content.76.8677":"Urm.. No! However, I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8678":"Urm.. No! I'll get on it now. Bye!","content.76.8679":"All that! Well thanks, ol' Jacky! I'll try and come back some time! Ciao, and have fun gardening!","content.76.8680":"Uh... Actually, I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8681":"Uh... Yeah, no. I'm going to go. Bye!","content.76.8682":"Who are you?","content.76.8683":"Where do you come from?","content.76.8684":"Why do you stay here, in this dark and humid hole?","content.76.8685":"What is this story of Ship's Apprentice and Captain?","content.76.8686":"What's that got to do with Nyl Crocodyls?","content.76.8687":"Hi Jacky! Long time, no see. Doing OK? Everything going well with Boufson?","content.76.8693":"What the... What?!","content.76.8695":"But why do you stay here then? You could go anywhere in the world!","content.76.8696":"No way! If I'd known that, I'd have gone to sell the story to Phil Harmonic. So much the better for you, Jacky! I wish you all the happiness in the world, even here in the damp tunnels.","content.76.8697":"What exactly do I have to do?","content.76.8700":"Otherwise, I have some questions for you...","content.76.8701":"OK! I'm on my way!","content.76.8702":"What's happening to the creatures in the area?","content.76.8703":"See you soon.","content.76.8704":"But who are you exactly?","content.76.8705":"Who is this Olavrann?","content.76.8706":"Where are we?","content.76.8707":"I have all the information I need, thanks.","content.76.8708":"Ok, I'll do that!","content.76.8709":"I think I did it!","content.76.8710":"I'd also like to know...","content.76.8711":"I've got everything I need.","content.76.8712":"What are you doing here?","content.76.8714":"This is terrible!","content.76.8716":"I'd also like to know...","content.76.8717":"I've got everything I need.","content.76.8718":"What is that sort of Temple over there?","content.76.8719":"That could be interesting. I'll go see!","content.76.8720":"I want to change class. I don't feel too much like a [#breedName].","content.76.8721":"I want to change my characteristics.","content.76.8722":"Where does this Fine Sänd come from?","content.76.8723":"Messages in bottles?!","content.76.8724":"Enjoy the sun! I'm going to see what's in these bottled messages.","content.76.8726":"I recovered all the messages in bottles. What do you think of that?","content.76.8727":"I saw a little boat to La Mädrague Beach; the compass is surely guiding me in the right direction.","content.76.8728":"I helped the Skäter, even if she'd prefer to stay there...","content.76.8729":"Moooore Sänd!? I'll think about it!","content.76.8730":"On a boat... How did you land here?","content.76.8733":"All right... I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8734":"Enough personal information. I'd like to completely change the subject.","content.76.8735":"Hmm, that'll do for today. Bye!","content.76.8737":"Alright. I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8738":"Enough personal information. I'd like to completely change the subject.","content.76.8739":"Hmm, that'll do for today. Bye!","content.76.8741":"Alright. I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8742":"Enough personal information. I'd like to completely change the subject.","content.76.8743":"Hmm, that'll do for today. Bye!","content.76.8744":"Alright. I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8745":"Enough personal information. I'd like to completely change the subject.","content.76.8746":"Hmm, that'll do for today. Bye!","content.76.8747":"Alright. I have something else I want to ask you.","content.76.8748":"Enough personal information. I'd like to completely change the subject.","content.76.8749":"Hmm, that'll do for today. Bye.","content.76.8750":"Just a minute. I have a few questions to ask you.","content.76.8751":"I'd also like to know...","content.76.8752":"I've got everything I need. Bye!","content.76.8753":"Where are we?","content.76.8754":"Forget it, I need to think. Bye!","content.76.8755":"Do you know who... Who I am?","content.76.8756":"Wha... What?","content.76.8758":"What happened...?","content.76.8759":"150 years! Uh... I'd also like to know...","content.76.8760":"I think I've got everything I need. Bye!","content.76.8761":"okay. I'd also like to know...","content.76.8762":"I think I've got everything I need. Bye!","content.76.8763":"Wha... What?","content.76.8765":"... ... What are you doing here alone?","content.76.8766":"WHAT?! You're a girl?","content.76.8767":"I lost your drawings to activate the slabs leading to the Bläck Skäte.","content.76.8772":"Well... See ya later.","content.76.8773":"Explicit... Not really...","content.76.8775":"Great story!","content.76.8781":"I'll find you some Fine Sänd!","content.76.8782":"I'll bring you some Bläck Sänd! Confronting the Bläck Skäte doesn't scare me!","content.76.8783":"I'm ready to leave Incarnam and head to the World of Twelve!","content.76.8784":"My body is ready. Go on, I'll follow you!","content.76.8785":"Uh... No, I'll take another walk and come back to see you, ok?","content.76.8786":"I'd also like to know...","content.76.8787":"I've got everything I need.","content.76.8788":"Is Stasis evil, then?","content.76.8789":"I'd also like to know...","content.76.8790":"I've got everything I need.","content.76.8791":"I'd also like to know...","content.76.8792":"I've got everything I need.","content.76.8793":"Nice pool, by the way! What are the stones by the entrance for?","content.76.8794":"Ah yes! That seems good. I will go immediately.","content.76.8795":"I'd like to leave the dungeon, please!","content.76.8796":"Let me past, snout-face, before I smash in that tiny bit of brain matter that's still floating around your empty skull.\\nI have some business to discuss with your boss...","content.76.8797":"What's your job?","content.76.8798":"What are you exactly? A Bwork? A Lousy Pig? A Hukl?","content.76.8799":"Forget it, I must have made a mistake...","content.76.8800":"That's my golden pass.\\n[pay 1,000 kamas]","content.76.8801":"That's my V.I.P. invitation.\\n[pay 10,000 kamas]","content.76.8802":"Forget it, I must have made a mistake...","content.76.8803":"That's my employee I.D.\\n[pay 100,000 kamas]","content.76.8804":"Three - zero? Isn't that the result of yesterday's Gobbowl match?\\nBasically, I don't think I have enough...","content.76.8805":"That's my golden pass.\\n[pay 1,000 kamas]","content.76.8806":"That's my V.I.P. invitation.\\n[pay 10,000 kamas]","content.76.8807":"That's my employee I.D.\\n[pay 100,000 kamas]","content.76.8808":"Let me past, snout-face, before I smash in that tiny bit of brain matter that's still floating around your empty skull.\\nI have some business to discuss with your boss...","content.76.8809":"Eminerell Lebbocq advised me to come and talk to you...","content.76.8810":"What's your job? Beggar?","content.76.8812":"Forget it, you wouldn't understand. Bye!","content.76.8813":"I'd like some information about the first guard...\\n[100 kamas]","content.76.8814":"I'd like some information about the first guard...\\n[350 kamas]","content.76.8815":"I'd like some information about the first guard...\\n[700 kamas]","content.76.8816":"I'd like some information about the first guard...\\n[1,150 kamas]","content.76.8817":"I'd like some information about the second guard...\\n[200 kamas]","content.76.8818":"I'd like some information about the second guard...\\n[600 kamas]","content.76.8819":"I'd like some information about the second guard...\\n[1,100 kamas]","content.76.8820":"I'd like some information about the second guard...\\n[1,700 kamas]","content.76.8821":"I'd like some information about the third guard...\\n[300 kamas]","content.76.8822":"I'd like some information about the third guard...\\n[850 kamas]","content.76.8823":"I'd like some information about the third guard...\\n[1,500 kamas]","content.76.8824":"I'd like some information about the third guard...\\n[2,250 kamas]","content.76.8825":"I'd like some juicy information...\\n[100 kamas]","content.76.8826":"Don't you think you're asking for a little too much?","content.76.8827":"Actually, it's Lebbocq who's sent me and...","content.76.8828":"I... Uh... I love exotic dancing!","content.76.8829":"What beauty! Call the Feca fire brigade, we're on fire, boys!","content.76.8830":"What's your job?","content.76.8831":"I'm more of a loner. Bye!","content.76.8832":"Let me guess: You're a specialist in snappy comebacks, right?","content.76.8833":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.8836":"I'm here for the Orichalcum. I know you've got it!","content.76.8837":"It would seem that you happen to be in possession of something I would like to acquire.","content.76.8839":"Wait, wait...! Wait a minute, give me a chance to redeem myself!","content.76.8840":"The Arkaeologist, Eminerell Lebbocq, sold you an item by mistake that actually belongs to me!","content.76.8842":"It's an item you bought from Eminerell Lebbocq the Arkaeologist a while back...","content.76.8843":"Sorry, I...","content.76.8844":"I got lost in the maze of factories. I'm going home.","content.76.8845":"I'm a huge fan of your factories and...","content.76.8846":"Ok. I'll leave you...","content.76.8848":"Yes! Yes, that's it! I need it, it's of the utmost importance! Let's talk business!","content.76.8850":"Yes, that's the item I was telling you about. How about we trade?","content.76.8852":"It must be because we're cut from the same cloth that I perfectly understand your admirable actions during the purge of the Sidimote Moors against the threat from the Ouginak rebels!\\nHow can I be anything but dazzling in your presence?","content.76.8853":"And, as always, it's a pleasure to do business with the high-society tycoons. \\nDoing business with little people will never be as good as confronting a monument of your stature!","content.76.8854":"I... need that Orichalcum. Is... is that a good enough argument for you?","content.76.8855":"That's good tactics. Whatever it takes, I won't give up until I've got the Orichalcum!","content.76.8856":"Haha! I'm not going to take any risks in a discussion I can't win...","content.76.8857":"I'm very serious, and I'm not going to drop this business!","content.76.8860":"Let's go. Haven't you finished playing Bow Wow and Bow Meow wars yet?!","content.76.8861":"It's simple. Because I have good reasons to prove my credentials to you!","content.76.8862":"Grrr! And why should I have to put up with an Ouginak's threats?","content.76.8864":"Claws at least as sharp as your watchdog fangs!","content.76.8865":"I'm certainly more anxious to sink my teeth into something than you, sweetie!","content.76.8866":"And I'll make an effort to ignore the fact that you're a pretentious Ouginak!","content.76.8867":"I'll spare you the pleasantries. Let's get back to our conversation!","content.76.8868":"It's good to hold your tongue sometimes!","content.76.8869":"You're a big man! Someone so well-off as yourself, with access to all the inner circles, could have more than an Orichalcum. Why not give me that ridiculous ball of metal?","content.76.8870":"I wasn't planning on going to bed this early! What's more, nothing gives me more pleasure that doing business with a man of your caliber, no matter the outcome!","content.76.8872":"Yes, you financed the rebel Ouginak attack and avoided the invasion of the Moogrr king's forces!","content.76.8873":"Yes, you fought off the Ouginak rebel attack and stopped the Lavalarve invasion!","content.76.8874":"That doesn't surprise me, since you're the genius engineer that worked on the Netrail! You always succeed! Everyone must be jealous of you and plot against you.","content.76.8875":"Aren't you the genius engineer who took part in the design and the creation of the Netrail? Your genius is limitless.","content.76.8877":"I love your inventions. I even have a Sidimotes & Co. toaster! Yum! Warm toast with jelly and Gobbette butter every morning, thanks to you!","content.76.8878":"National heroes, mechanical inventions, and even your own Militia! Impressive!","content.76.8879":"Ummm... Here goes... I... You...","content.76.8880":"Here's what I suggest...","content.76.8881":"We know each other well now. You want to give me the Orichalcum?","content.76.8882":"I know that getting the Orichalcum will have a price. But would you do me the favor of a discount?","content.76.8883":"Are you sure you don't want to talk to me about your militia?","content.76.8884":"I'm ready to shell out if I have to.\\n[pay 10,000 kamas]","content.76.8885":"You're the creator of the Netrail and have numerous patents for your Sidimotes & Co. brand; I've got a long way to go before I catch up to you!","content.76.8886":"I am certainly the most competent Blacksmith and engineer to date!","content.76.8887":"It's your place, so we'll play by your rules. What do you want me to do?","content.76.8888":"My culinary specialty will delight your tastebuds like never before. Nothing is too good for someone as hot as you.","content.76.8889":"How could a doggy like you say no to some kibble and a marrow bone in a remote-controlled golden bowl?","content.76.8890":"You're a big man! You won't lose any more money investing in my dishes than you have given for this city!","content.76.8891":"Even for Orichalcum?","content.76.8892":"What would you say to the rare leather vest my partner is selling, in exchange for the Orichalcum? ","content.76.8893":"What would you say to me offering my services? And, in reward for completing your assignments, you'll give me your item?","content.76.8894":"Sometimes, I can be funny when I want to be!","content.76.8895":"You mean... sweep the attics in your factory? ","content.76.8896":"You mean... for missions that require sweat, perseverance and going outside of Sidimotes and Co.'s jurisdiction?","content.76.8897":"You mean... be part of your militia under a daily contract?","content.76.8898":"I understand. Getting around in a mechanical chair can't be much fun day in, day out! I can help you.","content.76.8899":"I understand. You've certainly got a lot on your plate with managing your company! I can help you.","content.76.8900":"It's a very good offer. You should take it!","content.76.8901":"Don't you think you might be overdoing it?","content.76.8902":"I'll complete whatever mission it takes to get the Orichalcum!","content.76.8903":"Your colossal project?! A pyramid-shaped palace? Asthenic mummies?","content.76.8904":"Deal! Bones of wood and bones of steel. If I'm lying, may I be the girlfriend of hell's Bow Wow!","content.76.8905":"Deal! Your wish is my command, so long as we both respect our part of the contract.","content.76.8907":"Deal! I knew I would convince you in a flash!","content.76.8908":"I'm the person you need!","content.76.8909":"Obviously! Let's go!","content.76.8910":"I'm fine, perfectly fine! I'm going now, but I'll be back!","content.76.8914":"I'm here for your shared resources.","content.76.8918":"Here's your fresh-picked Golden Brown Dung!","content.76.8919":"Here are your 20 Dried Dungs...","content.76.8922":"Yes! What's more, you were the one who asked me to come. What can you tell me about the Orichalcum?","content.76.8924":"Uh... No, actually. Bye.","content.76.8925":"It's possible, but I have something else to take care of at the moment. Bye.","content.76.8926":"Yes... Uh... I can't remember what I have to do...","content.76.8927":"I think I found an Orichalcum, but I'm not sure!","content.76.8928":"Hmmm, in fact, I think I'll head back. See you later.","content.76.8929":"So, where are we up to?","content.76.8930":"I've had a little chat with everyone. You could say the people in this neighborhood are rather... keen.","content.76.8931":"Alright, but who is it? And where can we find him?","content.76.8932":"Oh really? That's strange. I hope that nothing has happened to him and he will agree to give us the Orichalcum...","content.76.8933":"Amazing... Well, where shall we start then?","content.76.8934":"The Sidimotes & Co. Factory ghetto? Let's go!","content.76.8935":"Here I am! So, what do we do now?","content.76.8936":"Very well! Let's go!","content.76.8937":"Hang on... I have some things to take care of first. See you later.","content.76.8938":"It seems you need seeds, right? (Quests 6 to 20)","content.76.8939":"It seems you need resources, right? (Quests 6 to 20)","content.76.8951":"I want to take care of the Boss! (Quests 6 to 20)","content.76.8952":"Here are the 10 Gobball Seeds.","content.76.8953":"Here are the 10 Gobball Skins.","content.76.8960":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.8962":"Here are the 10 Tofu Seeds.","content.76.8964":"Here are the 10 Tofu Pheromones.","content.76.8966":"Here are the 10 Larva Seeds.","content.76.8968":"Here are the 10 Larva Skins.","content.76.8970":"Perfect! A femme fatale for rent. I'll note that down.","content.76.8971":"okay. I won't forget.","content.76.8972":"Eminerell Lebbocq told me about your slicing edge.","content.76.8973":"Information for sale. Alright, no problem.","content.76.8976":"Thank you for your gallantry! Let's go!","content.76.8977":"That doesn't put my mind at ease at all. I think I'll wait a while.","content.76.8978":"Don't you think you were a bit tightfisted with that reward, Jacky? Give me the ring you're hiding behind your back!","content.76.8980":"No, actually I think I'll just decline!","content.76.8981":"Here's your Chafer Tibia!","content.76.8982":"Here are 2 Bone Flours, prepared just right!","content.76.8983":"Here are your 10 Chafer Bones in case you need a little snack!","content.76.8984":"No, actually I think I'll just decline!","content.76.8985":"Here is your Crate, crafted with care!","content.76.8986":"Here's your basic handle cut to perfection!","content.76.8987":"Here's your basic string all tied up!","content.76.8988":"No, actually I think I'll just decline!","content.76.8989":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.8990":"But... And the socks? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.8991":"What?! I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.8992":"Huh?! Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.8993":"Here are your 10 Osamodas Powders for your biscuit cushion!","content.76.8994":"Here are your 100 Buckets o' Water to quench your thirst!","content.76.8995":"I'd like some info, but I don't have enough kamas...","content.76.8996":"O... Okay. I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.8997":"Oh... Ok. Goodbye!","content.76.8998":"Ok, so what do we do now to get the Orichalcum from the hands... I mean, the heart, of the Mechamummy?","content.76.8999":"Yes, you directed the rebel Ouginak attack and avoided the invasion of cute Gemlins!","content.76.9001":"I'd like to take advantage of your services...\\n(2,000 kamas)","content.76.9002":"I'd like to take advantage of your services... but I haven't got enough.\\n(2,000 kamas)","content.76.9003":"I'd like to take advantage of your services... On behalf of someone else, of course.\\n(2,000 kamas)","content.76.9004":"I'd like to take advantage of your services... but I haven't got enough.\\n(2,000 kamas)","content.76.9005":"Forget it, I'll come back later. Farewell!","content.76.9006":"Remind me again: How do we leave and come back here?","content.76.9007":"I can well imagine. Anything else?","content.76.9008":"Super! Thanks for the info!","content.76.9009":"What is this mechanized mummy?","content.76.9010":"Ah... and sinc...","content.76.9011":"I think I found an Orichalcum, but I'm not sure!","content.76.9012":"I think I found an Orichalcum, but I'm not sure!","content.76.9013":"What can Tonguetwist, Skrapur and Savhanna do for us?","content.76.9015":"Very well, thank you.","content.76.9016":"I think I've got the third and last Orichalcum from Brakmar, but you are the only one who can certify its authenticity.","content.76.9017":"... And?","content.76.9018":"Hmmm?! What \"Hmmm...\"?","content.76.9019":"Awesome! As soon as Milo Tchatch gets in touch, we can open Oktapodas's Temple in Sufokia! Thanks and see you!","content.76.9020":"Yes, I have the Royal Tofu Feather.","content.76.9021":"Yes, I have the Royal Wool.","content.76.9022":"Yes, I have the Royal Feather.","content.76.9023":"Yes, I have the Morfor Horn!","content.76.9024":"Let's talk about my little Characteristic problems... (Restat Quest)","content.76.9025":"Let's talk about my little Characteristic problems... (Restat Quest)","content.76.9026":"Let's talk about my little Characteristic problems... (Restat Quest)","content.76.9027":"Let's talk about my little Characteristic problems... (Restat Quest)","content.76.9028":"Let's talk about my little Characteristic problems... (Restat Quest)","content.76.9029":"Let's talk about my little Characteristic problems... (Restat Quest)","content.76.9030":"This is for you! 150 bone powders.","content.76.9031":"This is for you! 150 Branchilegs.","content.76.9032":"This is for you! 150 Piwi beaks.","content.76.9033":"This is for you! 150 Country Scalps.","content.76.9034":"This is for you! 150 gold Crackler teeth.","content.76.9035":"This is for you! 150 bells.","content.76.9036":"This is for you! 150 Cwab eyes.","content.76.9037":"This is for you! 150 Koko Leaves","content.76.9038":"I haven't got the resources.","content.76.9039":"I would like to redistribute my Characteristics differently.","content.76.9040":"I'm bringing you the resources for the Restate of Farmergency!","content.76.9041":"No, nothing...","content.76.9043":"I'm not happy with my Abilities. Can you reset them for me?","content.76.9044":"I'm not happy with my Characteristics. Can you reset them for me?","content.76.9045":"I'm not happy with my Characteristics. Can you reset them for me?","content.76.9046":"I'm not happy with my Characteristics. Can you reset them for me?","content.76.9047":"I'm not happy with my Characteristics. Can you reset them for me?","content.76.9048":"I'm not happy with my Characteristics. Can you reset them for me?","content.76.9049":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9050":"That's great! Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9051":"That sends shivers down your spine. I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9052":"Is he really that powerful? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9053":"Stroud, that rings a bell... Well... I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9054":"It's a funny story. Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9055":"By my god and all the others! Urgh! I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9056":"Suddenly, I don't feel so good... Thanks for the info. Bye...","content.76.9057":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9058":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9059":"Djaul? In his knickers? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9060":"Djaul? In pantyhose? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9061":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9062":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9063":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9064":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9065":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9066":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9067":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9068":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9069":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9070":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9071":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9072":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9073":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9074":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9075":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9076":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9077":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9078":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9079":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9080":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9081":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9082":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9083":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9084":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9085":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9086":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9087":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9088":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9089":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9090":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9091":"Really? I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9092":"Really? Thanks for the info. Bye!","content.76.9093":"There is no...","content.76.9094":"I've completed all your missions. Now it's your turn to keep your word!","content.76.9095":"I'll do what I can, but don't expect any miracles.","content.76.9096":"I do have a Mechamummy to confront, in case you'd forgotten...","content.76.9097":"O... Okay. I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9098":"Oh... Ok. Goodbye!","content.76.9099":"It seems you have a little job for me?","content.76.9100":"What's that got to do with me?","content.76.9104":"Sorry; I'm not interested right now. I might be back later. Bye.","content.76.9106":"Let's go! We'll be through these airlocks in less time than it takes to say asphyxiation.","content.76.9107":"I really want to try again to win the bet about going through the airlocks today! Here's my wager.\\n[500 kamas]","content.76.9108":"I really want to try again to win the bet about going through the airlocks today, but I don't have enough money...\\n[500 kamas]","content.76.9109":"Let's go! We'll be through these airlocks in less time than it takes to say asphyxiation.","content.76.9113":"See you soon.","content.76.9114":"What's that got to do with the Orichalcum?","content.76.9115":"Right! And we weren't stupid enough to help him complete his plan. Ok, thank you.","content.76.9116":"Weren't you supposed to let us into the factory?","content.76.9117":"Train with a Mr. Punchy 90%","content.76.9118":"Train with a Mr. Punchy 80%","content.76.9119":"Train with a Mr. Punchy 70%","content.76.9120":"Train with a Mr. Punchy 60%","content.76.9121":"Train with a Mr. Punchy 50%","content.76.9122":"Train with a Mr. Punchy 40%","content.76.9123":"Train with a Mr. Punchy 30%","content.76.9124":"Train with a Mr. Punchy 20%","content.76.9125":"Train with a Mr. Punchy 10%","content.76.9126":"Train with a Mr. Punchy 0%","content.76.9127":"I really want to have another go at winning the bet about going through the airlocks today...","content.76.9128":"Ok, I'll see what I can do...","content.76.9129":"Ok. Seeya!","content.76.9130":"I want to take care of the Boss! (Quests 21 to 35)","content.76.9131":"It seems you need seeds, right? (Quests 21 to 35)","content.76.9132":"It seems you need resources, right? (Quests 21 to 35)","content.76.9133":"Here are the 10 Treechnee Seeds.","content.76.9134":"Here are the 10 Piwi Seeds.","content.76.9135":"Here are the 10 Essences of Raised Skeleton.","content.76.9136":"Here are the 10 Piwi Beaks.","content.76.9137":"Here are the 10 Branchilegs.","content.76.9138":"Here are the 10 Bone Powders.","content.76.9140":"Yeeesh, you're dismal! If it's dangerous, what are you doing here alone?","content.76.9141":"Skeletons don't scare me. I've even already confronted one or two of them!","content.76.9142":"What are Combat Challenges?","content.76.9143":"Wow. I have a hard time imagining you in a tutu! And on that note, I'm off.","content.76.9144":"It's lovely here. What are you doing in the area?","content.76.9145":"I mean... in general?","content.76.9146":"Business in the area? I haven't noticed any.","content.76.9147":"That seems interesting, thank you. I'm going to see!","content.76.9148":"I was hunting Gobballs!","content.76.9149":"Yeah, I'm more of an adventurer myself...","content.76.9150":"And that's all?","content.76.9151":"Mum's the word!","content.76.9152":"Uh... Hey?... Having a blast?","content.76.9153":"You seem to be very attached to your crops.","content.76.9154":"And if I respect them, will I get a reward?","content.76.9155":"Actually, that could be useful! Hmm... Ot?","content.76.9156":"Uh... are you talking to me?","content.76.9157":"Uh... To tell the truth, I'm not very rich.","content.76.9158":"That seems like wise advice. I will go immediately.","content.76.9159":"I'm not sure that's a good idea. But I'll think about it.","content.76.9160":"You don't seem cold. Why are you shivering?","content.76.9161":"And really, what do you do?","content.76.9162":"The weather, you say? What does that change?","content.76.9163":"And how do I know their needs?","content.76.9164":"Uh, no... Bleugh. Why would I do that?","content.76.9165":"Really? And where are they?","content.76.9166":"Thanks for the information.","content.76.9167":"Impressive...","content.76.9170":"Sorry. I'm going.","content.76.9171":"I understand better. I'm leaving!","content.76.9172":"Ok...","content.76.9173":"I see that I'm bothering you. I'll go...","content.76.9174":"No, it's not me. *flees*","content.76.9175":"Ok, ok...","content.76.9176":"I'll be discreet and careful. See you around!","content.76.9177":"I'll be discreet and careful. See you around!","content.76.9178":"Hmm, I don't think he's talking to me...","content.76.9179":"I smell fraud. See you around!","content.76.9180":"Everything's fine, thanks. See you around!","content.76.9181":"Very funny. See ya.","content.76.9182":"Ok, well, have a blast!","content.76.9183":"Nature is crazy! I'm off.","content.76.9184":"Thanks!","content.76.9186":"Yes, of course; I love that! (You sneak away)","content.76.9189":"5 Bow Meow Seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9190":"5 Gobball Seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9191":"5 Tofu Seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9192":"5 Larva Seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9193":"5 Raised Skeletons Seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9194":"5 Piwi Seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9195":"5 Treechnee Seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9196":"5 Ash Cuttings (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9197":"5 Hazel Cuttings (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9198":"5 Chestnut Oak Cuttings (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9199":"5 Api Cuttings (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9200":"5 Wheat Grains (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9201":"5 Artichoke Seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9202":"5 Tuberbulb Seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9203":"5 Barley Grains (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9204":"5 Thistle Seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9205":"5 Iriss seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9206":"5 Flax Seeds (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9207":"5 Mint Shoots (5,000 kamas)","content.76.9210":"I want to take care of the The Ecosystem.","content.76.9211":"I want to take care of the The Ecosystem.","content.76.9212":"Yo, I have something else to do.","content.76.9213":"I want to take care of the The Ecosystem.","content.76.9214":"I want to take care of the The Ecosystem.","content.76.9215":"I want to take care of the The Ecosystem.","content.76.9216":"I want to take care of the The Ecosystem.","content.76.9217":"I want to take care of the The Ecosystem.","content.76.9218":"I want to take care of the The Ecosystem.","content.76.9219":"I've changed my mind; it's too expensive.","content.76.9220":"Super! Thanks for the info!","content.76.9221":"I see. You're not one to split hairs, you...","content.76.9222":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9223":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9224":"Oh! Now that we're getting to the heart of the matter, and sorry for interrupting, but I was wondering who did your hair. It's a crime to let someone leave like that!","content.76.9225":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9226":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9227":"If I were to dissect your words, I'd get the impression you were threatening me...","content.76.9228":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9229":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9230":"Come on, it's a little unkind to say such things...","content.76.9231":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9232":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9233":"Hey! You like animals? You have to be careful, but generally, they're louder than they are dangerous...","content.76.9234":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9235":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9236":"Oh, the action! Slicing the air, decimating obstacles, sabering the competition, eradicating adversaries...","content.76.9237":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9238":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9239":"Skull? Head? Might you be an intelligent man?","content.76.9240":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9241":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9242":"The tongue? Are you a man of taste after all? A chef, maybe...?","content.76.9243":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9244":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9245":"The sea? You must really be a fisherman.","content.76.9246":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9247":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9248":"Still as indecisive. I was wondering what sort of sharp mind was hiding in your head.","content.76.9249":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9250":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9251":"Ok. I think I've understood. You're a politician!","content.76.9252":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9253":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9254":"Oh! A rat-catcher, is that it? So you know about rodents then!","content.76.9255":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9256":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9257":"Acrobat! How could I have missed out on that! Always on a razor's edge...","content.76.9258":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9259":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9260":"Masquerade? Are you a maskless Masqueraider on vacation?","content.76.9261":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9262":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9263":"You have trophies? You're a hunter then. Have I got it right?","content.76.9264":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9265":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9266":"Trickery. What a funny word. You're a noble, a guy from the top?","content.76.9267":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9268":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9269":"Bad timing and bad luck often go hand in hand. Are you perhaps an unlucky Enutrof, or an Ecaflip stamped with an Ouginak brand?","content.76.9270":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9271":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9272":"Ha! The axes! My uncle was a forest ranger and...","content.76.9273":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9274":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9275":"You talk about consequences. Are you a messenger of Destiny? Oops, that slipped my mind...","content.76.9276":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9277":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9278":"I... Ok, you want to play the Statue's game. It's a diversion that some find interesting, but personally, it doesn't move me.","content.76.9279":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9280":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9281":"Come on! How hard you are! It's as if you're going to jump at my throat at any moment.","content.76.9282":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9283":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9284":"Ok, I admit, maybe I pushed it a little too far. But hey, a little verbal sparring makes the day more interesting, doesn't it?","content.76.9285":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9286":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9287":"I think I've upset you. I must have a bit too heavy on the spoonerisms and nonsense. Shall we cut the dispute short?","content.76.9288":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9289":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9290":"Come on! Is that worth cutting the ties that bind us?","content.76.9291":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9292":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9293":"Do you really want to cut the ties of friendship?","content.76.9294":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9295":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9296":"Come on... Let a little smile on to your face!","content.76.9297":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9298":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9299":"I've hurt you, is that it, and you want to hurt me in return?","content.76.9300":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9301":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9302":"Oooohhh... You're not really funny. Don't let yourself get beaten... Grab the beast by the fur and get your claws out!","content.76.9303":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9304":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9305":"We had some good moments together, huh? You're not really going to rip up those magic moments like some common weed, are you?","content.76.9306":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9307":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9308":"Ok ok ok... I'll put my pride aside and try to be in a good mood to excuse myself.","content.76.9309":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9310":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9311":"Still mute? Bow Meow cut out your tongue and eat it?","content.76.9312":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9313":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9314":"I give up. Just let me know what I can do to excuse myself.","content.76.9315":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9316":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9317":"I'm getting out the white flag and planting it in the ground in front of me. Shall we sign a peace treaty with our blood?","content.76.9318":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9319":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9320":"Sorry. What I wanted to say is: lets bury the hatchet?","content.76.9321":"Uh... I have something else I want to ask you...","content.76.9322":"Ok, then let's cut this conversation short. And JUST this conversation. Thank you. Farewell... Uh... Goodbye!","content.76.9323":"Actually, I think... What? What do you...","content.76.9324":"okay. That's what I thought. See you soon.","content.76.9325":"Whoa... A Lousy Bwork. There's only one intellectual who would want to mix these species and see what happens...","content.76.9332":"It's a good philosophy in the area, I suppose. Bye.","content.76.9333":"What a verb! As bouncy as your neckline. Bye.","content.76.9334":"Uh... Okay. See you soon.","content.76.9335":"O... Okay. I'd like to ask you something else...","content.76.9336":"Oh... Ok. Goodbye!","content.76.9337":"STOP! You talk a lot, don't you?","content.76.9338":"Wait grampa, I've got a question! What's that huge door behind you?","content.76.9340":"Of course. I'm the bravest and strongest of all adventurers!","content.76.9341":"I easily beat Steel Beak and Sham Moon: do you really think I'm not up to it?","content.76.9342":"I managed to defeat Steel Beak and Sham Moon; I'm strong enough now, right?{[1*]?:}","content.76.9343":"Pfff, ok, you'll see... I'm going to go face off against Steel Beak and Sham Moon, and then we'll see if I'm not up to it!","content.76.9344":"Yes, yes... I know... I'm not strong{[1*]?:} enough to get through the door, blablablah... *sigh*","content.76.9345":"I've changed my mind. I'd prefer not to find out what's behind the door.","content.76.9346":"Yes, I'm interested... Tell me more!","content.76.9347":"But... but... There are still dragons today? It's obviously been so long, is this Nogord still alive?","content.76.9348":"Well, that's a tall order! Yes, I feel ready to confront this dragon! If only to die on the field of honor and so the bards will sing of my exploits!","content.76.9350":"Calm down, calm down... I'll sum up the situation, even if it's a bit crazy. I come from the future, and you're the one that sent me to confront Nogord, regarding his Dofus. I know it sounds crazy, but you yourself told me that in the future, your Dofus was quite weak and you had an idea to make it more powerful.","content.76.9351":"Yes, I think I understand... So, basically, you need me to be the bait and the cannon fodder, is that it? So you're sending me to be slaughtered, and if I don't go, no matter, you'll find some other innocent to send to their doom...","content.76.9352":"It's true that seen from that angle... Well I didn't come all this way for nothing. Where's this lizard so we can be done?","content.76.9353":"Even for glory and billions of kamas, I wouldn't go up against a dragon! All things considered, I'm going back to my time. See ya, old-timer! Err... young-timer! Young-old-timer!","content.76.9354":"Yes, that's true, I'll get ready. I won't delay before jumping into this perilous fight!","content.76.9355":"Ummm, yes, that's it. I don't feel quite ready for such a fight. But soon!","content.76.9356":"You see before you the vanquisher of Nogord Wungleezared! I beat his old lizard-butt! In the end, he flew off without a fuss.","content.76.9357":"I'll return straightaway. See you in a moment!","content.76.9359":"Darn. After so much difficulty and fatigue; all that for nothing... ","content.76.9360":"Will I see you again outside of Incarnam?","content.76.9361":"I want to receive the \"Otomai Finisher\". See you soon!","content.76.9362":"Thanks, and see you soon!","content.76.9363":"Here are your three Orichalcums!","content.76.9364":"Here we go! Open sesame!","content.76.9365":"What an immense hangar!","content.76.9366":"Well, if you say so. 500 kamas, let's go!","content.76.9367":"Oh, okay. Take your 700 kamas. \\nIt's this ladder here. Come on!","content.76.9368":"If there is a next time!","content.76.9369":"Okay, it's a deal!","content.76.9370":"We won't let them win!","content.76.9373":"We've finally discovered the marvels in store for us in Oktapodas's Temple!","content.76.9374":"A beautiful adventure, despite the incidents!","content.76.9378":"Oh yes! That seems like the sub I'm looking for!\\nHow much does the voyage cost?","content.76.9379":"What's this about?","content.76.9380":"The Orichalcums... I can't give them to you!","content.76.9381":"I'll bring back your cloudy Moogrr Mimilk as soon as possible!","content.76.9382":"Your sub is impressive! I'll come back!","content.76.9383":"We're going to be able to leave then?!","content.76.9384":"But... I thought the cloudy Moogrr Mimilk was the payment?","content.76.9385":"*You look worriedly toward Milo Tchatch*","content.76.9386":"Well... we don't have a choice, understood!","content.76.9390":"Wow!","content.76.9391":"good validation","content.76.9392":"I'm just looking! Goodbye.","content.76.9393":"I'm in a good mood today; I'll get rid of the Riktus for you.","content.76.9395":"Are you sure your ship floats?","content.76.9396":"Lucky for you your wooden box there is safe and sound...","content.76.9397":"Er... alright!","content.76.9399":"How does it go underwater?","content.76.9400":"Uh... and it comes back up how, exactly?","content.76.9401":"At least this training will be useful to me later!","content.76.9402":"Thank you for the diving license!","content.76.9403":"Off to Oktapodas's Temple!","content.76.9405":"I'll be back with your 500 kamas right away!","content.76.9406":"I'll be back with your 700 kamas right away!","content.76.9407":"Yes, the last one was part of the personal collection of an old sourpuss!","content.76.9408":"You can say that again!","content.76.9409":"Nothing left but to try!","content.76.9410":"It's always good to believe!","content.76.9411":"If it's the cheapest, might as well see it!","content.76.9412":"Cheaper... I lost 500 kamas, and I have to go pay for another service!","content.76.9413":"... possible.","content.76.9414":"You have... strange tastes.","content.76.9415":"And you couldn't have mentioned it sooner!?","content.76.9416":"Don't do anything horrible.","content.76.9417":"I'm impatient.","content.76.9418":"I'm going to go look at the holds!","content.76.9420":"It's this ladder here: Come on!","content.76.9422":"...","content.76.9423":"...","content.76.9424":"...","content.76.9425":"...","content.76.9426":"...","content.76.9427":"...","content.76.9428":"...","content.76.9429":"...","content.76.9430":"...","content.76.9431":"Go on, place the Orichalcums!","content.76.9432":"Yes, finally, and without getting your hands dirty!","content.76.9433":"Yes, after me!","content.76.9434":"Let's go!","content.76.9435":"...","content.76.9436":"...","content.76.9437":"...","content.76.9438":"A way... a way... (You look around)","content.76.9439":"Anyway, we don't have a choice!","content.76.9440":"Understood, I'm ready to experiment! I got it once, so I can do it again!","content.76.9441":"I've had my fair share of emotions, thanks. I'm going to rest first...","content.76.9442":"The Wild Estate! That makes me thirst for adventure; I'll come visit you and the others!","content.76.9443":"Let's go!","content.76.9444":"Not yet, I'm right in the middle of it.","content.76.9445":"Right, let me finish... I'm ready at last!","content.76.9446":"All right... I'll make short work of the lizard.","content.76.9447":"Wha... WHAT?! A Dofus, a real one, for me?","content.76.9448":"Thanks a million!","content.76.9449":"Thank you.","content.76.9450":"I'll head to the heart of the temple.","content.76.9451":"Great, thanks...","content.76.9452":"Yes, agreed, very pretty stones.","content.76.9453":"If that were the case, I wouldn't mind.","content.76.9455":"I'll go and see the submersibles later!","content.76.9456":"Later, maybe.","content.76.9457":"Oh, nothing!","content.76.9458":"The Xelor Dimension? Heh, no... Why, is it important? Travel through time with the \"Xelor's Sandglass\" artifact, you say? Ok, ok, I'll go look for it then...","content.76.9459":"Oh, definitely! Here are the 100,000 kamas!","content.76.9460":"Currently, I'm primarily without-the-Seal-of-Companionship...","content.76.9461":"Erm, no thanks...","content.76.9462":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Spring Gobballs!","content.76.9464":"... (You quietly slip out the back...)","content.76.9467":"I'd like to give you a hand dealing with the Occult Cult Members!","content.76.9493":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.9494":"I want to take care of the Boss! (Quests 36 to 50)","content.76.9495":"It seems you need seeds, right? (Quests 36 to 50)","content.76.9496":"It seems you need resources, right? (Quests 36 to 50)","content.76.9497":"Here are the 10 Crackler Seeds.","content.76.9498":"Here are the 10 Crackler's Gold Tooths.","content.76.9499":"Here are the 10 Moogrr seeds.","content.76.9500":"Here are the 10 bells.","content.76.9501":"Here are the 10 field plant seeds.","content.76.9502":"Here are the 10 country scalps.","content.76.9513":"I want to take care of the Boss! (Quests 51 to 65)","content.76.9514":"It seems you need seeds, right? (Quests 51 to 65)","content.76.9515":"It seems you need resources, right? (Quests 51 to 65)","content.76.9518":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.9519":"Here are the 10 Mother-of-Pearl.","content.76.9520":"Here are the 10 Mollusky Seeds.","content.76.9521":"Here are the 10 Kokoko leaves.","content.76.9522":"Here are the 10 Kokoko seeds.","content.76.9523":"Here are the 10 Stubbyob leathers.","content.76.9524":"Here are the 10 Bitter-Hammer essences.","content.76.9525":"Here are the 10 Wild Wools.","content.76.9526":"Here are the 10 Wild Gobball Seeds.","content.76.9527":"Here are the 10 Bwork Fabrics.","content.76.9528":"Here are the 10 Bwork Seeds.","content.