pell book will probably turn up one day...","content.76.11310":"They slipped out of my grasp at the last moment...","content.76.11311":"They'll be back one day, I'm sure.","content.76.11312":"The Rogues had already gotten rid of the spell book before I arrived{[1*]?:}. But I recovered the most important part, right?","content.76.11313":"I did my job.","content.76.11314":"Until next time.","content.76.11315":"Here are the stolen treasures for the contract.","content.76.11316":"Here are the stolen treasures for the contract.","content.76.11317":"Here are the stolen treasures for the contract.","content.76.11318":"Here are the stolen treasures for the contract.","content.76.11319":"I see. Thanks for the info!","content.76.11320":"I'd like to learn one of your professions!","content.76.11321":"I'd like to learn one of your professions!","content.76.11322":"I see. Thanks for the info!","content.76.11323":"I'd like to learn one of your professions!","content.76.11324":"I see. Thanks for the info!","content.76.11325":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11326":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11327":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11328":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11329":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11330":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11331":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11332":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11333":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11334":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11335":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11336":"What is this place exactly?","content.76.11337":"I'd like to learn one of your professions!","content.76.11338":"I see. Thanks for the info!","content.76.11339":"Here are the 10 Bandit Breaths.","content.76.11340":"Here are the 10 Elite Riktus essences.","content.76.11341":"Here are the 10 James Bombs.","content.76.11342":"Here are the 10 Rogue essences.","content.76.11343":"Here are the 10 dark cloths.","content.76.11344":"Here are the 10 Hoodlum essences.","content.76.11345":"Here are the 10 Stalagmites.","content.76.11346":"Here are the 10 Stalagmote Seeds.","content.76.11347":"I'm going to ask Nina Richa for some information, then.","content.76.11348":"Could I get more information about Nina Richa's contract?","content.76.11349":"It seems you need some help dealing with lumberjacks...","content.76.11350":"Yes, I'm here to settle the matter. Do you know where they went, more or less?","content.76.11351":"Okay, a well-led investigation is underway.","content.76.11352":"I'm here to deliver your 100 sylvan woods.","content.76.11353":"Well, alright... Fortunately, I saved the world in passing at least...","content.76.11354":"Incredible! I'll leave you in peace.","content.76.11355":"I felt a strange call while I was fighting some Treechnids. Was it you?","content.76.11356":"I don't know why, but I don't understand anything you're telling me at all. You don't want to speak face to face?","content.76.11357":"Indeed, but it doesn't interest me any more than that. I'm looking for three lumberjack brothers: Grumble Mouth, Still Book and Fluffy Block. Does that sound familiar?","content.76.11358":"Are Treechnids human?","content.76.11359":"Continue...","content.76.11360":"Well, it's unfortunate for the lumberjacks. How do we fix that now?","content.76.11361":"I imagine this spirit was you.","content.76.11362":"Okay, so where is this Soft Oak right now?","content.76.11363":"There's not a second to lose then!","content.76.11364":"Okay Root, let me handle this.","content.76.11365":"Unless...?","content.76.11366":"... Seriously?","content.76.11367":"I've completed the Nina Richa contract. (You tell the whole story)","content.76.11368":"There you have it. I've freed the Soft Oak.","content.76.11369":"Feel free if you still need a helping hand. See you later!","content.76.11370":"Didn't you used to raise Gobballs?","content.76.11371":"I see... I have another question.","content.76.11372":"I'll leave you to your work, goodbye.","content.76.11373":"What's that castle?","content.76.11374":"Goodbye.","content.76.11375":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.11376":"Can I stand for election too?","content.76.11377":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.11378":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.11379":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.11380":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.11381":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.11382":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.11383":"Can I stand for election too?","content.76.11384":"Oh, so there are laws?","content.76.11385":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.11386":"Can I stand for election too?","content.76.11387":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.11388":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.11389":"And what happens if you get arrested?","content.76.11390":"Ok, I'll be careful. Goodbye.","content.76.11391":"Ok, I'll be careful. Goodbye.","content.76.11392":"What's that castle?","content.76.11393":"Goodbye.","content.76.11394":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.11395":"Can I stand for election too?","content.76.11396":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.11397":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.11398":"What's that castle?","content.76.11399":"Goodbye.","content.76.11400":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.11401":"I can imagine being a good Governor myself...","content.76.11402":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.11403":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.11404":"What's that castle?","content.76.11405":"Goodbye.","content.76.11406":"Can anyone vote?","content.76.11407":"Can I stand for election too?","content.76.11408":"It's all very well having a Governor, but what does he do?","content.76.11409":"Thanks for the information. Goodbye.","content.76.11411":"You wouldn't have a little job for me, would you?","content.76.11412":"Help Old Joe with his Moogrrs? It's as good as done!","content.76.11413":"Humm... On second thought, that doesn't sound very interesting.","content.76.11414":"One way or another, if you need to defeat bad guys, you can always count on me.","content.76.11415":"I've completed the Amakna Mine contract.","content.76.11416":"You got what you deserved, you knew the risks in choosing the wrong path... the path to crime.","content.76.11417":"I'm a little sorry, actually...","content.76.11418":"(Leave her alone)","content.76.11419":"Okay, I'm counting on you!","content.76.11420":"Ah! Now things are getting interesting!","content.76.11422":"(Sum up the story)","content.76.11423":"Of course. I'll take good care of it.","content.76.11424":"Evolving one's Gemlin... that strikes me as a good start.","content.76.11425":"Thanks, Mammy!","content.76.11426":"Did you want to see me?","content.76.11428":"Réponse","content.76.11429":"I am an involved patriot and I'm willing to pay the 2,000 kamas!","content.76.11430":"2,000 kamas! That's too much...","content.76.11431":"A good, dedicated patriot? Well, I think I still have some work to do...","content.76.11432":"I'm not a good patriot and I don't even have the kamas... I'm no where close to having it!{[1*]?:}","content.76.11433":"Actually, I've changed my mind.","content.76.11434":"I would like to procure an Amaknian harness for my petsmounts please.","content.76.11435":"I am an involved patriot and I'm willing to pay the 2,000 kamas!","content.76.11436":"2,000 kamas! That's too much...","content.76.11437":"A good, dedicated patriot? Well, I think I still have some work to do...","content.76.11438":"I'm not a good patriot and I don't even have the kamas... I'm no where close to having it!{[1*]?:}","content.76.11439":"Actually, I've changed my mind.","content.76.11440":"I would like to procure a Bontarian harness for my petsmounts please.","content.76.11441":"I am an involved patriot and I'm willing to pay the 2,000 kamas!","content.76.11442":"2,000 kamas! That's too much...","content.76.11443":"A good, dedicated patriot? Well, I think I still have some work to do...","content.76.11444":"I'm not a good patriot and I don't even have the kamas... I'm no where close to having it!{[1*]?:}","content.76.11445":"Actually, I've changed my mind.","content.76.11446":"I would like to procure a Brakmarian harness for my petsmounts please.","content.76.11447":"I am an involved patriot and I'm willing to pay the 2,000 kamas!","content.76.11448":"2,000 kamas! That's too much...","content.76.11449":"A good, dedicated patriot? Well, I think I still have some work to do...","content.76.11450":"I'm not a good patriot and I don't even have the kamas... I'm no where close to having it!{[1*]?:}","content.76.11451":"Actually, I've changed my mind.","content.76.11452":"I would like to procure a Sufokian harness for my petsmounts please.","content.76.11453":"Here are the 10 commonkore trunks.","content.76.11454":"Here are the 10 Plantala seeds.","content.76.11455":"Here are the 10 Pandissident skins.","content.76.11456":"Here are the 10 Pandissident essences.","content.76.11457":"Here are the 10 Blightopard furs.","content.76.11458":"Here are the 10 Blightopard seeds.","content.76.11459":"Here are the 10 Pandala Ghostoplasms.","content.76.11460":"Here are the 10 Pandala ghost essences.","content.76.11461":"I was sure{[1*]?:} I ran into you there. So, do you have a solution?","content.76.11462":"Okay. I have to go to the University Library.","content.76.11463":"Okay. En route for Frigost!","content.76.11464":"(you tell Otomai about your adventures)","content.76.11465":"That's a lot of work for so few people.","content.76.11466":"What makes you say that?","content.76.11467":"I'd go even further. Justice is highly personal and depends on your senses and your perception of the world.","content.76.11468":"I can believe in one thing: that I'm going to think about it over a big bamboo milk. See you later, Otomai, and thank you for the Plantalacide.","content.76.11469":"There's a bit of a biological issue over in Pandalucia. I thought you might be able to help.","content.76.11470":"I brought the resources needed to make an anti-Plantala solution.","content.76.11471":"What's going on here?","content.76.11472":"I'm off. Enjoy.","content.76.11473":"That seems like a rather tricky situation. I can help you with anything?","content.76.11474":"I'm off. Enjoy.","content.76.11475":"I'll take care of it! See you soon, gramps!","content.76.11476":"I think I'll head out. See you around!","content.76.11477":"I was expecting Pandalucia to be much prettier...","content.76.11478":"Plantalas?","content.76.11479":"I think I'll head out. See you around!","content.76.11480":"Sure. I'll get on it.","content.76.11481":"I brought the stuff to make traps!","content.76.11482":"(take the traps and head out)","content.76.11483":"I set the traps in their places.","content.76.11484":"True. I could take the opportunity to learn a bit more about the monsters.","content.76.11485":"I've gotten rid of the Plantala threat! It seems they were dumping a toxin into the water sources in Pandalucia to activate the curse... This mixture corrupted the bamboo that much more.","content.76.11486":"Thank you, I'd be delighted! (take the bottle, drink it down in one go, then leave)","content.76.11487":"Thank you, but I think I'll pass. (leave without further ado)","content.76.11488":"Do you want a hand?","content.76.11489":"I think I'll head out. See you around!","content.76.11491":"I'll leave you alone.","content.76.11492":"Wait. What's going on here?","content.76.11493":"*you wonder why there are dissidents among the Pandissidents*","content.76.11494":"I'll leave you alone.","content.76.11495":"Very nice! (take your leave)","content.76.11497":"Do you know anything about the Pandissidents? Where exactly do they come from?","content.76.11498":"Can you repeat the information about the Pandissidents?","content.76.11499":"I wonder if I know anyone like that.","content.76.11500":"Do you know anything about the Pandissident village?","content.76.11501":"I see... That \"Pandora\" fellow doesn't seem to have said his last word.","content.76.11502":"I found a dissident in your ranks.","content.76.11503":"He seems to have many followers. Are you willing to risk a civil war in your own clan?","content.76.11504":"Here's what I suggest: I'll silence him, and you leave this village in one season.","content.76.11505":"Very well. I'm off.","content.76.11506":"You call this a forest?","content.76.11507":"I'm off.","content.76.11508":"... And? Are you going to tell me about it?","content.76.11509":"I'm off.","content.76.11510":"About the forest.","content.76.11511":"I'm off.","content.76.11512":"What do you mean, burned?","content.76.11513":"I'm off.","content.76.11514":"I see. I'll get the information somewhere else.","content.76.11515":"I found out that you set the forest on fire yourselves.","content.76.11516":"The Great Spirit?","content.76.11517":"Maybe if I take care of all the Blightopards once and for all, you can replant the forest. Your Great Spirit will be happy, too!","content.76.11519":"Got it. I'll go get the materials.","content.76.11521":"Thanks a lot!","content.76.11522":"I've inspected the entrances... (give your report)","content.76.11525":"Yes.","content.76.11526":"No, I don't see anyone or anything. Bye.","content.76.11527":"Maybe you just need a big bash on the back of your head...","content.76.11528":"Wait... The real world? A threat? I didn't sign up for that. No way. I'm feeling a little targeted when you talk.","content.76.11529":"I didn't quite get that, but okay.","content.76.11530":"Are you some kind of expert in ghost magic?","content.76.11531":"Fine. Noted. I'll go see Lab Elfive.","content.76.11533":"Fine. Gotta go. See you later.","content.76.11534":"Okay, let's do it!","content.76.11535":"I brought the resources needed for the ritual.","content.76.11536":"Good. Let's go.","content.76.11537":"I'm not powerful enough yet. (level 186)","content.76.11538":"I'm not powerful enough yet. (level 171)","content.76.11539":"I'm not powerful enough yet. (level 186)","content.76.11540":"I'm not powerful enough yet. (level 141)","content.76.11541":"I captured a Yokai Ghost. (Hand over the capture stone)","content.76.11542":"So, the ritual?","content.76.11543":"I don't feel that different... But okay!","content.76.11544":"I've completed the ritual, and now I'm ready to face the threat.","content.76.11545":"(Start a fight)","content.76.11546":"Good old Pandiego! This is a good time to pay him a visit.","content.76.11547":"I'd really like to understand what's going on in this cemetery.","content.76.11548":"And then what?","content.76.11550":"Let's hurry and get inside this tomb.","content.76.11551":"Sounds complicated...","content.76.11552":"We can talk more after our mission.","content.76.11555":"Calm will soon return to the cemetery. Now it's time for you to go.","content.76.11556":"No, there's nothing left for you to do here.","content.76.11557":"Ghost Tanukouï San isn't holding you back - you are. You'll always have regrets and attachments here. You won't ever get rid of them. Just reincarnate yourself somewhere else, start a new story, with all new ups and downs.","content.76.11558":"It's a shame you're dead - we could've gone for a drink! I wish I'd gotten to know you sooner, but I'm glad I got to meet you. Goodbye.","content.76.11559":"I'm looking for the perfect weapon to fight Blightopards. (Explain the whole situation)","content.76.11560":"I have the materials you wanted. (Hand over 4 flammable flints, 1,000 powders, and 4 eternal strings)","content.76.11561":"What a fun party that was!","content.76.11562":"Two days ago?! What have I been doing since then...? I can't remember a thing.","content.76.11563":"Otomai...? (Change the subject) So, about bamboo milk, nothing's truly resolved?","content.76.11564":"Who's this Great Spirit again?","content.76.11565":"Count Harebourg may be behind all that.","content.76.11566":"I know what he's capable of, so that wouldn't surprise me. But he hasn't done anything incriminating on Pandalucia, for now at least. Well, I'm off to see Otomai!","content.76.11567":"We have to face facts. Otomai's solution isn't working...","content.76.11568":"We have no choice - we have to turn to your Great Spirit, if he even exists.","content.76.11569":"Okay, let's go!","content.76.11570":"Tell me, Princess Amalia... Have you been to Pandalucia?","content.76.11571":"... But wha...","content.76.11572":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Helmet\".","content.76.11573":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Cloak\".","content.76.11574":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai Initiate's Armor\".","content.76.11575":"Here are the resources for the item.","content.76.11576":"I've changed my mind. Bye.","content.76.11577":"Here are the resources for the item.","content.76.11578":"I've changed my mind - bye.","content.76.11579":"Here are the resources for the item.","content.76.11580":"I've changed my mind. Bye.","content.76.11581":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Helmet\".","content.76.11582":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Cloak\".","content.76.11583":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai Initiate's Armor\".","content.76.11584":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Helmet\".","content.76.11585":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Cloak\".","content.76.11586":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai Initiate's Armor\".","content.76.11587":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Helmet\".","content.76.11588":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Cloak\".","content.76.11589":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Helmet\".","content.76.11590":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Cloak\".","content.76.11591":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Helmet\".","content.76.11592":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Cloak\".","content.76.11593":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Helmet\".","content.76.11594":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Cloak\".","content.76.11595":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Helmet\".","content.76.11596":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Cloak\".","content.76.11597":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Helmet\".","content.76.11598":"I'll ask the Justice Knight for more information in that case.","content.76.11599":"I need to know where I can find the Royal Blibli.","content.76.11600":"I'm not going to back down.","content.76.11601":"Fine. I'm on my way.","content.76.11602":"The Prespics and Bliblis have formed an alliance to survive the poaching.","content.76.11603":"Really? The Bontarian hunters didn't hold back...","content.76.11604":"And what about you? Aren't you doing anything about it? What will you do when all the species have disappeared?","content.76.11605":"Calm down... Can you tell me where the Royal Blibli is now?","content.76.11606":"I'll have to clean the place out, then. Thanks a lot. I'll head for that infamous bridge!","content.76.11607":"I see. Thank you and have a nice day.","content.76.11608":"Isn't there any other way? I need to go there for the Guild of Mercenaries.","content.76.11609":"Thank you very much. I'll be back very soon.","content.76.11610":"I defeated the Royal Blibli.","content.76.11611":"I'm on my way...","content.76.11612":"It was my pleasure. See you around.","content.76.11613":"I've completed the Royal Blibli contract. (Tell the whole story.)","content.76.11614":"Could I get more information about the Sarkophagus contract in the Sidimote Moors?","content.76.11615":"Sure thing. I've had a lot of experience{[1*]?:}{[1*]?:}{[1*]?:} with skeletons. Don't worry about me.","content.76.11616":"Attacking anything that moves isn't what I'd call serene...","content.76.11617":"Do you have any idea how to stop them?","content.76.11618":"I get the feeling you weren't very motivated either... Very well. I'll get to work!","content.76.11619":"Do you have any information about the Chafers?","content.76.11620":"Come on, there are hundreds in this mine. Don't try to tell me you didn't notice anything.","content.76.11621":"Fine. I'll just have to investigate in the mine by myself then.","content.76.11623":"Hi. You wouldn't happen to have any information on the mine Chafers for me, would you?","content.76.11624":"(Show the miner's journal and explain what's in it.)","content.76.11625":"Oh, yes, I understand. Ordering Brakmarians to work themselves to death every day must have been very difficult.","content.76.11626":"I don't see any miners today. What happened to them?","content.76.11627":"You have my word. Tell me everything.","content.76.11628":"So, the Chafer soldiers in the Sidimote Moors are...","content.76.11629":"Wow. If that had happened to me, I'd be haunting the region, too.","content.76.11630":"Coward. I hope your actions haunt you until the end of your life.","content.76.11631":"Whatever. I might have done the same thing in your shoes.","content.76.11632":"I've completed the Chafer contract.","content.76.11633":"(Pretend to laugh, then leave.)","content.76.11634":"Hi, Pandiego. Say, I ran into Amalia recently... She's eight years old and has never left the Sadida Kingdom. I have trouble believing she really saved Pandalucia from the Thirsters!","content.76.11635":"I think we've got a problem, and I need your help. And I haven't been drinking recently. Well... not a lot, anyway.","content.76.11636":"My name is [#name] and it's the year 976.","content.76.11637":"All right, let's go see him! Head to Astrub.","content.76.11638":"I'd like you to meet someone...","content.76.11639":"Excuse me, have you ever been to Pandalucia?","content.76.11640":"It just so happens that I've taken a mercenary contract or three in my life.","content.76.11641":"OK, I'll be there right away...","content.76.11642":"I'd need more information. I'm looking for the Count of Frigost. Goes by the name of Harebourg.","content.76.11643":"Uh, Farle, do you not realize who you're talking to? Mercenary quests? Me? I've already done everything here! *put pressure on Farle*","content.76.11644":"Thank you, I'll head there now.","content.76.11645":"I've completed a mercenary contract.","content.76.11646":"Hello, I've come to talk to you about Count Harebourg.","content.76.11647":"What exactly is his plan?","content.76.11648":"Any idea where he might have gone?","content.76.11649":"Thanks a lot, Alibert. Really. See you later.","content.76.11651":"Excuse me, have you ever been to Pandalucia?","content.76.11653":"You wouldn't happen to have seen a slightly crazy Xelor with a sinister laugh and a plan to conquer the world, would you?","content.76.11654":"What do you mean? Alibert told me you were head of the armies here.","content.76.11655":"OK. Well, now you've got me curious. What's the story?","content.76.11656":"Getting back to Count Harebourg, would you be able to point me to someone with information about him?","content.76.11657":"After all, a bit of public service never hurt anyone.","content.76.11658":"It just so happens that I've already completed a mercenary contract.","content.76.11659":"Yes, I've completed a mercenary quest. And yeah, it's not exactly fun times over in Bonta.","content.76.11660":"Fill his cup with the good stuff, eh?... Wine? Stay right there, I'll be back in a minute!","content.76.11662":"Have you got a minute? I have a few questions for you about the Xelor you ran into...","content.76.11663":"Excuse me, have you ever been to Pandalucia?","content.76.11664":"Excuse me, have you ever been to Pandalucia?","content.76.11665":"Excuse me, have you ever been to Pandalucia?","content.76.11666":"I'm actually looking for Count Harebourg. Do you know if he's been through here?","content.76.11667":"Let me guess: I'll need to complete a mercenary quest to win your trust. I'll be right back.","content.76.11668":"Not so fast, Viscus. This isn't my first time in Brakmar{[1*]?:}. I've already had the \"pleasure\" of visiting certain regions.","content.76.11669":"Charles-Henri... I wasn't looking forward to crossing paths with him again.","content.76.11671":"Charles-Henri... I wasn't looking forward to meeting him.","content.76.11672":"I completed a mercenary contract in Brakmar.","content.76.11673":"Fancy meeting you here...","content.76.11674":"We've never met, but I need to learn more about Count Harebourg.","content.76.11675":"I'm not really as interested in you today as I am in Count Harebourg. I know he was here. What was he looking for? And why?","content.76.11676":"I have a proposition for you. We can either talk about the Chafers at the Morbax Neplopolis... which, by the way, I know all about... Or we can talk about Count Harebourg. I know he was here. What was he looking for? And why?","content.76.11677":"Get to the point.","content.76.11678":"He didn't notice anything?","content.76.11679":"Do you know where I can find him? Did he leave an address or something?","content.76.11680":"Thank you for coming. I know this is going to be a tough fight, but with you by our side, we have a chance.","content.76.11681":"After this battle, let's go visit the city.","content.76.11682":"Okay, so, one, I can't hear you. Two, we need to talk about the fact that you came here with a rock. And five... There is no five.","content.76.11683":"Don't mention it. I'm glad you're here. I'm counting on you to stay safe and sound!","content.76.11684":"Kabrok... It's always an honor to be able to count on you. I hope everything's going well at the shop.","content.76.11685":"I understand. Living a normal life, doing normal things... I could never get used to that. And I wish I could, I really do. I wish I could just push a button that would let me enjoy a peaceful life.","content.76.11686":"If you're looking for adventure, you've already got a horde of Mechas to fight off and a city to save. That's already plenty, right? I'll let you get ready.","content.76.11687":"To be honest{[1*]?:}, I wasn't sure you'd agree to come. I thought you were stuck watching spores and preventing contamination...","content.76.11688":"All right, well, if everything's fine in Ohwymi, at least one island is doing okay. I'll let you get ready. Don't put yourself in too much danger, the spores need you!","content.76.11689":"Sure, I'll give you back the Ocarina for the battle. Mimi, I really appreciate your help! Thanks so much for coming. I don't know where the archaosologists are, and I don't really have time to go looking for them. And by the way, you were none too easy to find either...","content.76.11690":"I originally came looking for the Wa Wabbit, but he's nowhere to be found... At least with you, I didn't come back empty-handed{[1*]?:}. Take care!","content.76.11691":"There's only one way to find out...","content.76.11692":"It feels like we're getting closer to some real answers. We both want to know what's going on with this temporal anomaly on Pandalucia. Let's stay alive long enough to make Count Harebourg spill the beans!","content.76.11693":"I couldn't stand it if anything bad happened to you, so please try to stay alive.","content.76.11694":"Thanks, Tovak. I'm glad{[1*]?:} I'll be able to rely on you.","content.76.11695":"It won't be an easy fight, so keep an eye out, an eye that works! I'm counting on you!","content.76.11696":"You're a monster. I'll keep an eye on you during the battle, and don't even try to hide from me.","content.76.11697":"I'm ready{[1*]?:}.","content.76.11699":"What's a prince like you doing in such a dangerous area?","content.76.11700":"*You politely step away from the Sadida with the stinky breath*","content.76.11702":"Aren't you the popular one...","content.76.11703":"I should go. Take care of yourself, Prince Armand.","content.76.11704":"Wait a minute... If you don't like Arachnees, what are you doing here?","content.76.11705":"I'll leave you be.","content.76.11706":"Come on, let's head back to the village. I'll go with you.","content.76.11707":"I'll leave you be.","content.76.11708":"What about if I kill all the Arachnees, will that do?","content.76.11709":"I'll leave you be.","content.76.11710":"Fine, figure something out...","content.76.11711":"I promise I'll be careful.","content.76.11712":"You'll get what's coming to you. Fortunately for you, I have other things to do.","content.76.11713":"I'm sorry to have disturbed you. I won't take advantage of your kindness any longer.","content.76.11714":"Your Majesty, I know this may seem like an impertinent question, but can you tell me whether you, or your late wife when she was alive, ever had any contact with a certain... Count Harebourg?","content.76.11715":"I'd like a word with you.","content.76.11716":"Don't worry, I know Count Harebourg sent you. In fact, I'm actually your newest ally!","content.76.11717":"No, please, go ahead, it's quite fascinating, really.","content.76.11718":"(Start a fight)","content.76.11719":"Your Highness! The danger from the south, the Bubourgs, the deforestation... It was all orchestrated by Count Harebourg!","content.76.11720":"Your Highness?","content.76.11721":"But... It's all true! I...","content.76.11722":"... Well, don't say I didn't warn you. Next time, you can figure things out with him on your own!","content.76.11723":"Before we go any further, I need to talk to you about something.","content.76.11724":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11725":"I dunno, I didn't really think that much about it. Let's just forget about it.","content.76.11726":"I flipped a kama to decide.","content.76.11727":"Even if Chad wanted to protect us, he still sold us out to the enemy. He got what he deserved.","content.76.11728":"I couldn't stand the thought of losing you. I would have sacrificed anything to protect you.","content.76.11729":"I did it for the World of Twelve. You're more important than you think.","content.76.11730":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11731":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11732":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11733":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11734":"Listen, Pandora. I don't know what kind of answer you were expecting, but I'm not here to soften you up with a bunch of sweet talk. We have responsibilities here, a world in grave danger, and a divine power to manage. You're much more important than some Sram double agent.","content.76.11735":"Pandora... If we don't do something, the whole world will be lost. It's our responsibility to create a world where people like you and me won't have to take up arms to go off and fight monsters. We have to stop Ogrest, we have to stop Harebourg, and we have to stop the decline of our World. So let's get back to work. The sooner we finish, the sooner you'll get a vacation!","content.76.11736":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11737":"Let's start there. It's a good opportunity for a little punitive strike.","content.76.11742":"Before we go any further, I need to talk to you about something.","content.76.11743":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11746":"I dunno, I didn't really think that much about it. Let's just forget about it.","content.76.11747":"I flipped a kama to decide.","content.76.11748":"Pandora stole the power of the gods. She was dangerous. She got what she deserved.","content.76.11749":"I couldn't stand the thought of losing you. I would have sacrificed anything to protect you.","content.76.11750":"Heh heh heh... To be honest, I didn't mind seeing her die.","content.76.11751":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11752":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11753":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11754":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11755":"Like I said, I'm looking for someone called Count Harebourg. All I know is that he's somewhere in the Divine Dimensions.","content.76.11756":"Get to the point.","content.76.11757":"...","content.76.11758":"Wait!... Okay, we'll talk about the hows and whys later. Damn, that Chad still holds his cards as close to his chest as ever...","content.76.11759":"I need your help breaking into a prison...","content.76.11760":"I'll take care of those Boowolves. But I need your help, my prince... You could point me in the right direction. Do you know anything about those weird creatures?","content.76.11761":"Thank you, Prince Armand.","content.76.11762":"My king, I doubt the Boowolves could've escaped the Sadida prisons on their own... I think they received outside help.","content.76.11763":"I don't know, I'll keep investigating. Maybe I'll find some answers.","content.76.11764":"(Describe your expedition in the Boowolf Dungeon)","content.76.11765":"I found your Boowolf expert...","content.76.11766":"Don't get too excited... The expert, first name Milkar, was actually a Moowolf. He was the one that helped the Boowolves break out of jail. The clearing should be peaceful again now!","content.76.11767":"It was nothing. Farewell, Your Highness.","content.76.11768":"Say, did a \"Boowolf expert\" and some Sadida guards pass by recently?","content.76.11769":"Say, did a \"Boowolf expert\" and some Sadida guards pass by recently?","content.76.11770":"I promise I'll be careful.","content.76.11771":"Here are the 10 Gerbean skins.","content.76.11772":"Here are the 10 Gerbean seeds.","content.76.11773":"Here are the 10 Bubourg claws.","content.76.11774":"Here are the 10 Bubourg seeds.","content.76.11775":"I need your help breaking into a prison...","content.76.11776":"You really don't have anything for me?","content.76.11777":"That's what I'm looking for! Let's do it!","content.76.11778":"Everything will work out!","content.76.11779":"I brought 40 night chestnuts!","content.76.11780":"I brought 40 Blightopard totems!","content.76.11781":"I brought 40 Tanukouï's testicools!","content.76.11782":"I brought 10 Nogord Wungleezared scales!","content.76.11783":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Helmet\".","content.76.11784":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai's Scouts Cloak\".","content.76.11785":"I'd like to recover the item \"Otomai Initiate's Armor\".","content.76.11786":"I'd like you to come with me.","content.76.11787":"Don't get too excited... The expert, first name Milkar, was actually a Moowolf. He was the one that helped the Boowolves break out of jail.","content.76.11788":"That monster proved too strong for me. It seems to be using a tool to weaken its enemies. I decided on a strategic retreat...","content.76.11789":"Farewell, Your Highness.","content.76.11790":"(Tell Otomai everything)","content.76.11791":"It's the real deal, Otomai. Harebourg wasn't lying... I saw it firsthand. We're facing a new kind of danger!","content.76.11793":"Oh yeah... Should I come back later then?","content.76.11794":"Do you think they need to be warned? Xelor seems to be aware, but maybe not the others.","content.76.11795":"Okay... I don't really have much else to do, after all.","content.76.11806":"I need to travel to other dimensions. Will you help me?","content.76.11807":"Hey there Pandora, are you doing okay?","content.76.11808":"So, what's new?","content.76.11809":"What are the Watchers again? I kind of forgot...","content.76.11810":"How were the Watchers created?","content.76.11811":"So... you can travel through time, right?","content.76.11812":"I'm fine.","content.76.11813":"...","content.76.11814":"(Change the subject)","content.76.11815":"(Change the subject)","content.76.11816":"What are the Watchers?","content.76.11817":"I didn't know any of that! So what's it all about?","content.76.11818":"I can't believe there were people like you to keep watch.","content.76.11819":"We'll eventually find her, don't worry.","content.76.11820":"(Change the subject)","content.76.11821":"How were the Watchers created?","content.76.11822":"Okay.","content.76.11823":"(Change the subject)","content.76.11824":"So... you can travel through time, right?","content.76.11825":"When you put it that way, it sounds quite simple. I wonder if other Twelvians have already looked into the matter.","content.76.11826":"I'd like to help you, but I don't have any leads either. We're really at the starting point... I hope Otomai will find a solution.","content.76.11827":"Have you heard from Chad?","content.76.11828":"Chad and I were wondering if you could go with us on the adventure.","content.76.11829":"(Change the subject)","content.76.11830":"(Change the subject)","content.76.11831":"Could you at least open a portal to a Divine Dimension for me?","content.76.11832":"Neat! I always dreamed of going to \"my\" dimension.","content.76.11833":"Okay, sounds like a good start to me.","content.76.11834":"The portal doesn't seem very stable. What can we do? (Daily Quest)","content.76.11835":"Here, I've filled the Wakfu harvester so we can use it to fuel the machine. (Daily Quest)","content.76.11836":"What's new?","content.76.11837":"What do you know about the Watchers?","content.76.11838":"I'll be off. See you around.","content.76.11839":"I see. Do you want to band together?","content.76.11840":"You weren't the only ones.","content.76.11841":"I see.","content.76.11842":"I see.","content.76.11843":"Come on, you're a good, honest person. The bottom line is that this whole experience has made you a little calmer and wiser, which can't hurt. I hope you'll enjoy the peaceful life you seek.","content.76.11844":"Come on, you're a good, honest person. The bottom line is that this whole experience has made you a little calmer and wiser, which can't hurt. I hope you'll enjoy the peaceful life you seek.","content.76.11845":"I'll be off. See you around.","content.76.11846":"You're an engineering genius and a true master of riddles. Why did you have so much trouble with the whole door thing?","content.76.11847":"I hope you'll find peace.","content.76.11850":"Gotta go. See you later.","content.76.11851":"(Realize that she seems to have changed a lot)","content.76.11852":"What brings you here?","content.76.11853":"So you're from the future? I'm starting to get confused. I already saw a Pandora from the future, but in the past...","content.76.11854":"Those were indeed the days! *You encourage Pandora to take the time she needs*","content.76.11855":"Okay.","content.76.11856":"And what else? *You've got no time to lose*","content.76.11857":"I think so, yes.","content.76.11858":"No wait, I'll do some other stuff first.","content.76.11859":"Well, I didn't know that!","content.76.11860":"(Expect the worst)","content.76.11861":"...","content.76.11862":"But I don't understand! What exactly is this threat?","content.76.11863":"How so? How can that be the case? I don't understand.","content.76.11864":"Surely there's a way to fight them...","content.76.11865":"There has to be a way...","content.76.11866":"What do you mean?","content.76.11867":"Okay.","content.76.11868":"You're starting to sound like Harebourg.","content.76.11869":"So, there's no plan? There's no way out? Everything will disappear in a few years' time?","content.76.11870":"\"Yes\", errr, no. I refuse.","content.76.11871":"Say always.","content.76.11872":"Oh yeah... So you're going to leave me wanting more. I can wait.","content.76.11873":"Okay, very well. Let's go! Where is he?","content.76.11874":"Four dungeons and a bit of scrap metal? You were right to ask me! I'm the{[1*]?:} specialist!","content.76.11875":"No worries.","content.76.11876":"You be careful.","content.76.11877":"Four dungeons and a bit of scrap metal? You were right to ask me! I'm the{[1*]?:} specialist!","content.76.11878":"What do I have to do?","content.76.11879":"(Observe Pandora)","content.76.11880":"I found the ore!","content.76.11881":"Okay, I'll get back to it!","content.76.11882":"Okay, I'll get back to it!","content.76.11883":"I found all the plans.","content.76.11884":"I'm looking for a rather unusual ore. I hear you're a specialist.","content.76.11885":"I defeated the Osamodas dolls.","content.76.11886":"Say, you're a... miner dragon, right?","content.76.11887":"I've got to go. You look like someone I know and it's a little unnerving...","content.76.11888":"Okay. I'll deal with it.","content.76.11889":"It's a pleasure.","content.76.11890":"How so?","content.76.11891":"A miner dragon, I... no, I mean...","content.76.11892":"So you're a minor major miner dragon then?","content.76.11893":"Oh, my mistake. Well, I've got to go. I still have some... quests to complete, and whatnot. Goodbye!","content.76.11894":"I've got the plans AND the ore.","content.76.11895":"Can I get some rest first?","content.76.11896":"Errr... alright. What do I have to do?","content.76.11897":"Okay, that's what I'll do. (Take a nap)","content.76.11906":"Okay, that's what I'll do. (Take a nap)","content.76.11907":"It wasn't just ore and plans to collect, was it? You've had your share of adventures too, judging by the state of your clothes. You're not alone. Let me help you.","content.76.11908":"(Sympathize) That must have been hard for you, right?","content.76.11909":"(Put things into perspective) It's true that if you'd told me, I'd probably have wanted to do it for you.","content.76.11910":"(Persist) You still could have told me. We're a team, so we're supposed to work together.","content.76.11911":"It'll be okay. We'll get there, whatever it takes. The stakes are too high to give up now.","content.76.11912":"I'm starting to think this whole \"plans\" and \"sacrifices\" thing just shows there's an evil spirit.","content.76.11913":"Come on, let's get to work on those keys. (Craft the keys)","content.76.11914":"Come on, let's get to work on those keys. (Craft the keys)","content.76.11915":"It'll be okay. We'll get there, whatever it takes. The stakes are too high to give up now.","content.76.11916":"I'm starting to think this whole \"plans\" and \"sacrifices\" thing just shows there's an evil spirit.","content.76.11917":"Come on, let's get to work on those keys. (Craft the keys)","content.76.11918":"(Wake up)","content.76.11919":"(Get up)","content.76.11920":"Aren't you coming?","content.76.11921":"Alright, I'm off. Wish me luck.","content.76.11923":"(Finish crafting the keys)","content.76.11924":"(Look at Pandora)","content.76.11925":"Aren't you coming with me?","content.76.11926":"Come on, Pandora. You don't have to do everything yourself all the time.","content.76.11927":"Alright, I'm off. Wish me luck.","content.76.11928":"Hi! I know we don't know each other, but I need your help.","content.76.11929":"Hello, Mishell. I need your help.","content.76.11930":"(Explain the situation)","content.76.11931":"I really need to get there. It's very important. Can I do something for you in exchange?","content.76.11932":"A monster you've never seen before? I bet there are plenty in the Osamodas Dimension. Help me get there first, and I'll get you one.","content.76.11933":"Ah, not a bad idea. Thanks a lot. I'll give it a try.","content.76.11934":"(Explain the situation)","content.76.11935":"Yes, yes, thanks again. See you soon!","content.76.11936":"I met Osamodas...","content.76.11937":"He seemed to already know about the whole thing. He gave me a gift. Do you know what it is?","content.76.11938":"This whole dimension was like a kind of big laboratory.","content.76.11939":"I see. So that's what it was.","content.76.11940":"I'm not sure{[1*]?:}...","content.76.11941":"I'm starting to understand, yes.","content.76.11942":"Oh, right! (Understand)","content.76.11943":"Oh, right! (Remain at a loss, but agree anyway)","content.76.11944":"That's smart.","content.76.11945":"I see. What do I have to do?","content.76.11946":"(Hold out the god Osamodas's feather to Pandora)","content.76.11947":"Not at all. You bring hope to all of us.","content.76.11948":"I don't like it, but whatever it takes.","content.76.11949":"So, I guess I'll hear from you again when the time comes?","content.76.11950":"Okay.","content.76.11951":"Do you need help with those other things you were talking about?","content.76.11952":"Okay.","content.76.11953":"See you later.","content.76.11954":"I want to take care of the Boss! (Quests 201 to 215)","content.76.11955":"It seems you need seeds, right? (Quests 201 to 215)","content.76.11956":"It seems you need resources, right? (Quests 201 to 215)","content.76.11957":"Here are the 10 Vandalophrenic leathers.","content.76.11958":"Here are the 10 Vandalophrenic seeds.","content.76.11959":"Here are the 10 Sunsloth epicuticles.","content.76.11960":"Here are the 10 Sunsloth seeds.","content.76.11961":"Here are the 10 Sirius pincers.","content.76.11962":"Here are the 10 Crabstacean seeds.","content.76.11963":"Here are the 10 Tundrazor leathers.","content.76.11964":"Here are the 10 Tundrazor seeds.","content.76.11971":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.11972":"I want to get the quest \"Scoreboard: Bosses 186 to 230\".","content.76.11973":"(Look around) Where exactly are we?","content.76.11974":"You belong to the Guild of Hunters?","content.76.11975":"I've changed my mind.","content.76.11976":"In that case, I'd be happy to help you.","content.76.11978":"I see.","content.76.11979":"There's something I don't understand: Aren't dolls supposed to be, you know, the god Sadida's sort of thing?","content.76.11980":"Alright, I see. Thanks.","content.76.11981":"What exactly is this place?","content.76.11986":"I must go now, oh great god Osamodas. (Rub your ears painfully)","content.76.11987":"I see.","content.76.11988":"I'd like more information about the waves...","content.76.11989":"What does that mean, in a nutshell?","content.76.11990":"What should I expect once the fight's started?","content.76.11991":"What are the rewards?","content.76.11993":"Actually, I'll leave you be.","content.76.11994":"Ask more questions.","content.76.11995":"Ask more questions.","content.76.11996":"Ask more questions.","content.76.11998":"15 rounds.","content.76.11999":"25 rounds.","content.76.12000":"35 rounds.","content.76.12001":"1.","content.76.12002":"11.","content.76.12003":"21.","content.76.12004":"31.","content.76.12005":"41.","content.76.12006":"(Start the fight)","content.76.12007":"(Enter the Dimensional Voyager House and rest)","content.76.12008":"(Wake up)","content.76.12009":"A moment in the past.","content.76.12010":"Your dream.","content.76.12011":"The coming day.","content.76.12012":"*You get the feeling this day could be... a long one*","content.76.12013":"Yeah...","content.76.12014":"Alright, I'll meet you there.","content.76.12015":"All I did was keep our part of the deal.","content.76.12016":"It was great! There were such powerful creatures. They were created to...","content.76.12017":"I didn't like that Vandalophrenic much. But there were some really powerful creatures! They were designed to...","content.76.12018":"Anyway, it was really nice. I gotta go now. *You start to leave*","content.76.12019":"(Obey Mishell)","content.76.12020":"(Keep listening)","content.76.12021":"How so?","content.76.12022":"A few, yes...","content.76.12023":"Not usually. But there are times when I feel a bit ill when I get into fights with monsters.","content.76.12024":"Never heard of it.","content.76.12025":"If you wanted to reassure me, you failed. Well, the day is just beginning, so there'll surely be some good news.","content.76.12027":"Hey, Mallory. I'm back from the Osamosa Dimension...","content.76.12028":"I picked up their trail in a village... but it was already deserted. The portal closed because there wasn't enough energy to keep it open, and they disappeared.","content.76.12029":"I'm sorry{[1*]?:}...","content.76.12031":"(Leave)","content.76.12032":"No. Mendrock was the only Voyager whose body was found.","content.76.12033":"Hey, Arturo.","content.76.12034":"I'm sorry{[1*]?:}...","content.76.12035":"Who was Serge?","content.76.12036":"I'm sorry{[1*]?:} if it's a painful question.","content.76.12037":"I don't quite follow.","content.76.12038":"I'm sorry{[1*]?:}...","content.76.12039":"The Shhhudoku Kingdom is a funny place, kind of like a big Crackler.","content.76.12040":"Gotta go. See you later.","content.76.12041":"The god Osamodas should have taken his cue from this one instead of that tiny thing he showed me the other day...","content.76.12042":"Really?","content.76.12043":"It's staggering. There are all these changes in our own universe, and no one realizes it...","content.76.12044":"What are we doing here then?","content.76.12045":"Okay.","content.76.12046":"Say, do you often get involved like that in Twelvians' business?","content.76.12047":"Good. I'll get going!","content.76.12048":"Hi. I heard about the \"Whisperers' melody\". Do you have any information about it?","content.76.12049":"Hi. I heard about the \"Whisperers' melody\". Do you have any information about it?","content.76.12050":"Oh, I see. I should probably help you sort out your troubles first.","content.76.12051":"Who?","content.76.12052":"Um, I left him in a bad way. I hope he'll be willing to talk to me... Thank you!","content.76.12053":"Is the water nice?","content.76.12054":"I gotta go, see ya.","content.76.12055":"*You decide to dip your hand in to see for yourself*","content.76.12056":"You're insane! Get out of there right now! The water's hot enough to boil a Gobbalrog!","content.76.12057":"That's if your muscles haven't melted away by the time you get out of your bath!","content.76.12058":"I didn't want to know... If I bring you some clothes, will it be enough to convince you to come out?","content.76.12059":"*Seeing the Scramshells around you gives you an idea*\\nHey. Did you know that Rykke Errel wore Scramshell shells during his training? They're really heavy, you know. What's more, Master Rykke Errel had everyone call him Smashing Scramshell!","content.76.12060":"Don't go anywhere; I'll get you a shell or two.","content.76.12061":"Say, I'm trying to make a little outfit out of Scramshell shells. I already have some shells, but I'm looking for a fabric that's strong enough to fasten them onto. Got any advice?","content.76.12062":"Sorry, what's that?","content.76.12063":"Sorry, I don't have the background... What's this about silting up?","content.76.12064":"Let me guess, the water's rising?","content.76.12065":"(Keep listening)","content.76.12066":"I see, and you accidentally deposited sand where the Scramshells live?","content.76.12067":"That ridge thing sounds like it was a pretty bad idea overall. It wasn't like that before, was it?","content.76.12068":"(Agree)","content.76.12069":"You got that right...","content.76.12070":"I see.","content.76.12071":"Great! And where can these toads be found?","content.76.12072":"Yeah, well, me neither...","content.76.12073":"That'd be a good thing. Thanks for the info. See you later!","content.76.12074":"Okay. Do you remember which way he went?","content.76.12075":"I see. Thanks for the information.","content.76.12076":"Be patient a little longer, my friend. I'll be back soon!","content.76.12077":"Say, you didn't see a toad around here by any chance?","content.76.12078":"Here, I was able to make your outfit.","content.76.12079":"Have you heard of the Whisperers' melody?","content.76.12080":"Is it true? Tell me, where is the sheet music?","content.76.12081":"Drats... back to square one...","content.76.12082":"What was it then?","content.76.12083":"Great. Thank you!","content.76.12084":"I found seven notes of the melody, but I don't have the last one... It looks like the stele is stuck behind a rockslide... And that's not all. I feel really weird, like I'm... Well, I feel a kind of tingling sensation in my body. Aand strange presences on this island.","content.76.12085":"Uh, what's that?","content.76.12086":"How could I forget you? I'm happy{[1*]?:} to see you! Plus, you look well.","content.76.12087":"Thanks a lot, you're the best! But you shouldn't stay long. I think some adventurers will want to attack you if they see you. You look like a completely different dragon.","content.76.12088":"Bye, and take care!","content.76.12089":"We've found the whole melody. What's next?","content.76.12090":"You still don't want to tell me more about this great plan, do you?","content.76.12091":"Go on!","content.76.12092":"So far, I'm with you, more or less.","content.76.12093":"(Agree but remain skeptical{[1*]?:})","content.76.12094":"Okay, I see. I must admit I'm not a{[1*]?:} big{[1*]?:} fan of Xelor's tinkering with people's fates to that extent. He seems to get some kind of sick enjoyment out of it.","content.76.12095":"Yeah... Can you refresh my memory? What's all this about the gods' knowledge again?","content.76.12096":"I see. What's that exactly?","content.76.12097":"What exactly are you thinking?","content.76.12098":"It's rather abstract.","content.76.12099":"Okay... Um, I'm not quite sure how to do that, but I'll give it a try.","content.76.12100":"Sounds good.","content.76.12101":"(Keep scanning the horizon)","content.76.12102":"(Keep scanning the horizon)","content.76.12103":"(Think it's fate)","content.76.12104":"(Think it's your skill)","content.76.12105":"(Think it's luck)","content.76.12106":"(Think it's your determination, your desire)","content.76.12107":"(Think it's your legacy)","content.76.12108":"(Head out)","content.76.12109":"(Head out)","content.76.12110":"(Head out)","content.76.12111":"(Head out)","content.76.12112":"(Head out)","content.76.12113":"(Head out)","content.76.12114":"(Head out)","content.76.12115":"The Scramshells? It wasn't a picnic, I must say.","content.76.12116":"Oh? So that's why I feel different{[1*]?:}. But I don't feel more powerful{[1*]?:}.","content.76.12117":"Okay, I'll meet you at the stele.","content.76.12118":"Okay, I'm off.","content.76.12119":"Is it even on this island?","content.76.12120":"That's weird. When I see the effect these little fragments had on classic monsters, I don't dare imagine what they could do if someone got hold of them.","content.76.12121":"Can we talk?","content.76.12122":"I really need you. It's to save the world.","content.76.12123":"(Fight)","content.76.12124":"I'm kind of getting the plan along the way, if you like... so... Right now, I'm not quite sure what to do. Even if I get the gods' power from the Last Voyager.","content.76.12125":"It's kind of like mission impossible, isn't it? I tried to face Ogrest and he, how can I put it... disembodied{[1*]?:} me so well that I... well...","content.76.12126":"Really?","content.76.12127":"In fact, I already met him in the Forgotten Dimension. He saved me from Ogrest's Wrath.","content.76.12128":"Actually, I've never seen him. Who exactly is Aguabrial? What kind of dragon should I expect?","content.76.12129":"I thought dragons were immortal.","content.76.12130":"Oh, right.","content.76.12131":"Uh, how exactly does one get a Dofus?","content.76.12132":"I have to tell you something. I'm not much of a specialist when it comes to seducing dragons and all that.","content.76.12133":"Charm? That gives me an idea. Alright, let's split up!","content.76.12134":"Where is Pandora?","content.76.12135":"I don't understand what you're telling me... but Pandora is my friend. You'd better not touch so much as a hair on her head!","content.76.12136":"Then you have something in common... Do Dimensional Voyagers always have to be so mysterious? Is it a job requirement?","content.76.12137":"I don't really have time to chat with you.","content.76.12138":"Is that your plan? (Get ready to fight)","content.76.12139":"Well, what do we have to do now?","content.76.12140":"Alright, I'll meet you there.","content.76.12141":"Hello, Mishell. I brought you a cute little fox from the Osamodas Dimension!","content.76.12142":"If you wanted to reassure me, you failed. Well, the day is just beginning, so there'll surely be some good news.","content.76.12143":"Um, I left him in a bad way. I hope he'll be willing to talk to me... Thank you!","content.76.12144":"Okay, I'll meet you at the stele.","content.76.12145":"I'm fine, how are you?","content.76.12146":"(Wait for the rest)","content.76.12147":"So your plan is to kill the gods?","content.76.12148":"How so?","content.76.12149":"That's a bit extreme...","content.76.12150":"I'm not sure{[1*]?:} mortals can exist without the power of the gods and their wisdom to guide them.","content.76.12151":"You're wrong about everything. The Primordial Dofus created harmony. Your plan will destroy everything that was done right over the last few millennia... ","content.76.12152":"You're wrong about everything. The Primordial Dofus created harmony. Your plan will destroy everything that was done right over the last few millennia... ","content.76.12153":"You're wrong about everything. The Primordial Dofus created harmony. Your plan will destroy everything that was done right over the last few millennia... ","content.76.12154":"At least I'm thinking straight. I know you must be stopped, even though I didn't understand everything in your story.","content.76.12155":"That was when...","content.76.12156":"Is Pandora dead?","content.76.12157":"The train of your provocations runs on the rails of my indifference.","content.76.12158":"What is this place?","content.76.12159":"You seem to have a grudge against the god Xelor, don't you?","content.76.12160":"Here are the 10 Scramshell leathers.","content.76.12161":"Here are the 10 Scramshell seeds.","content.76.12162":"Here are the 10 Plantiguard tufts.","content.76.12163":"Here are the 10 Plantiguard seeds.","content.76.12164":"Here are the 10 Small Orange Snappers.","content.76.12165":"Here are the 10 Pingwin seeds.","content.76.12166":"I'm not sure{[1*]?:} mortals can exist without the power of the gods and their wisdom to guide them.","content.76.12167":"I'm not sure{[1*]?:} mortals can exist without the power of the gods and their wisdom to guide them.","content.76.12168":"Good. I'll get going!","content.76.12169":"You're welcome! But tell me, have you heard of the Whisperers' melody?","content.76.12170":"You're welcome!","content.76.12171":"I should probably help that poor Iop get out of the spring first...","content.76.12172":"Have you heard of the Whisperers' melody?","content.76.12173":"That'd be a good thing. Thanks for the info. See you later!","content.76.12174":"I didn't want to know that... I've gotta go, bye.","content.76.12175":"(Tell Otomai everything)","content.76.12176":"I completed the Plantiguard quest.","content.76.12177":"I completed the Pingwin quest.","content.76.12178":"I'm just passing through. Good day!","content.76.12179":"I'd like you to give me a bottle.","content.76.12180":"Yes... I... I don't know what came over me. Sorry{[1*]?:}. No, wait, I really need your bottle to do something with it.","content.76.12181":"I see. Seeing as you're getting the bears on your side, I was thinking I could borrow a little bit of it to make my way into the area.","content.76.12182":"You wouldn't think they were that civilized.","content.76.12183":"How so? What kind of species doesn't feed its children?","content.76.12184":"I think I like his style...","content.76.12185":"Oh yes, he doesn't look very approachable.","content.76.12186":"He's not the kind of monster I'd go and slap on the back before inviting him for a drink, if you get my drift.","content.76.12187":"Really, I think he and I have a lot in common.","content.76.12188":"If he can talk, theoretically, we can reason with him.","content.76.12189":"Where's the dungeon? *You ready your weapons*","content.76.12190":"I accept. The teddies just need to behave!","content.76.12191":"I'm not sure if the world deserves to be saved.","content.76.12193":"But I'm... going around in circles. I feel like I'm just good at killing monsters, and even stronger monsters after that, but the world doesn't seem to... heal. I don't feel like it's getting any better.","content.76.12194":"I feel like this struggle is futile. The more I persevere, the less I can save things. And now even Pandora is gone. It's so frustrating.","content.76.12195":"Thank you for your advice, Otomai.","content.76.12196":"I need to talk.","content.76.12197":"I faced Aguabrial briefly, but he backed out. He told me to meet him on the Mount Zinit Peak.","content.76.12198":"Here goes nothin'...","content.76.12199":"On second thoughts, I'd rather wait a while.","content.76.12200":"Hi, Susan. I found out a bit more about the Plantiguards...","content.76.12201":"Oh yes, sorry.","content.76.12202":"I was there looking for that Bearkneck, and I noticed their hives were growing mainly on the sides of the mountain. I think he set up his lair right inside the mountain.","content.76.12203":"I think I'll go and explore a bit. I'm sure I'll find a hunters' camp eventually.","content.76.12204":"(Agree enthusiastically) Great! So, what do you know about Plantiguards?","content.76.12205":"(Remain doubtful) I need information about the Plantiguards and their leader, Bearkneck.","content.76.12206":"That confirms what I thought!","content.76.12207":"Okay, that confirms my suspicions.","content.76.12208":"I'm not saying no...","content.76.12209":"I hear you're a specialist in the region.","content.76.12210":"Forget it... Do you know any beekeepers here in Amakna?","content.76.12217":"I'm here on behalf of Juspark.","content.76.12218":"Hi, are you okay?","content.76.12219":"Like you said...","content.76.12220":"What's wrong, gramps?","content.76.12221":"Oh, well, I understand that, I'm no stranger to old age...","content.76.12222":"Harmony... Tell me more.","content.76.12223":"Okay, I'll ask them what came over them then. The hard way, of course. See you later!","content.76.12224":"It's strange... No matter how many questions I asked, nobody told me anything. I searched the area but didn't find much...","content.76.12225":"Well, what should we do then?","content.76.12226":"Anyway, why did they spare you?","content.76.12227":"Okay, that's clever. I want the same, now.","content.76.12228":"All right, I'll check in with her. See you soon!","content.76.12229":"I defeated the Pingwins' leader... (Explain the content of the Morse steles, and how your fight played out)","content.76.12230":"The Pingwins should be free of Little Daddy Praved's magical influence. But we cannot bring the past back to life, nor the many dead creatures.","content.76.12231":"See you soon.","content.76.12232":"What did I want again? Oh, yes, the Pingwins.","content.76.12233":"Adorable, adorable... I hear they slaughtered a load of people.","content.76.12234":"What's up with you all and the little seals? Anyway, I guess you don't know much about it either.","content.76.12235":"Yes, it's very sad. I'd have loved to see those little seals myself too. Anyway, I guess you don't know much about it either.","content.76.12236":"That's intriguing. It may not have anything to do with it, but I'll take a look. Thanks for the information!","content.76.12237":"I need your help deciphering animal languages... I figured you might have some experience.","content.76.12238":"(Stare at him)","content.76.12239":"Okay. So I'm your official courier now.","content.76.12240":"A good old-fashioned quest, then. I'll get going.","content.76.12241":"Here are the 100 golden makoffee.","content.76.12242":"Here is Yeast's shopping.","content.76.12243":"There, Jenry, I brought everything back. So, what about that translation?","content.76.12244":"Thank you. You really helped me out again{[1*]?:}. See you soon!","content.76.12245":"I'm here on behalf of Jenry. I need... *You take out your Posteet* living-dead, giant Arachnees, orcs and goblins...","content.76.12246":"Errr, sorry{[1*]?:}. (Hand over the right Posteet to Yeast)","content.76.12249":"Thanks a lot. ","content.76.12250":"Yes, well... To do that, you'd have to find some honey, for a start...","content.76.12251":"Let's say no.","content.76.12252":"Okay, let's go... (Leave, dragging your heels)","content.76.12253":"Let the adventure begin, my friends! (Leave light-heartedly)","content.76.12254":"Okay, so there's nothing useful for entering the Plantiguards' lair.","content.76.12255":"It's alright, I'm used to it. See you later, Farle!","content.76.12256":"I'm back, Veronica. So...","content.76.12257":"Sorry. My bad, that makes twice already... Muriel, right?","content.76.12258":"Oh, I'm terribly sorry{[1*]?:}. Why don't you go and do the Plantiguard Dungeon then, since you apparently do everything by yourself around here? Trust me, I'm going to take care of this whole situation with Bearkneck. I've found where his lair is...","content.76.12259":"It's alright, Geraldine, I beat Bearkneck. He shouldn't bother the Plantiguards anymore!","content.76.12260":"What are you going to do now?","content.76.12261":"I could give you a hand, if you like. You don't have to do everything by yourself.","content.76.12262":"Well, goodbye then.","content.76.12263":"I'm just passing through.","content.76.12264":"What exactly are you doing here?","content.76.12265":"Wait... You know about it?","content.76.12266":"How come you're close to the Watchers? If you don't mind my asking... Could you tell me more about your past?","content.76.12269":"Okay.","content.76.12270":"*You try to digest Juspark's story, which clearly doesn't abide by the rules*","content.76.12271":"That's really interesting. But then how did you contact the Watchers?","content.76.12272":"Ah. We're getting there!","content.76.12273":"Okay, that sounds about right. I understand better.","content.76.12274":"Hmmm... Open sesame!","content.76.12275":"Well...","content.76.12276":"... Not really. I think a life of adventure suits me. Maybe I'll settle down sometime later.","content.76.12277":"I lost my roots a long time ago. I have nowhere to go back to. So I'm a bit lost{[1*]?:} in that respect...","content.76.12278":"I... I don't know. I never really thought about it much. I've always done one quest after another, just like that.","content.76.12279":"Actually, there is something I'd like to do later. But for now, I still have things to do here.","content.76.12280":"That's true. Alright, see you soon! Good luck with your work.","content.76.12281":"Okay, but promise me we'll sit down together for a beer or two and tell each other everything about our lives!","content.76.12282":"(Get ready to fight)","content.76.12284":"We took a heck of a beating...","content.76.12285":"Let's make a plan. Can you locate him?","content.76.12286":"So that's what the feather I got from Osamodas was for?","content.76.12287":"Look, Pandora, will you tell me your plan now? I'm rather tired of being kept in the dark. Trust me, I won't let you down.","content.76.12288":"Nice! Revelations at last.","content.76.12289":"Those so-called \"Plagues\", I guess.","content.76.12290":"So it's pretty crucial that it doesn't fall into the wrong hands.","content.76.12291":"Well, yeah, but you told me about finding a way to avoid it anyway.","content.76.12292":"So, we'll be sacrifices no matter what. But we will act as intermediaries.","content.76.12293":"I see. And even then, \"strengthening\" islands or even continents is difficult in the space of just a few years. And the more we go back in time, the more we risk nourishing the Plagues, right?","content.76.12294":"Okay, but can't we go back in time and, I don't know, start saving things?","content.76.12295":"Well, I'm stuck then.","content.76.12296":"(Eagerly wait for Pandora to continue talking once the dramatic effect has passed)","content.76.12297":"I've been on the verge of a panic attack since this morning, if you really want to know...","content.76.12298":"(Go to pieces and roll around on the floor kicking and screaming)","content.76.12299":"That's not surprising. I was actually expecting it. I guessed what your intentions were a long time ago.","content.76.12300":"... So the idea is to stop time in 977, and create a time loop... from which you would be excluded, with the help of your powers as a Watcher. You could cause time scars, create \"retroactive\" changes in our universe that we wouldn't even be aware of, all in order to protect it.","content.76.12301":"And how exactly are you going to go about it?","content.76.12302":"And that's when this stranger came and ruined everything. That'll teach you to hide things from me. Now we'll have to go find him and give him what's got coming.","content.76.12303":"I think he is after all the gods' knowledge. If we collect any more fragments, we're bound to cross his path.","content.76.12304":"Can you locate the other fragments?","content.76.12305":"Great, let's go.","content.76.12306":"(Contemplate the mid-afternoon light reflecting on the water)","content.76.12307":"(Go back to see Pandora)","content.76.12308":"Great, let's go!","content.76.12309":"I was lucky, that's all.","content.76.12310":"Come on now, you wouldn't have gotten very far without me.","content.76.12311":"You know, the real definition of time is change. If there is no change, and if the past, present and future are one, then time does not exist. I finally understood the real nature of this time loop... As long as the spirit of the World of Twelve changes, it will be fine.","content.76.12312":"Should I meet you here in a year's time, then?","content.76.12313":"Well, in that case, it's farewell.","content.76.12314":"Farewell, Pandora.","content.76.12315":"I need to talk to you.","content.76.12316":"I don't really have time to tell you everything right now. I'm trying to explore the mountain... Have you ever ventured there?","content.76.12317":"Roughly how long does it take to get there?","content.76.12318":"I'll never have time to get to the summit before the Voyager carries out his plan...","content.76.12319":"Really? Who was he then?","content.76.12320":"I don't really care.","content.76.12321":"I see...","content.76.12322":"At this point...","content.76.12323":"*You come around to the idea of a catapult; maybe it isn't such a bad idea after all. It's just that you risk losing your life nine times out of ten*","content.76.12324":"Go see the great catapult, I guess... I'm not sure{[1*]?:} if we'll ever see each other again, in that case.","content.76.12325":"(Hurry)","content.76.12326":"What is this place?","content.76.12327":"What a funny idea to live in a Crackler!","content.76.12328":"I see.","content.76.12329":"Come on, be a good loser and admit defeat.","content.76.12330":"I know you gave it your all while fighting. You almost beat us. But it's not up to you to decide people's future, nor their past. That will be their own responsibility from now on.","content.76.12331":"We agreed on a number of points. I hope you find the strength to believe in this future...","content.76.12332":"(Watch your dying enemy)","content.76.12333":"(Leave)","content.76.12334":"It's partly thanks to you, Otomai.","content.76.12335":"We did some great things. I'm sorry{[1*]?:} it all ends like this...","content.76.12336":"You played a decisive role all the same. We would never have gotten Aguabrial's help without you. And coming back with Pandora at that moment allowed me to activate the water clock while the Voyager was taking care of you.","content.76.12337":"They'll have to learn to resist on their own now. Tough times are coming. And the Ogrest issue still needs solving. It's no good resisting the Eliocalypse if Ogrest's Chaos engulfs us before then...","content.76.12338":"Well, I can't guarantee it. You probably won't forget{[1*]?:} me, and you'll still be changed by everything we've done since we met. But you'll be missing details of what's yet to come.","content.76.12339":"I'll take your words to heart. See you soon, Otomai.","content.76.12340":"(Hurry to find Shhhudoku in the middle of the night)","content.76.12341":"I really need your help... I have to use the catapult to get to the mountain's summit.","content.76.12342":"I really don't have time to explain everything to you.","content.76.12343":"(Propel yourself to the mountain's summit)","content.76.12344":"I have the Turquoise Dofus, but ever since I used it for the time loop, I can't seem to use its power...","content.76.12345":"Okay, I'll be back with all that.","content.76.12346":"Here are 3 shadow fragments.","content.76.12347":"Here are 500 Ogrest's tears.","content.76.12348":"Here are 1,000 powders.","content.76.12349":"Here are 250 divine tiramisoups.","content.76.12350":"Here are 20 everlasting flakes.","content.76.12351":"I collected a Turquoise Dofus, but ever since I used it for the time loop, I can't seem to use its power...","content.76.12352":"Uh, nothing at all. You must have heard wrong.","content.76.12353":"(Change the subject) It's a Dofus, and there aren't many left in this era... So I don't know how to \"activate\" it.","content.76.12354":"How do you know all that...?","content.76.12355":"No.","content.76.12356":"No.","content.76.12357":"Yes, but no.","content.76.12358":"Thanks, Juspark! I promise, if someday I want to bulk up, I'll come see you.","content.76.12359":"(Sigh)","content.76.12360":"It's just that... *You put your face in your hands, totally crushed{[1*]?:} from having completed these quests without ever having the opportunity to use this great relic*","content.76.12361":"Courage...? That could be what I need! (Drink all evening)","content.76.12362":"Well, it was quite a night.","content.76.12363":"Transformed{[1*]?:}? But... It's true! I feel the power of the Turquoise Dofus now! Thanks, Pandiego!","content.76.12368":"You're right, there's nothing more for me to do here.","content.76.12369":"Train with two Mr. Punchys 0%","content.76.12370":"Train with two Mr. Punchys 50%","content.76.12371":"Train with two Mr. Punchys 90%","content.76.12372":"Train with three Mr. Punchys 0%","content.76.12373":"Train with three Mr. Punchys 50%","content.76.12374":"Train with three Mr. Punchys 90%","content.76.12375":"Goodbye.","content.76.12376":"Train with several Mr. Punchys","content.76.12377":"Train with a Tofu.","content.76.12378":"Train with a Gobbette.","content.76.12379":"Train with an Ancestral Crackler.","content.76.12380":"Train with a Crobak.","content.76.12381":"Train with a Pinsular.","content.76.12382":"Train with an Inanite.","content.76.12383":"Train with a Wodent (base summons when the gobgob is empty / in Incarnam).","content.76.12384":"Train with a Red Piwi.","content.76.12385":"Train with an Arachnee.","content.76.12386":"Train with a Moogrr.","content.76.12388":"Goodbye.","content.76.12389":"Train with a Snailmet.","content.76.12390":"Train with a Rokoko.","content.76.12391":"Train with a Boowolfine.","content.76.12392":"Train with a Slith.","content.76.12393":"Oh, alright, fine. I'll leave you to it. Have a good day!","content.76.12394":"It seems there's a powerful artifact on this island...","content.76.12395":"Alright, I see. Thanks a lot.","content.76.12396":"Okay, I'll mine a bit.","content.76.12397":"I'll never work for a demon. I'm getting out of here! (Start a fight)","content.76.12398":"What are you doing here? What is this place?","content.76.12399":"Well, we're both stuck here then...","content.76.12400":"But... I don't want to come back here!","content.76.12401":"Okay, I'll come back later. I hope there'll be some lore this time...","content.76.12402":"You're... who, exactly?","content.76.12403":"I'm just passing through.","content.76.12404":"Oh, ditto, I'm walking around. Actually, I'm trying to reach Rushu's palace. The thing is, I don't know where to start.","content.76.12405":"Are you offering me a quid pro quo? Go on then, I'm listening.","content.76.12406":"Are you stuck here? I can help you leave, if you like.","content.76.12407":"In any case, it's very clearheaded of you to have managed to sort out fact from fiction.","content.76.12408":"True. True indeed.","content.76.12409":"You seem to know a lot about Shushus!","content.76.12410":"Okay, well, I think I get the idea. Let's talk quests now. Where's the dungeon?","content.76.12411":"That complicates things.","content.76.12412":"Increasing the oblivion? Hmm, it seems pretty empty around here already.\\nI guess if I pummel a few monsters in the ecosystem, I'll get some information. I'll be back!","content.76.12413":"Well, I haven't found an easy solution, but they use some kind of dark energy. It's that non-living thing, no doubt about it.","content.76.12414":"I think I know who to call on to help us find out more about this strange lair of evil. I'll go get the Archaosologists!","content.76.12415":"Well, yes. Why, do you know them?","content.76.12416":"What's the problem? I thought that with your personality and your ability to study an environment, it would have worked rather well with your dad.","content.76.12417":"Come on, it's your family. You only have one, right?","content.76.12418":"You say your parents are only interested in ruins?","content.76.12419":"But you, meanwhile, seem to be only interested in finding your secret garden with the Shushus. Relationships go both ways, you know. You might have been hurt by their not being there, but... You weren't really there for them either, were you?","content.76.12420":"Well, that's a bit awkward{[1*]?:}.","content.76.12421":"Don't worry, you won't have to do anything. As for me, I'll go get help.","content.76.12422":"Actually, we unlocked the secrets of Oktapodas's Temple together.","content.76.12423":"I don't know you that well, but I know you belong to the archaosologists' guild.","content.76.12424":"I'm just passing through. Have a good day.","content.76.12425":"I need your help. It's about the Void Spiral... (Tell the story, taking care not to mention Arlemia)","content.76.12426":"I need your help. It's about the Void Spiral... (Tell the story, including Arlemia's part in it)","content.76.12427":"I need your help. It's about the Void Spiral... (Tell the story, taking care not to mention Arlemia)","content.76.12428":"I need your help. It's about the Void Spiral... (Tell the story, including Arlemia's part in it)","content.76.12429":"I... Alright, I wasn't expecting such enthusiasm.","content.76.12430":"I... Alright, I'll manage.","content.76.12431":"(...)","content.76.12432":"(...)","content.76.12433":"(...)","content.76.12434":"(...)","content.76.12435":"(...)","content.76.12436":"(...)","content.76.12437":"*You stare at Juspark and try to look as serious as possible* So, that would be...","content.76.12438":"*Your voice becomes panicked* Has it already begun?!","content.76.12439":"Looks like we have no choice.","content.76.12440":"But do we even know where she is? I thought she'd vanished. ","content.76.12441":"No, you're not thinking about...","content.76.12442":"*You play along while waiting for the masquerade to end, but it's starting to drag on*","content.76.12443":"*Answer in a boring, sleep-inducing, uninteresting way* I don't know. What's your point?","content.76.12444":"Well, I don't really know. There are strange Shushu statues and also rifts that go into the Shustuft Crust. I wonder what it might be. Do you think...?","content.76.12445":"I wonder how we could have missed it.","content.76.12446":"*You furrow your brow before facing the facts* Shushus... yes, Shushus!","content.76.12447":"Yes, it's true that something like that makes sense to me.","content.76.12448":"*You raise your hand* Wait, are you giving me quests now? Where did Pandora go?","content.76.12449":"Alright. I just didn't know you were so savvy about these things, the end of the world and all that.","content.76.12450":"(Realize that Juspark seems to fill the role wonderfully despite her enigmatic absentmindedness)","content.76.12451":"I... Where should I start?","content.76.12452":"Oh, you want me to go see Rushu... Whatever... After all, why not... (Wipe the sweat from your brow, gulp, and take your leave of Juspark, thinking life is way too short)","content.76.12453":"*You shout out* Rushu! Rushu!","content.76.12454":"It's okay, we're still in the World of Twelve. I know he's not someone who should be taken lightly, but... What's the problem?","content.76.12455":"It's clearly already begun. Demonic statues and rifts leading into the Shustuft Crust have appeared all over the world... I'm sorry{[1*]?:} to tell you this, but you're not the only one right now.","content.76.12456":"I'm telling the truth. Besides, no one seems surprised by them appearing. As if it were normal. Anyway... Can't we reconfigure your portal to go to Rushu's palace?","content.76.12457":"Yes, I can see who it is.","content.76.12458":"Okay, and is there a risk that Rushu will notice us if we summon a portal too close to him?","content.76.12459":"Hmmm, what to do...","content.76.12460":"What is this place?","content.76.12461":"Alright. So I guess we're in the same kind of area here?","content.76.12462":"What if I want to meet Rushu, then?","content.76.12463":"Oh, really?","content.76.12464":"Business? I thought you didn't want to be noticed?","content.76.12465":"I think I'm starting to understand. You guide adventurers here in the hope they'll defeat Rushu, and you take up the vacant position of king of darkness?","content.76.12466":"Well, now I just need to go explore those islands.","content.76.12467":"I see... Actually, I was just trying to learn more about the forgotten dimensions.","content.76.12468":"Really? I'm used to danger. I can assure you it doesn't scare me.","content.76.12469":"That prophecy again... I know full well that it means trouble, Wolfram.","content.76.12470":"My story so far? I've been through so many things...","content.76.12471":"It all began in Incarnam, of course. There were owls who asked me which nation I wanted to go to, and Pandawas who taught me the art of combat... well, I think...","content.76.12472":"First of all, I arrived in Incarnam after Ogrest gave me a clobbering. I met Otomai there, and I helped him solve a problem in the dimension.","content.76.12473":"I began my journey a long time ago, and I remember I wanted to conquer the nations with an army of gobballs. Everyone wrote their own story, right?","content.76.12474":"I went to Astrub, of course. All adventures worthy of the name begin with Tainela and the Gobball Dungeon.","content.76.12475":"I went to Astrub. It was the crossroads between four nations, and a real mess! I took the opportunity to raise hell with the members of Destiny and all that.","content.76.12476":"I'm just not sure. I traveled a lot after I left Astrub, never staying in the same place more than a day, maybe two.","content.76.12477":"Well, I explored the nations, the nearby islands...","content.76.12478":"I faced the Black Crow, Master Shhhudoku, the Moogrrs... Oh, the Moogrrs...","content.76.12479":"I traveled all over the world and made the most of everything it had to offer.","content.76.12480":"Then I heard rumors that Frigost had been rediscovered, and with it, the Ice Dofus...","content.76.12481":"I went to Chillberg Island, I had to face Missiz Freezz in the past and then in the present, and I woke Count Harebourg, who fled.","content.76.12482":"I chased him to Wabbit Island, but he got away. Wabbit Island was in the throws of a conflict between the Lenalds and the Wabbits... ","content.76.12483":"I found Harebourg in Pandalucia after a rough night of liquid celebration... I also met Pandiego.\\n\\nA great spirit of the valley protected us at the last moment, but Pandalucia seems lost anyway.\\n\\nThat island has suffered too much to ever recover, but it still maintains a dream and an age-old legacy.","content.76.12484":"I noticed a strange anomaly. Pandalucia seemed to be... in the future. Events that happened there in the past, hadn't yet happened in the rest of the world.\\n\\nI made the connection thanks to a young Sadida named Amalia.","content.76.12485":"That's when I met Pandora.\\n\\n*You continue your story about the Divine Dimensions, the Watchers, Count Harebourg, the journeys between the nations and the Last Voyager who came close to carrying out his plan*","content.76.12486":"That strange man seemed willing to do anything to change this obscuring phenomenon.","content.76.12487":"And now he's dead.","content.76.12488":"Do you not hear how condescending that sounds? It took me a long time to tell you everything.","content.76.12489":"Cool, a riddle. Can't you just speak plainly for a minute?","content.76.12490":"Well...","content.76.12491":"(Say nothing{[1*]?:})","content.76.12492":"I... What do you mean?","content.76.12493":"Wait, I thought the prophecy was to bring balance back to the world... Haven't I already fulfilled it by releasing the gods' knowledge for all Twelvians? That was the whole point of the Methea project, right?","content.76.12494":"Is that true? I don't remember that tablet...","content.76.12495":"It's true; I already read that tablet.","content.76.12496":"If so... maybe I already fulfilled the prophecy. I used the Artifacts of the Ten original gods to face Ogrest on Mount Zinit.","content.76.12497":"... The Darkli Moon hammer?","content.76.12498":"Pandawa's magic barrel, then? I think goddess Pandawa came after the others, maybe that's it?","content.76.12499":"What is this scepter?","content.76.12500":"I need to go back to the Shustuft Crust... And from there, there's some kind of forgotten dimension, like here.\\n\\nSo, what might happen to me in this other world?","content.76.12501":"If I bring him back, isn't he going to... be missed in that other world?","content.76.12502":"What should I do with it?","content.76.12503":"It's a very difficult decision to make. I'm not sure{[1*]?:} about this whole prophecy thing, for a start.","content.76.12504":"Every time we fight something, something else takes its place. There's always someone, something, a new threat, a new twist. It's as if there's an eternal game board where players come and go for all eternity.","content.76.12505":"Who made this scepter?","content.76.12506":"How many parallel worlds are there, then? I thought there was only this reality with Shushus everywhere.","content.76.12507":"What are the risks if I don't get involved?","content.76.12508":"Could you be wrong...? Well, I guess if in doubt, I'll take a look.","content.76.12509":"(Take your leave while wondering to yourself how this old Boowolf knew so much about your quest)","content.76.12510":"I see.","content.76.12511":"Got any information on the demons in this area?","content.76.12512":"I'm back!","content.76.12513":"Well, I've reduced everything in that temple to dust. But I'm not sure I've really resolved anything in a truly... lasting way. Be that as it may, I did find a key fragment.","content.76.12514":"I'm going to continue exploring as best I can, then. Thanks again for your help.","content.76.12515":"*Politely wait for her to speak*","content.76.12516":"Yes. Everyone grows up, gets old, then dies and returns to oblivion. Nothing is eternal.","content.76.12517":"So, all good?","content.76.12518":"I think if you really search your real memories, you'll see that there's more there than just the Shushu business. Your parents in that world showed affection for you, too.","content.76.12519":"To tell you the truth, it could be in the very near future. Preventing that destiny from becoming reality is the whole reason I'm here.","content.76.12520":"There's still time. We can still take action to delay the inevitable. And even if I die one day, our children will continue this fight, as will their children in turn.","content.76.12521":"I'm sure they're very proud of you. It's not too late to go and spend some time with them and tell them how much you love them.","content.76.12522":"(Bid her farewell, then leave)","content.76.12523":"Well, I've reduced everything in that temple to dust. But I'm not sure I've really resolved anything in a truly... lasting way.","content.76.12524":"I think Arlemia still needs time.","content.76.12525":"You don't deserve your daughter's ungrateful attitude.","content.76.12526":"You weren't there for her when she needed you... You can still redeem yourself, but it'll take a whole lot of time and effort.","content.76.12527":"Try to understand her. You were young once too. And you're from a different generation...","content.76.12528":"Yeah, I'm eager to get back there too. All right, later, Milo.","content.76.12531":"I just remembered I have something else to do... It's really far away... and extremely urgent.","content.76.12533":"No problem. But first, I'll take care of defending you near the pillars!","content.76.12534":"OK, so... the green portal to the north? Great, I'm off!","content.76.12535":"I want to meet Rushu.","content.76.12536":"I want to take care of the Boss! (Quests 216 to 230)","content.76.12537":"It seems you need seeds, right? (Quests 216 to 230)","content.76.12538":"It seems you need resources, right? (Quests 216 to 230)","content.76.12539":"Here are the 10 Pseudopods.","content.76.12540":"Here are the 10 Phytomorph Seeds.","content.76.12541":"Here are the 10 Voidivion Skins.","content.76.12542":"Here are the 10 Voidivion Seeds.","content.76.12543":"Here are the 10 Horridemon Wings.","content.76.12544":"Here are the 10 Horridemon Seeds.","content.76.12545":"Here are the 10 Reman'haunt Scalps.","content.76.12546":"Here are the 10 Streye Seeds.","content.76.12547":"Here are the 10 Destroyer Arms.","content.76.12548":"Here are the 10 Destroyer Seeds.","content.76.12549":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.12550":"Nothing special, I just saw a light.","content.76.12551":"You belong to the Guild of Hunters?","content.76.12553":"In that case, I'd be happy to help you.","content.76.12554":"I've changed my mind.","content.76.12555":"All right, I'm off, then.","content.76.12556":"Kali? Wh... what are you doing here?","content.76.12557":"Um, yes, my apologies... miss.","content.76.12558":"This \"little wretch\" has calmed you down in your dungeon more than once.{[1*]?:}","content.76.12560":"(Briefly wonder what Kali eats for breakfast)","content.76.12561":"(Focus{[1*]?:} on Kali's story)","content.76.12562":"*You wonder who would be harder to fight - Kali or a legion of demons. Either way, you definitely wouldn't want to have to fight both at once*","content.76.12563":"I guess I'll have to give you a little taste of my power, huh? I'll be right back.","content.76.12564":"I see. I'll be on my way then.","content.76.12565":"(Briefly wonder what Kali eats for breakfast)","content.76.12566":"(Focus{[1*]?:} on Kali's story)","content.76.12567":"Nice place.","content.76.12568":"Actually, the main reason I came{[1*]?:} here was to look for a key fragment. If anyone's got it, I think it must be the head of those Horridemons.","content.76.12569":"Okay. So... what next?","content.76.12570":"I, uh... All right, miss. (Suppress an awkward smile)","content.76.12571":"Wait a second, are you trying to take me for a ride or something? Ha! Over my dead body!","content.76.12572":"Oh. Right. I understand.","content.76.12573":"Okay, on my way.","content.76.12574":"I suppose that makes sense. You could have explained that part first...","content.76.12575":"Okay, on my way.","content.76.12576":"What kind of thing?","content.76.12577":"Why? Didn't those dreams make any sense?","content.76.12578":"I just want to make sure I understand...","content.76.12579":"I just want to make sure I understand...","content.76.12580":"Very well.","content.76.12581":"So what's so bad about that?","content.76.12582":"Yeah, I suppose I'd better get back to it...","content.76.12585":"I understand better now what you're trying to say. It must be hard for you to be haunted by memories that aren't even real. To tell you the truth, I'm hoping to investigate that... which is why I want to meet Rushu.","content.76.12586":"You're right. I'll go back and find a way to get into that dungeon.","content.76.12587":"You said you'd had visions... dreams. Can you tell me what they were about?","content.76.12588":"All those demons we've fought are just sadistic for no reason. It's in their nature.\\nBut you helped me to climb Mount Zinit when there was nothing forcing you to do so.{[1*]?:} I think you're different, deep down. No matter what's happened in your past or who you've met along the way... What if today, you had a chance to turn the page on all that? Maybe these visions are a second chance.","content.76.12589":"I'm ready{[1*]?:}.","content.76.12590":"Hang on, I'm not ready yet... {[1*]?:}","content.76.12591":"I finished beating up the Horridemons.","content.76.12592":"What's the next in the plan?","content.76.12593":"(Think that this plan is going in a pretty terrifying direction, then take your leave)","content.76.12594":"(Think that this plan is going in a pretty nice direction, then take your leave)","content.76.12595":"(Think that if you had to choose, you would rather put the collars on someone else, then take your leave)","content.76.12596":"(Think that this plan is going in a pretty terrifying direction, then take your leave)","content.76.12597":"(Think that this plan is going in a pretty nice direction, then take your leave)","content.76.12598":"(Think that if you had to choose, you would rather put the collars on someone else, then take your leave)","content.76.12599":"What's the next in the plan?","content.76.12600":"I got the collar.","content.76.12601":"Can I take part?","content.76.12602":"Yeah, I'll have to do all the work again, won't I?","content.76.12603":"Is that right? We'll see about that!\\n*You hope to make Kali realize that she will never have your blind obedience. But despite your rebellious attitude, your chains make you suffer excruciatingly as you head off to the dungeon*","content.76.12604":"*You put on the handcuffs and collar that will allow you to enter the dungeon. Fortunately, you keep control over your bonds and will be able to remove them once inside*\\nAlright, I'm going then.","content.76.12605":"Anyway... Mission accomplished.","content.76.12606":"Well, someone has to take care of all these missions.","content.76.12607":"Well, someone has to take care of all these missions.","content.76.12608":"Well, someone has to take care of all these missions.","content.76.12609":"Now I've got my hands on the key fragment, I'll be on my way again. I hope you'll have lots of fun here.\\n(Take your leave)","content.76.12610":"Oh, really?","content.76.12611":"*You get up with difficulty, ready{[1*]?:} to get back on the adventure trail after concluding this painful chapter*","content.76.12612":"It's tempting, but I must get back to my quest now.","content.76.12613":"How could I refuse such a proposal?","content.76.12614":"Finally...","content.76.12615":"(Nod and then leave)","content.76.12616":"(...)","content.76.12617":"(Continue)","content.76.12618":"(Leave)","content.76.12619":"You're right, it's time I bolted.","content.76.12620":"I'm just passing through.","content.76.12621":"I'm passing through.","content.76.12622":"... Goultard?! You're really the last person I expected to see here.","content.76.12623":"Yes, it was a bit of a silly question. So what is this place?","content.76.12624":"I'm looking for a key fragment... I'm trying to get to Rushu.","content.76.12625":"It's true that I'm a little afraid of seeing him. I wouldn't be against a coaching session from the illustrious Goultard himself.","content.76.12626":"I... What's so funny?","content.76.12627":"Okay, kill ten demons in the territory, that works. Then you'll send me searching for stuff that other demons will come out of, then I'll go defeat a powerful monster in a lair... I guess.","content.76.12628":"I don't understand, is Old Joe really that famous?","content.76.12629":"Okay, well, time to go defeat ten Shushus...","content.76.12630":"I've had a strange feeling since I arrived in this area.\\nI've had a strange feeling since I arrived in this area.\\nEver since.","content.76.12631":"Uh, I don't really know. I feel like I'm losing my mind a bit here. The atmosphere is oppressive, I must say.","content.76.12632":"*You're beginning to not understand what Goultard is saying. You decide to go back to your quest*","content.76.12633":"There, I defeated ten demons.","content.76.12634":"There, I defeated ten demons.","content.76.12635":"There, I defeated ten demons.","content.76.12636":"I... don't think I feel well. There are far too many unusual things in this place. Powerful magic seems to be at work...","content.76.12637":"Where should I start? We must hurry before we lose our minds!","content.76.12638":"What just happened?","content.76.12639":"Alright, I'd better get going.","content.76.12640":"As soon as I kill them, these strange demons return to the ground... and then come back to life as if nothing had happened. I feel like I'm fighting weeds that keep growing back. It's like I can't get the roots out.","content.76.12641":"I don't really see what you're getting at.","content.76.12642":"Oh, right, so it won't be easy to fight a whole island...","content.76.12643":"Aren't you going to help me?","content.76.12644":"Now I feel under pressure...","content.76.12645":"I see. Right, I'll head off, but with self-confidence this time.","content.76.12646":"But wasn't I supposed to get a third lesson?","content.76.12647":"*You eyeball Goultard doubtfully*","content.76.12648":"Run away from adversity?","content.76.12649":"It's difficult doing so day in, day out.","content.76.12650":"I see. Those are wise words as always, Goultard. Thank you for helping me{[1*]?:} defeat those weird Shushus! Even if I didn't understand everything about this weird territory, at least I got the key fragment I was looking for.","content.76.12651":"What are you going to do next?","content.76.12652":"How so?","content.76.12653":"That sounds like the very definition of \"serious\".","content.76.12654":"Alright, I'm off. Thanks again for everything!","content.76.12655":"Okay, I found some clues. Apparently, it's a place that isn't really \"accepted\" by Rushu. He avoids it and tries not to mention it, perhaps out of fear?","content.76.12656":"I defeated that... thing in the dungeon. I think?","content.76.12657":"This isn't a very typical place.","content.76.12658":"How so? Have we met? I'm pretty sure{[1*]?:} this is the first time I've been here...","content.76.12659":"That's a huge understatement to say the least... *You think about the time loop you're stuck in{[1*]?:}*","content.76.12660":"What's all this about?","content.76.12661":"Anyway... What's all this about?","content.76.12662":"You must have a mountain of paperwork to send to Rushu. I didn't know demons had all kinds of criminal proceedings. Darn it... I didn't expect to come across a legal expert who knows me from who knows where.","content.76.12663":"Well, how come you know me? I don't think I remember you...","content.76.12664":"Yes, I need to get to Rushu. I was told there was a key fragment in this place.","content.76.12665":"Whoa, alright. I'll figure out a way to loosen your tongue. I'll start by causing a little commotion in your beloved territory...","content.76.12666":"Why is that?","content.76.12667":"... To summarize, what does that mean?","content.76.12668":"Ultimately, Shushus' rules are very similar to Twelvians' rules.","content.76.12669":"The following may be considered a lack of supervision:\\nThe fact that an agent assigned to the supervision of the kingdom eats fermented mushrooms during their working hours.","content.76.12670":"*You're beginning to doubt your mushrooms were actually fermented... You'd better to try another argument*\\nAlright, forget I said anything about it.","content.76.12671":"Okay, that's fine with me.","content.76.12672":"So?","content.76.12673":"I see, she must be a little angry with everyone. Doesn't Rushu know anything?","content.76.12674":"And then what?","content.76.12675":"Wait, what?","content.76.12676":"What about the key fragment?","content.76.12677":"Alright, thanks for the information. Do you see that we can get along well, in the end? You should have started with that. That said, I'm still going to file a dismissal motion against you. I'll see you at the Shushuic court.\\n(Leave heroically)","content.76.12678":"She's a demon queen, after all. Any information at all might be useful to me?","content.76.12679":"Territories besides this one?","content.76.12680":"What happened to Rushu's brother?","content.76.12681":"Reincarnated? Could he have made a pact with Thanatena?","content.76.12682":"Do you know how many other demon kings are still alive?","content.76.12683":"So, Vaal'Enthia?","content.76.12684":"I see, thank you very much for all this information.","content.76.12685":"Sounds like she's in a tragic situation. I almost feel sorry for her, but she's still a really dangerous demon queen...","content.76.12686":"That's mind-blowing. What if I asked you why you recognized me{[1*]?:} when I arrived{[1*]?:} in the Kingdom?","content.76.12687":"I don't believe that. Demons are well known for mastering trickery, aren't they, Mr. I-play-cards-during-my-working-hours?","content.76.12688":"If you say so. I don't really care. What matters is that I found the key fragment. If I see Rushu, I won't hesitate to remind him of your breaking the rules.","content.76.12689":"No problem... I guess I also have to thank you for your help. So thank you, and see you later.","content.76.12690":"I've decided to hold you liable! I'll prove that you lied by omission to Rushu!","content.76.12691":"I'm back! I studied the administrative law of the Rushu's Kingdom a little. It was quite difficult, but I think I found something to incriminate you.","content.76.12692":"I've got witnesses. I can prove everything.","content.76.12693":"Tell me a bit about Vaal'Enthia.","content.76.12694":"I defeated Vaal'Enthia... for now.","content.76.12695":"Help you? Uh, alright! Just as soon as you start being nice, and only if you tell me where I can find the key to...","content.76.12696":"Oh, you don't need to bother telling me about your tragic past. Just tell me where I can find the fragment of the key I need to enter Rushu's Palace.","content.76.12697":"*You decide to be patient*","content.76.12698":"What's the Ch'Tyx?","content.76.12699":"Akeranzu?","content.76.12700":"It's all a bit mystical. The Destroyers?","content.76.12701":"Perhaps... Well, I guess these Destroyers retreated here?","content.76.12702":"The naughty demons are up to something again. Do you know what they intend to do?","content.76.12703":"He was once a Pandawa? Alright. Well, how about you explain what I have to do?","content.76.12704":"I like challenges.","content.76.12705":"Alright, time to destroy the Destroyers.","content.76.12706":"You look... exhausted.","content.76.12707":"Nice place. Can I bother you? I could use some guidance.","content.76.12708":"How so?","content.76.12709":"So, you don't want to leave here anymore?","content.76.12710":"How did you end up with the Destroyers?","content.76.12711":"I guess it must have been a terrifying encounter.","content.76.12712":"I understand. Sad story.","content.76.12713":"I'd better get back to my quest.","content.76.12714":"You're still just as nice...","content.76.12715":"(Scan the horizon)","content.76.12716":"(Turn to face Val'Ture)\\nI'll do what must be done. What's your plan?","content.76.12717":"Wait, why do you want me to face K'Abah'Al?","content.76.12718":"Let's go! It should be a relaxing trip.","content.76.12719":"I defeated those few Destroyers. What's next?","content.76.12720":"Okay, I'll talk to you again to get to the Tomb of the Forgotten.","content.76.12721":"I took a Kar'Drak by force.","content.76.12722":"I want to sail to the Tomb of the Forgotten.","content.76.12723":"What's next for you?","content.76.12724":"I don't see how that would help you reincarnate.","content.76.12725":"What if you went to Externam instead? You've done good deeds, and you helped me{[1*]?:} defeat K'Abah'Al once and for all. I think it's worth asking Thanatena to make a pact with you so you can reincarnate. It would be a \"new beginning\", and a bit more promising at that.","content.76.12726":"I see. I guess all that's left is to wish you all the best.","content.76.12727":"(Leave)","content.76.12728":"Well, I defeated K'Abah'Al!","content.76.12730":"Um, that's actually not a bad idea. At least it should be an interesting trip. I'll get going.","content.76.12731":"*You decide to say hello to Juspark*","content.76.12733":"I came{[1*]?:} as soon as I got your letter. Is there a problem?","content.76.12734":"*You shrug your shoulders, hardly surprised{[1*]?:}*\\n\\nAgain? What is it this time?","content.76.12735":"Oh no, not this talk about the Chosen One{[1*]?:} again. Get to the point, or I'm leaving.","content.76.12736":"I like it when you speak in riddles, but I wish you'd be more to the point this time.","content.76.12737":"What's happening to me? Hey, what's going on? Why are you taking my hand?","content.76.12738":"Yet more anomalies? I thought we were safe from the Eliocalypse now...","content.76.12739":"(Blink hard)","content.76.12740":"(Catch your breath)\\n\\nWh... What just happened?","content.76.12741":"Well, alright... I won't find out more about these riddles by staying here, so I might as well head out.\\n\\n*You slowly recover from your visions, but your mind is still very muddled. You need to go look for strange elements... That's rather vague*","content.76.12742":"(Go over to the young girl)","content.76.12743":"Well, we have lots to discuss. I found these journals...\\n(Talk about what was in the journals and mention the mysterious elements straight from the Shustuft Crust)","content.76.12744":"Good day. Sorry{[1*]?:} to bother you but I've got a few questions for you, if you don't mind?","content.76.12745":"No, well, err, I can come back later if this isn't a good time...","content.76.12746":"Tell me, what's up with you invading the World of Twelve with your Shushu statues all over the cities? What are you trying to do? And why did you create the dimensional rifts to fight monsters? Why doesn't anyone seem surprised about any of that?","content.76.12747":"What do you mean?","content.76.12748":"Oh, gosh, I wouldn't want to disturb you or anything...","content.76.12750":"What? No.","content.76.12751":"Well, if you say it like that, I would like you to lend it to me.","content.76.12752":"Oh, yes, I can't wait to read it!","content.76.12753":"(Take on a rather distant air because, in truth, you're the one who wrote the book)","content.76.12754":"(Find the words to express an intuition that's been haunting you for some time)\\n\\nI've come to ask you what you know about parallel worlds.","content.76.12755":"*You play the copycat*","content.76.12756":"*You stay standing and look him up and down haughtily*","content.76.12757":"*You leave, ending the conversation abruptly*","content.76.12758":"But take the divine dimensions, for example, what are they?","content.76.12759":"Could there possibly be another... \"Astral Plane\" somewhere? A side hidden from our world?","content.76.12760":"Well, there's nothing here for me to sink my teeth into, clearly. Thank you for the answers, Otomai.","content.76.12761":"I wonder if I've already walked in a parallel world...\\nA world that has, since, left our plane.\\n\\nYes. This world no longer exists. All that's left is a vague, fuzzy memory. Sometimes the certainty that we were indeed there rises to the surface.","content.76.12762":"(Wait)","content.76.12763":"Where am I?","content.76.12764":"Err... (Follow her)","content.76.12765":"*You hesitate but answer* Err, it's just... I've been on the road a long time, so...","content.76.12766":"*You change the subject* Oh, you know how it is. Have you had a good day?","content.76.12767":"*You admit to everything* I don't know you, you don't know me, and I'm not from this world.","content.76.12768":"*You change the subject* Oh, you know how it is. Have you had a good day?","content.76.12769":"*You admit to everything* I don't know you, you don't know me, and I'm not from this world.","content.76.12770":"*You admit to everything* I don't know you, you don't know me, and I'm not from this world.","content.76.12771":"It's the truth. My name is [#name], and I'm from another world. Where I come from, a great threat is looming over everything that exists, and there's a good chance your world is involved.","content.76.12772":"(Go into detail about all the ins and outs of the Eliocalypse)","content.76.12773":"That's mostly it, yes. I've come here to find an Artifact that should separate our two worlds for good because, if things continue like this, everything might disappear.","content.76.12774":"I think that I'll go back when I fall asleep. Otherwise, I'll be stuck here, I guess...","content.76.12775":"Don't worry. I know how to defend myself.","content.76.12776":"That's nice of you, thanks!","content.76.12777":"I've got a few questions.","content.76.12778":"Nothing, nothing. Let's go.","content.76.12779":"Can you tell me about where we are? What's its history, for example?","content.76.12780":"Can you tell me about where we are? What's its history, for example?","content.76.12781":"That's what I was talking about. Your alternative lives' memories are mixing and merging.","content.76.12782":"That's what I was talking about. Your alternative lives' memories are mixing and merging.","content.76.12783":"Just who are you?","content.76.12784":"I... err... I wasn't trying to... Never mind, let's get going.","content.76.12785":"*You think that this mysterious person is probably going to be hard to handle, but since this is your only clue, you've got to follow her*","content.76.12786":"I don't really know. This world seems very different from mine.","content.76.12787":"What are you doing here?","content.76.12788":"Yes, that's it, exactly.","content.76.12789":"Can you tell me about this place? Is it an island?","content.76.12790":"Are there creatures called \"Shushus\" in your world?","content.76.12791":"Could you tell me the history of this world?","content.76.12792":"Can you tell me a bit about yourself? You said it's just you and your friend. What are you doing here?","content.76.12793":"I understand. Can I ask what your... Huh, that's odd. I was about to ask you something, but I've just forgotten what...","content.76.12794":"Admittedly, that must be unsettling. I'd like to meet this{[1*]?:} \"other me\"...","content.76.12795":"I found it.","content.76.12796":"I'm not sure{[1*]?:}.","content.76.12797":"No, I haven't found it.","content.76.12798":"I found it... But I lost it.","content.76.12799":"And you, what is most important to you?","content.76.12800":"And you, what is most important to you?","content.76.12801":"And you, what is most important to you?","content.76.12802":"I think that's an excellent answer. I totally approve!\\n\\n*Despite everything, those words make you think of the last voyager. His words were similar, but his actions too extreme*\\n\\n*Or... Were they really?*","content.76.12803":"I will, definitely!","content.76.12804":"I've got a few questions to ask you, if you don't mind. I'm rather curious{[1*]?:} about you and your world.","content.76.12805":"Are there \"Shushus\" in your world?","content.76.12806":"Are we on an island?","content.76.12807":"Can you give me more context to understand your world?","content.76.12808":"Can you tell it to me?","content.76.12809":"(Wait for the rest, confused. So far, it's the history of the World of Twelve without a comma out of place)","content.76.12810":"(Think that it must surely be the Horsemen of the Eliocalypse)","content.76.12811":"*Gripped with doubt, you look up. The stranger was right. Now that the sun has set, and despite the pale horizon trying timidly to light up the evening sky... Not a single star or moon can be seen*","content.76.12812":"That story is both different from and similar to that of the world I'm from.","content.76.12813":"Really?","content.76.12814":"Thank you. I'll read them when I've got a minute.","content.76.12815":"Ultimately, there's only one world? We're in the... Shustuft Crust?","content.76.12816":"You live alongside demons? ","content.76.12817":"In any case, for most Twelvians, living with demons is unthinkable.","content.76.12818":"...","content.76.12819":"Well, we don't run into too many demons, I must say. Everyone mostly keeps to themselves. The few famous demons are infamous instead, like Djaul.","content.76.12820":"I believe so, yes, there are. Many, even.","content.76.12821":"Well, that doesn't seem realistic.","content.76.12822":"I see...\\n\\nSo, Incarnam and Externam have disappeared? What happens when you die?","content.76.12823":"The concept of paradise set forth by Selenda isn't very clear...","content.76.12824":"I still don't understand. We have always existed in conflict, in opposition.","content.76.12825":"So, does it only work with the dead, then? I think I'm starting to get the idea.","content.76.12826":"I didn't know that she had such a unique power. Do you have a secret talent yourself?","content.76.12827":"I must say, I've got the impression that I've seen you before somewhere. I don't know where.","content.76.12828":"And how are things with my \"other me\"?","content.76.12829":"Is he really that bad?","content.76.12830":"Can I go see Rushu?","content.76.12831":"Yes, okay. You're not half bad after all.","content.76.12832":"Yes, okay. You're not half bad after all.","content.76.12833":"I hope to come back in one piece.","content.76.12834":"Sure.","content.76.12835":"Train with an Elite Chafer.","content.76.12836":"Train with an Enraged Boohemoth.","content.76.12837":"Train with a Standard-Bearing Whisperer.","content.76.12838":"Train with a Zordfish.","content.76.12839":"Train with a Whirlibig.","content.76.12840":"Train with an Ancestral Treechnid.","content.76.12841":"Train with a Crushing Hyphalump.","content.76.12842":"Train with a Wabbit Shawpshootew.","content.76.12843":"Train with a Sramva.","content.76.12844":"Train with a Culler of the Wind.","content.76.12845":"Train with a Stalaguar.","content.76.12846":"Train with a Pheromaniac.","content.76.12847":"Train with a Gerbean.","content.76.12848":"Train with a Noicebubourg.","content.76.12849":"Train with a Dreggon Warrior.","content.76.12850":"Train with a Wolfix.","content.76.12851":"Train with a CeEvroaint.","content.76.12852":"Goodbye.","content.76.12853":"Goodbye.","content.76.12854":"What's all this about?","content.76.12855":"Ok, never mind then.","content.76.12856":"Is there a way in?","content.76.12857":"Tell me about Decepticod.","content.76.12858":"Tell me about Merkator.","content.76.12859":"Tell me about Kralaman.","content.76.12860":"Tell me about Lardevil.","content.76.12861":"Tell me about you.","content.76.12862":"I've heard enough.","content.76.12864":"Tell me about Merkator.","content.76.12865":"Tell me about Kralaman.","content.76.12866":"Tell me about Lardevil.","content.76.12867":"Tell me about you.","content.76.12868":"I've heard enough.","content.76.12869":"Tell me about Decepticod.","content.76.12871":"Tell me about Kralaman.","content.76.12872":"Tell me about Lardevil.","content.76.12873":"Tell me about you.","content.76.12874":"I've heard enough.","content.76.12875":"Tell me about Decepticod.","content.76.12876":"Tell me about Merkator.","content.76.12877":"Tell me about Kralaman.","content.76.12879":"Tell me about you.","content.76.12880":"I've heard enough.","content.76.12881":"Tell me about Decepticod.","content.76.12882":"Tell me about Merkator.","content.76.12884":"Tell me about Lardevil.","content.76.12885":"Tell me about you.","content.76.12886":"I've heard enough.","content.76.12892":"I've heard enough. (Leave without listening to the end)","content.76.12893":"I'd like to fight you.\\n(Consume 1x Black Crow's Lair Symbol)","content.76.12894":"Fighting doesn't really{[1*]?:} sound all that good to me right now. I'll come back later.","content.76.12895":"Very well, I'll fight.\\n(Consume 1x High Wind Plateau Symbol)","content.76.12896":"Fighting doesn't really{[1*]?:} sound all that good to me right now. I'll come back later.","content.76.12897":"Fighting doesn't really{[1*]?:} sound all that good to me right now. I'll come back later.","content.76.12898":"Well, I don't know... They were frolicking peacefully in the meadow. When I came near, they charged at me and bit me. I was injured. Plus, I noticed that they looked rather ferocious.\\n\\nIs that normal for gobballs? Can you confirm that that is what should be expected?","content.76.12899":"That'd be a yes. Otherwise, that would mean that they haven't been working properly for a few hundred years. Thanks for the answers. See you soon!","content.76.12900":"Hello. I'd like to know if the gobballs are behaving properly.","content.76.12902":"Jeez, this kid is a pain...","content.76.12903":"Yes.","content.76.12906":"Nothing. Farewell.","content.76.12910":"Yes.","content.76.12911":"Hey, kid, I'm looking for a treasure. Anything like that around here?","content.76.12913":"Wow, this beach is amazing! Any idea where the best spot is to get a tan?","content.76.12914":"This kid's a real piece of work...","content.76.12915":"\"Azozu and me\"?","content.76.12916":"I know I'm not hearing things; you just said \"Azozu and me\".","content.76.12917":"What can I do to prove you can trust me? As long as you've got useful information for me, I'll help you with your problems.","content.76.12918":"I'm leaving. I get it.","content.76.12919":"Alright, alright. I'll go and find someone bigger to point me in the right direction.","content.76.12920":"I have to admit that even I might not be able to resist giving you a quick kick in the pants...","content.76.12922":"OK, I've taken care of your pirate friends. Now can you help me?","content.76.12923":"What should I do now?","content.76.12924":"I promise.","content.76.12925":"No, I'd still prefer to leave.","content.76.12927":"I've had it with you, kid. I don't feel like helping anymore.","content.76.12928":"Hmm, that's quite the traumatic turn of events. Can you give me a quick physical description of your friend? I'm sure it would help me find him.","content.76.12930":"That's... one bizarre story. I'll come back later.","content.76.12931":"Strange way of describing a kid, but hey, I'm not judging...","content.76.12932":"No need for all that. Where can I find information about Azozu?","content.76.12933":"Well, that's a terrible plan.","content.76.12934":"I'll head there right away. Wait for me here.","content.76.12935":"I changed my mind. I'm going home.","content.76.12936":"I found some information about Azozu, and I gave the pirates in that camp \ta taste of their own medicine. So who's a{[1*]?:} zero{[1*]?:} now?","content.76.12937":"Apparently, Azozu has been adopted by someone named Pohl and spirited away to the depths of the pirates' den.","content.76.12938":"It's just as I feared...","content.76.12939":"I can't; it's too dangerous to venture into that.","content.76.12940":"I defeated Pohl, who was actually the \"octopus\" that the \"Octopus Crew\" is named after. I also found some information about Azozu, and I know where he's being kept.","content.76.12942":"Well, not really. I still have to go get him... I've collected all the clues; I just need to find the path... Anyway, about the information you mentioned...","content.76.12943":"Not me. Give them to me, and I'll come back to help you when everything's finished.","content.76.12944":"So basically, I should have just headed north as soon as I landed on the island. What a day...","content.76.12945":"Anyway, I'm looking for Cire Momore's treasure. Any chance you and your little friends could give me a hand?","content.76.12946":"Hmm, how about a pint?","content.76.12947":"I've been chatting with your little friends, but unfortunately they were none too cooperative...","content.76.12948":"I've gathered quite a few interesting tidbits about Cire Momore... Why hide them from me? I could help you to fight him! And in exchange, maybe we could share the treasure?","content.76.12949":"I got rid of the weapon{[1*]?:} your colleagues were making.","content.76.12950":"I'm just passing through.","content.76.12952":"A curse? So then what are you doing here?","content.76.12954":"If there's no treasure, I suppose you wouldn't object to me having a look around?","content.76.12955":"\"My{[1*]?:} little{[1*]?:} friend\"...? That's rich, coming from a half-pint like you.","content.76.12956":"Alright, then. I'll go and find someone more... agreeable.","content.76.12957":"Hmm, sounds like I'd be better off looking somewhere else.","content.76.12959":"And I'm not sure{[1*]?:} I really want to commit to that... See ya!","content.76.12960":"From the continent? It must have been a long time indeed...\\n\\n*hand the beer to Berylbell*","content.76.12961":"You know what? I think I'll actually keep it to myself.","content.76.12962":"If you say so. So can you help me with my quest now?","content.76.12963":"And you know what they say in my country? You can lead a dwarf to beer, but you can't make him share! Hahahaha...\\nAh... what were we talking about? Oh right, my quest.","content.76.12967":"We can do this the hard way if we have to!","content.76.12968":"I was hoping it wouldn't come to this, but you leave me no choice.","content.76.12969":"Finally, I get to fight!","content.76.12972":"...","content.76.12973":"A mad queen? Who was she? And what was the goal of your expedition?","content.76.12974":"You're right: I'm here for the treasure. Do you know where it is?","content.76.12978":"What kind of danger are we talking about?","content.76.12981":"... Cire Momore, huh?","content.76.12982":"...","content.76.12983":"I think it's important to move on and avoid losing anything more.","content.76.12985":"I think it's important to see things through so that all of your efforts won't have been in vain.","content.76.12986":"Are you thinking of giving up your fight against Cire Momore? Giving up your chance at his treasure?","content.76.12987":"I guess you're right: Life is too short for regrets. ","content.76.12988":"There's no doubt about it; I'm not just any old wanderer!","content.76.12990":"You know, as long as I get my hands on the treasure...","content.76.12991":"No problem. Although they don't seem to be much for discussion...","content.76.12993":"Your friends are pretty hardheaded... and I would know, after the beating I gave them.","content.76.12994":"A new weapon?","content.76.12996":"I'll head there right now.","content.76.12997":"Finally, a bit of action!","content.76.12998":"Can you fill me in a bit more on Ephedra and Cire Momore?","content.76.12999":"Can you fill me in a bit more on these caverns and the Bitter-Hammers' expedition?","content.76.13000":"Moving forward... Maybe I should do the same and forget about Cire Momore's treasure?","content.76.13001":"An island paradise, they said... Beautiful beaches, they said...","content.76.13002":"That's oddly reassuring, in a way...","content.76.13003":"All that for a bird? Farewell.","content.76.13006":"I'm going home, this place is bumming me out.","content.76.13007":"Well, not really. In fact, I'm concerned to hear you say that.","content.76.13008":"I didn't know about that code. But I am an adventurer{[1*]?:}!","content.76.13010":"What's a little girl like you doing around here?","content.76.13011":"A little girl in a shady place like this... That'll only end in tears. I'd better leave.","content.76.13012":"Sounds like a serious situation. Stay here; I'll try to find them.","content.76.13013":"You should go home and wait for them; I'm sure they'll be back soon.","content.76.13014":"I'll see what I can do. Thanks, Goomy. Stay here and stay safe. I'll be back soon.","content.76.13016":"I recharged the necklace by making it absorb the souls of the Deathburns I defeated. Now it seems to shine when I point it towards the north.","content.76.13017":"I'll head there right away. Stay here and stay safe.","content.76.13018":"I've found a bunch of different information left by your parents. I know where to find them.","content.76.13019":"That's my intention. Wait for me here, and I'll be back soon!","content.76.13021":"I beat the Skeleton Giant in the dungeon. I managed to find your father's notebook. I know where your parents must be.","content.76.13022":"Right now, my main interest is in finding Cire Momore's treasure...","content.76.13023":"Thanks a lot, Goomy. I promise I'll save your parents as quickly as I can!","content.76.13024":"I should go...","content.76.13026":"The Bitter-Hammer expedition? You're not a clan?","content.76.13027":"And this treasure has something to do with the treasure of Ereboria?","content.76.13028":"How did you get here?","content.76.13029":"Centuries?","content.76.13030":"A connection with the treasure?","content.76.13031":"I'd really appreciate it{[1*]?:}.","content.76.13032":"Bribing someone with alcohol, now there's a thought...","content.76.13034":"I have the feeling I'm getting close to Cire Momore's treasure, but I ran into a nasty little punk while exploring the caves who didn't seem too cooperative...","content.76.13035":"Who are you?","content.76.13036":"I'm looking for this island's treasure.","content.76.13037":"The island... What is it? Valbuena?","content.76.13038":"What's a Forgelance?","content.76.13039":"Haha, just joking around. Of course I know that. Anyway, that's all the questions I had, so... later! (Leave)","content.76.13040":"Apparently I'm a bit lost{[1*]?:}. Can you give me a quick refresher?","content.76.13041":"Oh, I see, so you're kind of like... rebels, in a way.","content.76.13043":"In short, the Twelvians will be glad that they can count on your lances when the time comes...","content.76.13044":"Wise words indeed. Thank you for telling me your story. (Leave)","content.76.13045":"Oh cool, so whereabouts is that?","content.76.13046":"Come on; you mustn't know me that well. You could drop me off at Chillberg Island with no toothbrush, wearing nothing but a swimsuit, and tomorrow afternoon I'd show up at your pool with a smile from ear to ear and my pockets bursting with kamas. In other words, I'm what's known as a{[1*]?:} professional{[1*]?:}.","content.76.13047":"Alright, friend. I'll be back very soon, and I'll bring the treasure with me!","content.76.13048":"I don't think you'd fit through, to be honest. It's kind of a small portal.","content.76.13049":"(Get ready to fight)\\n\\nEnough chit-chat? Fine by me. Let's let our fists do the talking - it's the only language you understand, anyway.","content.76.13050":"I should have known. It's you who runs the demonic prison... because you're the one behind this whole situation with the pacts. I suppose the rifts are your doing as well.\\n\\n(Look around you)\\n\\nAnd there are some of them here, at the crossroads.","content.76.13051":"You've been manipulating me{[1*]?:} since the beginning...","content.76.13052":"What were you trying to do?","content.76.13053":"But the papers are talking about strange memories... And people haven't noticed the appearance of the statues or the rifts... Strange memories of Arlemia or Kali... What's all this about?","content.76.13054":"(Turn to Ahr Khayuh)\\n\\nAnd you? Did you know about this the whole time?","content.76.13055":"I... I heard voices...","content.76.13056":"(Give in to the experience)","content.76.13057":"(Concentrate on the voices)","content.76.13058":"(Concentrate on the voices)","content.76.13059":"(Concentrate on the voices)","content.76.13060":"Again... What the heck is going on?","content.76.13061":"Mais qui es-tu à la fin ? Que se passe-t-il ici ?","content.76.13062":"Je vois, toi aussi tu as ces étranges souvenirs...","content.76.13063":"Peux-tu me raconter tes souvenirs ?","content.76.13064":"Y a-t-il un indice quelque part que tu peux me dire ?","content.76.13065":"J'ai du mal à comprendre.","content.76.13066":"Est-ce que tu te sens... assimilée par cette autre personnalité ?","content.76.13067":"Tu aurais donc un indice sur la suite ?","content.76.13068":"Que veux-tu dire ?","content.76.13069":"J'y comprends de moins en moins quelque chose...","content.76.13070":"M'oui. Après tout, il y a déjà de nombreuses dimensions. Pandora n'est plus là, pas vrai ? Je vais demander à Otomaï, voir s'il pourrait m'orienter.","content.76.13071":"Ça ne te ressemble pas de m'envoyer en quête comme ça... Tu m'as habitué{[1*]?e:} à être plus solaire.","content.76.13072":"(Promettre sans certitude que vous reviendrez) ","content.76.13073":"What is it, exactly?","content.76.13074":"Here are the 10 Pirate essences.","content.76.13075":"Here are the 10 Pirate fabrics.","content.76.13076":"Here are the 10 Deathburn essences.","content.76.13077":"Here are the 10 Deathburn fleshes.","content.76.13078":"A treasure? I'm in!","content.76.13079":"Alright, then. I'll be careful{[1*]?:}.","content.76.13080":"Here are the 10 Abyssal Creeper fins.","content.76.13081":"Here are the 10 Abyssal Creeper seeds.","content.76.13082":"Here are the 10 Stasified scrap metals.","content.76.13083":"Here are the 10 Foggernaut guard essences.","content.76.13084":"... Cire Momore?","content.76.13085":"Where did Cire Momore come from?","content.76.13086":"And the curse on this island is somehow linked to Cire Momore?","content.76.13087":"I think I understand...","content.76.13088":"Hmm, so you're not responsible for these caverns?","content.76.13089":"Nascherite?","content.76.13090":"Where is she now? Is she still alive?","content.76.13091":"I get it now. Thank you.","content.76.13092":"Thanks for the warning. I'll be careful{[1*]?:}.","content.76.13093":"Who's talking to me like that?","content.76.13094":"Ça oui, je les ai bien calmés, mais...","content.76.13095":"*You look around, astounded{[1*]?:}. A feeling takes hold of you. You may have seen this place before, but you can't put the events together from memory*\\n\\nI was wondering... it's a bit weird here. What exactly is this place?","content.76.13096":"This is a lovely place.","content.76.13097":"I have to go.","content.76.13098":"I am indeed from the surface, and I've also traveled a great deal. In fact, I was embarking on a new journey. That's when my boat fell, because the sea opened up. Could you tell me a little about what's going on here?","content.76.13099":"Of course.","content.76.13100":"Something new?","content.76.13101":"So you left. But what about the rest of your people?","content.76.13102":"I see... Thanks for your story.","content.76.13103":"I see... Thanks for your story.","content.76.13104":"Your proposal will do quite nicely. I'll get right on it.","content.76.13105":"I see... I assume their leader is responsible for all this. Thanks for the information.","content.76.13106":"How did the sea open up? Are the Abyssal Creepers responsible?","content.76.13107":"And that's pretty much it. What do you think?","content.76.13108":"*You approve, deep in thought{[1*]?:}*","content.76.13109":"Alright, I'm off to find more information!","content.76.13110":"New Sufokians?","content.76.13111":"I get the idea, absolutely.","content.76.13112":"Tell me everything...","content.76.13113":"Sounds difficult to follow...","content.76.13114":"I see; I get it now.","content.76.13115":"What's the difference between the Abyssal Creepers and the Fish-Men?","content.76.13116":"I found the wreckage of a merchant ship...","content.76.13117":"I found some suspicious barrels, some kind of garbage...","content.76.13118":"That's fine with me. Here we go.","content.76.13119":"Come on; pull yourself together, Spriggiss. Everyone was born for a reason. You've already done so many things; you can't just give up like that!","content.76.13120":"Are they really your people? If you'd assimilated into the social principles of the Abyssal Creepers, you'd have lost the person you've now become. You spent time telling me about your journey. It suits you. You followed your path, and you were right to do so. You must bear everyone's heritage now.","content.76.13121":"Thanks for the warning. I'll be careful{[1*]?:}.","content.76.13122":"Do you know who the madman there who goes by the name of \"Black Ink\" is?","content.76.13123":"I don't want to bother you any longer. Have a nice day.","content.76.13124":"I see...","content.76.13125":"Your king?","content.76.13126":"I'll get going to this sanctuary I've heard so much about. I'll see what I find there...","content.76.13127":"We'll see; I can be stubborn{[1*]?:}.","content.76.13128":"Err, well actually... No, not really.","content.76.13129":"A military invention, anyway. An arms race isn't what I'd call scientific breakthroughs.","content.76.13130":"I'm looking for answers. For now, apart from a few altercations, there's nothing really conclusive. I don't want to make things worse...","content.76.13131":"I was wondering... What sort of scientific breakthrough are you talking about?","content.76.13132":"I found out what you were up to. I also broke one of your robots, there...","content.76.13133":"To be completely honest, I was just going about my exploration of Ereboria when I came across these tunnels...","content.76.13134":"You've got a nice worksite here.","content.76.13135":"You seem quite young to be talking to me like that. Who are you?","content.76.13136":"I'm just passing through.","content.76.13137":"So what's it for?","content.76.13138":"I can imagine! You know, I've always had a keen interest{[1*]?:} in science...","content.76.13139":"I had a look around your complex...","content.76.13140":"Hey there, friend! As I was going about my exploration, I discovered some tunnels, and Foggernauts seem to be inside them. I tried to figure out what they were doing here, but I didn't get any answers. I get the impression there was quite the worksite down there.","content.76.13141":"Apparently, the Foggernauts are there to mine the Stasili under the island.","content.76.13142":"*talk about what you discovered in the complex*","content.76.13143":"The Foggernauts seem to be convinced they're doing the right thing with their inventions.","content.76.13144":"They didn't seem particularly hostile.","content.76.13145":"Maybe...?","content.76.13146":"Could they be trying to colonize Ereboria?","content.76.13147":"But can this world really exist?","content.76.13148":"Hmm... yeah, I guess so. Actually, what are you doing here? This is quite a worksite!","content.76.13149":"I managed to enter the cemetery, and I found many names written on the tombstones...","content.76.13150":"So Raeliss was the one behind it all... I defeated him.","content.76.13151":"Apparently, he's gone missing.","content.76.13152":"Perhaps you could fill this role...","content.76.13153":"Thank you, Spriggiss. Take care of yourself and your heritage. May your journey be peaceful.","content.76.13154":"Like I said, I've got news about your friend, Azozu... Well, I found a map showing a hiding place where the pirates' treasures are hidden, but the map is incomplete and is of no use right now.","content.76.13155":"Not so fast. I might have an idea. I don't know if you remember, but in the pirates' camp, I saw shovels lying around.","content.76.13156":"Think, Nao... Why would the pirates need shovels if not to hide some nice treasure or clues to where their hiding place is?","content.76.13157":"Thanks! Don't go anywhere; I'll be right back... I'll dig around and see what I find.","content.76.13158":"I found Azozu!","content.76.13159":"All's well that ends well... Azozu wasn't alone, however... He was being held prisoner with another macawker!","content.76.13160":"Really? Great, I've got my own macawker now! I hope he won't make me as insufferable as you, kiddo. Come on; look out for each other, most of all.","content.76.13161":"Do you know anything about those pirates?","content.76.13162":"I see.","content.76.13163":"Do you know anything about the octopus crew?","content.76.13164":"Elaine? Who is she?","content.76.13165":"Hmm, see you later, then.","content.76.13166":"Recently we've been seeing Foggernauts in human form on the surface... Where do they come from? Moreover, where do the robotic Foggernauts we're used to seeing come from?","content.76.13167":"I see.","content.76.13168":"Quite the opponent...","content.76.13169":"No, it just appeared like that. Actually, I'm having a hard time seeing how to fight it.","content.76.13171":"I was wondering about the Foggernauts...","content.76.13172":"That's a nasty scar around your eye. How did it get there?","content.76.13173":"Maybe it's true.\\n\\n*You continue to think about this horrible opponent. There must be a way to retrieve this fabulous treasure... Deep in thought{[1*]?:}, you walk away from Cyross, telling yourself that someday you'll come back and put an end to all this*","content.76.13174":"I saw this Cire Momore everyone's talking about... It was a difficult encounter...","content.76.13175":"You must agree that it's not very convincing.","content.76.13176":"Very well, madam.","content.76.13177":"Stasili?","content.76.13178":"Stasis, Wakfu... Okay, I get it. But isn't it a bit dangerous handling things like that inside machines and other inventions? I get the feeling your operation could blow up the island at any time...","content.76.13179":"Speaking of curses... Aren't you here for Cire Momore's treasure?","content.76.13180":"Well, if it's for science...","content.76.13181":"You know, if you were nicer and more cooperative, I'd probably ask fewer questions.","content.76.13182":"Your complex?","content.76.13183":"Alright, alright.","content.76.13184":"I still get the impression your story is a vicious cycle.","content.76.13185":"It's still dishonest to craft weapons that are each more destructive than the last under the cover of scientific research.","content.76.13186":"I get that it's a sensitive issue. I hope you'll be careful.","content.76.13187":"So, the Foggernauts in human form who appeared recently are Unaltered Ones?","content.76.13188":"Thanks for the info!","content.76.13189":"You don't sound needy to me, talking about so much money...","content.76.13190":"(Sigh) True, we don't have the same problems.","content.76.13191":"Your colleague told me about a science complex in the area.","content.76.13192":"You should pay closer attention to what your men are doing.","content.76.13193":"And so... I'd have loved to see what happens there. You never know, I might even be able to help!","content.76.13194":"Look, maybe we can come to some sort of arrangement...","content.76.13195":"You've already heard of the treasure, I guess?","content.76.13196":"If you help me, perhaps we can share the treasure?","content.76.13197":"Exactly, I could try to find a way with your technomages' help.","content.76.13198":"Got it. Onward, science!","content.76.13199":"Are you turning a blind eye to what's happening under your command?","content.76.13200":"Oh yes, money...","content.76.13201":"Your world?","content.76.13202":"Face death... As in, Cire Momore?","content.76.13203":"Beat death... Are you talking about eternal life?","content.76.13204":"But isn't death what gives life meaning?","content.76.13205":"And do you think the ends justify the means? I have a feeling that Ereboria could implode with your worksite.","content.76.13206":"I get what you mean, but it's too easy to see it that way. I don't think it's that simple.","content.76.13207":"Be careful.","content.76.13208":"Pleased to meet you{[1*]?:}, Great Prince. ","content.76.13209":"Yeah, yeah... I know all about dirty work.","content.76.13210":"No worries; I'm used to it. But they weren't much into talking last time.","content.76.13211":"Yeah, or eliminate me... Well, we'll see.","content.76.13212":"let me guess... I have to go back there and try to learn more?","content.76.13213":"I see.","content.76.13214":"I don't know where to start...","content.76.13215":"Right, let's get back to doing the dirty work.","content.76.13216":"I'm off to... think.","content.76.13217":"I must go.","content.76.13218":"To be completely honest, I was just going about my exploration of Ereboria when I came across these tunnels...","content.76.13219":"I'm looking for answers. For now, apart from a few altercations, there's nothing really conclusive. I don't want to make things worse...","content.76.13220":"I was wondering... What sort of scientific breakthrough are you talking about?","content.76.13221":"I found out what you were up to. I also broke one of your robots, there...","content.76.13222":"I was wondering about the Foggernauts...","content.76.13223":"That's a nasty scar around your eye. How did it get there?","content.76.13224":"I must go.","content.76.13225":"I see.","content.76.13226":"Thanks for the info!","content.76.13227":"I heard about people going missing in Emelka Forest. I'll definitely pursue it, but first I need a lead. Do you have any details?","content.76.13228":"I can't be the first person to ask you that. Do you know if anyone investigated it? What happened to them? Where can I find them?","content.76.13230":"I get the idea...","content.76.13231":"I see - you think I'm like the other adventurers. I can assure you that with my help, those disappearances will be over!","content.76.13232":"Too bad...","content.76.13233":"Trust me - I'll give you a full report before attempting anything.","content.76.13234":"You're right - I'll go train more...","content.76.13235":"Alibert to Emelka? Gotcha. Thank you, I promise you won't regret it.","content.76.13237":"I'm here to get information about the recent disappearances around here. I heard from Farle Ingalsse that you could guide me.","content.76.13238":"Don't worry. I'll be very careful{[1*]?:}.","content.76.13239":"After careful consideration, this whole thing scares me a bit. I'll come back some other time...","content.76.13240":"What nasty things, those Prancing Chimeras... What do you think we should do?","content.76.13241":"Alright, I'll look into what area the Prancing Chimeras are appearing in, and I'll let you know what I find out.","content.76.13242":"Actually, I have a fear of amphibians. I should probably leave this mission to someone else...","content.76.13244":"I'm back from the mission you gave me, and I didn't see a single Prancing Chimera... That said, I think I've got a lead. I heard some strange cries from a dilapidated tower east of the forest. It might be related to the mission, but the tower is inaccessible due to a large gate.","content.76.13245":"What an odd story. What could cause such popular princesses to be forgotten?","content.76.13247":"You're right - I need to find a way to get through that gate. Be right back!","content.76.13248":"I just remembered I have to leave right away. It's too bad this is coming up now...","content.76.13249":"I'm coming from the princesses' tower, and they're known as the \"Misses Ugly\". I guess that tells you what kind of curse the god Osamodas cast on them.","content.76.13250":"Basically, the Misses Ugly had to forcibly kiss them to try to break their curse, and they turned into Prancing Chimeras as a result. Apparently that's what would happen to any adventurer who kisses them insincerely... We have to find someone who can break that curse.","content.76.13251":"In other words...","content.76.13252":"Good luck...","content.76.13253":"Je ne suis pas sûr{[1*]?e:} de ce que vous manigancez, mais je ferais tout ce qui est en mon pouvoir pour vous en empêcher.","content.76.13254":"Tu vas voir... (Consommer 1x Incantation de Féca Fragile)","content.76.13258":"I'm interested! I'm a bit rusty{[1*]?:}, so reviewing the basics would be good.","content.76.13259":"No thanks, I'd rather move on.","content.76.13260":"I'd like to attend the class on combat positioning.","content.76.13261":"I want to learn more about elements.","content.76.13262":"I want to learn more about melee and distance.","content.76.13263":"I want to change my class. I don't really feel like a true [#breedName].","content.76.13264":"I've already got all the information I need - I'm going to move on.","content.76.13265":"I'm sure{[1*]?:} of it, so let's go.","content.76.13266":"I changed my mind - I'm going to remain a plain [#breedName] for now.","content.76.13267":"I have some questions to ask you.","content.76.13268":"Where are we? How'd I end up here?","content.76.13269":"I've got everything I need.","content.76.13270":"I have more questions...","content.76.13271":"I've got everything I need.","content.76.13272":"What are you doing here?","content.76.13273":"I have more questions...","content.76.13274":"I've got everything I need.","content.76.13275":"Nice to meet you, Hooly! Yes, that's right - I only just reincarnated. It's kind of confusing. I don't totally understand what's happening to me.","content.76.13278":"I wouldn't mind a refresher.","content.76.13280":"That's amazing! But then, what're you?","content.76.13281":"Then where are we?","content.76.13282":"Other incarnates? I'm not the{[1*]?:} only{[1*]?:} one who's fallen{[1*]?:} before?","content.76.13283":"Thanks for your help, Huly. I'll check out the rest of the island and come back if I need to.","content.76.13284":"I have more questions...","content.76.13285":"I've got everything I need.","content.76.13286":"Can you tell me about the incarnation process?","content.76.13287":"I have some questions for you...","content.76.13288":"So far, so good. We'll see if I'm ready to move on to the next world. Who are you, anyway?","content.76.13289":"You don't say... Anyway, thanks for helping out.","content.76.13290":"Alright, I'm going to scope out the island.","content.76.13291":"Nothing, goodbye.","content.76.13292":"Do you know who I am?","content.76.13293":"I got everything I needed - till next time.","content.76.13294":"Could you tell me about Wakfu and Stasis?","content.76.13295":"I'd like you to share what you know about the World of Twelve.","content.76.13296":"Hmmm... What then?","content.76.13297":"150 years! Uh...","content.76.13298":"Ask more questions.","content.76.13299":"I got everything I needed - till next time.","content.76.13300":"Okay, I see what you mean. So basically, Wakfu is good and Stasis is evil, right?","content.76.13301":"Ask more questions.","content.76.13302":"I got everything I needed - till next time.","content.76.13303":"Ask more questions.","content.76.13304":"I got everything I needed - till next time.","content.76.13305":"Hello and thank you, Kheperalia. Life seems so peaceful on Rii. Looks like you're doing a great job!","content.76.13306":"That explains it. Wait, did you say I was a{[1*]?:} new [#breedName] earlier...?","content.76.13307":"I do have some questions for you.","content.76.13309":"Je reviendrai quand j'aurai une Incantation de Féca Fragile...","content.76.13311":"Well, I'd like to learn how to train and care for my dragoturkey. I thought you might be able to help me?","content.76.13313":"Thanks!","content.76.13314":"I want to learn more about line of sight.","content.76.13315":"I want to learn more about areas of effect.","content.76.13316":"I want to learn more about movement effects.","content.76.13317":"I want to learn more about combat states.","content.76.13318":"I understand, I'll try to help you.","content.76.13319":"I'd like more information about the ecosystem.","content.76.13321":"Actually, I'll come back later.","content.76.13322":"I'd like to attend the class on combat positioning.","content.76.13323":"I want to learn more about elements.","content.76.13324":"I want to learn more about melee and distance.","content.76.13325":"I want to learn more about line of sight.","content.76.13326":"I want to learn more about areas of effect.","content.76.13327":"I want to learn more about movement effects.","content.76.13328":"I want to learn more about combat states.","content.76.13329":"Actually, I'll come back later.","content.76.13330":"I'd like to attend the class on combat positioning. (Already done)","content.76.13331":"I want to learn more about elements. (Already done)","content.76.13332":"I want to learn more about melee and distance. (Already done)","content.76.13333":"I want to learn more about line of sight. (Already done)","content.76.13334":"I want to learn more about areas of effect. (Already done)","content.76.13335":"I want to learn more about movement effects. (Already done)","content.76.13336":"I want to learn more about combat states. (Already done)","content.76.13337":"I took care of the Wodents!","content.76.13338":"It's as good as done!","content.76.13339":"This is for the flowers.","content.76.13340":"Potions? I'm going to see!","content.76.13343":"I'm back and I've regained all my powers. I think it's time for me to go take on the strongest monsters in the Krosmoz.","content.76.13344":"I don't think I'm ready{[1*]?:} just yet. I'll come back later.","content.76.13345":"Seems you're jealous of my inordinate power... I'll have to show you what I'm made of!","content.76.13347":"I'll be waiting!","content.76.13349":"You're right - I'll go train more and come back later.","content.76.13350":"I've already got all the information I need - I'm going to move on.","content.76.13351":"Okay... What if I decided to kill everything I see?","content.76.13352":"Is that also the case on Rii?","content.76.13353":"I had something else...","content.76.13360":"I took care of the Wodents!","content.76.13361":"This is for the flowers.","content.76.13362":"I'd like more information about the ecosystem.","content.76.13363":"I've already got all the information I need - I'm going to move on.","content.76.13364":"I took care of the Wodents!","content.76.13365":"This is for the flowers.","content.76.13366":"I'd like more information about the ecosystem.","content.76.13367":"I've already got all the information I need - I'm going to move on.","content.76.13368":"Here are the 10 Sandyoptera Carapace Parts.","content.76.13369":"Here are the 10 Sandyoptera Seeds.","content.76.13370":"Hey! Don't scream like that.","content.76.13371":"(Scream in terror)","content.76.13372":"(Remain impassive, appearing unflappably calm and composed)","content.76.13373":"A... A talking vegetable?","content.76.13374":"Well, hey, vegetables came to life and started attacking the Lenalds. I guess it's no surprise they can talk as well.","content.76.13375":"That's right. I come from the Lenald village and would like to know what's going on here.","content.76.13376":"How strange. I fought a number of vegetables before coming here, but none of them seemed rational or sentient.","content.76.13377":"I don't even know where to start... Any idea where I could gain insight into your... nature?","content.76.13378":"Maybe those strange vegetables are preparing a meal. You should go ask them.","content.76.13379":"I'm sure{[1*]?:} there's no need to worry. See you soon!","content.76.13380":"(Leave quietly)","content.76.13381":"I have to go - so long.","content.76.13382":"I've got zero leads on the mutant veggies' origins...","content.76.13383":"(Describe your inspection of the pot and the cooking notes you found)","content.76.13384":"Those creatures seem to run on instinct, lacking sentience. I do believe you're an exception.","content.76.13385":"Well, I'm fine. And how are you, Tom?","content.76.13386":"(Nod, pretending to listen)","content.76.13387":"(Nod, making an effort to grasp your friend's questions)","content.76.13388":"But tomatoes are vegetables, aren't they?","content.76.13390":"Really? I always thought they were a vegetable.","content.76.13391":"Still, science is important, right?","content.76.13392":"It sounds like the Muvegitants worship a certain \"Great Zomkin\". Does that name ring a bell?","content.76.13393":"*You guess that the Muvegitants are somehow linked to the Zomkin*","content.76.13394":"I'll find a solution to our problem one way or another.","content.76.13395":"(Tell Tom Eyto that you defeated the threat)","content.76.13396":"I went to where all the Muvegitants converged: the huge rotting Cawwot at the height of the zone. It was like a compost pile where the Muvegitants tossed... Wabbits, Lenalds, and other creatures too...","content.76.13397":"Forgive me, I'm...","content.76.13398":"I just wanted to know...","content.76.13399":"(Leave)","content.76.13400":"I'm looking for someone named Liz...","content.76.13401":"(Decide to leave her alone)","content.76.13402":"(Leave)","content.76.13403":"I notice you're more trusting than the other Lenald villagers.","content.76.13405":"Why take a step like that?","content.76.13406":"You keep mentioning Inali... What's that? Is it like Feng Shui?","content.76.13407":"I see. Now that you mention it, I remember hearing two Lenalds talk about some Inali's sanctuary?","content.76.13408":"Interesting... Can I make this offering as well?","content.76.13409":"Can you remind me where the sanctuary is?","content.76.13410":"Thank you very much. I'm on my way.","content.76.13411":"About paying tribute...","content.76.13413":"(Leave)","content.76.13414":"What do you mean? What did I ever do to you?","content.76.13416":"A sacred relic... Why would the Wa steal it from you?","content.76.13417":"I didn't think the Wa was capable of something like that. Let me fix my mistake.","content.76.13418":"Check the arsenal? It's as good as done!","content.76.13419":"I don't think confronting your Loyal Lenald will solve anything.","content.76.13420":"(Decide to leave her alone)","content.76.13421":"(Decide to leave her alone)","content.76.13422":"Your destiny isn't to fight.","content.76.13423":"You've taught me your culture and traditions, though. Isn't your wisdom your greatest strength?","content.76.13424":"I'm sure{[1*]?:} your ancestors and Inali are still present. They're just waiting to be heard.\\n\\n(Nod slowly)","content.76.13425":"... Liz?","content.76.13426":"What exactly do you mean?","content.76.13427":"Oh yes, that's right... I'll go see the Loyal Lenald.","content.76.13428":"Enough about the reports, great king. Your army will never be a match for the Wabbits... There's no comparing you and them, no report on the arsenal.","content.76.13429":"*You raise an eyebrow, just a tad defiantly{[1*]?:}*\\nThough in your crummy arsenal, I see an old man, a kid, and a big guy in a dojo. Sounds like the setup to a joke.","content.76.13430":"(Go check on Liz)","content.76.13431":"I accept your challenge. I'll show you how ready you're not! Soon, thanks to me, you'll all be replacing your Lenald Woks with Flutegear...","content.76.13432":"It was very informative - I learned a lot!","content.76.13433":"I... I slaughtered them! Hahaha!","content.76.13434":"Well, we can head out... I just have one question: Don't I get a say in this?","content.76.13435":"(Stretch a bit)\\n\\nWell, it's a complicated conflict... But I've got to admit the \"relic\" has me curious!","content.76.13436":"Oh! The relic is actually a Dofus...\\n\\n*Ever since you beat up the Lenalds in the dojo and a goddess named you the chosen{[1*]?:} one{[1*]?:} to boot, you seem to have forgotten their customs and the value of respect... But your eyes light up when Liz mentions the Dofus. You follow up with a question, sounding a bit uninterested*\\n\\nWhere should I start, then?","content.76.13437":"So what'll you do, Liz?","content.76.13438":"Yes, let's do it together, Liz!","content.76.13439":"I understand. I'll do what I must to properly return it to the Lenald people. In your great clairvoyance, might you know where my quest leads next?","content.76.13440":"Hmm, okay.\\n\\n*Your thoughts are fixated on the Dofus*","content.76.13441":"Good luck with that.","content.76.13442":"It seems this place offered wisdom in the end. Your path is clear now!","content.76.13443":"*You decide not to disturb her*","content.76.13444":"I don't think I could ever understand your situation... I'm a pretty standard{[1*]?:} incarnate{[1*]?:} compared to you.","content.76.13445":"Yes... Good day to you, then.","content.76.13446":"Indeed... It was like a... an aggregate of various Muvegitants. How shall I put it? It was more like an instinct to survive and expand. I felt like I was fighting a force of nature, not one endowed with logic or reason. I'm sorry{[1*]?:}, I don't think it had sentience either.","content.76.13447":"I hope I stopped them from doing harm at least temporarily. I should be going, Tom Eyto. I'm glad to have met you... If I ever get more answers, I'll be sure to pass them along.","content.76.13448":"See you soon!","content.76.13449":"Yes, you look militarized.","content.76.13450":"A Black Wabbit? What's that about?","content.76.13451":"Thank you for the warning, great king. See you soon.","content.76.13452":"What's going on here? I just got to the island, and I'm already being court-martialed?","content.76.13453":"Well... If it's being offered, I wouldn't turn down the Woyal Bow of Pwodding.","content.76.13454":"I'm listening.","content.76.13455":"Ah, it seems our interests are aligned.","content.76.13456":"Deal. I mean... What about the Zwombbits?","content.76.13457":"Consider it done.","content.76.13458":"No particular reason. I was just stopping by to say hi.","content.76.13459":"I collected 10 Spowomawose.","content.76.13460":"I'll catch up with you there.","content.76.13461":"I see. I'll come back later, then.","content.76.13462":"I'm just passing through. Good luck!","content.76.13463":"Gotcha. I'll come back later. Good luck.","content.76.13464":"Okay... I'm off.","content.76.13465":"(Leave quietly)","content.76.13466":"Not yet...","content.76.13467":"Have you by any chance seen a huge zeppelin flying over your island?","content.76.13468":"I have a coded message for the Wa! Uh no... for the Loyal Lenald!!","content.76.13469":"Have you by any chance seen a huge zeppelin flying over your island?","content.76.13470":"Do you need a hand?","content.76.13471":"Want to taste my freshly pressed Black Cawwot Juice?","content.76.13472":"Have you by any chance seen a huge zeppelin flying over your island?","content.76.13473":"Have you by any chance seen a huge zeppelin flying over your island?","content.76.13474":"I should go...","content.76.13475":"I've temporarily eliminated the threat of the Muvegitants...\\n*You recount your journey in the devastated fields*","content.76.13476":"Yes, I'm a bit frustrated{[1*]?:} I couldn't make more progress. I just hope I bought some time...","content.76.13477":"I still think you're being a little extreme in your approach.","content.76.13478":"Going to war over an Ivory Dofus... I mean, that makes sense...","content.76.13479":"I don't really get why I was chosen{[1*]?:}. I still have so much to learn about Lenald culture...","content.76.13480":"Are you still preparing for war against the Wabbits?","content.76.13481":"I see. I'll do my best to find out what's going on. Good day, youl highness.","content.76.13482":"I've temporarily eliminated the threat of the Muvegitants...\\n*You recount your journey in the devastated fields*","content.76.13483":"I'm not only doing this for the Lenalds. This situation has me intrigued{[1*]?:}. And admittedly, I bear some responsibility in all this since I was involved in the Wa ascending to the throne.","content.76.13484":"He does seem to put a lot of faith in war.","content.76.13485":"Why did he sign a peace treaty with them if he hates them so much?","content.76.13486":"A Wabbit Kween? I didn't know the Wa had a wife...","content.76.13487":"I see. Thanks for all the info, Liz. I think I'll pay them a visit anyway...","content.76.13488":"You take care of yourself too, Liz!","content.76.13489":"He can't even spare a moment for an old friend?{[1*]?:}{[1*]?:}{[1*]?:}","content.76.13490":"Yes, I came to his rescue a while ago. Seems to me that worked out well for him.","content.76.13491":"I must speak with the Wa - the fate of your people is at stake.","content.76.13492":"Sounds more like imprisonment...","content.76.13493":"Me, suspicious{[1*]?:}? If anyone is suspicious, it's you.","content.76.13494":"What can I do to persuade you to let me see the Wa?","content.76.13495":"Did I hear that right? You just said I didn't understand anything and you want me to help you?","content.76.13496":"Could I see the Wa afterwards?","content.76.13497":"I want to get the \"Tear Collector\" quest.","content.76.13498":"My name is [#name]. I'm simply a{[1*]?:} wandering adventurer{[1*]?:}.","content.76.13499":"Well... That's very kind of you. I'd like to find out more about what's going on here. It seems the Wabbits and Lenalds are threatened by that strange pyramid in the distance.\\n\\n*You point to the distant pyramid. Its outline shimmers in the stifling desert heat, giving it an almost ghostly appearance*","content.76.13501":"*You nod encouragingly in an attempt to learn more. The slightest detail could help you*","content.76.13502":"Actually, I need information on the pyramid first.","content.76.13503":"I see. I'm sorry, all of that must have been challenging for you.","content.76.13504":"If I understand correctly, you're still adjusting to life here. ","content.76.13505":"The Wabbit and Lenald territories are pretty close by. Why not seek shelter with them?","content.76.13506":"When you mention that pyramid... what is it exactly?","content.76.13507":"Who is Sindrya?","content.76.13508":"(Offer encouragement)","content.76.13509":"Great, that would help a lot. How could I repay you?","content.76.13510":"(Grab the basket)\\n\\nYour perceptiveness is commendable, but I still don't know what I'll be able to do. Thank you for the lunch basket. I'll bring it to Sindrya right away.","content.76.13511":"I'm here on Alia's behalf... I've brought you a lunch basket.","content.76.13512":"(Hand over the lunch basket)","content.76.13513":"Okay... I'm off.","content.76.13514":"I was hoping you could tell me about that pyramid that appeared a while back. I'm trying to find out how and why it appeared, and maybe help resolve the matter.","content.76.13515":"What do you mean?","content.76.13516":"I've heard legends of Tal Kasha... So, she's back? I thought she was lost to Ogrest's Chaos.","content.76.13517":"Tal what now? Never heard of it.","content.76.13518":"I'm sorry{[1*]?:} to hear your companions are gone. Is there anything I can do to help?","content.76.13520":"Ah, you want to get to your clan?","content.76.13521":"I see...","content.76.13522":"*You want to ask her to say more about the Sandyoptera, but Sindrya seems to be getting impatient. You gently cut in with a reassuring{[1*]?:} word*\\n\\nSo you want more wood to continue with your project. I'll take care of it, let me help you.","content.76.13523":"(Leave)","content.76.13524":"I got some wood for your project.","content.76.13525":"Nothing in particular... I'm off.","content.76.13526":"I'm sorry{[1*]?:} to bring this up again, but I really need to learn more about the pyramid. The Wabbits and Lenalds are blaming each other for the sudden appearance of this desert. Things could take a dire turn if I do nothing.","content.76.13527":"True. Still, I'd like to help them. I hate to see blood spilled for no reason.\\n\\n*You keep the details of the conflict to yourself, particularly the existence of an Ivory Dofus*\\n\\nWhat's more, I could do something about Tal Kasha, or find out the specifics of what happened to your companions.","content.76.13528":"You really underestimate me - I can face all kinds of dangers.","content.76.13529":"(Listen to Sindrya)","content.76.13530":"(Keep listening)","content.76.13531":"I understand. It rose up and hit the coastline.","content.76.13532":"*Your mind fills with questions as soon as you realize that neither the Wabbits nor the Lenalds caused the desert to appear. But you keep them to yourself until Sindrya finishes her story*","content.76.13533":"I see. Thanks for your story. Is it... Is it possible they've been in the pyramid all this time?","content.76.13534":"Even worse?","content.76.13535":"Thank you... Wait, shouldn't you keep it?","content.76.13536":"I'll give it back once I'm done with it. It may have some kind of value...","content.76.13537":"I've got my hands full as it is. Thanks again, and see you soon.","content.76.13538":"I found this ancient pendant. It's important for my quest, but it's become very worn and I'd like to restore it.","content.76.13539":"Thanks a lot. I don't know a thing about jewelry making.","content.76.13540":"Thanks a lot. I don't know that much about jewelry making. I've crafted a few things, but that's it.","content.76.13541":"Thanks a lot. I'm pretty familiar with jewelry making, but this goes beyond my skills.","content.76.13542":"Thanks a lot. I'm a great jeweler.{[1*]?:}{[1*]?:}{[1*]?:} I've crafted tons of items... With this, though, I'm not sure where to start.{[1*]?:}","content.76.13543":"(Find a chair and read a bit while you wait)","content.76.13544":"(Stay nearby to see what she does)","content.76.13545":"(Stay standing and stare into space)","content.76.13546":"Thanks so much. It helps more than you know.","content.76.13547":"Hello. I found this pendant, and it seems to be connected to the Huppermages... Could you tell me anything about it?","content.76.13552":"It's a long story. But could you tell me what you think of this pendant?","content.76.13553":"Lady Jhessica? Who is she?","content.76.13554":"Wait... What?","content.76.13555":"I'd like to know more, yes. Especially about Tal Kasha, if possible.","content.76.13556":"(Continue listening)","content.76.13557":"*You wonder how Tal Kasha is involved in all this, but you're hesitant to interrupt the story*","content.76.13558":"(Struggle to keep your eyes open)","content.76.13559":"I see...\\n\\n*You describe how the pyramid reappeared a few months ago on the coast of Wabbit Island in an elemental storm*","content.76.13560":"Thanks for the history lesson. Is there some way to get rid of Tal Kasha?","content.76.13561":"Couldn't the pyramid be sent back to the sea floor?","content.76.13562":"Ah, all right. Well, I've learned a lot thanks to you. Thanks a lot.","content.76.13563":"Well, in other words... I was a good protector.","content.76.13564":"(Draw your weapons and attack)","content.76.13565":"(Stay still)","content.76.13566":"(Object)","content.76.13567":"(Draw your weapons and attack)","content.76.13568":"I... W-What happened?","content.76.13569":"I'm going to go. Thank you again for instructing me, Grand Master.","content.76.13570":"I'm back.\\n\\n(Describe what you've learned about the pyramid)","content.76.13571":"Nothing in particular. I'll come back later.","content.76.13572":"Sindrya wanted you to take this pendant. It's very valuable - really a nice gift. She may be a bit standoffish at times, but Sindrya seems to think highly of you.","content.76.13573":"What is it?","content.76.13574":"Let's not worry now, Bordegann will be fine.","content.76.13575":"Everything will be fine, Alia. I'll help you. All three of you will be able to return to Ohwymi.\\n\\nCould you tell me where to find Bordegann? I'll go and lend him a hand. I{[1*]?:} haven't looked into the Sandyoptera situation yet...","content.76.13576":"I'll get going. See you soon.","content.76.13577":"I wasn't expecting to run into anyone here. I didn't mean to interrupt - what were you doing?","content.76.13578":"I'm here on Alia's behalf. I've brought a lunch basket.","content.76.13579":"I'm glad to help - what's the problem?","content.76.13580":"Oh yes, the Sandyoptera? It's true I haven't looked{[1*]?:} into them yet...","content.76.13581":"I understand. You're so wise... Did you come to those conclusions yourself?","content.76.13582":"Ah, so you do have some contacts... I thought they'd rejected you altogether. For Wabbits and Lenalds alike, now's not really a good time to trust outsiders. ","content.76.13583":"Do you have any idea where the mother-hive is?","content.76.13584":"Endo... Endopterygotic... Bombyxolite? Wow.","content.76.13585":"That'll make executing the plan tricky.","content.76.13586":"Of course. Cheers, and see you in the mother-hive!","content.76.13587":"Okay, I'll go on ahead.","content.76.13588":"Yes. I defeated the bombyxolite.\\n(Show the strange substance you collected)","content.76.13589":"Good luck to you, Bordegann.","content.76.13590":"What do you know about the Sandyoptera?","content.76.13591":"What do you mean?","content.76.13592":"I see.\\n\\n*You wonder why Bordegann knows so much about the Muvegitants*","content.76.13593":"That's quite a unique and powerful ability...","content.76.13594":"I see. Thank you for the info. On that note, I'll head back out!","content.76.13595":"Very well. Where is he?","content.76.13596":"*You shake hands with Bordegann*\\n\\nI'll come back with solutions. Thanks for everything, and good luck building your vessel.","content.76.13597":"Okay, I'll go on ahead.","content.76.13598":"For now, I want to get the Scoreboard quests.","content.76.13599":"Say, just between us... What do you think of Alia?","content.76.13600":"Before I go, could you share more about the Sandyoptera?","content.76.13601":"Wow. I wasn't expecting that - didn't mean to tease you.","content.76.13602":"You go very well together. I hope you can get back to your village. With that, I'll return to my adventures.","content.76.13603":"(Keep going forward anyway)","content.76.13604":"(Turn around)","content.76.13605":"Hello. You must be Patwick? I was sent by Bordegann.","content.76.13606":"I know this is kind of sudden, but I'm an{[1*]?:} adventurer{[1*]?:}, and I'm on a quest to restore peace on the island. I've been told you can provide answers about the Muvegitants and the Sandyoptera... Could I trouble you? I have a long story to share.","content.76.13607":"Coffee, black, no sugar.","content.76.13608":"I'll have tea.","content.76.13609":"No thanks, I'm good.","content.76.13610":"Some water would be nice.","content.76.13611":"Yes, one named Tom Eyto. Does that sound familiar?","content.76.13612":"Well, I destroyed the Great Zomkin a while back. That must've slowed their growth quite a bit.","content.76.13613":"Now, about the Sandyoptera.\\n\\n(Share what you learned about the Sandy Cawwot) ","content.76.13614":"What do you mean?","content.76.13615":"(Set your index finger on your chin, confused but still wanting to listen)","content.76.13616":"So, what are you thinking?","content.76.13617":"Your time is running out? How so?","content.76.13618":"What can I do?","content.76.13619":"The gweat waw? That must be the one the Wabbit steward told me about. I really need to track down a book with an overview of this island's history...","content.76.13620":"Okay, I'll be on my way.","content.76.13621":"Wait... How is it that you created the Muvegitants?","content.76.13622":"How is it that you created the Muvegitants?","content.76.13623":"(Turn around)","content.76.13624":"I don't want to burden you, but you're responsible for a real mess out there.","content.76.13625":"If you're sincere, I'm sure{[1*]?:} you'll find a way to redeem yourself.","content.76.13626":"(Hold the scientist's gaze)","content.76.13627":"I'll do whatever I can to help make a brighter future for the island.","content.76.13628":"I found the documents you were talking about!","content.76.13629":"Spice?","content.76.13630":"You mean the pyramid of Tal Kasha? The one that emerged from the sea? Do you know its history?","content.76.13631":"I have to go inside the pyramid, I suppose? Not looking forward to that...","content.76.13632":"Yeah, I get it. I'll bring you the spice.","content.76.13633":"What can you tell me about spice?","content.76.13634":"Refresh my memory...","content.76.13635":"Yes, I know the story.","content.76.13636":"Yes, I remember now.","content.76.13637":"How... enticing.","content.76.13638":"What effects does spice have?","content.76.13639":"I see. Thank you for explaining.","content.76.13640":"What can you tell me about spice?","content.76.13641":"I decided I had to go to the pyramid.","content.76.13642":"What is it?","content.76.13643":"Very well... I'll let you rest. Thanks for the answers. See you later.","content.76.13644":"I'd like information about what's inside, what it looks like...","content.76.13645":"Well... I met a scientist who may know how to deal with both the Muvegitants and the Sandyoptera.\\n\\nIf I manage to eliminate both problems, the Wabbits and the Lenalds won't have a reason to go to war anymore.\\n\\nI need to get my hands on a resource that's apparently found in the pyramid: spice.","content.76.13646":"I see...","content.76.13647":"Okay, got it. Thanks!\\n\\n*You suddenly feel a sensation quite similar to the one you experienced{[1*]?:} when the Huppermage Grand Master probed your mind. Perhaps some residue of his powerful magic had remained within you, and was re-activated with Sindrya. You suddenly have a very clear view of her thoughts*","content.76.13648":"*The magic fades away. You realize that this strange moment of sharing occurred because Sindrya felt the need to share her feelings, but didn't know how. You understand her awkwardness, the distance she maintains from others, and most of all, the weight of her sadness. You decide not to say anything to avoid making her uncomfortable*\\n\\n*You say goodbye to Sindrya, before setting off toward the pyramid of Tal Kasha. The Ouginak exhales in response, clenching her fists. The one \"Trapped in the Desert\" watches you head for the horizon, your silhouette quickly obscured by the stifling heat of the sun*","content.76.13649":"All right... You win. I'll bring you your paper and ink.\\n\\n*You remember that Liz seemed to be writing a letter when you met her. It occurs to you that you could ask her for help*","content.76.13650":"Well, I'm back already.\\n\\nI was able to speak with the Kween. She needs paper and ink. Would you happen to know where I can get some?","content.76.13651":"Thanks a lot, Liz!","content.76.13652":"(Give the Kween the paper and ink)\\n\\nThis is for you. Now can I see the Wa?","content.76.13653":"Orange ink? Where could I have found that?","content.76.13654":"Well then, I still would've had to handle things... Look, I can just go beat up the Viziew myself. What are you sending me to get ink and paper for, anyway?","content.76.13655":"You entrust your field to someone so easily bribed?","content.76.13656":"Yes, ma'am!","content.76.13657":"I just talked to the Kween. I need paper that she'd like.","content.76.13658":"Well... You're not like other Wabbits. You seem a bit more hospitable.","content.76.13659":"What do you mean?","content.76.13660":"I think I understand... But why assassinate the current Wa?","content.76.13661":"Ah, the infamous great war...","content.76.13662":"Well, great history lesson. But what does it have to do with the Webels?","content.76.13663":"So, the current Wa Wabbit, husband of the Kween I helped restore to the throne, is no longer the same king who declared war on the Lenalds. In that case, why don't the Webels stop?","content.76.13664":"So, nobody likes the Wa Wabbit? How come there aren't more Webels, then?","content.76.13665":"In any case, you seem to be confirming that I may have aided the wrong monarch...","content.76.13666":"But why help me so freely?","content.76.13667":"Well... Thanks a lot, I guess.","content.76.13668":"No worries, I'll get by. I'm off, see you.","content.76.13669":"I have a favor to ask. Would you please juice my premium cawwot?","content.76.13670":"Thanks, youl highness!","content.76.13671":"(Give the Kween the paper and ink)\\n\\nIt feels like I've gone around the island several times... Well, here you go. Now can I see the Wa?","content.76.13672":"Say...\\n\\n(Show the letter you got from the Viziew)","content.76.13673":"Wait, so you were in cahoots with the Viziew??","content.76.13674":"So, you were plotting your own husband's assassination...","content.76.13675":"I see. You want the Wa to stay alive for as long as possible. That way, you'll avoid dividing authority.","content.76.13676":"Come on, you also wanted to get rid of me at the same time.","content.76.13677":"Okay, enough stalling. Take me to the Wa - we'll negotiate peace between the Wabbits and the Lenalds, and work on a solution to deal with the Muvegitants.","content.76.13678":"For one, it isn't your kingdom, and for two, I still have the letter you sent the Viziew. This is your handwriting, isn't it?\\n\\n(Present the letter resolutely)","content.76.13679":"I don't know{[1*]?:} if that's in your best interest. You see, the Viziew also kept a diary... In which he mentions his plans to assassinate the Wa, apparently with your support.\\n\\n(Show the diary)","content.76.13680":"(Open the diary and look for a compromising passage)\\n\\nAh, here we go. I quote, \"It's a good thing the Kween suppowted us by giving us hew gawden...\"","content.76.13681":"It's true that many Wabbits seem sympathetic to your cause.","content.76.13682":"*You look at the Kween, perplexed. You suspect she's had a difficult past, while also being extremely pragmatic*\\n\\nIf I understand correctly, you bought your people's love for you. You're a more magnanimous leader than the Wa Wabbit, but only because that's in your own best interest.","content.76.13683":"Well, I'll finally get to see the Wa again... Thanks for nothing, my Kween.","content.76.13684":"I see. I'll come back later, then.","content.76.13685":"Hello, your highness. It's been a while. I've come to check in... Apparently you taxed the Lenalds' Ivory Dofus?","content.76.13686":"Ah, so that means...","content.76.13687":"That has nothing to do with me, though.","content.76.13688":"You want to talk about the Muvegitants? If so, I've already started dealing with them...","content.76.13689":"In that case, you should refer to the pyramid... And the creatures in the desert.","content.76.13690":"(Look around you)\\n\\nOh, I understand perfectly. But anyway. I don't see you going to the front line...","content.76.13691":"Despite having an Ivory Dofus, you chose to lock yourself in your thwone woom...\\n\\nDid you know your subjects disapprove? They seem to be leaning in favor of your Kween.\\n\\nListen to me, I beg of you - you have to give the Lenalds the Ivory Dofus and work together against the external threat!","content.76.13692":"Maybe acting like a responsible leader and finding sustainable solutions would help you be accepted by your people. I heard about your father, Cywus. He actually signed the peace treaty...","content.76.13693":"I think you're being paranoid... Why not try working with them for once?","content.76.13694":"Time for another detour, then!","content.76.13695":"Uh... I thought I was going to see the Wa Wabbit. I'd like to speak with him.","content.76.13696":"Oh no, that's not at all how...","content.76.13697":"*Raising your voice in exasperation*\\n\\nI just want five minutes with him, that's all!","content.76.13698":"Does that mean if I get rid of the Viziew, you'll let me into the thwone room?","content.76.13699":"All right... You told me he was in your garden, right? I'll get him myself, then.","content.76.13700":"(Cross your arms, confused)","content.76.13701":"Yes, I can imagine. You'd be an outstanding leader if you agreed to make peace with the Lenalds...","content.76.13702":"Understood. I'll get going.","content.76.13704":"The Wa Wabbit may have tricked me into trading him the Cawwot Dofus for a fake Ivory Dofus.","content.76.13705":"Now that you mention it, I know exactly who I could go and see... I happen to know a scientomage with all kinds of ancient knowledge. He'll help us figure this out.","content.76.13706":"I'm headed to Rii. Thank you, Liz.","content.76.13708":"I'd like to ask you for some information about the Dofus.","content.76.13709":"*You frown with a look that says you're not here to joke around*","content.76.13710":"I've acquired the Ivory Dofus that was given to the Lenalds by Inali, the divine protector of the Lenald people. I feel like I don't really know how to use it. I think I remember that you were the guardian of the Ochre Dofus, so I'd like you to tell me what you think. (Show the item)","content.76.13711":"Okay... And is it possible that someone might have robbed it of its power?","content.76.13712":"(Reveal what you've learned about the Pyramid of Tal Kasha)","content.76.13713":"Uh, I just mean that I doubt Tal Kasha will be very open to discussion...","content.76.13714":"Maybe I can learn more if I go back to see the Grand Master of the Huppermage School...\\n\\nBut be that as it me, I'm quite surprised to hear you say that. Someone as knowledgeable and well-read as you knows nothing about such a powerful form of magic?","content.76.13715":"Thanks for your help, Otomai. Until next time.","content.76.13716":"All right, uh... I'll come back later to talk to you about the Ivory Dofus.","content.76.13717":"(Reveal what you've learned about the Pyramid of Tal Kasha)","content.76.13718":"I see... Can you tell me more?","content.76.13719":"So you think that Mirror of Light and Darkness is what allowed Tal Kasha to rob the Ivory Dofus of its power?","content.76.13720":"*You wonder if Sindrya might be able to give you some information about the mirror*\\n\\nI don't like all this, not one bit. I'll go and ask the locals, they've probably seen something.\\n\\nI have a feeling I'll have to go and face Tal Kasha directly.","content.76.13721":"Thank you, Grand Master. I'll head to the island to continue my investigation.","content.76.13723":"(Recount your conversation with the Grand Master)\\n\\nHave you seen anyone go into or out of the pyramid since you've been here?","content.76.13724":"*A few moments' thought is enough to figure out the connection between the Dofus that the Wa gave you and the Pyramid of Tal Kasha*\\n\\nSindrya, I think I know where the power of the Ivory Dofus is being held! I absolutely must go back inside the pyramid. If I were Tal Kasha, I'd keep a power like that in a room where I was always there to watch over it.","content.76.13725":"Listen, I've had countless adventures, defeated thousands of monsters, and restored peace between the peoples of the island.\\n\\nI'm touched{[1*]?:} that you're worried about me, but I'm absolutely certain I can do this. I'll take all the necessary precautions, and then I'll go and defeat Tal Kasha - that's a promise.","content.76.13726":"I'm sorry{[1*]?:} to upset you, but this Dofus is very important to me. It represents how far we've come together, and I have no intention of ending this adventure before I've taken care of all the details.","content.76.13727":"I'm very grateful{[1*]?:} to you for your help{[1*]?:} with my quest... and for trusting me. And now, I'm off to restore the power of the Ivory Dofus. Thank you, Sindrya.\\n\\n(Turn away from her)","content.76.13728":"*You can't hide your amazement at the idea that Sindrya is actually worried about you*\\n\\n*You decide that it would probably be better for everyone to finish the discussion here and now*\\n\\nOkay, I promise. I'll start by defeating the most powerful monsters on the island.","content.76.13730":"Thanks for everything, Sindrya. I'll come back to see you once the Dofus has regained its power.","content.76.13731":"(Leave)","content.76.13732":"What is it?","content.76.13733":"Train with a 9-cell Mr. Punchy","content.76.13734":"I've just returned from the pyramid... There's something I have to tell you.\\n\\n(Explain that you fought some Ougyptians)","content.76.13735":"I'm terribly sorry{[1*]?:}. I've collected a bit of spice for Patwick's experiments, but unfortunately, not enough that I can give you any.","content.76.13736":"Are you okay?","content.76.13737":"Thank you for your help. I never could have done{[1*]?:} it without you.","content.76.13738":"Patwick, I found some spice in the Pyramid of Tal Kasha!","content.76.13739":"(Wait patiently as Patwick analyzes the substance)","content.76.13741":"How can you be so sure?","content.76.13742":"This might sound like a terrible thing to say, but... Wouldn't you rather live out your final days in peace?","content.76.13743":"What do you mean?","content.76.13744":"I understand. What should I do now?","content.76.13745":"So it all comes full circle. I must go back to convince the Wa Wabbit and the Loyal Lenald to ease the growing tensions between their peoples.","content.76.13746":"Not even if I trade you a... black cawwot?","content.76.13747":"Okay, okay, no need to get upset. I'll be on my way.","content.76.13748":"Uh... It's... magical.","content.76.13749":"*You make the trade. It all went exactly as the Kween predicted... You examine the pwemium cawwot that you hold in your hands. It looks like a completely normal cawwot*\\n\\nSo this is a pwemium Cawwot? I don't see how it's any different from a regular cawwot. Well, anyway... I should get someone big and strong to juice it for me to make ink with it.","content.76.13750":"I don't have any right now, but I'll come back later.\\n\\n*The Guawd looks terribly disappointed. You'll have to come back later with a black cawwot, as this Wabbit clearly has a soft spot for them*","content.76.13755":"It's over. Give me the Ivory Dofus, and meet with the Lenalds to ease the tensions.","content.76.13756":"We found a solution to those problems.\\n\\n(Recount your meeting with Patwick, your expedition into the Pyramid of Tal Kasha to collect the spice, and your battle with the Bombyxolite, which should have greatly slowed the Sandyoptera's growth while Patwick works on developing a longer-term solution)","content.76.13757":"It seems she does all kinds of things behind your back. Maybe if you hadn't stuffed your face quite so much back then, she wouldn't have had to run those experiments on the Cawwot fields...","content.76.13758":"I mean, you were betrayed by your own guards, after all...\\n\\nIt's like I told you: to earn the respect of your people, you'll simply have to make peace with the Lenalds. Give them back their Dofus, and fight the Sandyoptera together!","content.76.13759":"All right, that's enough. Just write the damn invitations, or else...\\n\\n(Brandish your weapon threateningly)","content.76.13760":"Thank you, Your Majesty. And I'll see you very soon.","content.76.13761":"Youl Highness, I have some news for you...\\n\\n(Hand over the letter of invitation to the diplomatic council)","content.76.13762":"Liz has agreed to represent the Lenalds. Are you willing to let her go to the council alone?","content.76.13763":"*You wonder how you could possibly convince him. Maybe if you came back later?*\\n\\nAll right...","content.76.13764":"Thanks, youl highness!","content.76.13765":"(Bow respectfully to Liz, then leave)","content.76.13766":"Liz, I have some news for you...\\n\\n(Hand over the letter of invitation to the council)","content.76.13767":"Patwick, I have something for you...\\n\\n(Hand over the letter of invitation to the council)","content.76.13768":"You're going to bring a Muvegitant to the council? I... Hmm. Maybe that's not such a bad idea.","content.76.13769":"*You assume that Tom Eyto can't read, so there's no point in handing him an invitation. You explain the situation*","content.76.13770":"Thanks, Tom Eyto!","content.76.13771":"Alia, I have some news for you...\\n\\n(Hand over the letter of invitation to the diplomatic council)","content.76.13772":"I'm sure {[1*]?:} it'll all be just fine. I'll be there{[1*]?:} too. I think these people need an outside perspective that only you two can provide. Come on.","content.76.13773":"Thanks, Alia!","content.76.13774":"Here, this is for you...\\n\\n(Hand over the letter of invitation to the council)","content.76.13775":"Bordegann, you're a very charismatic person and a born leader. I'm sure you'll have your chance to persuade them.\\n\\nWho knows, maybe they could help build Sindrya's ship...","content.76.13776":"*You gratefully shake Bordegann's hand*\\n\\nSee you soon!","content.76.13777":"Sindrya, I've got some news for you...\\n\\n(Hand over the letter of invitation to the diplomatic council)","content.76.13778":"Maybe they'd agree to help you build the ship, if we can manage to convince them...","content.76.13779":"I understand. Thank you. Maybe I'll tell you all about it, if things go well!","content.76.13780":"Sure, that's easy to say...","content.76.13781":"It's true, I could resort to trickery. Got to fight fire with fire, right?","content.76.13782":"Patwick, I... I might have an idea. The reason the Wa Wabbit is so attached to the Ivory Dofus is that Count Harebourg stole the Cawwot Dofus from him.\\n\\nSo what if we gave the Wa Wabbit a new Cawwot Dofus? That way, he'd simply have to give the Ivory Dofus back to the Lenalds.","content.76.13783":"I don't have time for that! We need to settle this before a war breaks out. I'm this close to painting a piwi egg myself to try and fool him.","content.76.13784":"What? It's actually possible?","content.76.13785":"All right, then... I'll take care of it right away.","content.76.13786":"Hi Sindrya, I'm back!","content.76.13787":"I've defeated the heads of all the families on the island. I think I'm finally ready to go and fight Tal Kasha!","content.76.13788":"Wow, I'd swear this was a real Cawwot Dofus. In any case, this is our last chance. Thank you very much. \\n\\n(Leave)","content.76.13789":"I have the ingredients you wanted.","content.76.13790":"It's hard to believe it's really over. Then again, in a way, this is only the beginning...","content.76.13791":"We all worked together to make this peace a reality. People aren't always receptive or easy to work with, but it's always possible to find a path to peace. That's what this adventure has taught me.","content.76.13792":"But... Are you sure?","content.76.13793":"I see... Maybe Inali wanted you to decide for yourself, as the guardian. In that case, I accept it most gratefully. I'll prove myself worthy of it.\\n\\n(Bow respectfully to Liz, then take the Dofus)","content.76.13794":"Thank you very much. It was an unforgettable adventure, and I learned a lot from all the different residents of the island. See you soon, Liz.","content.76.13796":"I have a coded message for the Wa! Uh no... for the Loyal Lenald!!","content.76.13797":"Have you by any chance seen a huge zeppelin flying over your island?","content.76.13798":"Do you need a hand?","content.76.13799":"Want to taste my freshly pressed Black Cawwot Juice?","content.76.13802":"Thanks a lot. Have a good day!","content.76.13804":"We need to talk about the Ivory Dofus. It doesn't seem to be working, and I can't draw the slightest energy from it. Are you sure it's authentic?","content.76.13806":"I'm here about what you contacted me for.","content.76.13807":"I'm ready{[1*]?:}, show me.","content.76.13808":"(Cross your arms) Do you visit the ruined ship often?","content.76.13809":"(Nod) I see... Do you have any idea what it is?","content.76.13810":"Do you know what it's used for? I wonder who could've hidden that kind of relic on Mount Zinit...","content.76.13811":"(Take Otomai's note)","content.76.13812":"I did read the note you gave me.","content.76.13813":"Hm... If I've got it right, the stele belonged to an Eliatrope scientist who desperately tried to activate it. It should allow one to enter another world, his name is scribbled on it. He doesn't seem to have been able to activate it over several years, and the only idea he had left was forbidden by the \"patriarch\" of his people. So he wanted to hide the stele until things changed.","content.76.13814":"(Think) So, Qilby is some high-level Eliatrope scientist...? Seems pretty odd we never found traces of him before.","content.76.13815":"I imagine so... But what's that got to do with me?","content.76.13816":"I saw Sufokian Foggernauts mining incredible amounts of Stasis in the depths of Ereboria. I think it's your best shot at stabilizing the stele. Though first you'll probably have to convince whoever's leading the Sufokian expedition...","content.76.13817":"Very well. Let's try to discover this \"other world\" together. Let's meet there once I've spoken with Frida Mofette. In the meantime, you can look for a good place to set it down.","content.76.13818":"I need to ask you a favor. Basically... (Start sharing what happened to you)","content.76.13819":"I need to ask you a favor. Basically... (Start sharing what happened to you)","content.76.13820":"(Sigh) I suppose that's the way it is... What do you need right now?","content.76.13821":"Uh... Okay, if that's what you want.","content.76.13822":"*You hesitate to mention the stele, but then change your mind* I'll need a large amount of Stasis for various reasons.\\n\\n(After briefly pausing to look around, continue) Seems like there's a bit of it around here. I'll be needing several crystals' worth.","content.76.13823":"(Make it apparent that you're completely unprovoked) Great... and?","content.76.13824":"That's kind of you... I'll go do it somewhere, it won't hurt a moofly. Don't worry....","content.76.13825":"(Explain what happened to you in the Necroworld)","content.76.13826":"I get the feeling I didn't leave voluntarily. I don't really know what happened, or why I came back right before the moment that could've been my last.","content.76.13827":"Could be...","content.76.13828":"(Think) Do we really want to? I think we could learn from this experience to set limits on researching certain unknown artifacts.","content.76.13829":"I see where you're coming from. I saw horrifying things there. I don't wish for anyone to go there.","content.76.13830":"I'm right behind you.","content.76.13831":"I have your Cire Momore's candles.","content.76.13832":"I have your Ogrest's tears.","content.76.13833":"I've got your Necro Stones.","content.76.13835":"Thanks for helping me out. I needed a lot of Stasis.","content.76.13836":"(Sigh) Let's get this over with. Give me the list and I'll go get the resources...","content.76.13837":"Is that really the only reason?","content.76.13838":"Don't worry, this'll stay between us!","content.76.13839":"Why are you training so much?","content.76.13840":"Why are you training so much?","content.76.13841":"Ha ha, you're an ambitious one! But what is the Trool Fair, exactly?","content.76.13842":"That seems cool - I'll try and swing by there one of these days!","content.76.13843":"You've still got a way to go before we can work together as a team... Daldal! Good luck!","content.76.13844":"Don't you have any good plans that are lucrative enough for me to get involved?","content.76.13845":"The god Enutrof? I suppose his fortune must be immeasurable indeed.","content.76.13846":"Are you sure such a dimension even exists?","content.76.13847":"I hope I can find a way to do it during my adventure.","content.76.13848":"You'll soon hear tales of my exploits!","content.76.13849":"Talk about a fortune - I've never seen so much gold!","content.76.13850":"Talk about a fortune - I've never seen so much gold!","content.76.13851":"Talk about a fortune - I've never seen so much gold!","content.76.13852":"What a lovely aroma! What are you cooking?","content.76.13853":"... You cook with monster chunks?!","content.76.13854":"I can't say as I feel too reassured{[1*]?:}...","content.76.13855":"*You summon up your courage and take a tiny bite. An explosion of flavors overwhelms your uncultured palate{[1*]?:}*","content.76.13856":"It's... It's delicious, you mean!","content.76.13857":"I'll note that down... Do you often experiment with new recipes?","content.76.13858":"Wait, what do you mean, jellies?","content.76.13859":"He must've had a few too many cocktails on the beach...","content.76.13860":"You've piqued my curiosity. I'll confirm this rumor when I go to Bilbiza, then!","content.76.13861":"Am I imagining things, or do you have a slight accent?","content.76.13862":"So, how's Amakna?","content.76.13863":"Oh, really? What kind of rumors?","content.76.13864":"It definitely seems like cause for concern.","content.76.13865":"Got it, thanks for the info.","content.76.13868":"You seem like an incredible warrior!","content.76.13869":"A few centuries? I'll never live that long!","content.76.13870":"What was your toughest battle, Goultard, sir?","content.76.13871":"Rushu? You mean the Demon King?!","content.76.13872":"Wow! But wait... There's not supposed to be any connection between the World of Twelve and the demons' world! How'd you manage to get to the Shustuft Crust?","content.76.13873":"Good to know... In that case, I'll get back to training!","content.76.13874":"I didn't know you were so deeply involved with life in Astrub.","content.76.13875":"If you don't mind me saying so, you've collected an amazing amount of stuff in this house!","content.76.13876":"If you don't mind me saying so, you've collected an amazing amount of stuff in this house!","content.76.13877":"Now that's more like an Enutrof!","content.76.13878":"Kelba? Is that an island?","content.76.13879":"I see. So how do I get there?","content.76.13880":"They might be selling some valuable equipment. I suppose I'll stop by and have a look - bandits don't scare me.","content.76.13881":"Are those the Riktus you mentioned earlier?","content.76.13882":"Interesting. I guess I'll pay that pesky crow a little visit.","content.76.13883":"Hello, I was wondering why there's that statue of Ecaflip nearby. ","content.76.13884":"Since you're an Ecaflip yourself, I thought maybe you could help me...","content.76.13885":"You've got a real nose for business. All right, fine, I'll come back!","content.76.13886":"A dimension belonging to the god Ecaflip? Is that all?!","content.76.13887":"Fighting in divine arenas? Now you're talking!","content.76.13888":"You may not like my outfit, but I do, and that's all that matters. Have a good day!","content.76.13889":"You seem to care a whole lot about the environment!","content.76.13890":"Personally, I have to admit that watching over an ecosystem isn't all that exciting. I'd much rather head out on an adventure!","content.76.13891":"The god Osamodas? What do you mean?","content.76.13892":"*Keep your cool and listen to the story*","content.76.13893":"I've never heard of it...","content.76.13894":"I wonder what a dimension like that would look like.","content.76.13895":"One day, I expect I'll be able to tell you for sure whether it's myth or reality. Thanks for your story, it was fascinating!","content.76.13896":"Hey, I'll have you know I've already found quite a few treasures!","content.76.13897":"I'll take care of selling my{[1*]?:} own{[*1]?:} loot, but thanks for the info!","content.76.13898":"... Wait. Always say... you never know!","content.76.13900":"Not exactly a strong motivation to go there.","content.76.13901":"It all seems too good to be true.","content.76.13902":"Oh, sure, when I'm the one taking all the risks! You Enutrofs are all the same...","content.76.13903":"Fear not! There's not a villain alive who can steal my underwear!","content.76.13904":"I suppose you've had a bit of experience with sinister places?","content.76.13905":"I can help you! I'm not afraid of the undead!","content.76.13906":"Monk Island? I like the sound of that!","content.76.13907":"The Nun? Is this ghost really that dangerous?","content.76.13908":"Your... Underwear? I must have misheard you.","content.76.13909":"I'm sorry about your underwear.","content.76.13910":"Your self-sacrifice in the name of justice is incredible!","content.76.13911":"Are you okay? You seem preoccupied with something...","content.76.13912":"(Decide not to bother this Hullcatz)","content.76.13913":"I imagine that sailing got even tougher with Ogrest's Chaos.","content.76.13914":"I won't deny it, this is really exciting. For us adventurers, discovering the secrets behind these kinds of myths is our whole reason for living!","content.76.13915":"I could hardly claim to be much of an adventurer{[1*]?:} otherwise!","content.76.13916":"Well, I don't know.","content.76.13917":"Intriguing! I'll come back and tell you all about it once I've found it.","content.76.13918":"In that case, good luck in your quest.","content.76.13919":"I'm not sure{[1*]?:} I understand.","content.76.13920":"Are you sure you want to do that?","content.76.13921":"I'm not sure{[1*]?:} the god Sram would appreciate you hunting his followers in his dimension... And you know how to get there?","content.76.13922":"I prefer adventure. By the way, where'd you get those scars?","content.76.13923":"An Ouginak education? What do you mean?","content.76.13924":"Yeah, doesn't sound like an easy life...","content.76.13925":"Indeed! Where did your adventures take you?","content.76.13926":"I hope someday you'll find the information you're looking for about your people!","content.76.13927":"From what I understand, it seems like Brakmar is a pretty dangerous nation.","content.76.13928":"Oh, just all kinds of adventures! Too bad they didn't come to anything useful...","content.76.13929":"Any news from your son, Jenry Hones Jr.?","content.76.13930":"I'll think about it. Until next time!","content.76.13931":"You're a bounty hunter?","content.76.13932":"You're a bounty hunter?","content.76.13933":"You're a Bonta native?","content.76.13934":"Oh, really?","content.76.13935":"I will, definitely! What's the most impressive place you saw in your travels?","content.76.13936":"Pandalucia? What's that?","content.76.13937":"Sounds great, thanks for the recommendations.","content.76.13938":"Ruins in Bonta?","content.76.13939":"Can you tell me what leads your son was looking into?","content.76.13940":"I'm sure I'll run into him at some point in my adventures. Thanks for the info, and see you later!","content.76.13941":"Are the digs going well?","content.76.13942":"I'm just enjoying the pure forest air. Are you in charge of this grove?","content.76.13943":"You used to live in the Sadida Kingdom?","content.76.13944":"An important person passed away?","content.76.13945":"My sincere condolences for your queen...","content.76.13946":"That's a nice philosophy.","content.76.13947":"I'll head out to the countryside a little later, then. Thanks for sharing that with me!","content.76.13948":"Yes. I do know your father. Are you looking into crocodyls?","content.76.13949":"Are the digs going well?","content.76.13950":"Let me guess: the crocodyls?","content.76.13951":"Have you made any interesting discoveries on that front?","content.76.13952":"I see. I'll go there right away. I want to learn more about this proud warrior too! I'll come back and see you after I've read it.","content.76.13953":"(Cough awkwardly)\\n\\nOh, I've, uh... already read that stele.","content.76.13954":"The Jade Empire?","content.76.13955":"I don't really know. As it stands, that doesn't really tell me anything specific. I would have liked to find something useful for my quest.","content.76.13957":"So? Are the fish biting?","content.76.13958":"I'll keep your story in mind in case I ever have to go to that island!","content.76.13959":"I understand, but I was wondering if you could tell me about the islands you've traveled to.","content.76.13960":"For months?!","content.76.13961":"Hmm, the island seems exceptionally hostile.","content.76.13962":"And how did you manage to escape?","content.76.13963":"Hello. You seem quite intrigued by this statue.","content.76.13964":"Is that someone important in Astrub?","content.76.13965":"The city of mercenaries... That's the nickname people use for Astrub!","content.76.13966":"Yes... I've been told that the warm beer there is really something else.","content.76.13967":"I had no idea the city was so old.","content.76.13968":"Thanks for the story. I hope something can be done for the statue!\\n\\n(Say goodbye and leave)","content.76.13969":"(Decide not to bother this Hullcatz)","content.76.13970":"I could always go for a little swim off the coast of Bonta... I wonder how the water is at this time of year.","content.76.13971":"I can't swim, so it could be tricky... I'll keep an eye out in case I'm ever on a sea voyage near Bonta.","content.76.13972":"(Cough awkwardly)\\n\\nOh, I've, uh... already found that stele, south of Bonta.","content.76.13973":"(Tell the story of Crocobur, the mythical sword)","content.76.13974":"What do you suppose we should do? We don't have a lot of clues...","content.76.13975":"*You weigh the pros and cons. Apparently, there's an ancestral sword to be had... Surely it's worth taking an interest in*\\n\\nAll right, I'll go and see the Archivist right away.","content.76.13976":"I'm looking for books about Crocoburio.","content.76.13977":"Do you really think we'll find anything useful?","content.76.13978":"Okay. Let's go!","content.76.13979":"I've read the stele about Crocoburio's birth.","content.76.13980":"I've read the stele about Crocoburio's sword, Crocobur.","content.76.13981":"The Bonta archivist told me about Crocoburio's death.\\n\\n(Hand over the book you received from Master Hoot)","content.76.13982":"(Wait for Jenry to continue)","content.76.13983":"(Leave Jenry to his thoughts)","content.76.13985":"I'll look into all that...","content.76.13986":"I've examined the bones and the stele.","content.76.13988":"Hmmm... The stele only says that Crocoburio was very precocious, and that he quickly developed great ferocity and skill in combat. The truth is, we don't have any information about his size...","content.76.13989":"It's also possible that the stories were greatly exaggerated, especially with the passage of time.","content.76.13990":"That makes sense. Now let's talk about the stele...","content.76.13991":"How strange. Who would have deliberately desecrated this tomb to add this stele?","content.76.13992":"(Cross your arms)\\n\\nThis stele was written in Crocodyl, by crocodyls, right? Could it be some kind of urban legend?","content.76.13993":"So this stele could have been made by an imposter trying to make their story more believable. On the other hand, it's also possible that Crocoburio really did come back to life.","content.76.13994":"(Scratch your head)\\n\\nSo there are no other leads?","content.76.13995":"Well, thanks for that little expedition. It's too bad I wasn't able to get my hands on that legendary sword...","content.76.13996":"See you later!","content.76.13997":"I forget where I was with all this...","content.76.13998":"Not far from here? I'll head there right away.","content.76.13999":"I forget where I was with all this...","content.76.14000":"I could always go for a little swim off the coast of Bonta... I wonder how the water is at this time of year.","content.76.14001":"I can't swim, so it could be tricky... I'll keep an eye out in case I'm ever on a sea voyage near Bonta.","content.76.14002":"Got it, thanks.","content.76.14003":"I forget where I was with all this...","content.76.14004":"All right, I'll go and see Master Hoot.","content.76.14005":"All right, then, I'll try to find a maritime route southeast of Bonta.","content.76.14006":"I forget where I was with all this...","content.76.14007":"Thank you for the reward.\\n\\n(Leave)","content.76.14011":"Hello, uh, Sebsokk...? Yeah, of course, and I heard you needed some crowned thistles.","content.76.14012":"*You think to yourself that some guy hanging out in a dark corner can't possibly be a reliable source of information, and you're better off leaving without a word. In any case, you haven't collected any Crowned Thistles*","content.76.14013":"(Leave)","content.76.14014":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14015":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14016":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14017":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14018":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14019":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14020":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14021":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14022":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14023":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14024":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14025":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14026":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14027":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14028":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14029":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14030":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14031":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14032":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14033":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14034":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14035":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14036":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14037":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14038":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14039":"Uh... Yes, I've got it. Here.\\n\\n*You hand over the ingredient, which he snatches out of your hands*","content.76.14040":"I want to take care of the Boss! (Quests 231 to 245)","content.76.14041":"It seems you need seeds, right? (Quests 231 to 245)","content.76.14049":"Here are the 10 Primitive Scales.","content.76.14056":"Here are the 10 Ferociraptor Seeds.","content.76.14057":"I'll get back to hunting! Bye!","content.76.14058":"It seems you need resources, right? (Quests 231 to 245)","content.76.14059":"Here are the 10 Primount Seeds.","content.76.14060":"Here are the 10 Starvannah Seeds.","content.76.14061":"Here are the 10 Bwork Seeds.","content.76.14062":"Here are the 10 Wakfu Essences.","content.76.14063":"Here are the 10 Primal Skins.","content.76.14064":"Here are the 10 Celestial Flakes.","content.76.14065":"Here are the 10 Carminite Gems.","content.76.14066":"Here are the 10 Rusted Metal.","content.76.14067":"I haven't crossed half of the Shustuft Crust just to leave empty-handed...","content.76.14068":"Now tell me why these dimensional rifts have appeared.","content.76.14069":"You don't know? What are these journals, these statues, all these strange feelings that Twelvians are starting to experience?","content.76.14070":"This wouldn't be your first betrayal. I found out that you eliminated your brothers and sisters to take power. So why should I trust you? Why should I listen to you, instead of...","content.76.14071":"... It's not you...","content.76.14072":"Um, right. So, this is a little embarrassing{[1*]?:}, but I've obviously got{[1*]?:} the wrong person here. I'm sorry{[1*]?:}. Please don't use my coming here as an excuse to invade the World of Twelve. I know I broke the pact, but I thought you'd broken it first.\\n\\n(Turn your back on the Lord of the Shadows and start to walk away)","content.76.14073":"(Leave the palace as the terrified Shushus look on)","content.76.14074":"(Stare at Sthulhu)","content.76.14075":"But... why?","content.76.14076":"Don't worry; you'll get what's coming to you soon enough. I need to take care of this thing with the memories first, but after that, rest assured that I'll be coming back to settle the score with you two. Oh, and don't bother trying to hide. I'll turn the whole Shustuft Crust inside out to find you if I have to. I've already done it once, after all. And on that note... see you real soon, Sthulhu.\\n\\nOh, and I'll keep the remnants as a reward.\\n\\n(Leave furious{[1*]?:}, but swearing a little late that you wouldn't get caught again)","content.76.14077":"(Glare at the young woman, then leave)","content.76.14078":"(Glare at the demon, then leave)","content.76.14079":"Hi, Jacqueline. I found out a bit more about the Plantiguards...","content.76.14080":"I was there looking for that Bearkneck, and I noticed their hives were growing mainly on the sides of the mountain. I think he set up his lair right inside the mountain.","content.76.14081":"(Leave for the Plantiguard dungeon)","content.76.14082":"(Explain how your investigation went)","content.76.14083":"I'm back, Jacqueline. So...","content.76.14084":"Okay, Jacqueline, I've defeated Bearkneck. He shouldn't bother the Plantiguards anymore!","content.76.14085":"What are you going to do now?","content.76.14086":"I could give you a hand, if you like. You don't have to do everything by yourself.","content.76.14087":"Well, goodbye then.","content.76.14088":"We need to talk. I had a little look around the Shustuft Crust, and... things haven't exactly gone as we hoped.","content.76.14089":"(Recount your adventures)","content.76.14090":"All that time and all those fights, only to come up empty-handed...","content.76.14091":"Uh, no...? Unless I'm missing something.","content.76.14092":"That seems like a very optimistic way of looking at things.","content.76.14093":"From the very beginning? I could go have a look around Rii, see how things are going...","content.76.14094":"Gotcha. But before I leave, I'd like to talk about my expedition in the Shustuft Crust.","content.76.14095":"I need to talk about Rushu.","content.76.14096":"I'd like to talk about the forgotten islands of the Shustuft Crust.","content.76.14097":"I'd like to talk about Sthulhu and Ahr Khayuh's betrayal.","content.76.14098":"You know what, I should go.","content.76.14099":"I'm not so sure.{[1*]?:} He killed his brothers and sisters, but he never took the time to destroy their dimensions. So is he still dwelling on that past event? Or is he really not aware of those forgotten territories?","content.76.14100":"I don't know. He seemed pretty furious when I wielded the power of the Vestiges. Maybe some part of him regrets having come to this point.","content.76.14101":"I guess you could say I've made good progress. Having the help of the Vestiges also definitely helped, plus the fact that I have multiple primordial Dofus. But it's still not enough to beat Ogrest, or to prevent the Eliocalypse...","content.76.14102":"I know, don't worry. I'll be careful{[1*]?:}.\\n\\n(Once again, you wonder how this woman who looks like an ordinary member of the Guild of Hunters knows so much about such important topics)","content.76.14103":"I'd like to talk about the forgotten islands of the Shustuft Crust.","content.76.14104":"I'd like to talk about Sthulhu and Ahr Khayuh's betrayal.","content.76.14105":"I'd better go. Duty calls.","content.76.14106":"I feel like that whole island was just one big Shushu. Maybe Goultard was just one more illusion. I don't much feel like going back there to ask him. But why would Dementya show me that?","content.76.14107":"In any case, a lot of Twelvians wound up going to the Shustuft Crust because of that strange phenomenon with their memories. I even met an archaosologist there...","content.76.14108":"Seriously? All the demons I've met so far have been wicked, devious, and cruel. I can't really see us all getting along...\\n\\n*You have a brief flashback to Val'Ture*\\n\\nI know I shouldn't generalize, but...","content.76.14109":"I need to talk about Rushu.","content.76.14110":"I'd like to talk about Sthulhu and Ahr Khayuh's betrayal.","content.76.14111":"I'd better go. Adventure calls.","content.76.14112":"Speak for yourself. I feel like I'm being played for a fool. It's not a great feeling... But I've decided not to take vengeance right away. First deal with the causes. Then the consequences.","content.76.14113":"I still have to wonder what they were thinking. Sthulhu is one thing... But Ahr...","content.76.14114":"I'm so frustrated{[1*]?:}, though. I should have seen it coming. Of course those pact statues and rifts would open passages between the Shustuft Crust and the World of Twelve. I should have suspected those two from the beginning.","content.76.14115":"You don't want to know...\\n\\n*You shake your head*\\n\\nThe worst part is, I don't think I'll ever get used to the whole concept of this time loop. Some things change. And some things get reset. It's such a long process, and I have no way of judging the actual impact of what I'm doing to protect the World of Twelve.","content.76.14116":"I need to talk about Rushu.","content.76.14117":"I'd like to talk about the forgotten islands of the Shustuft Crust.","content.76.14118":"I'm leaving now. Thanks for the comforting words.","content.76.14119":"I'd like to talk some more about my expedition in the Shustuft Crust.","content.76.14120":"I need you to shed some light on a rather... technical... subject.","content.76.14121":"I know it's a bit vague, but I'm looking for some kind of passage. An unexpected feature, a point of interest... Ideally, an unknown portal.\\n\\nIt's a long shot, but I have to ask.","content.76.14122":"It won't be a waste of my time. The Shustuft Crust is huge. I'd rather start by following your suggestions.","content.76.14123":"Aren't you in a cheerful mood... Let's go.\\n\\n(Climb aboard the boat)","content.76.14124":"You know what, I'll just stay here after all.","content.76.14125":"I can't go any farther right now... But I think I hear voices calling me.\\n\\n(Concentrate to listen more closely)","content.76.14126":"*You've seen this dream before in the past*","content.76.14127":"(Try to concentrate on the memory)","content.76.14128":"(Try to draw on your strength)","content.76.14129":"(Concentrate harder, suppressing the urge to scream)","content.76.14130":"(Decide to stop resisting)","content.76.14131":"(Take a deep breath and open your eyes)","content.76.14132":"(Leave)","content.76.14133":"(Leave)","content.76.14134":"(Clear your throat and speak slowly)\\n\\nHello. I come in peace. Do you speak Twelvian?","content.76.14135":"(Leave)","content.76.14136":"I'm not exactly shipwrecked.{[1*]?:}\\n\\n*You tell Bworkana about your adventure in the swamps. Between the countless moskitos and the unnerving bones scattered across the marshy ground, together with the overwhelming humidity and terrible smells, you had an unforgettable trip... in all the worst meanings of the word*","content.76.14137":"A paddock? Come again? There must be some mistake.","content.76.14138":"No, I don't think so. And I don't suggest you try to make me, unless you want things to get messy...","content.76.14139":"(Show these Bworks that you won't just let yourself be manhandled)","content.76.14140":"(Run away without a moment's hesitation)","content.76.14141":"Do you always attack adventurers that pass through here? That's not very polite of you. I thought we could at least talk it over.","content.76.14142":"Yes, people often tell me I'm a pretty decent fighter. But why don't you just answer me?","content.76.14143":"*You wipe your face with the Bworkette's unbelievably filthy garment. You let her drop to the ground, motionless, before answering in a vicious tone*\\n\\nAll right, let's go through this in order. What's all this about a herd?","content.76.14144":"Thanks, but I'm not interested.","content.76.14145":"You're messing with me, right?","content.76.14146":"Unless one of us has a son first, it's going to be tricky for me and your daughter to reproduce!","content.76.14147":"Oh, I see. There's just one little problem: I'm... well...","content.76.14148":"That's not really the issue... Whatever, never mind. What's all this about a Twelvian herd?","content.76.14149":"You know that a relationship isn't just about looks, right? And besides...\\n\\n*You think about what standards the revolting Bworkette Chief might be applying here*\\n\\nNever mind. Just answer my question about the herd. Did you say there are other Twelvians in it?","content.76.14150":"No, that's not what I meant... Whatever, forget it. What's all this about a Twelvian herd?","content.76.14151":"Wow. You know what? Forget it. I'm not even going to respond to that. Just answer my question about the herd. Did you say there are other Twelvians in it?","content.76.14152":"Nice{[1*]?:} to meet you, Bworkana. I'm expecting the worst, but I have to go see what this is about.","content.76.14153":"Is everything okay? I saw you were being attacked. I stepped in to defend you, seeing as we're friends now...","content.76.14154":"Oh, nothing.","content.76.14155":"Oh, great! I was totally super interested in that.","content.76.14156":"Oh, okay. I thought her darling mother's blessing was enough on its own.","content.76.14157":"An ancient artifact? What kind?","content.76.14158":"*You sense that you're close to your goal. Your apprehension grows. Could it really be this easy? You don't know yet*\\n\\nOh... I see.\\n\\n(Nod politely and refrain from asking any more questions about the \"scaly Not Bworks\")","content.76.14159":"... Yes?","content.76.14161":"I've had better fights... but I feel like he went easy on me.","content.76.14162":"(Ask the gathered crowd whether matter possesses its own principle or whether it owes its existence to a higher principle, then argue the pros and cons of each position)","content.76.14163":"(Say that it is possible to complete punishing and strategically challenging battles without having to use 18 different states during the fight. Add that the current Toross is a good example of a boss with \"only\" two mechanics, namely start-of-turn AoE and the Necro transformation, but who's still really fun to fight because position and anticipation adjustments are both needed in choosing one's placement each turn to avoid lightning strikes)","content.76.14164":"(Promise that the Gelano is strong up to level 200+ and describe the possible builds for different level ranges, explaining that the difference in the stats is negligible compared to the kama savings)","content.76.14165":"(Make a small paper plane and throw it; it flies a short distance, then plunks down nose-first in the mud)","content.76.14166":"(Ask the Bworkettes about why the moskitos are pestering you even though you have no blood in your robotic body)","content.76.14167":"(Explain the principle of a perfect shot by executing a Robin Hood shot on a nearby post, adding a few old proverbs about the way of the bow and some mantras about calm and precision)","content.76.14168":"(Explain the obsolete nature of bartering and the societal role of a shared currency as described in the works of Harry Stottel)","content.76.14169":"(Demonstrate the different degrees of intoxication and alcohol's effects on mind and body)","content.76.14170":"There's one thing I don't understand... How'd he manage to double-cross us?","content.76.14171":"(Wait for a reaction)","content.76.14172":"That would also explain how he got into the UGW.\\nI don't know about you, but there's no way I'm admitting defeat.{[1*]?:}","content.76.14173":"So your chief is actually Zulnara.\\n\\n*You reflect that you could possibly become the chief of this clan of Bworkettes via marriage... Then you decide to push that idea out of your mind*","content.76.14174":"Thanks! See you soon, mom.","content.76.14175":"I've got a few questions...","content.76.14176":"What he's just acquired? Do you know where Nox went while I was fighting his puppets?","content.76.14177":"I don't like the sound of that... I'll go have a look around to learn more.","content.76.14178":"Who are you, exactly? You're the Bwork chief, is that it?","content.76.14179":"Great. I'll come back and see you as soon as I find anything.","content.76.14180":"*Even so, she seems to have a lot of influence over the clan. You wonder who the current chief is, if it isn't Bworkana*\\n\\nIs that... all you have to say? I have to admit, I'm impressed by how much you're able to say in so few words. Anyway, I have more questions.","content.76.14181":"I see. I want to ask you something else...","content.76.14182":"So that's why you created this herd?","content.76.14183":"I see. I won't push you any more on that subject. But I have another question...","content.76.14184":"Did I hear that you helped him?","content.76.14185":"What can you tell me about this island?","content.76.14186":"I couldn't help... noticing... that all the Bworks in your clan are women.","content.76.14187":"Thanks for the information. I'll leave you alone now.","content.76.14188":"Hello. Me Twelvian, me come in peace.","content.76.14189":"(Leave)","content.76.14190":"You could say that...","content.76.14191":"*You surmise that the Crocodyl artifact must be Crocobur. And Bworkana did tell you there was an artifact preserved in this building*\\n\\nI accept. When might we begin?","content.76.14192":"Let's fight!","content.76.14193":"I do have a few questions, actually...","content.76.14194":"All right, let's let our fists do the talking for now.","content.76.14195":"I'm just glad{[1*]?:} you're not hurt...","content.76.14196":"Yes, I understand. So Alraune is your sword? I noticed it was a Shushu sword... And then after her transformation, there was really no doubt.","content.76.14197":"(...)","content.76.14198":"(...)","content.76.14199":"(...)","content.76.14200":"(...)","content.76.14201":"(...)","content.76.14202":"It's true, I guess I've seen quite a few of them at this point... and I have to admit, I've never found it a pleasant experience. The last one was especially rough.","content.76.14203":"*In all your adventures, you've never heard of a Shushu protecting another living being out of sheer altruism. Could this one be an exception? After your recent misadventures in the Shustuft Crust, you're a bit skeptical*\\n\\nHmmm.","content.76.14204":"Listen, Zabimaru, I've been fooled{[1*]?:} by enough Shushus as it is. You won't trick me with your smooth talk.","content.76.14205":"I've seen it with my own eyes. How did you end up being attacked by the Starvannahs?","content.76.14206":"Yeah, I've actually crossed paths with it. Unfortunately, I haven't found a solution to its problem yet. What about the machines?","content.76.14207":"I see. What about the machines?","content.76.14208":"It sounds like your clan is in a pretty tough spot.","content.76.14209":"(...)","content.76.14210":"(Think to yourself that it's pretty ironic that the Bworks who exterminated the Crocodyls now find themselves trying to drive out the invaders. Even so, the mad Xelor has to be stopped, and you won't say no to this alliance... especially if you can get your hands on Crocobur as part of the deal)","content.76.14211":"I'll help you on one condition: that you immediately free the Twelvian slaves you're keeping in the herd. Except for those who want to stay, I guess...","content.76.14212":"*You grab Zulnara's hand and stand up*","content.76.14213":"*You immediately recognize a source of energy similar to what you've found elsewhere on Misty Isle*\\n\\nIs that the \"Crocodyl artifact\"? Looks more like an energy source that goes back to before they came to the island...","content.76.14214":"*You examine the sphere. It looks like nothing you're familiar with in this world. Still, your senses are on high alert. You sense traces of Wakfu in this object. You can't figure out what it is, but you can intuitively tell that it's something very important*\\n\\nWait... That's not Crocobur.","content.76.14215":"It's useful for my quest. I don't know just yet what I'm supposed to do with it. But Lebbocq will be disappointed!","content.76.14216":"I should try to find someone on the island who knows more about this. But Lebbocq will be disappointed!","content.76.14217":"Will do. See you later, Zulnara.","content.76.14218":"Maybe some other time.","content.76.14219":"I found some documents written by the person in charge of this place.","content.76.14220":"And to think, after all that, the island is still doomed... I have a hard time believing it!","content.76.14221":"Someone by the name of Qilby. The name is familiar... I've read one of his research journals in a lab inside Zinit. Otomai helped me to translate it, and I recognize most of the characters.","content.76.14222":"(Take the time to explain your discoveries in Mount Zinit, including the fact that there's actually a ship inside)","content.76.14223":"I found this letter, but it seems to be protected by some kind of Eliatrope encryption.","content.76.14224":"Yeah, that's the basic idea.","content.76.14225":"He was a scientist. According to his journal, though, he sank gradually into madness and betrayed the people closest to him... He mentions his brother a lot. It seems they built this island together.","content.76.14226":"That confirms what we learned with Laura.","content.76.14227":"I did find some Cryo capsules in the lab. Some of them were broken, too. There's also a passage in the journal about their interest in creating an ecosystem from the specimens in the capsules.","content.76.14228":"Well, you know, I've already traveled to other dimensions...","content.76.14229":"I don't mean to ruin the vibe, but this isn't helping us to stop Nox!","content.76.14230":"I'm no specialist, but I found this. Could it be connected?","content.76.14231":"Into the machine, yes. ","content.76.14232":"So what does it say?","content.76.14233":"(Approach the console)","content.76.14234":"Think you can unlock it?","content.76.14235":"What if we tried the same key that we used to unlock the archives in the Heart?","content.76.14236":"It seems that the author was Qilby's brother, who left it to him just before he died. I guess he wanted to make sure that only he could open it.","content.76.14237":"Indeed...","content.76.14238":"Of course. It might be our only chance to get to the bottom of all this!\\n\\nThose brothers lived millennia ago. I don't think they'll be mad at us.","content.76.14239":"All right, I'm counting on you. Let me know if you find anything!","content.76.14240":"I have a few questions...","content.76.14241":"Why is your clan still called the Bworkana Clan if you're the chief?","content.76.14242":"How did you meet Alraune?","content.76.14243":"You seem to be the only Bworkette in your age group...","content.76.14244":"So, Alraune, you were originally in Gisgoul?","content.76.14245":"I'd like to know more about the Crocodyls who used to live in this area...","content.76.14246":"I don't have any more questions. I'll leave you be.","content.76.14247":"I see. I have some more questions...","content.76.14248":"(...)","content.76.14249":"I see. I have some more questions...","content.76.14250":"Not to put too fine a point on it, but if you're all sterile, how'd you even manage to be conceived? I mean... I guess you weren't personally involved in the process...","content.76.14251":"I see. I have some more questions...","content.76.14252":"*You try to provoke her to see how she reacts*\\n\\nI've got to say, I haven't had many good experiences with Shushus. I still don't really trust you.","content.76.14253":"(...)","content.76.14254":"(...)","content.76.14255":"Vaal'Enthia? I see.","content.76.14256":"I'm not planning to, unless she wants to fight again to make me prove my worth... Anyway, I have more questions.","content.76.14257":"Yeah, definitely! I'd be interested to know what became of them.","content.76.14258":"No thanks.","content.76.14259":"So you know how to read and write?","content.76.14260":"I'll come back once I've read the book, and I look forward to talking to you about it.","content.76.14261":"I read your journal about the history of the Bworkana Clan!","content.76.14262":"(Keep talking about the book)","content.76.14263":"(Keep the moment going by talking about books you've read in the past, and promise to lend them to her the next time you come back)","content.76.14264":"Y-Yes?","content.76.14266":"I'm sorry{[1*]?:} to hear that. It's not easy to have no one to talk to about your interests. I understand.\\n\\n*Your mind turns again to the crushing loneliness you've felt since making those difficult decisions relating to your status as hero{[1*]?ine:} of the prophecy*","content.76.14267":"What is it, Zulnara?","content.76.14268":"Well... I'm a woman, so... To be honest, that might be a bit of a stumbling block as far as repopulating your clan.","content.76.14269":"We have so many duties and obligations. I've got to get back on the road after completing my quest here. There's no end to my journey in sight.\\n\\n*Shake your head compassionately, feeling briefly overwhelmed{[1*]?:} by your responsibilities once again*\\n\\nI'm sorry{[1*]?:}. I can't.","content.76.14270":"We have so many duties and obligations. I've got to get back on the road after completing my quest here. There's no end to my journey in sight.\\n\\n*Shake your head compassionately, feeling briefly overwhelmed{[1*]?:} by your responsibilities once again*\\n\\nI'm sorry{[1*]?:}. I can't.","content.76.14271":"(Maintain an expectant silence{[1*]?:})","content.76.14272":"I'd like that.","content.76.14273":"Maybe some other time.\\n\\n*You leave slowly, feeling intensely awkward{[1*]?:}*","content.76.14274":"(Take the time to slow things down)","content.76.14275":"*It was truly a heavenly moment*","content.76.14276":"*You enjoyed the experience, even though it was a bit strange*","content.76.14277":"*It was one of the worst experiences of your life, but once you were caught{[1*]?:} up in the moment, you couldn't stop*","content.76.14278":"See you soon, Zulnara.","content.76.14279":"What are you doing here? Let me guess... The Bworks captured and imprisoned you?","content.76.14280":"(Leave)","content.76.14281":"Really? Interesting. So far, all I've seen around here are Bworks.","content.76.14282":"So they arrived here after Ogrest's Chaos?","content.76.14283":"Yes, we should talk more about that. What's going on in this place? I've got my own suspicions, but I'd like to hear your take...","content.76.14284":"No problem. I'll try to find the key.\\n\\n*You hear grumbles of disapproval from the other cells. You sigh before continuing*\\n\\nThere don't seem to be any guards around at the moment, and those bars look pretty solid... I'll have to ask Bworkana, their elder, to give me the key.","content.76.14285":"You had me at \"fabulous treasures\". Do you think it's worth the effort?","content.76.14286":"I need to meet Zulnara and get my hands on that sword!","content.76.14287":"I see.\\n\\n*You reflect for a moment and come up with the beginnings of a plan*\\n\\nWe could try and learn a bit more about this clan. If we're able to figure out what happened, we'll gain useful information for our quest.","content.76.14288":"(Express yourself cautiously)\\n\\nI think I've got an in with Bworkana...","content.76.14289":"Yes, I thought of that too. But if we're going to try that, we need to improve our chances any way we can... What can you tell me about these Bworks?","content.76.14290":"I'll try to find that for you. Don't go anywhere... Not that you could, actually.","content.76.14291":"Sorry{[1*]?:}, Lebbocq, I can't risk compromising our charm offensive.","content.76.14292":"I found some resources that might interest you...\\n\\n(Hand over 10 Clan Emblems)","content.76.14293":"(Leave)","content.76.14294":"I found some resources that might interest you...\\n\\n(Hand over 1 Primitive Statuette)","content.76.14295":"I found some resources that might interest you...\\n\\n(Hand over 10 Carminite Gems)","content.76.14296":"We need to go over everything we've found.","content.76.14297":"Gisgoul? What's that?","content.76.14298":"Can I assume that this other Bwork clan is the one we've seen here, on this island?","content.76.14299":"I see...","content.76.14300":"A fertility statuette?","content.76.14301":"Speaking of which... All the Bworkettes here are females, and they seem to be on the older side. I haven't seen any children or adolescents in the swamp since I've been here.\\n\\nWhy did they separate from their male Bwork counterparts?","content.76.14302":"The plot thickens.","content.76.14303":"Pretty much all of the Bworkettes have those on them, either on their bodies or on their weapons... Personally, they remind me of Shushus.","content.76.14304":"Oh, yeah... This mineral supposedly forms when blood crystallizes under certain conditions, right? I've heard about that.","content.76.14305":"Any idea who that demon might be?","content.76.14306":"A while back, I might have been able to ask Ahr Khayuh, but... No. Besides, we have other leads to look into first.","content.76.14307":"I could go and ask Ahr Khayuh, but we have other leads to look into first. I'll go and see her as a last resort.","content.76.14308":"I know that sound. It sounds like people fighting. And they're coming this way...","content.76.14309":"Yeah, I know.\\n\\n*You consider that Lebbocq is pushing you so that he can get out of this cell as quickly as possible. But the lure of discovery is strong too*\\n\\nTo battle, I guess!","content.76.14310":"What should I do now?","content.76.14311":"All right, then!","content.76.14312":"Not really. But I could talk more with Zulnara at some point.","content.76.14313":"(Explain what you learned from Zulnara's journal)","content.76.14314":"Wait. What do we do with this strange sphere?","content.76.14315":"(Unlock the cell door)","content.76.14316":"Wait. What do we do with this strange sphere?","content.76.14317":"(Unlock the cell door)","content.76.14319":"(Unlock the cell door)","content.76.14320":"(Leave)","content.76.14321":"(Type \"Show error reports\" on the touch screen)","content.76.14322":"(Type in some random instructions)","content.76.14323":"(Try chronological sorting)","content.76.14324":"(Try sorting by location)","content.76.14325":"(Type in your birthday)","content.76.14326":"(Hit the console)","content.76.14327":"(Hit Milo)","content.76.14328":"(Type \"How do I beat Nox?\")","content.76.14329":"(Try reverse chronological sorting)","content.76.14330":"(Try another approach)","content.76.14331":"(Try another approach)","content.76.14332":"(Look over the errors in the first set of coordinates)","content.76.14333":"(Move on to the second set of coordinates)","content.76.14334":"(Try another approach)","content.76.14335":"(Try another approach)","content.76.14336":"(Try another approach)","content.76.14337":"(Try another approach)","content.76.14338":"(Wait for the revelation)","content.76.14339":"(Try another approach)","content.76.14340":"(Go back even further)","content.76.14341":"(Keep reading)","content.76.14342":"(Try another approach)","content.76.14343":"(Enter the command while cursing yourself for not having thought of it sooner)","content.76.14344":"(Ask Milo for help)","content.76.14345":"(Keep reading)","content.76.14346":"(Keep reading)","content.76.14347":"(Stop reading and take a moment to review everything you've discovered)","content.76.14349":"I'm also intrigued by this whole thing about Stasis.","content.76.14350":"What's up?","content.76.14351":"The Crocodyls again... For an extinct people, they sure show up in a lot of places.","content.76.14352":"So what do we do about the sealed entrance, then?","content.76.14353":"As a matter of fact... I do know one. In a manner of speaking.","content.76.14354":"Thanks for your help, Milo. We'll get that mad Xelor, I promise!","content.76.14355":"(Head out to find Jenry)","content.76.14356":"How's Arlemia doing?","content.76.14357":"And you think that coming to this island is the best way to fix that?","content.76.14358":"You could at least bring her back something she'd like.","content.76.14359":"That's what I like to hear! In the meantime, I'll take care of those ruins.","content.76.14360":"Jenry... I wasn't sure{[1*]?:} I'd find you here.","content.76.14361":"I found this strange artifact.","content.76.14362":"I found a strange Eliatrope structure. It was pretty well-hidden.","content.76.14363":"Personally, I think it looks more like a Wakfu egg.","content.76.14364":"Enough with the technical jargon, Milo! Is this thing a battery?","content.76.14365":"I'll see if I can find the right place for it!","content.76.14366":"Well, it just so happens that I've found an Eliatrope structure that fits that description.","content.76.14367":"It was some sort of container with a huge half-sphere on top like the ones from the platform. There were also tubes attached to it.","content.76.14368":"You're resistance fighters, I take it? But against whom exactly? This \"Lord Meccanox\"?","content.76.14369":"Nothing special. I'm leaving.","content.76.14370":"(Frown)\\n\\nWhat are your demands?","content.76.14371":"All right...","content.76.14372":"(Raise your eyebrows)","content.76.14373":"(Frown)","content.76.14374":"(Raise only one eyebrow)","content.76.14375":"And... that's all?","content.76.14376":"Alright, your demands have convinced{[1*]?:} me. I'll help you. What's the plan?","content.76.14377":"... So you weren't working all this time?","content.76.14378":"All that? Well, alright, I'll bring it to you.\\nBy the Twelve, I only just arrived on the island, and I already have to go back to do some harvesting and trading.\\n\\n(Briefly wonder why the Grambos need these ingredients)","content.76.14379":"There, I've brought the citronanas and planks.","content.76.14380":"I've brought the leathers and fibers.","content.76.14381":"I've brought a few tiramisoups.","content.76.14382":"Right. I brought you all your things, so now it's your turn. What's this plan of yours?","content.76.14383":"Do you mind telling me what it'll be used for?","content.76.14384":"Right. I brought you all your things, so now it's your turn. What's this plan of yours?","content.76.14385":"I see...","content.76.14386":"Do you mind telling me what it'll be used for?","content.76.14387":"Right. I brought you all your things, so now it's your turn. What's this plan of yours?","content.76.14388":"I see...","content.76.14389":"In fact, could you tell me what you'll use it for?","content.76.14390":"Right. I brought you all your things, so now it's your turn. What's this plan of yours?","content.76.14391":"I see...","content.76.14392":"(Swallow with difficulty)","content.76.14393":"(Feel determined{[1*]?:} despite yourself)","content.76.14394":"(Remain wary{[1*]?:}, as the speech has no effect on you)","content.76.14395":"So... I hate having to do this, but I'm three times your size. There's no way I'd go unnoticed{[1*]?:}...","content.76.14396":"I... What? It's not called a tributary. And it's west of here! Wait, you want to make him slip on a citronana peel?","content.76.14397":"But how do you expect your supervisor to slip if the plank is nailed down?","content.76.14398":"Oh, so that's why! You should have told me. So you're fighting to get salt on your stones, and you're using all that fish to entice Meccanox? You should have asked me to bring you food from the get-go.\\nYour plan is so hopeless...","content.76.14399":"(Wait)","content.76.14400":"Who was he?","content.76.14401":"I'm leaving.","content.76.14402":"I'm really sorry{[1*]?:} about your friend who got disintegrated. I didn't have time to react...","content.76.14403":"I'm not the best person to tell you what you do or don't deserve. I think it's a shame to give up. I'm sure{[1*]?:} that through dialogue, you'll be able to get more freedoms and benefits.","content.76.14404":"Well, it wasn't hard to change your mind.","content.76.14405":"What exactly was Patrohix doing?","content.76.14406":"I see.","content.76.14407":"We'll see... For now, I'd rather go it alone. I think being with you will only expose me to Nox.","content.76.14408":"As I keep telling you, I'm three times your size! Right, that's enough of this. I'll be back when I have some news.","content.76.14409":"(Leave)","content.76.14410":"One of your companions got killed, and that's all you have to say?","content.76.14411":"(Leave)","content.76.14412":"*You think about it. It's true that you're not a team leader*\\n\\nYeah, well...","content.76.14413":"I see. You're a pragmatic Grambo, serving your community in spite of it.\\n\\n*You think things over for a moment. The situation seems to have taken a sinister turn since you agreed to help the Grambos. Perhaps Meccanox knows what he's doing*\\n\\nI'm not here to take sides. I was originally an outsider{[1*]?:} to this whole situation.","content.76.14414":"The clockmaker? Do you mean that Xelor?","content.76.14415":"Oh...","content.76.14416":"I find this clockmaker interesting. I think I should meet him. Maybe that way, I could help you improve working conditions for your... employees.","content.76.14417":"*The more you think about it, the more you realize it'd be best to keep a low profile. You decide that an alliance with Meccanox would be a good way to learn more about the island. Let's just say it would still be more productive than allying with Julpi*\\n\\nPerfect. I hope I can help you out.","content.76.14418":"Alright.","content.76.14419":"(Leave)","content.76.14420":"(Leave)","content.76.14421":"Hey, Laura. I gave Milo and Lebbocq everything they needed for the scramblers, and I talked to all our allies. How are you getting on?","content.76.14422":"An Ebony Dofus, yes, or at least it looks like one.","content.76.14423":"(Summarize your discoveries and show the artifact of which you are now the guardian)","content.76.14424":"I can assure you that he's the one who has the six Primordial Dofus. This one is an anomaly. ","content.76.14425":"I get the impression that the magic of the Dofus will forever be elusive to us.","content.76.14426":"You can always try your luck and snatch it from its{[1*]?:} new{[1*]?:} guardian{[1*]?:}...","content.76.14427":"(Nod in agreement)","content.76.14428":"What's your point?","content.76.14429":"Do you mean to say this Dofus was born from Grougalorasalar's tears?","content.76.14430":"Possibly, but it's still just a theory. Either way, its power seems to be depleted or latent once again. I'm not sure it'll be much use against Nox as it is.","content.76.14431":"(Hear Lebbocq's choked exclamation)","content.76.14432":"It was the only thing to do. These people deserve some rest after suffering so much. And we couldn't take the risk of Bulak striking again.","content.76.14433":"(Hear Jenry's little outraged cry)","content.76.14434":"This is no time to be tearing each other apart. What's past is past, and time is against us!","content.76.14435":"You don't have to take so many risks.","content.76.14436":"Do you have something in mind?","content.76.14437":"(Take some time to recover from your emotions) ","content.76.14439":"Alright, I'm listening. What's your plan?","content.76.14440":"They're certainly formidable, but that doesn't make them invulnerable. What are you talking about?","content.76.14441":"That means that if we can cut off this flow...","content.76.14442":"How many scramblers do you think you can make?","content.76.14443":"What do you say, Lebbocq?","content.76.14444":"(Smile faintly at the archaosologist's feigned unwillingness)","content.76.14445":"I see. Did you manage to determine them?","content.76.14446":"I feel like our plan is coming into focus!","content.76.14447":"You've been busy during your stay in the area!","content.76.14448":"I guess it's feasible. But don't expect brilliant results, because they're still Grambos. It'll be quite something if they even understand the instructions...","content.76.14449":"That's a good idea! The Zurikats owe me, which should make things easier.","content.76.14450":"Actually, it will be quite easy to convince the Bworks. Unless you want to use your charms to do it yourself, Lebbocq!","content.76.14451":"I had an inkling.","content.76.14452":"To find out, we'll need to get to work! Does everyone know what they still have to do?","content.76.14453":"Alright, then. In that case, let's go. I suggest we all meet in the UGW headquarters once we've completed our tasks.","content.76.14454":"In that case, I'll leave you to it. Get to work!","content.76.14455":"(Place the tubes in the desired location before returning to your other tasks)","content.76.14456":"I brought you some metal!","content.76.14457":"(Leave)","content.76.14458":"I'm sorry{[1*]?:}, but that's the best I have.","content.76.14459":"If you're up to the task, I'll help you bring back as many as you want. ","content.76.14460":"I've still got some things to do. Good luck!","content.76.14461":"I'm sure{[1*]?:} you'll manage.","content.76.14462":"I've brought you a water clock.","content.76.14463":"I've brought you the pipes you asked for.","content.76.14464":"I have the tick intockts.","content.76.14465":"(Try to mime the situation and what you expect from the Starvannahs)","content.76.14466":"(Sigh and sit down to draw diagrams)","content.76.14467":"(Wait patiently)","content.76.14468":"What did he say?","content.76.14469":"(Mime a thank you to the Zurikat)","content.76.14470":"(Turn to Jenry)\\n\\nDo you think you can explain the rest?","content.76.14471":"Well, in that case, I'll let you handle things. I still have work to do!\\n\\n(Leave, waving goodbye to the Zurikat)","content.76.14472":"(Take some time to explain your plan)","content.76.14473":"That's the basic idea, yeah.","content.76.14474":"I've known Alraune to be more talkative...","content.76.14475":"(Watch the shushu sword wriggle around to dodge the Bwork's hand)","content.76.14476":"So, what's the problem? Something's obviously on your mind.","content.76.14477":"There's no point in trying to fool yourself... The spirit that possessed the Zurikat the tribe locked up wasn't a Crocodyl ghost. It was a demon. Or part of the spirit, at least.","content.76.14478":"It was Bulak Shub'Tan, a major demon. The missing piece of the puzzle. The last Crocodyls vanished in a blood ritual to summon this demon. They gave their lives in the sole hope of defeating you.","content.76.14479":"This time, he's really quite dead. I made sure{[1*]?:} of it. Someone had to put an end to his misdeeds.","content.76.14480":"Yeah, so a shushu.","content.76.14481":"Let's just say your mother didn't really leave them much choice when she used Alraune's powers to gain the upper hand. But in truth, Bulak betrayed them all. All he wanted was a way to return to the World of Twelve. The Crocodyls' fate was of little importance to him.","content.76.14482":"I found this text in their temple. They're the last words of their leader... This should help you better understand their motivations and what led to this disaster.","content.76.14483":"Our meeting point is in the Grambo village.\\n\\n(Point out the spot)\\n\\nSee you soon!","content.76.14484":"Not this time, Zulnara. It looks like the time has come for us to settle the score with the clockmaker!","content.76.14485":"Julpi, the time has come to let the UGW's demands be heard!","content.76.14486":"Let me be clear: The plan is for me to deal with knocking Nox around. But to do that, you have to clear the way for me, understood?","content.76.14487":"I want you to help Amelia sabotage machines to prevent them from attacking us.","content.76.14488":"He's not going to do anything at all, because I'm going to deal with him myself.","content.76.14489":"So, I'm not sure{[1*]?:} that...","content.76.14490":"That means you can have as much salt on your stones as you like. You can even eat something else. Citronanas for every meal, for example.","content.76.14491":"Freedom means you can do whatever you want, which even includes whipping Meccanox!","content.76.14492":"Well, I don't know. That's for you to decide. Reading books, picking flowers, traveling the world...","content.76.14493":"You'll be able to taste all the stones in the World of Twelve without it being anyone's business!","content.76.14494":"I'll leave it to you to ask Amelia about any technical details.","content.76.14495":"Come on! You just need to be a good teacher. We'll meet you here once we've finished.","content.76.14496":"Perfect. Now we just need to wait for the scramblers.","content.76.14497":"That's great already, so well done.","content.76.14498":"Can it really blow up?","content.76.14499":"...","content.76.14500":"Come on... I've had worse. I'll meet you at headquarters once it's done.","content.76.14501":"No, I don't think so. Nothing was displayed, and it didn't give off any energy.","content.76.14504":"Well, as it happens, I found this artifact and was wondering if it was related.","content.76.14505":"Personally, I think it looks more like a Wakfu egg.","content.76.14506":"Enough with the technical jargon, Milo! Is this thing a battery?","content.76.14507":"It's as good as done!","content.76.14508":"It was some sort of container with a huge half-sphere on top like the ones from the platform. There were also tubes attached to it.","content.76.14509":"It's as good as done!","content.76.14511":"It's done. I put an artifact in his machine.","content.76.14512":"So you were right.","content.76.14513":"Little by little, we're nearing the truth.","content.76.14514":"I'll do what I can. I want to know too.","content.76.14515":"I'll try to find that for us.","content.76.14516":"Okay, but I can only give you 20 minutes.\\n(Consume 1x Ancestral Feca Incantation)","content.76.14517":"Hello...\\n(Give a friendly wave)","content.76.14518":"(Decide not to bother the animal)","content.76.14519":"(Decide not to bother the animal)","content.76.14520":"I don't understand, sorry{[1*]?:}.\\n\\n(Point to the house behind the creature)\\n\\nWhere exactly is your master? A Twelvian seems to live here...","content.76.14521":"Hmmm, I see. You're starving, little guy! Don't worry: I'll bring you something to eat.","content.76.14522":"(Bring back a fish)\\nHere you go.","content.76.14523":"(Watch what the creature does with the fish)","content.76.14524":"It smells good...","content.76.14525":"For... Me?\\n\\n(Point to your chest)","content.76.14526":"Uh... Right.\\n\\n(Bring the bowl to your lips and look the Zurikat in the eye)","content.76.14527":"Yes, yes...\\n\\n(Take a sip)","content.76.14528":"Yes, yes...\\n\\n(Take a sip)","content.76.14529":"Yes, yes...\\n\\n(Take a sip)","content.76.14530":"It's very good.\\n\\n(Take another sip)","content.76.14531":"It's very good.\\n\\n(Take another sip)","content.76.14532":"It's very good.\\n\\n(Take another sip)","content.76.14533":"Very well, let's do it that way.\\n\\n(Finish the soup with gratitude and a satisfied sigh)","content.76.14534":"(Think about the Zurikat's other drawing)\\n\\nUm, I don't have anything on me right now. I'll go bring you the other item.","content.76.14535":"(Think about the Zurikat's other drawing)\\n\\nI assume you're talking about this...\\n\\n(Hold out the fruit to the Zurikat)","content.76.14536":"(Keep watching the Zurikat from outside the hut)","content.76.14537":"(Try to see what the Zurikat is drawing)","content.76.14538":"It's me?","content.76.14539":"(Place your hand on your chest, then on your drawing, and speak clearly)\\n\\n[#name].","content.76.14540":"Well, now we've been introduced. You're Brossar, and I'm [#name]. I'm looking for this island's treasures.\\n\\n(Smile at the creature)","content.76.14541":"I'm looking for, uh... Another Twelvian. The person who built the hut.","content.76.14542":"I don't recognize this person...\\n\\n(Shake your head)","content.76.14543":"It's... Jenry Hones Jr.!","content.76.14544":"So you've seen him? Where is he?\\n\\n(Awkwardly mime a place on the horizon and make a few improper gestures that no one would understand)","content.76.14545":"I, uh... I don't know what that means.","content.76.14546":"(Nod and look at the drawing)","content.76.14547":"(Hold out the fruit to the Zurikat)\\nHere you go.","content.76.14548":"I've got nothing to say to you.\\n\\n(Leave looking scornful)","content.76.14549":"Still giving grand speeches to no one, I see!","content.76.14550":"Well...","content.76.14551":"Yes, I... I know.","content.76.14552":"Well, well, well!","content.76.14553":"Yes, I remember. We found a stele from the Dofus Era announcing Crocoburio's resurrection.","content.76.14554":"I need you to refresh my memory.","content.76.14555":"I understand better. What makes you think the Crocodyls were really here, in this... savannah?","content.76.14556":"It would seem facts are facts. How and why did the Crocodyls end up here? And more importantly, where is Crocobur?","content.76.14557":"(Cross your arms)\\n\\nI think you're doing all this even more to impress your colleagues and family.","content.76.14558":"I ran into him too. He's the one who told me where I could find you.\\n\\n(Show the drawing)","content.76.14559":"How did you meet?","content.76.14560":"I can't believe the Zurikat pointed you to this location. That means he knows what Crocodyls are. I wonder if we can make him understand exactly what we're looking for.","content.76.14561":"Wait, about what you were saying... Didn't you say you didn't understand what these symbols were?\\n\\n(Take out your drawing and point to the symbol that was on the dolmen)","content.76.14562":"Drawings, or rather paintings, can be seen all over this savannah. It glows in the night, probably activated by starlight... Even the monsters have strange symbols painted on them.","content.76.14563":"I'll see what I can do. I need traces of that paint, don't I? Some painted material should do the trick.","content.76.14564":"Very well. I'll meet you there.","content.76.14565":"I've got some news. And let me tell you, it wasn't easy.\\n\\n(Hold out 10 Celestial Flakes, one Vesperal Tusk, and 10 Astracacia)","content.76.14566":"So it was Brossar who made it?","content.76.14567":"Yes, that's... That's what you said when I gave you the fruit, isn't it?","content.76.14568":"Hmm... It's the name of his paint.","content.76.14569":"But on the dolmens, the drawings were only visible at night, weren't they? Wait...\\n\\n(Take out the drawing of the dolmen that Brossar made for you and point to the night symbol)","content.76.14570":"So, the fruit lights up at night. As for the vial, the... Splotch, I guess it's so you can see the paint even in daylight.\\n\\nIf the grass in the area glows sporadically at night, I suppose it's because of the pollen from this tree.","content.76.14571":"Crocodyl, Crocodyl... That's all you ever talk about. Can you let me enjoy my super deduction for five minutes?","content.76.14572":"I also wonder how I managed to say something so logical. It's not like me. Not bad, eh? I should try being smart{[1*]?:} more often, shouldn't I?","content.76.14573":"(Look at the drawing)","content.76.14574":"I... Is that Brossar? He looks different...","content.76.14575":"Timo...","content.76.14576":"I see. It's possessing... It's controlling the region's animals.","content.76.14577":"Jenry, I hate to burst your bubble, but the monsters in this region are really fearsome and keep attacking us. When I see this drawing, I don't really feel like going to chat with their leader, even though he's a Zurikat like Brossar, and Brossar is really kind.","content.76.14578":"Jenry, I didn't get a chance to tell you this before, but I talked to Zulnara, the Bwork chief. She told me that the Starvannahs' leader was some kind of vengeful Crocodyl spirit. It looks like it's possessing that poor animal.\\nEven the Bworks couldn't get rid of it...\\nSo, we'll proceed as follows. You stay here, as it's safe here. And I'll switch to my main profession: doing dungeons.","content.76.14579":"No, Jenry, this time it's too dangerous.","content.76.14580":"Hmm... You can join me once I know more. For the time being, I'd like you to keep talking to this Zurikat. I get the impression you've developed a good relationship with him.","content.76.14581":"(Leave)","content.76.14582":"I've just realized this hut doesn't belong to a Twelvian... It's probably his, actually.","content.76.14583":"I'm not sure what we can do, honestly. It's possessing a Zurikat, and by extension, it's controlling all the Starvannahs. I tried hitting him very, very hard, but his wounds kept regenerating... We'd have to find a way to exorcise it.\\n\\nHonestly, this spirit is bad news... It's very, very sketchy.","content.76.14584":"Not really... Come to think of it, Jenry, you haven't said much about Crocobur since I got back{[1*]?:}.","content.76.14585":"Come on. If what the spirit says is true, Crocobur is somewhere on this island. We'll find it, I'm sure{[1*]?:}. Its power will surely free Timo.","content.76.14586":"Oh, by the way, I found this.\\n\\n(Reveal Timo's medallion)","content.76.14587":"Here, I think this is yours.\\n\\n(Give Brossar the medallion)","content.76.14588":"It'll be okay... There's nothing more I can do for now, but I promise I'll look for a solution later.","content.76.14589":"*You immediately recognize a source of energy similar to what you've found elsewhere on Misty Isle*\\n\\nWell... I wasn't expecting that. It's a new energy source. I'll be able to activate another resonance!","content.76.14590":"*You examine the sphere. It looks like nothing you're familiar with in this world. Still, your senses are on high alert. You sense traces of Wakfu in this object. You can't figure out what it is, but you can intuitively tell that it's something very important*","content.76.14591":"I'm going to continue exploring the island. I think this sphere will help me a lot. Thank you very much, Brossar. I'll be back!","content.76.14592":"I looked at the drawing. Where were we again?","content.76.14593":"Well, men, it was a very tough fight.\\n\\n(Talk about your exploration of the Starvannah dungeon)","content.76.14594":"A trap, you say?","content.76.14595":"I see. You seem to have a connection with this island. Funny, maybe you can solve these mysteries for your grandfather.","content.76.14596":"(Look at Brossar)\\n\\nYes, it may well be the key.","content.76.14597":"(Decide not to bother the animal)","content.76.14598":"(Decide not to bother the animal)","content.76.14600":"(Leave)","content.76.14601":"Speaking as equals is fine.","content.76.14602":"Well, nowhere. I'm leaving.","content.76.14603":"I looked at your Noxine-Express. It was busted. To make sure{[1*]?:}, I repaired the device and reconfigured the signal.","content.76.14604":"(Leave)","content.76.14605":"(Leave)","content.76.14606":"(Leave)","content.76.14607":"Yeah...","content.76.14608":"Your associates? Do you mean the Grambos who can't drink water more than once a week?","content.76.14609":"I see. I suppose that's a wiser option than heading straight for disaster with citronana-and-tiramisoup revolts.","content.76.14610":"I think you're honest... And your strategy may have a better chance of working than outright revolution, which would exacerbate the conflict. But we need to achieve tangible results for the Grambos.","content.76.14611":"Speaking of compromise... I'd love to help you, but I'll need some sort of compensation.","content.76.14612":"You see, I'm a great admirer{[1*]?:} of your technologies. Should I assume Nox designed everything himself?","content.76.14613":"I'd like it if I could study his inventions somewhat... Maybe you could tell me a little about him, so I could understand his inventive spirit.","content.76.14614":"Fine by me. I'd like to help you and the Grambos anyway. Especially if you're in danger from Nox's impatience. If I solved your problems, could it speed up your production?","content.76.14615":"Very well. Where should we start?","content.76.14616":"I'll get going right now.","content.76.14617":"Uh, hello. I'm not very familiar{[1*]?:} with the area, and I'd like to ask you a few questions. If you have the time, obviously.","content.76.14618":"(Look away and leave)","content.76.14619":"No, they had nothing.","content.76.14620":"I could fetch you some. But first, what are Fragmonnites?","content.76.14621":"(Look away and leave)","content.76.14622":"(Wonder why the earth has gone that way)\\n\\nI guess its Wakfu got extracted somehow...\\n\\n(Look at the Nox machines that are extracting Wakfu from the ground to operate)","content.76.14623":"I see. Yeah, it's very annoying. Your production line could suffer. Roughly how much would you like?","content.76.14624":"Alright, I'll get that for you.","content.76.14625":"(Hold out your hand in turn)","content.76.14626":"The uni... what?","content.76.14627":"(Pretend to know her)","content.76.14628":"That's a very quick introduction. I imagine you were talking about the United Grambo Workers earlier.","content.76.14629":"Oh, great... Getting back to the original topic, I have a few questions about the forest, and I was wondering if you could answer them.","content.76.14630":"Uh, were you listening to me{[1*]?:}?","content.76.14631":"Combat Ferociraptors? What do you mean?","content.76.14632":"They're incubating them? What's this all about? They'll never manage to hatch them like that.","content.76.14633":"Well, alright. So what do you actually want me to do for you?","content.76.14634":"What?","content.76.14635":"Wouldn't it be easier to take the eggs back from them and put them back in the wild?","content.76.14636":"Why would he attack you? He wouldn't even know it was you who found the eggs.","content.76.14637":"(Roll your eyes) Alright, alright. I'll help you if you promise to answer my questions when I'm done.","content.76.14638":"Let's go together; it'll help me gain their trust. Just discreetly introduce me as a{[1*]?:} new{[1*]?:} worker{[1*]?:}.","content.76.14639":"I was wondering, what project exactly are you working on here?","content.76.14640":"Is that all? Sounds like some business on the side... Admit it: That's not all you're doing, with your big machines and your big magnifying glasses.","content.76.14641":"Funny invention. As much as I admire your machines, a Noxine-Express isn't exactly awe-inspiring. I prefer dragoturkeys. But I'll see what I can do.","content.76.14642":"Well, well, well! That sounds revolutionary! I can't wait to be transported by a Noxine-Express. I wholeheartedly accept the mission.","content.76.14643":"I would have preferred to ride a big, flying Noxine, but never mind. I quite like the camping chair. Let's go.","content.76.14644":"I was wondering. Nox must be one heck of a genius to pull it all off. Is he the only master on board? He might have... partners. An alliance.","content.76.14645":"I see...\\n\\n(Think that it's becoming necessary to meet Nox to find out more about what he does)","content.76.14646":"Well... It's obvious to me that this great inventor has an ulterior motive. I think that your transport company is a front and that you are no strangers to the state of this territory. This \"Nox\" must be looking for something here...","content.76.14647":"You know, I could help you with your project if you told me more... Or I could go talk some sense into him. There are a number of options available.","content.76.14648":"Really? Hmmm...","content.76.14649":"An energy source?","content.76.14650":"(Speak in a reassuring, confident tone)\\n\\nI agree. I'll start by securing this energy source. Then we can decide on a plan to thwart the clockmaker. Don't worry: I'm used to this kind of situation. Let's go!","content.76.14651":"I told you to stop.\\n\\nI heard your sinister laugh from kilokameters around when you tricked me.","content.76.14652":"Well? No more assertive words from you, Meccanox? You're going to tell me everything! Do you hear me? Everything!\\n\\n(Give the Grambo a well-deserved slap)","content.76.14653":"How do you get into this box?\\n\\n(Raise your hand again)","content.76.14654":"Special trapdoors?","content.76.14655":"Okay, we'll try that. I'm warning you: The time for diplomacy with me is over. Next time I see you, if you've tried to swindle me again...\\n\\n(Throw the Grambo onto his crate and leave without a backward glance)","content.76.14656":"Thanks for the tip about the box.","content.76.14657":"You really helped me out. I'd never have guessed we'd have to put Nox machines in the trapdoors to open the box.","content.76.14658":"Ah, now that opened the box! But there was no energy source inside!\\n\\n(Shout)\\n\\nNone whatsoever! There was a huge robot instead! The machines assembled into one!","content.76.14659":"You do know you've done something really bad, don't you?","content.76.14660":"(Say nothing{[1*]?:} for a moment before resuming mercilessly)\\n\\nAlright, that's it. I don't want anything more to do with you. Give me the energy source.","content.76.14661":"Hmph...","content.76.14662":"Amelia?","content.76.14663":"*You immediately recognize a source of energy similar to what you've found elsewhere on Misty Isle*\\nWell... I wasn't expecting that. It's a new energy source. I'll be able to activate another resonance!","content.76.14664":"*You examine the sphere. It looks like nothing you're familiar with in this world. Still, your senses are on high alert. You sense traces of Wakfu in this object. You can't figure out what it is, but you can intuitively tell that it's something very important*","content.76.14665":"Thanks for the advice.\\n\\nYou should join them, Amelia. I know you can't escape the nation jokes, but this is a dangerous island, and you'd better group together. Besides, your talents would be really useful to us.","content.76.14666":"Oh, really?","content.76.14667":"Huh, all's well that ends well. Meccanox, I don't know if your choice to follow Nox is the right one. But I'd like to answer you on one point: I'm not like Nox. I don't blame you for being loyal to someone.\\n\\nBut you have to be consistent in life.","content.76.14668":"See, I told you I'd get revenge if you ever tricked me again. Now it's done. We're even.\\n\\n(Leave)","content.76.14669":"If Nox sees that Meccanox has already taken a beating, he'll leave him alone and focus on me instead.","content.76.14670":"(Take a different path than Amelia)","content.76.14671":"Some of the... machines... were defective and took a dislike to your Grambo friends. I saved them, but only just.","content.76.14672":"(Hand over 30 Fragmonnites)","content.76.14673":"Stop that right now.","content.76.14674":"Thanks for the tip about the box.","content.76.14675":"Amelia! What are you doing here?","content.76.14676":"Have you been here long?","content.76.14677":"Were you the one who...? Wait. Don't tell me. Were you the one who compromised the Fragmonnite harvest too?","content.76.14678":"I can imagine. I was duped by Meccanox...\\n\\n*You are furious inside*","content.76.14679":"I... see. How do you suggest getting out of here? Come to think of it, this isn't the first time we've been stuck in a prison.","content.76.14680":"Interesting. I've got no choice but to help you. The sooner we get out of here, the sooner I can take revenge on Meccanox.","content.76.14681":"You really made a fool of me!","content.76.14682":"I don't mean to ruin your effect, but a Xelor did the same thing to me not long ago.","content.76.14683":"Last time I checked, your massacre didn't really do you much good. Are you in such a hurry to go back to your prison?","content.76.14684":"Oh, really? You can always try, but I've handled tougher Shushus than you!","content.76.14685":"I've really made him angry this time... Let's see what this sword is worth!\\n\\n(Wield Crocobur and stand up to the demon)\\n\\n(If you are in a group, please wait until the other members are ready to fight Bulak)","content.76.14686":"I hope you enjoyed it, because it will be your last.\\n\\n(Wield Crocobur again)","content.76.14687":"If you think you can get away with another bluff...","content.76.14688":"What are you up to now?\\n\\n(Turn to the back of the temple)","content.76.14689":"Uh... Not yet. I'll go right away.","content.76.14690":"I've got the sea bosses.","content.76.14691":"I've got the ancestral essences.","content.76.14692":"I've got the primitive scales.","content.76.14693":"(Leave in silence to avoid causing any trouble)","content.76.14694":"Yes, but I feel like I'm missing something...\\n(Go back and find 1x Ancestral Feca Incantation)","content.76.14695":"(Decide not to bother this Hullcatz)","content.76.14696":"I'm really sorry{[1*]?:} for you.","content.76.14697":"Yes, of course.","content.76.14698":"(Listen patiently)\\n\\nFor an Ecaflip, I guess his fortune was to be in good company.","content.76.14699":"Don't you want to keep it? It's the only thing left of your friend...","content.76.14700":"I understand. Let me know if there's anything you need.","content.76.14701":"I think I... have something of yours.\\n\\n(Hold out Felix's journal for the Hullcatz)","content.76.14702":"I don't think it's good to live in the past.","content.76.14703":"Uh, I guess so...","content.76.14704":"Oh, you think so? I don't think so.","content.76.14705":"Since we can't turn back time, memorializing is an important way to prevent tragedies from happening again.","content.76.14706":"To be honest, I have better things to do than play with dolls.","content.76.14707":"(Leave)","content.76.14709":"(Start the fight)","content.76.14710":"(Leave)","content.76.14712":"(Start the fight)","content.76.14713":"(Leave)","content.76.14714":"(Start the fight)","content.76.14715":"(Leave)","content.76.14716":"(Start the fight)","content.76.14717":"(Leave)","content.76.14718":"(Start the fight)","content.76.14719":"(Leave)","content.76.14721":" I wasn't expecting to see you here! Isn't the island too dangerous for an archaosologist?","content.76.14722":"I ran into another archaosologist on the island. I was just wondering if you were also involved!","content.76.14723":"How is it you all ended up on this island?","content.76.14724":"How is it you all ended up on this island?","content.76.14725":"The reality isn't far off from what the sailors said.","content.76.14726":"I guess it must've been difficult.","content.76.14727":"You didn't seriously think I'd let you discover all the secrets and treasures on this island without me, did you?","content.76.14728":"What's going on?","content.76.14729":"It does seem like it'd be tricky for you to work in those conditions.","content.76.14730":"Hey, if that's all, I should be able to help you out.","content.76.14731":"Lovely. Is that all?","content.76.14732":"Sit tight, and I'll handle it.","content.76.14733":"I have the zircomet you needed.","content.76.14734":"I have the skins you asked for.","content.76.14735":"Here are some primaniola stems.","content.76.14736":"I went all the way to the forest to gather a few rozen just in case.","content.76.14737":"So? What are your findings?","content.76.14738":"(Go look for the rest of the resources)","content.76.14739":"(Go look for the rest of the resources)","content.76.14740":"(Go look for the rest of the resources)","content.76.14741":"Well, that's something!","content.76.14742":"This island seems to have been cut off from the world for a long time. That must be why.","content.76.14743":"You mean this rock is alive?","content.76.14744":"When you say, \"to our world\"... are you implying it originated somewhere else?","content.76.14745":"Y'know, I've seen so many weird things in other dimensions that nothing surprises me anymore.","content.76.14746":"Well... That makes sense. Although I don't know what to do with that information.","content.76.14747":"Since I've helped you to this point, I want to know the whole story! I'm right behind you.","content.76.14748":"Here's what I discovered.","content.76.14750":"I'll see what I can do to get a good pick.","content.76.14751":"What can you tell me about this cave?","content.76.14752":"Yes, I noticed you loved giving nicknames.","content.76.14753":"What's that?","content.76.14754":"Interesting, go on.","content.76.14755":"If I had a choice, yes, I would've gone without. What next?","content.76.14756":"It's worth trying. I'll deal with it!","content.76.14757":"I brought what you need to restore the amulet!","content.76.14758":"(Wait a minute)","content.76.14759":"(Take the archaosologist's amulet and feel a beneficial energy wash over you)","content.76.14760":"Fine by me. I'll take care of it, don't worry.","content.76.14761":"I'm trying to look after myself. Well, how do you feel?","content.76.14762":"Speaking of that egg, it sort of reminds me of Eliatrope tech.","content.76.14763":"The truth is, I've encountered artifacts like this before. Milo and I think they're related to the ruins in the forest.","content.76.14764":"I'll go present this egg. Try not to stick around while I'm not here to keep an eye on you!","content.76.14765":"Try not to stick around while I'm not here to keep an eye on you!","content.76.14766":"(Recap the recent events and discoveries linked to the heart of the island)","content.76.14767":"Milo told me about a Crocodyl temple up in the forest. Does that ring a bell?","content.76.14768":"That's possible, but there's one problem: The place is apparently sealed by runes. Milo thinks it could be Crocodyl magic.","content.76.14769":"Yes, in fact. I plan to ask the only Crocodyl we know on the island for help.","content.76.14770":"You got another solution?","content.76.14771":"Time is precisely what we're lacking. Also, if this place is connected to the Crocodyls' spiritual beliefs, it may allow us to appease the vengeful spirit.","content.76.14772":"I can't be sure{[1*]?:} of anything, Jenry. But it's worth a shot!","content.76.14773":"Very well. I'll meet you there!","content.76.14774":"I brought the Crocodyl spirit with me!","content.76.14775":"I found this journal near the corpse. It's written in the Crocodyl language.","content.76.14776":"Before I send you back to the immaterial, I have some questions for you.","content.76.14778":"Why did part of your soul stay trapped in the sword?","content.76.14779":"How did you wind up in this Bwork prison?","content.76.14780":"How did you know about the Dofus? Was it your doing?","content.76.14781":"And you murdered them all...","content.76.14782":"And yet he managed to imprison you.","content.76.14783":"Why did part of your soul stay trapped in the sword?","content.76.14784":"How did you wind up in this Bwork prison?","content.76.14785":"How did you know about the Dofus? Was it your doing?","content.76.14786":"Yes, I'm finished. The plan's very simple, demon. I take the Ebony Dofus, and you disappear.","content.76.14787":"You're a Shushu, it shouldn't have changed that much!","content.76.14788":"Hmm. I understand better now...","content.76.14789":"I've got my own theory about that.","content.76.14790":"(Hold yourself back from assaulting the demon as he continues to chuckle through coughs)","content.76.14791":"Who could have guessed...","content.76.14792":"(Raise Crocobur's blade to finish off the demon) \\nAt least you were true to your principles right until the very end. Farewell!","content.76.14793":"It's useless! You're in no shape to fight anymore!","content.76.14794":"Have you completely lost your mind?","content.76.14795":"A daring gamble, demon, but I could just as easily get rid of this sword.","content.76.14796":"(Stand there dumbfounded for a moment, then step closer and carefully pick up the sword, which seems to have regained its color)","content.76.14797":"Are you Crocatzin?","content.76.14798":"(Approach the Dofus, and after a few seconds that feel like hours, smash the blade down on it)","content.76.14799":"You've been unable to rest for all these years...","content.76.14800":"What happened exactly?","content.76.14801":"Why did you summon that demon?","content.76.14802":"Hmph. It's always the same with Shushus. All they're good for is betrayal and destruction... He got what he deserved!","content.76.14803":"That's right. When I used the vestiges to face Rushu, I was able to keep their powers. They grow weaker with every use. But, well...","content.76.14804":"(Sigh)\\nLet's just say I'm not a big fan of the evil energy contained in these objects. Using them is very painful.","content.76.14805":"Bulak is the one to blame!","content.76.14806":"Many peoples have suffered the same fate as you...","content.76.14807":"(Keep listening, with a growing suspicion that you won't like whatever's next)","content.76.14808":"He left you no choice. You've got to make peace with what happened.","content.76.14809":"(Cross your arms warily)\\nWhat can we do? He's sealed inside the sword again, and Crocobur is famous for being unbreakable.","content.76.14810":"(Keep listening)","content.76.14811":"It doesn't matter. That just might work!","content.76.14812":"Jenry, I think Crocatzin is right. The world will be better off without this blade, especially if it's possessed by a demon.","content.76.14813":"This sword has brought nothing but misfortune to those who have carried it, and an evil demon with enormous power will just be waiting for the next poor sucker to slip up so he can break out of here and sow more destruction and chaos.","content.76.14814":"I'm sorry{[1*]?:}. I know that finding this sword was important to you. But I only used the demonic power to defeat other demons: Bulak and Rushu. Nothing you can say will change my mind.","content.76.14815":"Don't be that way, Jenry. I'm no happier about it than you are. If circumstances were different, I would have liked to find a solution that would satisfy us both.","content.76.14816":"I'm only doing what I have to do. Just give me a little time.","content.76.14817":"(Scream at the pain that's tearing you apart)","content.76.14818":"(Think of Crocatzin and the demise of the Crocodyl people to feed your hatred for the demon and give you the strength to break the artifact)","content.76.14819":"I... I did it!","content.76.14820":"Someone had to do it. You'll finally be able to rest. And like they say, compassion is good for everyone.","content.76.14821":"(Bear witness to Crocatzin's final moments on the material plane - this time for good)","content.76.14822":"(Turn to the Dofus that's lost its shine and cautiously pick it up)","content.76.14823":"Rest in peace... (Sigh and look around one last time at this sick temple, the weight of your choices resting heavy on your shoulders)\\n\\nRight. Let's go back to Jenry's camp.","content.76.14824":"(Watch as the archaosologist turns and leaves, then step closer to the Zurikat to pick it up)","content.76.14825":"(Greet the Zurikat and set his brother down in front of him)","content.76.14826":"(Realize that he's thanking you and bow in return)","content.76.14827":"(Smile at their touching reunion and discreetly step away)","content.76.14828":"(Cross your fingers and hope she won't step on any booby-trapped slabs in the meantime)","content.76.14830":"(Recount the recent events)","content.76.14831":"So? What are your findings?","content.76.14832":"So? What are your findings?","content.76.14833":"So? What are your findings?","content.76.14834":"So? What are your findings?","content.76.14835":"(Leave)","content.76.14836":"(Leave)","content.76.14837":"(Leave him alone)","content.76.14838":"(Leave)","content.76.14839":"(Leave)","content.76.14840":"(Leave)","content.76.14841":"(Leave)","content.76.14842":"(Leave)","content.76.14843":"(Show the black egg you got from Dazzlosaurus)","content.76.14844":"(Discreetly take the little ball of Wakfu, wondering how you might be able to use it)","content.76.14845":"(Discreetly pick up the coveted artifact)\\nA few seconds more, and you would've been taking a Grambo corpse back to Milo.","content.76.14846":"Are you aware of a passage to another world?","content.76.14847":"(Leave)","content.76.14848":"(Leave)","content.76.14849":"(Leave)","content.76.14850":"(Leave)","content.76.14851":"(Leave)","content.76.14852":"(Leave)","content.76.14853":"(Leave)","content.76.14854":"Here are the 10 Well-Guawded Seeds.","content.76.14855":"I found this letter, but it seems to be protected by some kind of Eliatrope encryption.","content.76.14856":"(Leave in a hail of taunts)","content.76.14857":"(Leave)","content.76.14858":"(Leave)","content.76.14859":"I'm looking for a Iop gourmet... That wouldn't be you, would it?","content.76.14861":"Piece of cake.","content.76.14862":"I heard about some kind of cooking contest. I figured you'd probably know more about it.","content.76.14863":"Yeah, so... a Iop. All right, I should start with the one that I know. Thanks for your time, Mr. Yeast!","content.76.14864":"Oh, really? So what did you do?","content.76.14865":"Ah, now you've got my interest! Do you suppose you could tell me his name?","content.76.14866":"Hmm... Can you at least give me a general description? Any distinctive features?","content.76.14867":"Come on, I'm not afraid of some Iop gourmet!","content.76.14869":"Great, I'll head there right away! Thanks, Mr. Goultard!","content.76.14870":"To be honest, I didn't really think so. You wouldn't happen to know anything about someone like that, would you?","content.76.14872":"Hello, I'm looking for...","content.76.14873":"Sorry{[1*]?:} to disturb you. Are you Karn, the Iop gourmet?","content.76.14874":"*You are disconcerted{[1*]?:} by his threatening yet inquisitive tone*\\n\\nMe? Well... I'm the{[1*]?:} hero{[1*]?:} of the prophecy... and, uh...","content.76.14875":"*Struggling to save face, you try to project a firm tone*\\n\\nListen, I...","content.76.14876":"I've heard you were looking for high-quality dishes. Like the one you were sampling when I arrived{[1*]?:}, for example.","content.76.14877":"... And that you were willing to handsomely reward anyone who could satisfy your appetite?","content.76.14878":"Right. I've barely cooked a thing in my life.","content.76.14879":"Why's that?","content.76.14880":"Maybe I could lend him a hand?","content.76.14881":"Now you're talking! Let's go pay this Pascal Liko a visit.","content.76.14883":"Er, not really, now that you mention it...","content.76.14884":"I've brought you an exquisite dish that I cooked with Pa-Liko's help!","content.76.14885":"*Hand over the ikiakit meatballs*","content.76.14886":"*Hand over a Dynawich*","content.76.14887":"*Hand over a Karnivorous Kebab*","content.76.14888":"*Hand over a Pekobowl*","content.76.14889":"I was just coming by to say hi.","content.76.14890":"I'm sorry to bother you. I met Karn, and he told me about you.","content.76.14891":"Well, he did tell me he had a particular taste for your dishes. And since I've got such a big heart, I thought... maybe I could help you?","content.76.14892":"Right, exactly. And then we could share the rewards...","content.76.14893":"I'd love that{[1*]?:}! But why can't you provide more dishes for Karn?","content.76.14894":"And where do you get that meat?","content.76.14895":"I know all about hunting monsters!","content.76.14896":"You bet! ","content.76.14897":"You bet! ","content.76.14898":"I'm ready{[1*]?:} to hunt the monster of the day and turn it into a nice dish!","content.76.14899":"Here's the delicious meat of the day!","content.76.14900":"Let's see...","content.76.14901":"I'm a real master of Pa-Liko cuisine!","content.76.14902":"Well, I'm not exactly well-known{[1*]?:} for my cooking skills, but...","content.76.14903":"Fine. I'm a pretty decent cook, but...","content.76.14904":"I'm a pretty great cook{[1*]?:}{[1*]?:}{[1*]?:}. I've made hundreds of tiramisoups. Believe me.","content.76.14905":"You seem more anxious than usual, Mishell. Is everything okay?","content.76.14906":"(Cross your arms)\\n\\nThat's no way to ask a{[1*]?:} friend{[1*]?:} for help.","content.76.14907":"See, that wasn't so bad. But \"no answers without compensation!\" You told me that yourself when I first arrived on the beach.","content.76.14908":"You really don't know me, do you? But since I've already come{[1*]?:} all the way out here, I might as well listen.","content.76.14909":"Go on then, I'm listening.","content.76.14910":"(Wait for the next part of the story)","content.76.14911":"You mean there's some sort of wildlife emergency somewhere? Where, exactly?","content.76.14912":"Okay, but that doesn't tell me what's actually happening or where.","content.76.14913":"And why don't you take care of it yourself?","content.76.14914":"I understand the situation, but I've got a bunch of heroic missions going on at the moment. It's kind of hard to squeeze that in. If I agree to help you, what will you do for me?","content.76.14915":"So you're asking me to spend my time investigating something that has nothing to do with me... What's in it for me?","content.76.14916":"All right, I'll help you. But will you do something for me in return?","content.76.14917":"All right, I'm off to the Sadida Kingdom. I'll get back to you when I know more!","content.76.14918":"(Don't disturb him)","content.76.14919":"Hey, are you the one who's slaughtering the boowolves? I'm afraid that's going to be a problem!","content.76.14920":"Are you listening? I'm talking to you.","content.76.14922":"Are you listening? I'm talking to you.","content.76.14923":"Who are you to go slaughtering boowolves like that?","content.76.14924":"You're Karn, right? Who do you think you are, slaughtering a boowolf like that?","content.76.14925":"Aren't you overdoing it a bit? If you keep on like this, you'll wipe out the whole species.","content.76.14926":"A certain sense of honor?","content.76.14927":"Fine, I can see this conversation's going nowhere. I won't bother you any longer.","content.76.14928":"I need your help. Do you remember when I asked you to tell me about Karn?","content.76.14929":"I need your help. Do you know someone named Karn?","content.76.14930":"You seem unusually nervous all of a sudden. Is everything okay?","content.76.14931":"(Decide to push Goultard a little harder without worrying about his feelings)\\n\\nSo you've met him before?","content.76.14932":"What else?","content.76.14933":"What happened next?","content.76.14934":"From the way you're talking, I sense some kind of tension between you two.","content.76.14935":"He's slaughtering boowolves in the Sadida Kingdom. I'd like to find some way to stop him.","content.76.14936":"(Give Goultard a perplexed look)","content.76.14937":"Uh...","content.76.14938":"I'm glad I can always count on you. Thanks a lot, Mr. Goultard!","content.76.14939":"(Decide to push Goultard a little harder without worrying about his feelings)\\n\\nI know you've met him before, but... How did that go, exactly?","content.76.14940":"Hey, Karn, what's up?","content.76.14941":"I'd actually rather try and convince you to stop.","content.76.14942":"And how!\\n\\n(Show Goultard's hair)","content.76.14943":"(Pull your hand back to move the hair away)","content.76.14944":"If I understand correctly, you want to prepare an amazing feast... But you must have been restricting yourself to boowolves for quite a while now, right?\\n\\nI can bring you meat from even more powerful creatures. What do you say?","content.76.14945":"Perfect, I'll be back soon with the ingredients!","content.76.14946":"Hey, are you the one who's slaughtering the boowolves? I'm afraid that's going to be a problem!","content.76.14947":"This guy is one tough hunter to please. But no problem, I'll find you another one that's even more unique!\\n\\nBy the way, I should definitely investigate that situation with the boowolves some more... It's a promising lead.","content.76.14948":"Hey, Karn, what do you think of this?\\n\\n(Show the meats that you've collected)","content.76.14949":"This guy is one tough hunter to please.\\n\\nThat reminds me, I resolved the situation in the Sadida Kingdom with Milkar the moowolf... Maybe I should bring him a bit of Milkar meat. That should convince him that there's no more trouble in the region.","content.76.14950":"Hey, Karn, how's it going?","content.76.14951":"(Hand over the Milkar meat)","content.76.14952":"You're not far off.","content.76.14953":"No thanks. What are you doing afterwards?","content.76.14954":"I see, I see. Have you already got a creature in mind that you'd like to eat?","content.76.14955":"A dragon? With pleasure. Do you know where to find one?","content.76.14956":"Shall we go, then?","content.76.14959":"I'm ready{[1*]?:} for the dragon hunt!","content.76.14961":"All right, then, let's go. I'm right behind you.","content.76.14962":"Sounds like we'll be facing some serious danger. I need to get ready.","content.76.14963":"Oh yeah...","content.76.14964":"I was wondering... what are you going to do now?","content.76.14965":"So, how about that dragon hunt?","content.76.14966":"Okay...\\n\\n(Leave)","content.76.14967":"I could help with your recipe.","content.76.14968":"On second thought, I'll take care of the dishes.","content.76.14969":"(Add a Death Cap to the preparation)","content.76.14970":"(Add a Cashew Nut to the preparation)","content.76.14971":"(Add Finest Sea Salt to the preparation)","content.76.14972":"(Add a Funkus to the preparation)","content.76.14973":"(Add a Twisted Rump Chilli to the preparation)","content.76.14974":"(Add a Desert Truffle to the preparation)","content.76.14975":"Can I add other foods?","content.76.14976":"On second thought, I'll take care of the dishes.","content.76.14977":"Can I add other foods?","content.76.14978":"On second thought, I'll take care of the dishes.","content.76.14979":"Can I add other foods?","content.76.14980":"On second thought, I'll take care of the dishes.","content.76.14981":"Can I add other foods?","content.76.14982":"On second thought, I'll take care of the dishes.","content.76.14983":"Can I add other foods?","content.76.14984":"On second thought, I'll take care of the dishes.","content.76.14985":"Can I add other foods?","content.76.14986":"On second thought, I'll take care of the dishes.","content.76.14987":"(Hesitantly greet Mishell)","content.76.14988":"You asked the wyrmling to push me over the edge?!","content.76.14989":"Karn is an incredibly powerful figure. I couldn't risk reporting back to you beforehand.","content.76.14990":"A young lady once told me, \"You'll always find it beneficial to maintain good relationships, especially with strong and powerful people.\"","content.76.14991":"(Tell the story from your point of view)","content.76.14992":"It only seemed natural.","content.76.14993":"Wow... That's not like you at all, Mishell.","content.76.14994":"I was just completing my mission.","content.76.14995":"That's... not quite as nice, I guess.","content.76.14996":"I'm right behind you!","content.76.14997":"I'd like to help the Guild of Hunters.","content.76.14998":"What are you doing here?","content.76.14999":"I'll leave you be...","content.76.15000":"Have you been around here for long?","content.76.15001":"(Think that it was several years ago, at least)","content.76.15002":"So you're a survivor of an expedition... How did that go, exactly?","content.76.15003":"(Wait for her to follow)","content.76.15004":"I see. Thank you for telling me about your past.","content.76.15005":"Thinking about it... I found this journal the other day. The pages were scattered across the island.\\n\\n(Hold out Felix's journal)","content.76.15006":"Did you know him?","content.76.15007":"Would you like to tell me a bit about it?","content.76.15008":"Sylvenor?","content.76.15009":"You can keep the journal if you like.","content.76.15010":"I don't really know what to do with it...","content.76.15011":"Very well. I'll come back and see you once I know more about the island's secrets.","content.76.15012":"Thinking about it... I found this journal the other day. The pages were scattered across the island.\\n\\n(Hold out Felix's journal)","content.76.15013":"Well, there you go. That's more or less where I'm at. The Xelor responsible for Felix's death has taken off...","content.76.15014":"(Cross your arms)\\n\\nYou're not very talkative...","content.76.15015":"Do you think there's anything else I could do?","content.76.15016":"(Nod)\\n\\nI'll remember.","content.76.15017":"(Frown)\\n\\nThis girl? Really?","content.76.15018":"(Think that it's a joke and leave)","content.76.15019":"The Ouginak? You must mean Amelia...","content.76.15020":"(Purse your lips as you think about Lebbocq)","content.76.15021":"I see... Thank you for clarifying that.","content.76.15022":"Have you seen him around here?","content.76.15023":"Oh, really? Looking forward to seeing him again?","content.76.15024":"I see...\\n\\n(Politely take your leave)","content.76.15025":"By the way, do you know someone called... Juspark?","content.76.15026":"Did you meet the Archaosologists?","content.76.15027":"Do you know a Iop hunter with an eye patch?","content.76.15028":"I think I've uncovered most of this island's secrets.\\n\\n(Tell the whole story)","content.76.15029":"(...)","content.76.15030":"(...)","content.76.15031":"(...)","content.76.15032":"(...)","content.76.15033":"(...)","content.76.15034":"(...)","content.76.15035":"(...)","content.76.15036":"(...)","content.76.15037":"(...)","content.76.15038":"(...)","content.76.15039":"(...)","content.76.15040":"(...)","content.76.15041":"How are you?","content.76.15042":"How did you get to the island?","content.76.15043":"So that goes on with... your dad?","content.76.15044":"How did you manage to counter the clockmaker's surveillance system?","content.76.15045":"(Sit down a ways away with Arlemia)","content.76.15046":"Yes. It was a cold, dead landscape. Where the Grambos live, things are simple but lively.","content.76.15047":"So in the end, you came back.","content.76.15048":"(Offer encouragement)","content.76.15049":"Leave to go where?","content.76.15050":"*There's something on the tip of your tongue. Just as you're about to say it, the words vanish*\\n\\n(Suppress an inexplicable feeling)","content.76.15051":"So, you want to discover this other world? Then come back here?","content.76.15052":"It must be said that the Voidivions aren't very aggressive. They're happy just being inactive most of the time. It certainly wouldn't have been the same story if you'd showed up in the Citadel of Horror...","content.76.15053":"Yes, I believe in it.","content.76.15054":"I don't know.","content.76.15055":"Not really.","content.76.15056":"Why do you believe in it?","content.76.15057":"Why do you believe in it?","content.76.15058":"Why do you believe in it?","content.76.15059":"Hmmm...","content.76.15060":"We inevitably cross paths.","content.76.15061":"Do you think you and Milo are somewhat drifting apart?","content.76.15062":"Isn't your presence on the Misty Isle a way of getting closer?","content.76.15063":"(Think momentarily about what could draw her in)","content.76.15064":"(Show Zulnara's journal)","content.76.15065":"(Show Felix's journal)","content.76.15066":"(Mention the energy batteries)","content.76.15067":"(Mention Crocobur)","content.76.15068":"(Describe the laboratory in the heart of the island)","content.76.15069":"(Show the Ebony Dofus)","content.76.15070":"(Show Zulnara's journal)","content.76.15071":"(Show Felix's journal)","content.76.15072":"(Mention the energy batteries)","content.76.15073":"(Mention Crocobur)","content.76.15074":"(Describe the laboratory in the heart of the island)","content.76.15075":"(Show the Ebony Dofus)","content.76.15076":"Really? Do you sense something unusual about this Dofus? That's strange... When I showed it to the archaosologists, they didn't react strangely.","content.76.15077":"(Put away the Dofus)\\n\\n... So... Now what?","content.76.15078":"Something essential? Well, it's true that it's something very powerful. \\n\\n(Frown)\\n\\nBut it's lost all its power.","content.76.15079":"I... see. You mean that because my goals aren't aligned with the goals of this Dofus, I can't feel its power?","content.76.15080":"Is this another effect of your mysterious memories?","content.76.15081":"Uh...\\n\\nI don't really know what that involves, to be honest.","content.76.15082":"Alright, thanks for your help.","content.76.15083":"Alright, we'll talk about it more later. Thank you again.","content.76.15084":"(Think about how funny that is)","content.76.15085":"(Listen closely)","content.76.15086":"Alright.","content.76.15087":"Oh, really? That is to say...","content.76.15088":"Very well. Let's go! To... Let's see. The Crocodyl temple sounds like a good start to me!\\n\\n(Join Arlemia and set off for the place where you found the Ebony Dofus)","content.76.15089":"I see. That's a surprisingly simple answer.","content.76.15090":"Hmm, that's odd!","content.76.15091":"It must have been during my nap in the canyon.\\n\\nStill, you have a knack for finding adventurers to protect you from danger... For starters, if I hadn't been there in the Spiral...","content.76.15092":"(Agree jokingly)","content.76.15093":"I see.","content.76.15094":"(Grimace)","content.76.15095":"Well... I think it's best to close the subject now.","content.76.15096":"Hey now! What are you doing?","content.76.15097":"(Blush)","content.76.15098":"Oh, I was just a bit surprised, that's all...","content.76.15099":"That's handy.","content.76.15100":"How could he see and hear us?","content.76.15101":"Your blocker is handy. I'll be able to get around without having to worry.","content.76.15102":"Yes, ma'am...","content.76.15103":"*Your heart sinks when you realize the extent of the uncomfortable situation*\\n\\nNo, alright, I'm sorry{[1*]?:}. Anyway, thank you for the blocker.","content.76.15104":"Let's stop talking about that.\\n\\n(Leave with the scrambler in your pocket)","content.76.15105":"Let's stop talking about that. Well, unless...","content.76.15106":"There you go. So let's stop talking about that.\\n\\n(Leave with the scrambler in your pocket)","content.76.15107":"(Be serious{[1*]?:} and remain professional{[1*]?:}. This invasion of your personal space isn't a major affront to your working environment. There's no reason to get carried away or contact the appropriate Grambo services. A simple missive with the facts handed in directly to Grambo Resources should suffice)","content.76.15108":"Uh...\\n\\nI don't really know what that involves, to be honest.","content.76.15109":"(Don't react at all, but clear your mind)","content.76.15110":"(Say nothing)","content.76.15111":"It's time for you to get turned back, dummy.","content.76.15113":"(Say nothing)","content.76.15114":"You don't need to be a genius in temporal magic to realize that your plan is doomed to fail. When I'm done with you, not even a trip back in time with the god Xelor himself will bring you back.","content.76.15115":"(Say nothing)","content.76.15116":"I know you warned{[1*]?:} me to leave this island, but... You really don't know me, do you? I'm an expert in fighting deranged Xelors. I can't stop myself from cleaning their clocks. Yep, that's just how I am...","content.76.15117":"(Say nothing)","content.76.15118":"How blind you are. I have already beaten time on many an occasion. What makes you think it will be different with you?","content.76.15119":"I'm really sorry{[1*]?:} for you. But... I can't let you cause any more harm to those around you. I've got to stop you.","content.76.15120":"(Get ready to fight)","content.76.15121":"Everything is ready. Let's regroup.","content.76.15122":"(Make an epic speech to rally the troops)","content.76.15123":"(Make an emotionally charged, poetic speech)","content.76.15124":"(Make a funny speech to lighten the mood)","content.76.15125":"(Nod and leave)","content.76.15126":"Thanks for coming to my aid in the Clock. I appreciate it.","content.76.15127":"(Leave under a hail of praise)","content.76.15128":"I see...\\n\\n*Zulnara approaches you, her impressive Shushu sword in hand*","content.76.15129":"(Recover as best you can)\\n\\nHold back a little, please...","content.76.15130":"(Give Alraune an embarrassed look)","content.76.15131":"I think I should thank you. I had no idea you were that strong. You really saved me back there...","content.76.15132":"So, what exactly happened? All I remember is a big earthquake. I think I was out of steam...","content.76.15133":"I'd like to recall our battle with Nox.","content.76.15134":"I think I saw the Ferociraptors helping us in the end...","content.76.15135":"This is all thanks to you. Thanks again for coming. I wouldn't have made{[1*]?:} it on my own{[1*]?:}.\\n\\nNox was stronger than I expected.","content.76.15136":"I felt like my strength was failing me. He was using a mysterious cube to manipulate the Wakfu in a way I never imagined.","content.76.15137":"... Yeah, I have my doubts too.\\n\\n(Say you need some air as an excuse to go out for a bit)","content.76.15138":"Nox. Since you're here, let's have a little chat.","content.76.15139":"Did you get what you wanted?","content.76.15140":"... Wait...","content.76.15141":"The cube speaks to you?","content.76.15142":"What're you going to do now?","content.76.15143":"(Pout)\\n\\nWe've been fighting to liberate it. In the end, this artificial island won't stand much longer.","content.76.15144":"I'm just doing my job.","content.76.15145":"... Done.\\n\\n(Notice Arlemia and Milo arguing in the distance)\\n\\nAren't you going to say goodbye to them?","content.76.15146":"(Reach out to the clockmaker)\\n\\nIt's not too late...","content.76.15147":"(Say nothing)","content.76.15148":"(Say nothing)","content.76.15149":"Your overconfidence will be the end of you, Nox. You aren't the genius you claim to be.","content.76.15150":"It's just a hunch.","content.76.15151":"(Raise your eyebrows, perplexed)","content.76.15152":"You're here...","content.76.15153":"I suppose. Nox was here a minute ago.","content.76.15154":"It's okay; he's gone. I don't think he's ever coming back, either.","content.76.15155":"I can just tell. He has nothing else to gain here... He'll pursue his plans far away from here.","content.76.15156":"It's not that simple. With his surveillance system, he'll see us coming from a mile away.\\n\\nDespite being out of his mind, Nox is no less extra-cautious.","content.76.15157":"You're right. What do you want me to do, though?\\n\\nI don't even know where he is. Even if I did, as soon as I took two steps toward him, he'd notice me and teleport again.","content.76.15158":"I sense that you're really invested...","content.76.15159":"(Hesitate to say it)","content.76.15160":"Well, before facing Nox, I walked through the clock a bit. I found a few notes. He worked on a plan to time travel and go back to the past.","content.76.15161":"Let me finish...\\n\\n(Let out a deep sigh)\\n\\nI double-checked everything. I read several notebooks, and I looked over his machine. It won't work.","content.76.15162":"He got his temporal calculations wrong. I would say he just missed a few key factors.\\n\\nThe amount of energy he planned to harvest is right, but... It's pretty obvious he'll only go back a few minutes into the past. I'd be impressed if he manages to go back half an hour.","content.76.15163":"No. I think he wants to go back several years, maybe several centuries.\\n\\nBut as it is, his calculations are wrong. He made a mistake, plain and simple.","content.76.15164":"I guess it's fairly hazy for you. For me, it's quite clear. There's no more to fear from him.","content.76.15165":"(Flinch, then regain your composure)\\n\\nHe shouldn't have realized that he made a miscalculation. If I had just left{[1*]?:} saying, \"Never mind, pack everything up\", it would've seemed off...","content.76.15166":"(Don't react)\\n\\nHe shouldn't have realized that he made a miscalculation. If I had just left{[1*]?:} saying, \"Never mind, pack everything up\", it would've seemed off...","content.76.15167":"I wish I could've incapacitated him. Now I think it's wise to leave it at that.","content.76.15168":"Yes. Let's go back and party with the others! Even if the island is fated to disappear, we can be proud that we saved it!","content.76.15169":"(Shake your head and enjoy a well-deserved party)","content.76.15170":"... Not really. The Dofus isn't reacting.","content.76.15171":"I've got a few ideas... On course for a tour of the island.","content.76.15172":"Yes, I can feel energy radiating from it... But...\\n\\nThe pulse is weak.","content.76.15173":"To the Bworks' Harem. I'm getting my hopes up.","content.76.15174":"Nothing's happening at all. Seems like there's no negative energy in this area.","content.76.15175":"Okay. To the heart of the island.","content.76.15176":"Yes, but... That's not enough.","content.76.15177":"Honestly, I'm out of ideas...","content.76.15178":"Indeed, I see despair from the citronana-deprived Grambos. That's true. Good. Let's go.","content.76.15179":"Don't bother telling me about eternity. I'm already going through it.","content.76.15180":"None of that scares me. I already know the despair of seeing people do the Moogrr dungeon faster than me.","content.76.15181":"(Try resisting)","content.76.15182":"(Try resisting)","content.76.15183":"(Forget everything)","content.76.15184":"(...)","content.76.15185":"(...)","content.76.15186":"(...)","content.76.15187":"(...)","content.76.15188":"(...)","content.76.15189":"(...)","content.76.15190":"Crocatzin?","content.76.15191":"Something isn't right.","content.76.15192":"I see... What do I have to do?","content.76.15193":"Yes, the island is artificial.","content.76.15194":"Uh-oh...\\n\\n(Think that you'll still have to do dungeons at level and Stasis... 3? 4? Not the Timeless Theater, surely?)","content.76.15195":"Yes, forgive me.","content.76.15196":"(Nod)","content.76.15197":"I think I'm going to need keys... Alright, I'm ready{[1*]?:} to go back. Thanks for your help, brave Crocodyl prince.","content.76.15198":"How are you?","content.76.15199":"You helped me out{[1*]?:}! Thank you.","content.76.15200":"You won't even stay with your dear old dad for a while?","content.76.15201":"I see. Thanks for the help. Good thing an expert in unfathomable darkness and sunny spells was around to show me the way!\\n\\nAll that's left for me to beat is the clockmaker, and then we should be good!","content.76.15202":"I beat all the ghosts... The Dofus is churning with energy!","content.76.15203":"Okay. Thank you.","content.76.15204":"Well? Any news from the letter I gave you?","content.76.15205":"I've finally arrived{[1*]?:} in the World of Twelve! Uh... I guess I ought to compensate your for your ceiling.","content.76.15206":"If you don't mind me saying so, you've collected an amazing amount of stuff in this house!","content.76.15207":"I have to go. I'll come visit from time to time!","content.76.15208":"No worries!","content.76.15209":"(Grab the bag)\\n\\nI'm going to become an adventurer{[1*]?:} everyone in the whole World of Twelve will talk about!","content.76.15210":"Again, sorry about the roof, Mammy. Let's go, en route!","content.76.15212":"Ah yes, you are THE Goultard, in fact. I have a Haven Bag for you...","content.76.15213":"I have to go. I have a meeting. It's urgent, and far from here. Goodbye.","content.76.15214":"Mammy Pal asked me to bring it to you.","content.76.15215":"Well, okay.","content.76.15216":"I'm not against a little training. I hate to admit it, but I'm a little rusty{[1*]?:} ever since my reincarnation...","content.76.15217":"I am ready{[1*]?:} to train with you! What do you want to do?","content.76.15218":"My first mission is to fight Bow Meows?","content.76.15219":"(Sigh. The mission isn't very exciting)","content.76.15220":"Onto adventure, Daldal!","content.76.15221":"(Shrug your shoulders, imagining it could have been worse. Fighting rats, for example...)","content.76.15222":"(Fidget impatiently. It's time for your first fight in the World of Twelve!)","content.76.15223":"Wait... what? Unbelievable! Thank you so much!","content.76.15224":"Excellent!","content.76.15225":"OK! I'm on my way!","content.76.15226":"(Take young Percedal's side and shoot Goultard a reproachful look)","content.76.15227":"(Loudly mock Daldal)","content.76.15228":"(...)","content.76.15229":"Absolutely. Plus, now I've got a new traveling companion!","content.76.15230":"So... now what?","content.76.15231":"Oh, okay.","content.76.15232":"All right, I'm listening!","content.76.15233":"To be honest, I think I'd rather be gardening. I'm starting to get sick of fighting.","content.76.15234":"Pappy Pal? He wouldn't be related to Mammy Pal, by any chance?","content.76.15235":"Ah, now you're talking!","content.76.15236":"Brilliant! I'll do that, then. Thanks, Goultard, and see you soon!","content.76.15237":"I spent some time in Astrub. I managed to defeat Ogrest's Cult, and I beat all the dungeons in the area!","content.76.15238":"I think I'm ready{[1*]?:} to set out for adventure outside of Astrub!","content.76.15239":"Nice! I love gifts. Is it a super rare piece of equipment? Or some extra skill points?","content.76.15240":"Oh... Uh... Great... Thanks...","content.76.15241":"(Stare into the distance with no emotion)","content.76.15242":"Well, I guess I've been wasting my time here.","content.76.15243":"Ohhh! Wow! Brilliant! Thank you!","content.76.15244":"(Find yourself in a state of shock: this is an amazing gift that Goultard has given you)","content.76.15245":"Wow, that's amazing! You should have mentioned that first! Thanks, Master Goultard!","content.76.15246":"I'll come back later. See you soon!","content.76.15248":"Nice ax. Can I borrow one? I'd like to have a little equipment to take along on my adventures...","content.76.15249":"Thank you!","content.76.15250":"I was attacked{[1*]?:} by Chaos Plants in the reserve!","content.76.15251":"I guess I'm not getting an ax...","content.76.15252":"Yes...","content.76.15253":"Huh? But Iops are great!","content.76.15254":"It's true... Between the fishercats and the bow meows, there's a real feline vibe around here.","content.76.15255":"Gulp... Guess I'll hold off on doing any swimming.","content.76.15256":"Need a hand?","content.76.15257":"Rats? Well, that's not good. Want me to get rid of them?","content.76.15258":"Well, I've had more exciting missions. But someone had to do it!","content.76.15259":"All right, the sawmill's now fully rat-free. Feel free to call on my services again!","content.76.15260":"My pleasure. Although, rats, I have to say... Never mind. Have a good day!","content.76.15261":"What's gotten into them to be worshipping Ogrest like that?","content.76.15262":"I'll take care of this. Between this and the Raised Vault, there's no reason things should be this wild in the cemetery!","content.76.15263":"It's awfully busy here, for a cemetery. Need help?","content.76.15264":"I took care of the situation in the crypt.","content.76.15265":"Wow, such enthusiasm!\\n\\nGlad{[1*]?:} I was able to help. Feel free to call on me if you have any more problems.","content.76.15266":"Your kitchen's not as clean as it could be...","content.76.15267":"Larvae? It's true, they're not exactly the most hygienic...","content.76.15268":"Consider it done!","content.76.15269":"Of course. Call me if you need a hand again!","content.76.15270":"Goultard sent me. Apparently you've got some problems in the city that need fixing?","content.76.15271":"(Leave)","content.76.15272":"I'd like to be taken to the Neo HQ.","content.76.15273":"I won't bother you...","content.76.15274":"Goodness... What are you talking about?","content.76.15275":"A darkness? What do you mean?","content.76.15276":"It's a real disaster...","content.76.15277":"Sounds like the situation is hopeless!","content.76.15278":"The Neo Raid?","content.76.15279":"Holy cow! Can I join them too?","content.76.15280":"Great! I'll go to the Neo HQ right away.","content.76.15281":"Very well, thank you.","content.76.15283":"Yes, I... I think I'm a new recruit.","content.76.15284":"I'm just passing through. Later!","content.76.15285":"Is the situation really that bad?","content.76.15286":"No problem. I'll get you out of this mess in no time.","content.76.15287":"Before I join you, I have a few questions...","content.76.15288":"Go on - send the form, and let's be done with it.","content.76.15289":"How did you rally?","content.76.15290":"What's going on?","content.76.15291":"I'm willing{[1*]?:} to join you... But what's in it for me?","content.76.15292":"Go on - send the form, and let's be done with it.","content.76.15293":"The darkness?","content.76.15295":"I'm willing{[1*]?:} to help you out.","content.76.15296":"What do you mean?","content.76.15297":"Not bad for someone like you, shorty...","content.76.15298":"Why not kill the specter?","content.76.15299":"Ask more questions.","content.76.15300":"I'd like to sign the form to join the Neo Raid.","content.76.15301":"I see. So there's a section of the Neo Raid that travels the world.","content.76.15302":"No problem. I'll lend you a hand!","content.76.15303":"I guess if the fate of the World of Twelve is at stake... I'll help you out.","content.76.15304":"Ask more questions.","content.76.15305":"I'd like to sign the form to join the Neo Raid.","content.76.15306":"Cool!","content.76.15307":"Ask more questions.","content.76.15308":"I'd like to sign the form to join the Neo Raid.","content.76.15309":"(Carefully thumb through the contract)","content.76.15310":"(Sign without reading)","content.76.15311":"(Sign with a heavy heart)","content.76.15312":"Darkness is spreading... and the Neo Raid is rising!","content.76.15313":"Very well. Thanks a lot. See you soon!","content.76.15314":"I have some questions for you.","content.76.15315":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15316":"I'm just passing through. Later!","content.76.15317":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15318":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15319":"I haven't got any questions.","content.76.15320":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15321":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15322":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15323":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15324":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15325":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15326":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15327":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15328":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15329":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15330":"Great, thanks!","content.76.15331":"Great, thanks! Uh... What now?","content.76.15332":"I'm just passing through. Later!","content.76.15333":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15334":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15335":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15336":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15337":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15338":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15339":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15340":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15341":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15342":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15343":"I defeated a Neo Boss.","content.76.15344":"(Fear for your life)\\n\\nWow, that's not very reassuring... I'd rather move on.","content.76.15350":"Restricted? What do you mean?","content.76.15351":"Réponse","content.76.15352":"What happened to the Neo HQ?","content.76.15353":"But it's... Aguabrial?","content.76.15354":"But it's... Who is this dragon?","content.76.15355":"(Keep a wary eye on the dragon)\\n\\nAlright... Need me for a mission? I'm listening.","content.76.15356":"Really? A hidden area? And... What is it? And how do you enter?","content.76.15357":"Okay... It's mysterious.","content.76.15358":"It's true it's the goal of my quest, basically.","content.76.15359":"I'm wondering if the whisperers' melody put him in this state... Sorry, Aguabrial, I didn't mean to do that to you.","content.76.15360":"I wonder what's wrong.","content.76.15361":"(...)","content.76.15362":"I wonder what's wrong.","content.76.15363":"That sounds interesting! I can't wait to try. I'll come back after I've tempted my fate!","content.76.15364":"Nothing new. Later!","content.76.15365":"No problem. Later!","content.76.15366":"I've done tons of things associated with environmental quests.","content.76.15367":"(Head to the battlefield)","content.76.15368":"And for my part, I think my help would be welcome.","content.76.15369":"If there's any danger, let me help you! I've already fought at the side of the Neo Raid. I know the threat.","content.76.15370":"Let the Neo Heroes pass!","content.76.15371":"...","content.76.15372":"That's awful. You were unable to stop him?","content.76.15373":"I'll see what I can do.","content.76.15374":"*in unison with the giant*\\n\\nThe Neo Raid is rising!","content.76.15375":"(Leave)","content.76.15376":"I've brought back 100 Souper-Glou!","content.76.15377":"(Hand over 100 Coarse Souper-Glou)","content.76.15378":"(Hand over 100 Basic Souper-Glou)","content.76.15379":"(Hand over 100 Imperfect Souper-Glou)","content.76.15380":"(Hand over 100 Fragile Souper-Glou)","content.76.15381":"(Hand over 100 Rustic Souper-Glou)","content.76.15382":"(Hand over 100 Raw Souper-Glou)","content.76.15383":"(Hand over 100 Solid Souper-Glou)","content.76.15384":"(Hand over 100 Durable Souper-Glou)","content.76.15385":"(Hand over 100 Refined Souper-Glou)","content.76.15386":"(Hand over 100 Precious Souper-Glou)","content.76.15387":"(Hand over 100 Exquisite Souper-Glou)","content.76.15388":"(Hand over 100 Mystical Souper-Glou)","content.76.15389":"(Hand over 100 Eternal Souper-Glou)","content.76.15390":"(Hand over 100 Divine Souper-Glou)","content.76.15391":"(Hand over 100 Infernal Souper-Glou)","content.76.15392":"(Hand over 100 Ancestral Souper-Glou)","content.76.15393":"(Leave)","content.76.15394":"Okay... I'm ready{[1*]?:} to make my choice.","content.76.15395":"I want to fight Cire Momore.","content.76.15396":"I want to fight Rushu.","content.76.15397":"I want to fight Toross.","content.76.15398":"I want to fight the Clockmakers.","content.76.15399":"I want to fight Thalos-Kyarrelmne.","content.76.15400":"How does it work?","content.76.15401":"I'm not interested.","content.76.15402":"I'm not interested.","content.76.15403":"(Start a fight: Royal Gobball)","content.76.15404":"(Start a fight: Royal Gobball)\\n(Already done)","content.76.15405":"(Start a fight: Royal Piwi)","content.76.15406":"(Start a fight: Royal Piwi)\\n(Already done)","content.76.15407":"I must go.","content.76.15408":"(Start a fight: Royal Cwab)","content.76.15409":"(Start a fight: Royal Cwab)\\n(Already done)","content.76.15410":"(Start a fight: Silmawhirly)","content.76.15411":"(Start a fight: Silmawhirly)\\n(Already done)","content.76.15412":"(Start a fight: Hoodfella)","content.76.15413":"(Start a fight: Hoodfella)\\n(Already done)","content.76.15414":"(Start a fight: Tanukouï San)","content.76.15415":"(Start a fight: Tanukouï San)\\n(Already done)","content.76.15416":"Train with a Rhinocerock.","content.76.15417":"Train with a Marvelous Chimera.","content.76.15419":"I'll head there right away. Thanks for the tip!","content.76.15421":"I'm doing fine, thanks.","content.76.15424":"Great, thanks! I can't wait to check the place out.","content.76.15426":"Thanks, but I'm able to get there already.","content.76.15428":"Apparently, someone's looking for me?","content.76.15430":"Goultard told me you were looking for me. Here I am... What's on your mind?","content.76.15432":"Thanks. Goodbye.","content.76.15433":"(Wait for him to notice you so you can ask what's wrong)","content.76.15434":"(Think that now is not the time to get involved in yet another adventure)","content.76.15435":"Uh... A boat?","content.76.15436":"An old man? In your nets? Is he okay at least?","content.76.15437":"(Decide to follow the suggestion and go take a look)","content.76.15438":"(Decide to follow the suggestion and go take a look)","content.76.15439":"You're in the hold of a fishing boat. You were fished out of the middle of the ocean this morning. Are you okay?","content.76.15440":"(Leave)","content.76.15441":"(Try to be reassuring{[1*]?:}. The old man couldn't have lost his memory after a simple swim in the ocean)\\n\\nHmm... Did something hit you? Are you unwell?","content.76.15442":"(Put your hand on one shoulder)\\n\\nRelax. I don't need financial reward to help those clearly in need. I have some time, so I'll help you.","content.76.15443":"(Stare at him skeptically)\\n\\nApparently, all you have is those rags you're wearing, which aren't even yours.","content.76.15444":"Hmm, you just seem like a smooth-talker to me.\\n\\n(Think that maybe he's a rich Sufokian merchant or Bontarian noble)\\n\\nOkay then... I'll help you.","content.76.15445":"Let's get out of here for a start. The stench is making me nauseous. I'm not sure{[1*]?:} his fish is safe to eat anymore.","content.76.15446":"(Explain the situation in detail)","content.76.15447":"Yes, indeed! As promised, I'll help you. We first need to know the earliest thing you remember.","content.76.15448":"It still smells of old fish here. I'll see if the air's any fresher somewhere else.","content.76.15449":"That's a good start. Those shapes... What did they look like?","content.76.15451":"Could you draw it?","content.76.15453":"In that case, let's find someone good at drawing to recreate it as accurately as possible. ","content.76.15455":"Could you make a drawing from rather a vague description?","content.76.15456":"(Explain the situation in detail)","content.76.15457":"Great, thanks!\\n\\n(Agree on a time to meet before leaving)","content.76.15458":"(Threaten him)","content.76.15459":"This situation is no laughing matter.","content.76.15460":"(Let your new companion describe what he remembers)","content.76.15461":"You'll have to wait a bit longer. I've got other things to do first.","content.76.15462":"I didn't expect it to be done so quickly. ","content.76.15463":"I didn't expect it to take so long. ","content.76.15464":"Perfect. We just have to find out what it means. Now that you're looking at it, do you recall anything?","content.76.15465":"(...)","content.76.15466":"I'd love to learn how to draw such a travesty as that... ","content.76.15467":"I didn't dare say it. What's it supposed to be?","content.76.15468":"Hoodlums? ","content.76.15469":"Ah... If you squint, maybe. We'll make do with what we have. Now that we know what it is, we know where to go.","content.76.15470":"Well, that changes things quite a bit.","content.76.15471":"(Grab the Enutrof)\\n\\nRunning away isn't the answer. You must take responsibility for your actions! Besides, we're not yet sure of anything. Being connected in some way to people doesn't mean you share their values. ","content.76.15472":"Stop fretting. We'll see when we get there.","content.76.15473":"Great! Well, we know what we have to do! Let's look under the hood of those Hoodlums!","content.76.15474":"But it certainly looks like their hideout! Black Ink was right. ","content.76.15475":"What's not right is being involved with eco-terrorists. Give me some time. I don't know if I still want to help you.","content.76.15476":"Keep that in mind, but let's continue on this path for now.","content.76.15477":"These weapons?","content.76.15478":"You mean you were using weapons on people? ","content.76.15479":"I hope these people have also lost their memory and will promise me all their wealth if I help them.","content.76.15480":"It's possible that you saw or experienced things so horrifying that your brain decided to make you forget it all. The priority now is to find out where you were and who you were with, and hope that your memory will return at the same time. Let's climb aboard and see what happens!","content.76.15481":"You're right. That's maybe not the most sympathetic approach. Still, it's what puts food on my table and in my belly. Money doesn't grow on trees. Let's climb aboard for now.","content.76.15482":"It's important to be honest with yourself. I can't save everyone, and I can't be everywhere. I can help people, but I can only choose whom. Let's climb aboard for now.","content.76.15483":"Have you managed to remember anything else?","content.76.15484":"Cool, but not right now. I'll come back later.","content.76.15485":"It must be someone from your family or someone close to you. That's great! ","content.76.15486":"Someone else then. Maybe this person is connected with the weapons and blood you were talking about at the Hoodlums' hideout?","content.76.15487":"It doesn't matter who you were. It's up to you to become who you'll be tomorrow. Remember your past and accept it, whatever it was, to become a better person.","content.76.15488":"I'm not here to psychoanalyze you. It takes all sorts to make a world.","content.76.15489":"I'm not saying that... just that you need to accept your past for what it is.","content.76.15490":"It's your past; it's you. You'll just have to deal with it.","content.76.15491":"So forget it again.\\n\\nDon't you want to focus on uncovering your past rather than worrying about what it reveals? What exactly do you know about this person you remember?","content.76.15492":"Great. And how can we find this person we're looking for?","content.76.15493":"In that case, let's find someone who can sketch a portrait, and we can then take it to the appropriate authorities. \\n\\nBlack Ink's drawing wasn't anything to write home about... Let's go to Miranda's and Kabrok's shop instead. They're old friends.","content.76.15494":"We're trying to create a portrait sketch of someone... We can describe what the person is wearing. So I thought of you!","content.76.15495":"Yes, ma'am. Thanks, ma'am!","content.76.15497":"*Hand over the sketch*\\n\\nThat's kind of you, so thanks, but we sadly don't have time to wait for leads, especially if other people are involved. We'd like to continue our investigation on our own.","content.76.15498":"*Hand over the portrait sketch drawn by Miranda*\\n\\nIs this person on your wanted list? The individual may be involved in illegal activities.","content.76.15499":"*Hand over the portrait sketch drawn by Miranda*\\n\\nIs this person on your wanted list? The individual may be involved in illegal activities.","content.76.15500":"*Hand over the portrait sketch drawn by Miranda*\\n\\nIs this person on your wanted list? The individual may be involved in illegal activities.","content.76.15501":"*Hand over the portrait sketch drawn by Miranda*\\n\\nIs this person on your wanted list? The individual may be involved in illegal activities.","content.76.15502":"*Grab the paper and hide it in your pocket, suppressing a smile*\\n\\nYes, thankfully, no one here is like that. We'll therefore wait and stay out of danger.","content.76.15503":"The individual we're looking for is a collector of antiques, and we thought you might be able to help us.","content.76.15504":"Our investigations into the person we're looking for have led us here again. We think you might know this person. ","content.76.15505":"The individual we're looking for is involved in illegal activities and probably the black market. It seems your shop would be the perfect place for such activities.","content.76.15506":"That's perfectly understandable, but the person we're looking for is probably a very dangerous individual, and people's lives could be at risk. We can't afford to wait or turn a blind eye.","content.76.15507":"That may apply to the items here. But you could still have a warehouse where you stock other wares. ","content.76.15508":"Your business is not our concern. We're simply looking for someone who might have a connection to you. We just want some information.","content.76.15509":"(...)","content.76.15510":"(...)","content.76.15511":"(...)","content.76.15512":"*You take out the portrait sketch*\\n\\nHave you heard of someone named Aligias who looks like this? We're looking for him, and he fits the profile of someone who might buy items from your shop.","content.76.15513":"(...)","content.76.15514":"Okay... Thanks for your time.","content.76.15519":"(Leave the Old Amnesiac alone)","content.76.15520":"Do you recognize one of these creatures?","content.76.15522":"That's quite a vague description...","content.76.15523":"When you say terrifying, you mean like every giant creature that lives in a cave?","content.76.15524":"(...)","content.76.15525":"(...)","content.76.15526":"(...)","content.76.15527":"Is this cave somehow connected with Aligias or the Hoodlums?","content.76.15528":"Thanks for the info. Let's go see this cave with our own eyes. ","content.76.15529":"If lives are truly at stake, we don't have time to worry about that.","content.76.15530":"If you're scared, you can stay here and wait for me to come back. It's no surprise you can't get your memory back if you run away and hide at the slightest threat!","content.76.15531":"Great, then let's descend into the depths of Brakmar!","content.76.15536":"(Give him a little more time)","content.76.15537":"If it was that easy, anyone could do it. Who are you to succeed where all the others failed?","content.76.15538":"It's just as well that the road is long... Leaves more room for a few detours.","content.76.15539":"Nothing, I'm just rambling. Even though time is short, we also need to take the time to gather information. That's bound to take a little while.","content.76.15540":"It's up to you whether you see the glass as half-full or half-empty. Right now, it doesn't matter whether you're worried about yourself or the others. The path is the same, and we need answers. ","content.76.15541":"No results yet. We'll find something eventually. If you don't have confidence in yourself, then have confidence in me. ","content.76.15542":"Oh, I am... but you promised me a big reward, and you'd better deliver.","content.76.15543":"Well, since this isn't the right cave, let's turn back. We've got a sketch and a name. Might as well follow this lead. ","content.76.15544":"Well, since this isn't the right cave, let's turn back. We've got a sketch and a name. Might as well follow this lead. ","content.76.15545":"So Aligias himself built the cave he was keeping you in?","content.76.15546":"You're right. I doubt he'd hire Astrubian masons for that kind of work. ","content.76.15547":"I don't know if a sect like that really exists, but there must be people who'll do anything for a few kamas. And a prison would be the best place to find them. Let's go visit one.","content.76.15548":"We're looking for one of your prisoners, or someone they might know, who would know how to make artificial caves for a criminal. ","content.76.15550":"I'll think about it. Right now, though, we're looking for information.","content.76.15551":"We're looking for information.","content.76.15552":"That's one heck of a notebook!","content.76.15553":"(...)","content.76.15554":"(...)","content.76.15555":"(...)","content.76.15556":"(...)","content.76.15557":"(...)","content.76.15558":"(...)","content.76.15559":"(...)","content.76.15560":"(...)","content.76.15561":"(...)","content.76.15562":"(...)","content.76.15563":"Any chance you could go a little faster? We're in a hurry! ","content.76.15564":"(...)","content.76.15565":"(...)","content.76.15566":"(...)","content.76.15567":"(...)","content.76.15568":"(...)","content.76.15569":"(...)","content.76.15570":"(I don't believe this...)","content.76.15571":"(...)","content.76.15572":"(This is taking a while...)","content.76.15573":"(...)","content.76.15574":"(...)","content.76.15575":"(...)","content.76.15576":"(...)","content.76.15577":"What about former prisoners?","content.76.15578":"(Is he serious? Couldn't he have mentioned that up front?)\\n\\nCould you give us his name, or the name of his group?","content.76.15582":"We've got another question as well. Would you have any information about Aligias?","content.76.15583":"No idea. All we can say is that he's probably a dangerous criminal.","content.76.15584":"Please! ","content.76.15585":"You know what, never mind. Thank you. \\n\\nLet's go check up on the Elite Riktus instead!","content.76.15586":"(...)","content.76.15587":"(...)","content.76.15588":"(...)","content.76.15589":"(...)","content.76.15590":"(...)","content.76.15591":"(...)","content.76.15592":"(...)","content.76.15593":"(...)","content.76.15594":"(...)","content.76.15595":"I think we're actually going to leave. Thanks for your help! ","content.76.15596":"Your notebook...","content.76.15597":"(...)","content.76.15598":"(...)","content.76.15599":"(...)","content.76.15600":"(...)","content.76.15601":"(...)","content.76.15602":"(...)","content.76.15603":"Yes?","content.76.15604":"(I don't believe this...)","content.76.15605":"(...)","content.76.15606":"(Whisper)\\n\\nThis is the last time I ask him for information...","content.76.15607":"(...)","content.76.15608":"(...)","content.76.15609":"(...)","content.76.15611":"(...)","content.76.15612":"(...)","content.76.15613":"Oh well, thanks anyway. Let's go check up on the Elite Riktus.","content.76.15614":"(Hold me back! I'm going to shove that key right down his throat!)","content.76.15615":"Nothing. Really. Nothing. We're going to follow up on the Elite Riktus.","content.76.15616":"What is that...? ","content.76.15617":"I'll just pretend I didn't see the red thing there. Hey there!","content.76.15618":"Great, but we'll still have to get over there! ","content.76.15619":"What, you and me both?","content.76.15620":"No?","content.76.15621":"I kind of like being alive, and that doesn't look like the way to a long and peaceful life.","content.76.15622":"With all due respect, you haven't been the most useful in our previous battles. I wouldn't want anything to happen to you. I won't be able to protect you.","content.76.15623":"What about you?","content.76.15624":"But what if you just got lucky before? There's no guarantee that you'll manage it again. In all of our fights so far, I've been the{[1*]?:} only{[1*]?:} one who actually fought.","content.76.15625":"Alright, but you'd better not die! ","content.76.15626":"Ready{[1*]?:} as I'll ever be! Let's go and save Aligias's victims!","content.76.15627":"I've still got to prepare!","content.76.15628":"Old Amnesiac! How'd you manage to get here before me? Wait! You... You're dead? You're really dead? But I told you not to die, and you told me to trust you! ","content.76.15630":"So why did you lie to me?","content.76.15631":"That's what I said at the time. You can't just order someone to have good luck.","content.76.15632":"But why sacrifice yourself?","content.76.15633":"You've been dead the whole time? Ever since we first met?","content.76.15634":"Great, so I was risking my life for nothing... At least you've got your memory back. ","content.76.15635":"So that's how you were able to follow me everywhere, even in dangerous places, without ever risking your life... because it was already over.","content.76.15636":"So... Your body is in here somewhere, among all these bones. You didn't survive the torture. I'm sorry{[1*]?:} to hear that.","content.76.15637":"Stop! What do you mean, it's you? \\n\\nJust hold on, wait, stop right there. This is too much information all at once! I have so many questions!\\n\\nSo you were never one of the victims we were trying to save?","content.76.15638":"You've got to be kidding me. You were never alive. You were never a victim. What's next? You never actually had amnesia? So it wasn't enough to torture and kill people while you were alive... you kept going after you died! ","content.76.15639":"All those people... All those corpses... So you're the one behind all those deaths?","content.76.15640":"This had better be good, pal. Are you going to give me a logical reason why you tortured and killed all those people?","content.76.15641":"Not a chance. I don't want to hear your explanation. Nothing you can say can justify the things you did for all those years! ","content.76.15642":"You can't compare that to your situation. I'm getting tired of all your reasons. I think I'll just leave you to your fate here.","content.76.15643":"You expect me to believe you have all those answers?","content.76.15644":"Alright, go ahead and explain. Just don't talk about what you've done.","content.76.15645":"Give me the short version. I don't want the details. I just want to get out of here quickly and forget all of this.","content.76.15646":"So what's all that got to do with me? Did your self-centered ego need me to come here to hear all about your life AND death?","content.76.15647":"I can't imagine what all those people went through...","content.76.15648":"Couldn't he have just taken care of you? Why did all those people die for no reason?","content.76.15649":"Why did you want me to come here and see all this?","content.76.15650":"I believe you. Right. Happy now?","content.76.15651":"I guess it's a blessing in disguise.","content.76.15653":"Alright then. But I'm not doing it because you asked me to, and I'm not doing it for you. I'm just doing it for all those people who suffered so much over the years.","content.76.15654":"You could have just told me you wanted me to take it. I could have done without your explanation.","content.76.15655":"Don't thank me. I'm just doing what I think is right.","content.76.15656":"(...)","content.76.15657":"Yes, here you go.","content.76.15658":"They're not ripe yet. I'll come back later.","content.76.15659":"Of course. I'll stay within reasonable limits.","content.76.15660":"I saw your posters in Sufokia... I've come to seek{[1*]?:} adventure!","content.76.15661":"Yep. Folk don't seem to seek adventure these days.","content.76.15662":"Such enthusiasm...","content.76.15663":"Which island do you want to discover?","content.76.15664":"Sounds pretty standard, but I might be interested in hearing more.","content.76.15665":"So that's why you need adventurers. The island is full of secrets and dangerous things!","content.76.15666":"Yeah! Onward to adventure!","content.76.15667":"Meh.","content.76.15668":"News travels fast.","content.76.15669":"Not very brave for a criminal.\\n\\n(Hand over the copy of the portrait sketch)\\n\\nWe're looking for this individual.","content.76.15670":"Do we look like we're messing around here? Should we give you a few kicks in the rear to convince you?","content.76.15671":"Okay. Now talk.","content.76.15672":"Everything you know about him. His name, what activities he's involved in, where he lives.","content.76.15673":"What kind of reputation?","content.76.15674":"(...)","content.76.15675":"(...)","content.76.15676":"(...)","content.76.15677":"(...)","content.76.15678":"*As you turn to the Old Amnesiac for a moment, Remington sees his chance and escapes*\\n\\nOh! We weren't done yet, and we gave him our word... For him to be that terrified, this Aligias must really be dangerous. Did his answers bring back any memories?","content.76.15679":"So you were held captive with other people? There's no time to lose. Now that we know who he is, we've absolutely got to find him. ","content.76.15680":"He mentioned \"antiquities\". Let's go back to see Miranda and ask for information. She's got a large network too, so she'll probably know something. ","content.76.15682":"Before that, I have some questions about a certain criminal.","content.76.15683":"Everything depends on your answers.\\n\\n(Hand over the copy of the portrait sketch)\\n\\nWe're looking for this individual.","content.76.15684":"That's not how it works. Give us some information, and we'll see what we can do. Now talk!","content.76.15685":"(turn to the Enutrof)\\n\\nDid his answers bring back any memories?","content.76.15686":"Oh, right, the book. Why does your brother need the book?","content.76.15688":"He mentioned \"antiquities\". Let's go back to see Miranda and ask for information. She's got a large network too, so she'll probably know something. ","content.76.15689":"Do we look like we're messing around here? Should we give you a few kicks in the rear to convince you?","content.76.15690":"(...)","content.76.15691":"I wouldn't have guessed you'd be into these kinds of wall decorations.","content.76.15692":"You seem awfully pensive. How do you feel?","content.76.15693":"So this is it, the mysterious island that was just discovered not long ago?","content.76.15694":"I couldn't give two squits! Laters.","content.76.15695":"Oh, really? Have you been here a long time then? Then again, I see pirates all over the place...","content.76.15696":"It's possible.","content.76.15697":"That's certainly possible.","content.76.15698":"Quite possibly.","content.76.15699":"Maybe.","content.76.15700":"You think so?","content.76.15701":"Oh, right, you were the guy in Ereboria...","content.76.15702":"A bit like here then. Can I see the drawing?","content.76.15703":"Okay then, I'll go check it out!","content.76.15704":"Thanks for the info.","content.76.15705":"Ah, never mind. I've already seen your mysterious poster. Thanks anyway!","content.76.15706":"Looks like the bridge to reach the center of the island is destroyed.","content.76.15707":"Yeah...","content.76.15708":"Right, I'll go fetch some resources!","content.159.6274":"Ahr Khayuh","content.159.6275":"Ahr Khayuh","content.159.6357":"Alraune","content.159.6359":"Alraune","content.159.6361":"Alraune","content.159.6362":"Alraune","content.159.6363":"Alraune","content.159.6367":"Alraune","content.159.6398":"Alraune","content.159.6401":"Alraune","content.159.6402":"Alraune","content.159.6404":"Alraune","content.159.6405":"Alraune","content.159.6466":"Milo Tchatch","content.159.6535":"Amelia Hartlyss","content.159.6536":"Amelia Hartlyss","content.159.6537":"Amelia Hartlyss","content.159.6538":"Jenry Hones Jr.","content.159.6539":"Jenry Hones Jr.","content.159.6540":"Jenry Hones Jr.","content.159.6541":"Jenry Hones Jr.","content.159.6542":"Eminerell Lebbocq","content.159.6543":"Eminerell Lebbocq","content.159.6544":"Jenry Hones Jr.","content.159.6546":"Milo Tchatch","content.159.6547":"Milo Tchatch","content.159.6549":"Amelia Hartlyss","content.159.6550":"Amelia Hartlyss","content.159.6552":"Eminerell Lebbocq","content.159.6554":"Laura Craft","content.159.6555":"Amelia Hartlyss","content.159.6556":"Amelia Hartlyss","content.159.6557":"Jenry Hones Jr.","content.159.6558":"Eminerell Lebbocq","content.159.6559":"Eminerell Lebbocq","co