mEmote-Defaite\")\nend\n\n-- [SORTIE] Le chronomètre arrive à terme\n-- \nfunction event_1378_10437()\n    UI.stopCountdown()\nend\n\n-- [EVENT] ENTER/EXIT_INSTANCE - On retire les tickets de l'inventaire du joueur\n-- \nfunction event_1378_22945()\n    \nend\n\n","functions":["event_1378_10433","event_1378_10434","event_1378_10507","event_1378_10438","event_1378_11462","event_1378_10439","event_1378_10440","event_1378_10441","event_1378_10436","event_1378_10437","event_1378_22945"],"quest_calls":[],"dialogue_calls":[]},"scenario/1379.lua":{"source":"playerId = Context.getPlayer()\r\n\r\nfunction masoettePlayInit(mobileId)\t\r\n\tMobile.setMobileAnimationStaticKey(mobileId, \"AnimStatique02\")\n\tMobile.setMobileDirection(mobileId, 5)\r\n\tMobile.setMobileAnimation(mobileId, \"AnimSort-Fouet\")\r\n\tInteractiveElement.setAnimation(15554, \"AnimTrans_1\")\r\n\tinvoke(4000,1,\"masoettePlayInit\",mobileId)\r\nend\r\n\r\nfunction scenarioModeOn(mobileId)\r\n\tCamera.setUserZoomLocked(true)\r\n\tUI.closeMRU()\r\n\tUI.closeAllBags()\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-- Ferme l'inventaire\r\n\tUI.setShortcutEnabled(false)\t\t\t\t\t\t-- désactive les shortcuts\r\n    UI.manageFrame(\"World\",false) \t\t\t\t\t-- Désactive le déplacement\r\n\tUI.setUIVisible(false)\r\nend\r\n\r\nfunction scenarioModeOff()\r\n\tCamera.setUserZoomLocked(false)\r\n\tUI.setShortcutEnabled(true)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-- Réactive les shortcuts\r\n\tUI.manageFrame(\"World\",true) \t\t\t\t\t-- Réactive le déplacement\r\n\tUI.setUIVisible(true)\r\n    UI.manageMRU(58, false)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-- Blocage pack-unpack gelutin\r\nend\n\n-- [INITIALISATION] Initialisation du Chronomètre\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10443()\n    \nend\n\n-- [INIT] ENTER_INSTANCE - Inscription au scénario\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10444(masoette)\n    Mobile.addMobileCreationCallback(masoette, \"masoettePlayInit\", masoette)\nend\n\n-- [SCENE] Activation du monstre\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10450()\n    \nend\n\n-- [INTERACTION] Marabouf\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10682(marabouf, MaraboufTriggerer)\n    function bouffe(mobileId,targetId)\r\n    \tMobile.setMobileAnimation(targetId, \"AnimEmote-SeFaireBouffer\")\r\n    \tMobile.setMobileAnimation(mobileId, \"AnimComp-Croque\")\r\n    end\r\n    \r\n    ax, ay, az = Mobile.getMobilePosition(playerId)\r\n    bx, by, bz = Mobile.getMobilePosition(marabouf)\r\n    Mobile.setMobileLookAt(playerId, bx, by, false)\r\n    Mobile.setMobileLookAt(marabouf, ax, ay, false)\r\n    \r\n    Mobile.setMobileAnimation(MaraboufTriggerer, \"AnimEmote-AppelChat\")\r\n    invoke(1500,1,\"bouffe\",marabouf,MaraboufTriggerer)\nend\n\n-- [INTERACTION] Marabouf - Redevient interactif\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10683(marabouf, MaraboufTriggerer)\n    scenarioModeOff()\nend\n\n-- [INTERACTION] Masoette\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10684(masoette, playerTriggerer)\n    function fouetStart(casterId,mobileId)\r\n    \tMobile.setMobileDirection(mobileId, 3)\r\n    \tMobile.setMobileDirection(casterId, 5)\r\n    \r\n    \tMobile.setMobileAnimation(casterId, \"AnimEmote-SeFaireFouetter-Debut\",\"fouetBoucle\",casterId)\r\n    \tMobile.setMobileAnimation(masoette, \"AnimSort-Fouet\")\r\n    end\r\n    \r\n    function fouetBoucle(casterId)\r\n    \tMobile.setMobileAnimation(casterId, \"AnimEmote-SeFaireFouetter-Boucle\",\"fouetEnd\",casterId)\r\n    end\r\n    \r\n    function fouetEnd(casterId)\r\n    \tMobile.setMobileAnimation(casterId, \"AnimEmote-SeFaireFouetter-Fin\")\r\n    end\r\n    \r\n    fouetStart(playerTriggerer,masoette)\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\nend\n\n-- [INTERACTION] Masoette - Redevient interactif\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10685(marabouf, playerTriggerer)\n    \nend\n\n-- [ZOO] Goule A\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10688(gouleA)\n    function gouleOne(mobileId)\r\n    \tMobile.setMobileAnimation(mobileId, \"AnimHit\")\r\n    \tParticle.addParticleSystemToTarget(800304, mobileId, 1)\r\n    end\r\n    \r\n    invoke(1000,1,\"gouleOne\",gouleA)\nend\n\n-- [ZOO] Goule A - Cooldown\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10689(mandhal)\n    \nend\n\n-- [ZOO] Goule B\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10690(gouleB)\n    function gouleTwo(mobileId)\r\n    \tMobile.setMobileAnimation(mobileId, \"AnimHit\")\r\n    \tParticle.addParticleSystemToTarget(800304, mobileId, 1)\r\n    end\r\n    \r\n    invoke(1000,1,\"gouleTwo\",gouleB)\nend\n\n-- [ZOO] Goule B - Cooldown\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10691(mandhal)\n    \nend\n\n-- [ZOO] Goule C\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10692(gouleC)\n    function gouleThree(mobileId)\r\n    \tMobile.setMobileAnimation(mobileId, \"AnimHit\")\r\n    \tParticle.addParticleSystemToTarget(800304, mobileId, 1)\r\n    end\r\n    \r\n    invoke(1000,1,\"gouleThree\",gouleC)\nend\n\n-- [ZOO] Goule C - Cooldown\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10693(mandhal)\n    \nend\n\n-- [INTERACTION] Coffre\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10766(marabouf, coffreTriggerer)\n    Mobile.setMobileDirection(coffreTriggerer, 7)\r\n    Mobile.setMobileAnimation(coffreTriggerer, \"AnimEmote-SeFaireBouffer2\")\r\nend\n\n-- [INTERACTION] Coffre - Redevient interactif\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10767(marabouf, coffreTriggerer)\n    scenarioModeOff()\nend\n\n-- [SORTIE]\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10768()\n    \nend\n\n-- [SCENE] Un joueur monte sur l'interrupteur - Incrémentation\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10770()\n    Sound.playLocalSound(10, 70500004, 90, 1, 7 , 0)\nend\n\n-- [SCENE] Un joueur monte sur l'interrupteur - Décrémentation\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10771()\n    Sound.playLocalSound(10, 70500004, 90, 1, 7, 0)\nend\n\n-- [SCENE] Blocage des interfaces\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10797()\n    scenarioModeOn(playerId)\nend\n\n-- [SCENE] Blocage des interfaces - Fin\n-- \nfunction event_1379_10798()\n    scenarioModeOff()\nend\n\n-- [SCENE] Blocage des interfaces - Marabouf\n-- \nfunction event_1379_11010()\n    scenarioModeOn(playerId)\nend\n\n-- [SCENE] Blocage des interfaces - Fin - Marabouf\n-- \nfunction event_1379_11011()\n    scenarioModeOff()\nend\n\n","functions":["masoettePla